window.VALHEIM_PAGE_PREVIEWS={"index.html":{"zh":"这个内容全面、资料丰富的资源库由 英灵神殿 的爱好者维护。任何人都可以贡献内容，也可以使用这里分享的知识，无论是物品信息、世界背景故事，还是应对强敌的策略。 无论你是来 参与编辑 还是获取知识，我们都欢迎你！干杯！","en":"This comprehensive and informative resource is maintained by fans of Valheim . Anyone may contribute, just as anyone may take part in the knowledge shared - whether it be information about items, lore of the world, or strategies for difficult enemies. Whether you are here to start editing or to gain knowledge, you are welcome! Skål!","titleZh":"首页","titleEn":"Valheim Wiki"},"armor.html":{"zh":"护甲 指玩家可穿戴的服装，可减少物理、火焰、冰霜和闪电等 伤害类型 造成的伤害。伤害减免公式请参阅 伤害机制 ；不提供伤害减免的服装请参阅 饰品 。","en":"Armor refers to items of clothing players can wear which reduces damage taken from physical, fire, frost and lightning damage types . See Damage mechanics for damage mitigation formula. See Accessories for non-damage-reducing clothing.","titleZh":"护甲","titleEn":"Armor"},"biomes.html":{"zh":"生物群系 是 英灵神殿 世界中的不同区域，以独特外观以及其中的 生物 和 资源 区分。几乎每个生物群系还是一位 弃誓者 的领地。","en":"Biomes are regions in the world of Valheim that can be distinguished by their unique aesthetics, as well as the creatures and resources contained within. Additionally, almost every biome is the domain of one of the Forsaken .","titleZh":"生物群系","titleEn":"Biomes"},"building.html":{"zh":"“ 使用丰富的建造界面，建造维京蜜酒大厅、住宅、城堡等。从商船到威武战舰，打造传奇船只，征服海洋，探索新大陆。 ” 《英灵神殿》拥有丰富的 建造 系统，可设计满足各种战士需求的建筑。除了简陋住所和前哨，玩家还可以用建造界面打造庞大的基地、精巧的艺术作品、防御 生物 的工事，以及辅助生存的独特工具。 玩家从简单的木制构件起步，随后能解锁石材、金属等材料，建造更坚固的建筑。","en":"\" Raise your own viking mead halls, houses, castles, and more with our powerful construction interface. From knarrs to imposing warships, build legendary vessels to conquer the seas and discover new lands. \" Valheim features an extensive building system that can be utilized to design structures to meet the demands of any discriminating warrior. In addition to humble homes and outposts, players also use this building…","titleZh":"建材","titleEn":"Building"},"crafting.html":{"zh":"制作 是转换、组合 材料 以创造新 物品 的过程。 部分基础物品可在玩家背包制作，但多数需要 工作台 或 熔炉 等专用制作设施。多数装备也能升级品质，提高耐久及其他属性。","en":"Crafting is the process of converting and combining materials to create new items . Some basic items can be crafted in the player inventory, but most items require a dedicated crafting station such as a Workbench or Forge . Most gear can also be upgraded to a higher quality, increasing its durability and other aspects.","titleZh":"制作","titleEn":"Crafting"},"creatures.html":{"zh":"生物 是遍布 英灵神殿 的非玩家角色，可分为四类：","en":"Creatures are non-player characters which are found throughout Valheim . They can be split to four categories:","titleZh":"生物","titleEn":"Creatures"},"food.html":{"zh":"食物 是指食用后可暂时提升 生命值 、 耐力 和 埃达之能 的物品。玩家同时最多可食用三种不同食物，叠加其增益。增益强度会匀速下降，直到食物完全消化后消失。不同食物的增益持续时间和衰减速度各不相同。在先前食用的同种食物至少部分消化之前，玩家无法再次食用；状态栏中的食物图标闪烁时，表示可以再次食用。再次食用同种食物会刷新增益的强度和持续时间。 虽然玩家不会饿死，但食物能提高生命值和耐力的上限及恢复速度。玩家同时只能获得三种食物的效果，因此应根据接下来的活动选择食物。例如，探索或采集资源时应选择耐力加成较高的食物；进入地牢或与 首领 战斗时，则应选择生命值及生命值恢复加成较高的食物。 面对艰难战斗时，食物搭配也取决于玩家偏好的战斗方式。生命值上限影响玩家可承受的 失衡 上限，因此有效使用盾牌需要较高的生命值。偏好完全通过 闪避 避开攻击的玩家应尽量提高耐力，而使用魔法战斗的玩家则应尽量提高埃达之能。","en":"Food refers to items that can be consumed for temporary health , stamina , and eitr boosts. A player can consume up to three different types of food at any given time for a combined increase in buff strength. The strength of the buff decreases uniformly until it vanishes once the food is fully digested. Food buffs have variable durations and decrease rates. Players cannot eat more than one of the same type of food u…","titleZh":"食物","titleEn":"Food"},"how-to-play.html":{"zh":"控制 默认操作参见 控制 。 如何制作武器？ 按[E]拾取地面树枝及石头。 按 [I] 打开物品栏和制作界面。 用木材制作 棍棒 ，或用木材和石头制作 石斧 。 如何建造？ 更多详情请参阅： 建材 建造需要使用 工具锤 ，可在背包界面用木材和石头制作。除少数例外，建造时必须位于 工作台 的工作范围内；后期则需要对应的其他制作设施。默认按鼠标右键[RMB]打开工具锤的建造菜单。 如何制作物品？ 更多详情请参阅： 制作 除了少数可在背包中制作的基础物品，大多数物品都需要制作设施；这些设施可以用 工具锤 建造。最先使用的是 工作台 ，它允许你在周围一定范围内建造，但要制作物品，工作台本身必须有遮蔽。可以快速搭建一个修理小棚：先把工作台放在平地上，在后方放两面墙，左右各放一面墙，再用两块26°屋顶盖住。遮蔽满足要求后，对准工作台并按提示按下[E]，即可打开制作菜单。 如何睡觉？ 建简易小屋或庇护所，放 营火 ，再在内放 床铺 。室内篝…","en":"Controls For default controls, see Controls . How to make a weapon? Press [E] to pick up branches and stones that are on the ground. Press [I] to open inventory and crafting screen. Crafting a Club from wood or a Stone Axe from wood and stone. How to build? For more details, check: Building Building is done with the Hammer , which can be crafted from the inventory screen with wood and stone. With a few exceptions, b…","titleZh":"入门玩法","titleEn":"How to play"},"p-0032b71e283d00c277ac.html":{"zh":"软泥炸弹 是一种投掷武器，会生成半径4米、持续10秒的 毒素 范围云雾。云雾中的任何人（投掷者除外）都会在7秒内受到40点毒素伤害。敌人停留在云雾中时，伤害会刷新，因此最大伤害为40*(10+7)/7 = 97。 伤害值不受玩家任何技能影响，但可能因敌人的抗性而改变。","en":"Ooze bomb is a thrown weapon that creates a Poison 4-meter radius AoE cloud, which stays for 10 seconds. Anyone in the cloud (excluding the thrower) takes 40 poison damage over 7 seconds. If an enemy stays in the cloud, the damage is refreshed, so the maximum damage is 40*(10+7)/7 = 97. Damage value does not depend on any player skill, but may be altered by enemy resistance.","titleZh":"软泥炸弹","titleEn":"Ooze Bomb"},"p-0032d44b57f8cc1e3dfb.html":{"zh":"熊洞穴 是 黑暗林山 中的 地下城 。 洞内必有睡眠中的 巨熊 ，入口类似 巨魔洞穴 。","en":"Bear Caves are dungeons found in Black Forests . In the cave there is always a sleeping Bear . The cave entrance is similar to Troll Cave .","titleZh":"熊洞穴","titleEn":"Bear Cave"},"p-0075544d44bf59eea031.html":{"zh":"这是 长柄武器 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 武器 。","en":"This is a category for polearms which are a type of weapons .","titleZh":"分类：长柄武器","titleEn":"Category:Polearms"},"p-00bdb1a8d7b25faf6ee3.html":{"zh":"这是 剑 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 武器 。","en":"This is a category for swords which are a type of weapons .","titleZh":"分类：剑","titleEn":"Category:Swords"},"p-010059cbbc7269f6eab9.html":{"zh":"头带 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付175 钱币 购买。","en":"Headband is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 175 Coins .","titleZh":"头带","titleEn":"Headband"},"p-011b6223d48771ac49e6.html":{"zh":"木制武器 是一系列仅造成1点伤害的武器，主要适合训练和玩家之间的练习对战。 它们都可在等级1的 工作台 处修理，但除木剑外均无法升级。木剑也可以使用 青铜战斗神像 在 潜能熔炉 处升级。 它们的格挡护甲均为12。","en":"Wooden weapons are a series of weapons that deal only 1 damage. They are mainly suited for training and practice matches between players. They can all be repaired at a level 1 Workbench , but they can not be upgraded except for the Wooden Sword. The Wooden Sword can also be upgraded at the Forge of Potential with a Bronze Battle Idol .","titleZh":"木制武器","titleEn":"Wooden Weapons"},"p-012c6b4684b1dccbf835.html":{"zh":"尸鬼之牙 是第四种 弓 ，在 白银时代 阶段制作。 它还会为箭矢附加 毒素伤害 。","en":"Draugr Fang is the fourth bow and made during the Silver Age . It also adds poison damage to the arrows.","titleZh":"尸鬼之牙","titleEn":"Draugr Fang"},"p-016283d60ac9572888a7.html":{"zh":"封印之塔 是 北境平原 中的开放式 地下城 。与其他地下城不同，封印之塔位于地表，进入无需加载画面。 每个世界有3座封印之塔，与 希尔德 面前的地图互动可揭示位置。","en":"Sealed Towers are open dungeons found in Plains . Unlike other dungeons, Sealed Towers take place in the surface and do not need a loading screen to enter. Each world contains 3 Sealed Towers, their locations can be revealed by interacting with the map in front of Hildir .","titleZh":"封印之塔","titleEn":"Sealed Tower"},"p-0162fdf28ecbace57566.html":{"zh":"邪骨堆 是 诡秘墓穴 、 沼泽墓地 和 山地塔楼 中的 生物生成点 。 骨堆可生成近战及远程骷髅： 生成敌人有12.75%概率为1星，2.25%概率为2星。 玩家进入20米内时激活生成点，每6秒尝试在2.28米内生成，直到20米内有2只骷髅。","en":"The Evil Bone Pile is a creature spawner found in Burial Chambers , Swamp Graves and Mountain Tower . The pile can spawn melee and ranged Skeletons: Spawned enemies have a 12.75% chance to be 1 star and a 2.25% chance to be 2 star. The spawner activates when there is a player within 20 meters. The nest attempts to spawn within 2.28 meters every 6 seconds until there are 2 Skeletons within 20 meters.","titleZh":"邪骨堆","titleEn":"Evil Bone Pile"},"p-018898b5946a35cdcdc7.html":{"zh":"此分类页面过期，应审阅更新，主题已无关时归档或删除。","en":"The pages contained in this category are considered outdated. They should be reviewed, then updated to current information or archived (or deleted) if their subject is not relevant to the game anymore.","titleZh":"分类：过时内容","titleEn":"Category:Outdated"},"p-01896cfa0a4318a21469.html":{"zh":"软组织 既是资源节点，也是制作 埃达精华 的资源，遍布 迷雾之地 ，也可在 灰烬之地 的 腐朽之穴 中找到。","en":"Soft Tissue is both a resource node and a resource used to craft Refined Eitr . They can be found throughout the Mistlands , and inside Putrid Holes in the Ashlands .","titleZh":"软组织","titleEn":"Soft Tissue"},"p-01c0bfda2ecef31ddfc8.html":{"zh":"堇青石 用于制作部分 灰烬之地 武器的“雷霆／风暴”变体，有概率在灰烬之地 灰烬亡灵堡垒 内的 灰烬宝箱 找到。 堇青石升级武器增加10点 闪电 伤害。除弓外，主攻击命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，副攻击为20%；弓主攻击为20%。","en":"Iolite is a material used to craft the \"Thunder/Storm\" version of some Ashlands weapons. They have a chance to be found in Charred chests inside Charred Fortresses located in Ashlands. A weapon upgraded with Iolite gains 10 lightning damage and has a 25% chance to trigger a Chain Lightning on hit with the normal attack and a 20% chance with the secondary attack, except for the bow. The bow has a 20% chance to trigge…","titleZh":"堇青石","titleEn":"Iolite"},"p-01f58f68204441ee9a29.html":{"zh":"巨魔洞穴 是 黑暗林山 中的 地下城 。","en":"Troll Caves are dungeons found in Black Forests .","titleZh":"巨魔洞穴","titleEn":"Troll Cave"},"p-0275ec0785001b26c403.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以120枚 钱币 购买5个 林地混合香料 ，仅在击败 古树长老 后出售。","en":"Woodland herb blend can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 120 Coins for 5 items. It is only sold after The Elder has been defeated.","titleZh":"林地混合香料","titleEn":"Woodland Herb Blend"},"p-02b04c0b83b8eee6102d.html":{"zh":"轻羽斗篷 是一件可制作的 护甲 部件，提供 轻羽之落 效果：坠落伤害降低100%，坠落速度上限为5 m/s。它提供冰霜抗性，但极弱于火焰。为抵消这一弱点，对付 加尔 或 矮人 火 法师 等造成 火焰 伤害的敌人时，最好装备 抗火大麦酒 。 这件披风非常适合穿越 迷雾之地 地形中崎岖的山谷，玩家可攀上高岩并滑翔越过障碍。滑翔时“冲刺”会改变下落角度，但也会消耗 耐力 。","en":"Feather Cape is a craftable Armor piece that grants the Feather fall effect consisting of 100% fall damage reduction and fall speed limited to 5 m/s. It provides resistance to frost, however it is very weak against fire. To counter this weakness, it is best to equip a Fire Resistance Barley Wine when fighting enemies with Fire damage, such as a Gjall or the Dvergr fire mage .","titleZh":"轻羽斗篷","titleEn":"Feather Cape"},"p-031f1a7b91ec29a252a4.html":{"zh":"头骨堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 灰烬头颅 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Pile of Skulls is a buildable structure that is used to store Charred Skulls or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"头骨堆","titleEn":"Pile of Skulls"},"p-037ee2c2598ba98cd167.html":{"zh":"深渊之枪 是一种实用型 矛 。其主要攻击会掷出矛，并钩住非 首领 生物。 被钩住的敌人移动得太远时，会被拖向玩家，并持续消耗玩家的耐力。 再次攻击、使用任何其他武器攻击、离被钩住的目标太远、耗尽耐力，或尝试将目标拖过无法通过的地形或建筑，都会使牵引中断。","en":"The Abyssal harpoon is a utility spear . Its primary attack throws the spear and latches onto non- boss creatures. When a leashed enemy moves too far away, they are dragged towards the player, draining the player's stamina constantly. Attacking again or with any other weapon, moving too far away from the leashed target, running out of stamina, or attempting to drag the target through impassable terrain or structures…","titleZh":"深渊之枪","titleEn":"Abyssal Harpoon"},"p-0381ae0053d6515460e4.html":{"zh":"驼鹿肉 是通过击杀 驼鹿 获得的 极北之地 阶段食物。 可以在 铁烹饪台 上烤成 熟驼鹿肉 ；若任其烧焦，则会变成 木炭 。","en":"Moose Meat is a Deep North -tier food obtained by killing Moose . It can be cooked on a Iron Cooking Station to obtain Cooked Moose Meat , or Coal if left to burn.","titleZh":"驼鹿肉","titleEn":"Moose Meat"},"p-03934c8d0af2dc1b96c3.html":{"zh":"鹿肉炖锅 是一种 黑暗林山 级别的 食物 。","en":"Deer stew is a Black Forest -tier food .","titleZh":"鹿肉炖锅","titleEn":"Deer Stew"},"p-040d4645676f60263590.html":{"zh":"舒适度 等级决定 休息中效果 持续时间。舒适度1时最短8分钟，每额外一级增加1分钟，普通物品最高29分钟，配齐两种罕见季节物品最高31分钟。 通常最高舒适度为22。附近还有 仲夏柱 或 耶鲁树 时为23，两者都有则为24。 进入 诡秘墓穴 等大多数地下城时，可建篝火，轻松获得3舒适度及10分钟 休息好了 效果。 注意，同类别家具可以放多个，但只有舒适度最高者影响总舒适度。","en":"Comfort level determines the duration of Resting Effect . Minimum duration is 8 minutes (at 1 comfort), with each additional comfort level stacking 1 minute up to 29 minutes with usual items and 31 minutes with both rare seasonal items. The max comfort normally achievable is 22. If also near a Maypole or the Yule Tree 23, and if both then 24.","titleZh":"舒适度","titleEn":"Comfort"},"p-0410aab66e3f48e5e615.html":{"zh":"泥泞沼泽 是压抑的 生物群系 ，充满巨树、泥沼与敌对生物。巨大裸枝的 古树 伸向病态阴云，景象骇人。稀少陆地上的湿土蜿蜒穿过遍布此地、深及膝盖的疫水。 尸鬼 四处蹒跚，等待杀死活着的维京人，向早已不再倾听的诸神证明自己值得升天。 从难度上说，沼泽是刻意设置的障碍。初次进入时，整片土地似乎都在尽快致玩家于死地，所有生物都敌对。不论别处天气如何，这里始终下雨，玩家行进时一直 潮湿 ，耐力负担严酷。夜间还会 寒冷 ，并可能被 鬼魅 追赶。 毒素 也无处不在，是 大型软泥怪 、 软泥怪 和 蚂蟥 的主要攻击手段。必须善用前一生物群系解锁的特定 蜜酒 。 规模稍大的沼泽散布着 地下圣堂 ，需用 沼泽密钥 开启。墓室近乎废墟，蜿蜒走廊塌陷并被 泥泞的废料堆 堵住，开采可得 铁碎屑 、 皮革碎片 和 枯骨 。地表还有半浸水的废弃建筑、 敌对生物 生物生成点 ，以及偶尔出现的 焰灵 间歇泉 。","en":"The Swamp is an oppressive biome , filled with massive trees, muddy bogs, and hostile creatures. Immense, bare-branched Ancient Trees claw at a sickly cloud-laden sky, making for intimidating vistas. On what small bit of ground exists, tendrils of sodden soil snake around and through the knee-deep, plague-ridden water that permeates the entire biome. Draugr stumble about everywhere, watching and waiting to slay any…","titleZh":"泥泞沼泽","titleEn":"Swamp"},"p-044150b84ac15036af52.html":{"zh":"木材 指主要从以下来源取得的材料： 树木 :","en":"Wood refers to materials primarily obtained from Trees :","titleZh":"木材（消歧义）","titleEn":"Wood (disambiguation)"},"p-04caab7e4dc6c2e5106a.html":{"zh":"这是 魔法 的 分类 ，它属于一种 武器 。","en":"This is a category for magic which is a type of weapons .","titleZh":"分类：魔法","titleEn":"Category:Magic"},"p-056b1b13b5feec55d7de.html":{"zh":"余烬肋骨 是 灰烬之地 首领 青焰龙王 掉落的物品。","en":"Kindled Ribs is an item dropped from the Ashlands boss Fader .","titleZh":"余烬肋骨","titleEn":"Kindled Ribs"},"p-0651370538a2121c7d94.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣头颅 是破坏自然生成的 灰烬刚鬣腐尸 获得的资源，主要位于 腐朽之穴 入口或 秃鹫巢穴 附近。 破坏骸骨可能掉落灰烬刚鬣头骨，或其他三种骸骨部件之一。","en":"Asksvin Skull is a resource gathered by breaking naturally spawned Asksvin Carrion , found mainly near Putrid Hole entrances or Volture Nests . Destroying the Skeletons can drop the Asksvin Skull or any of the other three Asksvin Skeleton pieces.","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣头颅","titleEn":"Asksvin Skull"},"p-07113ec214480c3c68c3.html":{"zh":"冰火之剑 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境之剑 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 劈砍 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境之剑在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Frostfire Sword is a version of Nord Sword upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of Slash damage in exchange of a larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. An upgraded Nord Sword will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"冰火之剑","titleEn":"Frostfire Sword"},"p-0748be49e0e1c67938d8.html":{"zh":"狂战之斧：原始 是使用 翡翠 强化 狂战之斧 得到的版本。与所有使用翡翠强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 毒素伤害 ，且命中效果有20%概率施加 定身 。 已升级的狂战之斧在改造为狂战之斧：原始时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Primal Berserkir Axes are the upgraded form of Berserkir Axes using the Jade . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Jade, they gain 10 poison damage and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply Immobilized . An upgraded Berserkir Axes will NOT keep their upgrade level when they are made into Primal Berserkir Axes.","titleZh":"狂战之斧：原始","titleEn":"Primal Berserkir Axes"},"p-0785d5ed151c6d050fc1.html":{"zh":"青铜斧 是第三种单手 斧 ，可用于砍伐 古老的 、 桦树 、 山毛榉 、 冷杉 、 橡树 和 松树 树木。","en":"Bronze Axe is the third one-handed axe . It can be used to chop down Ancient , Birch , Beech , Fir , Oak and Pine trees.","titleZh":"青铜斧","titleEn":"Bronze Axe"},"p-0790ec5648c1aaf08864.html":{"zh":"间歇泉 是 幽暗沼泽 生态区中的 地点 ，是提供 火效果 的火焰喷口，由3只 焰灵 保护。 每只焰灵被杀后5分钟重生， 玩家基地 建筑会抑制 生成点 。","en":"Geyser is a Point of interest found in Swamp biomes. It is a fire geyser which provides Fire Effect and is protected by 3 Surtlings . Each Surtling respawns 5 minutes after it has been killed. The spawn points are suppressed by Player base structures.","titleZh":"间歇泉","titleEn":"Geyser"},"p-079447a598eca32ab2e0.html":{"zh":"此分类收录未完成内容，通常非完整可玩，仅 控制台命令 可访问，甚至无法访问。使用可能导致崩溃、世界损坏等非预期效果。 说明: ：非未完成或新文章分类，后者应加 进行中的工作 或 小作品 提示。","en":"This category is for unfinished content in the game. Such content is usually not in a fully playable state, is often only accessible through console commands (if even that), and if played is likely to trigger unintended side effects (e.g. crashes; world corruption). Note: This is not for incomplete or new articles, which should have a Work in progress (or Stub ) notice instead.","titleZh":"分类：未完成内容","titleEn":"Category:Unfinished"},"p-07db9f275666957d3c1e.html":{"zh":"建造和修复 原木结构 需要 圆木 ，且附近必须有 工作台 。","en":"Log structures require Corewood and the proximity of a Workbench to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"原木结构","titleEn":"Log Structures"},"p-083440ecdf30db40bf8b.html":{"zh":"石化巨魔长老 是 极北之地 中的资源节点。 巨魔长老 被击败后变成它，石化肢体也会自然生成，部分埋在雪中。 可在其上建造，或用 余烬炸药 炸开获得 石化组织 ，即 血金 原料。","en":"Petrified Gammeltroll is a resource node found in the Deep North . A Gammeltroll turns into one upon being defeated, and their petrified limbs can be found naturally, partially buried in the snow. They can be built on, or blown up with Ember Charges to obtain Petrified Tissue , the raw source of Bloodgold .","titleZh":"石化巨魔长老","titleEn":"Petrified Gammeltroll"},"p-08a0e2db3de2d51c2d5a.html":{"zh":"梅金吉奧德腰带 是一条可向 霍尔德 购买的腰带。","en":"The Megingjord is a belt that can be purchased from Haldor .","titleZh":"梅金吉奧德腰带","titleEn":"Megingjord"},"p-08bd7cbf4b138e67be4a.html":{"zh":"狂暴 是穿齐 熊皮套装 三件套后获得的 状态效果 。 它给出:","en":"Berserk is a status effect granted by wearing all three pieces of the Bear Set . It gives:","titleZh":"狂暴","titleEn":"Berserk"},"p-08c3de6f85c26afa91ec.html":{"zh":"黑金属防护神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Black Metal Protection Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"黑金属防护神像","titleEn":"Black Metal Protection Idol"},"p-08f2262ff8efec1b899b.html":{"zh":"拉塔托斯克药剂 是一种 泥泞沼泽 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：拉塔托斯克 发酵 而成。","en":"Tonic of Ratatosk is a Swamp -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Ratatosk .","titleZh":"拉塔托斯克药剂","titleEn":"Tonic of Ratatosk"},"p-09018b603a2759125189.html":{"zh":"甲壳之矛 是第五种 矛 。 甲壳之矛可以驱散9米半径内 迷雾之地 的 雾 。","en":"Carapace Spear is the fifth spear . The Carapace Spear is capable of dispelling the Mist of Mistlands in a 9-meter radius.","titleZh":"甲壳之矛","titleEn":"Carapace Spear"},"p-0934d986e83348d75cab.html":{"zh":"浴缸 是可放在任何地板上的装饰物，须在 工作台 范围内使用 工具锤 建造。需要 木材 作为燃料，点燃时产生烟雾。浴缸有燃料时还会提高2点 舒适度 。 浴缸独有的效果是让玩家在湿身时也能获得 休息好了效果 ，通常情况下无法做到。 用锤子拆除浴缸只返还建造材料，不返还用作燃料的木材；所有燃料木材 不会 掉落。 运行时提供 火效果 ，但范围只有周围约一米。","en":"The Hot tub is a decorative item that can be placed on any flooring, and can be built using the Hammer within the range of a Workbench . It requires Wood as fuel and produces smoke while lit. The Hot Tub also increases the Comfort level by 2 when fueled. Uniquely, the hot tub will allow a player to gain the Rested Effect while wet, something that is not normally possible.","titleZh":"浴缸","titleEn":"Hot Tub"},"p-0943e60455f782e19cb1.html":{"zh":"迷雾之地限定菇菇大杂烩 属于 迷雾之地 阶段的 宴席 。","en":"Mushrooms Galore á la Mistlands is the Mistlands -tier Feast .","titleZh":"迷雾之地限定菇菇大杂烩","titleEn":"Mushrooms Galore á la Mistlands"},"p-0953e68a3e85ea3909e6.html":{"zh":"萨满 可能指：","en":"Shaman may refer to:","titleZh":"萨满","titleEn":"Shaman"},"p-09541df867b71f0f0f9a.html":{"zh":"熔岩 是 灰烬之地 中的环境危险和 地点 。 炎金属矿脉 位于熔岩湖，被击中后可能开始沉入熔岩。","en":"Lava is an environmental hazard and point of interest found in Ashlands . Flametal Ore Veins are located in lava lakes, and can start sinking into the lava when struck.","titleZh":"熔岩","titleEn":"Lava"},"p-09657e958f0360caf695.html":{"zh":"轻羽之落 是穿戴 轻羽斗篷 获得的 状态效果 。 将坠落速度限制为5米/秒，完全免除坠落伤害，并降低20%跳跃耐力消耗。 迷雾之地 地形常崎岖且高耸，因此羽毛披风是探索必备装备。 坠落时冲刺可提高横向速度，而非仅滑翔，但仍消耗正常冲刺所需耐力。","en":"Feather fall is a status effect granted by wearing the Feather Cape . It limits the player's fall speed to 5 meters per second, completely negates fall damage, and reduces stamina used to jump by 20%. The negated fall damage makes the feather cape an essential part of equipment for exploring the Mistlands due to the biomes often jagged and high reaching terrain.","titleZh":"轻羽之落","titleEn":"Feather fall"},"p-096aa981e1fc62642741.html":{"zh":"雷电石 是在家园更新加入的物品，用于建造 湮灭者 。","en":"Thunder stone is an item which got introduced in the Hearth & Home update and is used to construct the Obliterator .","titleZh":"雷电石","titleEn":"Thunder Stone"},"p-0994e04807c83191d7fa.html":{"zh":"生物生成点 是可破坏对象，持续生成敌对 生物 ，详情见 生物生成点 。","en":"Creature spawners are destructible entities which continuously spawns hostile creatures . See Creature spawner for details.","titleZh":"分类：生物生成点","titleEn":"Category:Creature spawner"},"p-09e99d8899cd6b725e32.html":{"zh":"椅子 是家具，玩家可以坐下，也可以单纯用于装饰。","en":"Chairs are furniture. They can be used for the player to sit on, or as simple decorative objects.","titleZh":"椅子","titleEn":"Chairs"},"p-0a146d869fbc9bd2b48c.html":{"zh":"灰烬之箭 是供弓使用的 弹药 ，也是 甲壳箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Charred arrows are ammunition for bows and are the next direct upgrade from Carapace Arrows .","titleZh":"灰烬之箭","titleEn":"Charred Arrow"},"p-0a4df7cea452516f7df2.html":{"zh":"超小浆块 是 极北之地 中 魔阁哈拉 内的被动生物。 他们没有攻击。","en":"Tiny Pulp is a passive creature found in Mörkhalla in the Deep North . They have no attacks.","titleZh":"超小浆块","titleEn":"Tiny Pulp"},"p-0a579ff7892e420c66cd.html":{"zh":"骨骺蛟龙牙 是一件用于制作 灰烬之地 级武器的物品。","en":"Bonemaw tooth is an item used to craft Ashlands -tier weapons.","titleZh":"骨骺蛟龙牙","titleEn":"Bonemaw Tooth"},"p-0a7321c2e8a095d0efaa.html":{"zh":"这是 弩炮弹药 的 分类 ，它们是一种供 弩炮 使用的弹药。","en":"This is a category for missiles which are a type of ammunition for the Ballista .","titleZh":"分类：弩炮弹药","titleEn":"Category:Missiles"},"p-0abe0ed3f0372633119c.html":{"zh":"蓝色简朴连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付350 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的黄铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Simple dress blue is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 350 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's brass chest .","titleZh":"蓝色简朴连衣裙","titleEn":"Simple dress blue"},"p-0b0d894862e6723e7fc3.html":{"zh":"蓝色绳结头巾 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付200 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的黄铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Blue Tied Headscarf is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 200 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's brass chest .","titleZh":"蓝色绳结头巾","titleEn":"Blue Tied Headscarf"},"p-0b68483166e56e881aed.html":{"zh":"霍尔德 是 黑暗林山 中的 角色 。他是一名 矮人 商人，穿棕色长袍、金色腰带和披风。买家拥有足够 钱币 且世界进度达到要求后，可在霍尔德营地购买多种独特物品。","en":"Haldor is a character found in Black Forest . He is a Dvergr trader wearing a brown cloak, a gold belt and cape. At his camp, Haldor sells several unique items that can be purchased if the buyer has a sufficient amount of Coins and world progression.","titleZh":"霍尔德","titleEn":"Haldor"},"p-0b6f0e962e08e815ce05.html":{"zh":"灰烬披风 是侧重战斗的 灰烬之地 级别 披风 ，使攻击耐力消耗降低-10%，格挡耐力消耗降低-20%。 灰烬刚鬣披风 是一种机动性更强的灰烬之地级别披风，侧重闪避和奔跑。","en":"Ashen Cape is the combat focused Ashlands -tier Cape . It reduces attack stamina usage by -10% and block stamina cost by -20%. A more mobile Ashlands-tier cape is the Asksvin Cloak , which is focused on dodging and running.","titleZh":"灰烬披风","titleEn":"Ashen Cape"},"p-0bc95893341358cb215a.html":{"zh":"个人宝箱 是一种小型 宝箱 ，有六个物品格，只有主人能使用。","en":"The Personal chest is a small chest with six item slots, and is accessible only to its owner.","titleZh":"个人宝箱","titleEn":"Personal Chest"},"p-0beb95c2b3abbaafcbdf.html":{"zh":"灰石屋顶 是 灰石 构件，在 灰烬之地 生态区域 获得灰石后可建造。建造和修复时附近需要 切石机 。 可用来 庇护 ，避免 雨水 导致易受影响的建筑 潮湿效果 和 风化 。","en":"Grausten roofs are Grausten building pieces that can be built after obtaining Grausten from the Ashlands biome . They require the proximity of a stonecutter to be built and repaired. They can be used to shelter from the effect of rain , which causes the Wet Effect and weathering of susceptible structures.","titleZh":"灰石屋顶","titleEn":"Grausten Roofs"},"p-0c081f92ac10a3f45e91.html":{"zh":"炸弹 是由角色投掷的武器，使用后会被消耗。 关于命中时会召唤生物的炸弹类型，请参阅 黏液炸弹 。","en":"Bombs are weapons that are thrown by the character and consumed when used. See Blob Bombs for a type of bombs that summon a creature on impact.","titleZh":"炸弹","titleEn":"Bombs"},"p-0c094b45c68266df7b22.html":{"zh":"徒手 是玩家最初的武器。伤害较低，但较慢的次要攻击（踢击）具有不错的击退和失衡效果。它们很快就会被制作出的武器和工具取代。 主要攻击为拳击，次要攻击为具有额外击退效果的踢击。两种攻击的基础钝击伤害均为5。拳击具有2连击，第二拳（左手）造成双倍伤害。","en":"Bare fists are the player's first weapons. They deal low damage, offering good knockback and stagger on the slower secondary attack (kick). They get quickly replaced by crafted weapons and tools. The primary attack is a punch, and the secondary attack is a kick that does additional knockback. Both attacks have a base value of 5 blunt damage. The punch has a 2-hit combo where the second punch (left hand) does double…","titleZh":"徒手","titleEn":"Bare Fists"},"p-0c7075cd78fb0b364720.html":{"zh":"废弃村落 是在 极北之地 发现的大型聚落。 村庄中留有昔日居民的 影子 。靠近时，它们会像 矮人 一样说话。幽影从不攻击，其他生物也会忽略它们。 家具可破坏以获取先前生态区的各种资源。墙上的战利品被破坏时，有5.5%概率掉落。","en":"Abandoned Villages are large settlements found in the Deep North . Shadows of their past inhabitants reside in these villages. They speak when approached, akin to Dvergr . Shadows never attack, and other creatures ignore them. The furniture can be destroyed for various resources from previous biomes. The trophies on the wall have a 5.5% chance to drop when destroyed.","titleZh":"废弃村落","titleEn":"Abandoned Village"},"p-0c874f581a4534f15f1e.html":{"zh":"伤害 是实体生命值的减少，影响许多核心玩法。几乎所有实体、物品或建筑都以某种方式使用此系统。","en":"Damage is a reduction of an entity's health points. It affects much of the core gameplay mechanics. Almost every entity, object, or structure utilizes this system in some way.","titleZh":"伤害","titleEn":"Damage"},"p-0c8b0dbef56c96272926.html":{"zh":"灶是 基础 设施，用于烹饪、睡眠和取暖。 建造需要 切石机 。","en":"Hearths are base structures used for cooking, sleeping and warmth. They require Stonecutter to be built.","titleZh":"灶","titleEn":"Hearth"},"p-0c9618e9849a62c68ff5.html":{"zh":"告示牌 是装饰物。","en":"Sign is a decorative object.","titleZh":"告示牌","titleEn":"Sign"},"p-0d02d1001fbc07d29e85.html":{"zh":"冰火钉锤 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境钉锤 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 钝击 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境钉锤在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Frostfire Mace is a version of Nord Mace upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of Blunt damage in exchange of a larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. An upgraded Nord Mace will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"冰火钉锤","titleEn":"Frostfire Mace"},"p-0d054f347f0573e05e09.html":{"zh":"骨骺蛟龙 是 灰烬之地 大陆周围沸水中的敌对生物，驶向此生物群系时构成重大威胁。","en":"Bonemaw are aggressive creatures found in the boiling waters surrounding the Ashlands landmass. They pose a significant danger when sailing to the biome.","titleZh":"骨骺蛟龙","titleEn":"Bonemaw"},"p-0d1211f1e566afaa4fc2.html":{"zh":"盾牌核心 是在已升级 工匠台 制作的材料。","en":"Shield Core is a crafting material that is created at an upgraded Artisan Table .","titleZh":"盾牌核心","titleEn":"Shield Core"},"p-0daaef24063979b8356d.html":{"zh":"黄色简朴连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付350 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的黄铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Simple dress yellow is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 350 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's brass chest .","titleZh":"黄色简朴连衣裙","titleEn":"Simple dress yellow"},"p-0e5b9b1a3c3e662228f9.html":{"zh":"维京墓地 是 极北之地 中的 地点 ，类似 青青草原 的 维京墓地 。 大石排船形，部分地点最多三座相邻。","en":"Viking Graveyard is a Point of interest found in Deep North , it similar to Viking Graveyard found in the Meadows . It is a stone formation of large rocks arranged in a ship-like shape. Some location can have up to three ship rock formations next to each other.","titleZh":"维京墓地 (北方深境)","titleEn":"Viking Graveyard (Deep North)"},"p-0ec102589cc30ceb4a26.html":{"zh":"灰烬术士 是 灰烬之地 中的敌对敌人。","en":"Charred Warlocks are hostile enemies found in the Ashlands .","titleZh":"灰烬术士","titleEn":"Charred Warlock"},"p-0ec76a1cfdaf3c70745c.html":{"zh":"草帽 可与 丰收上衣 或 丰收之裙 组成一套服装，同时穿戴两件时，玩家的 耕作技能 增加+25。连衣裙和上衣可以互换，效果相同。取回 黄铜宝箱 并交给 希尔德 后，即可向她购买。","en":"Straw Hat is a part of a set together with either the Harvest Tunic or Harvest Dress that increases the player's Farming skill by +25 so long as both pieces are worn. Both the dress and tunic can be used interchangeably for the same effect. It is sold by Hildir after retrieving and bringing her the Brass Chest .","titleZh":"草帽","titleEn":"Straw Hat"},"p-0ed31431075edc9fc6e7.html":{"zh":"沼泽居民限定套餐 属于 泥泞沼泽 阶段的 宴席 。","en":"Swamp Dweller's Delight is the Swamp -tier Feast .","titleZh":"沼泽居民限定套餐","titleEn":"Swamp Dweller's Delight"},"p-0ed88e3fe7b841294d98.html":{"zh":"霜铸熔炉 是 极北之地 阶段的制作设施，将 铸坯 固化为北方深境的武器、护甲、盾牌、法杖及 隐秘钥匙 成品。","en":"Frost Foundry is a structure used to craft in the Deep North . It hardens Casts into finished Deep North weapons, armor, shields, staffs and the Intricate Key .","titleZh":"霜铸熔炉","titleEn":"Frost Foundry"},"p-0f37637232d4dab162e6.html":{"zh":"获取方式 以下对象掉落10个： 冰霜龙母 在她被击败时。 用途 建材 工匠台 说明 可放置物品架上，散发光芒及雾粒子。","en":"Availability 10 are dropped by Moder upon her defeat. Usage Building Artisan Table Notes Can be placed on an item stand. Emits light and fog particles.","titleZh":"龙之泪","titleEn":"Dragon Tear"},"p-0f62a4faddb4022baf42.html":{"zh":"尼德霍格：嗜血 是使用 血石 强化 尼德霍格 得到的版本。与所有使用血石强化的武器一样，玩家每缺少1点 生命值 ，其伤害就提高0.2% （不要与生命值百分比混淆） 。 已升级的尼德霍格在改造为尼德霍格：嗜血时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Nidhögg the Bleeding is the upgraded form of Nidhögg using the Bloodstone . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, its damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of health the player is missing (not to be confused with health percentage) . An upgraded Nidhögg will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Nidhögg the Bleeding.","titleZh":"尼德霍格：嗜血","titleEn":"Nidhögg the Bleeding"},"p-0fdfc499d66664e054b0.html":{"zh":"银项链 是一种 珍贵 物品。","en":"Silver Necklace is a Valuable item.","titleZh":"银项链","titleEn":"Silver Necklace"},"p-108040ac289a13952927.html":{"zh":"红宝石 是一种 珍贵 物品。","en":"Ruby is a Valuable item.","titleZh":"红宝石","titleEn":"Ruby"},"p-109d6f455ed8c31a4919.html":{"zh":"树木 是木材主要来源。成年树破坏后变为大原木，倒下并撞击路径中的物体。原木按树种掉不同木材，树桩始终掉普通木材。","en":"Trees are the primary source of wood. When destroyed, a full-grown tree will become a giant log that will fall over and collide with any objects in its path. Logs drop various types of wood, depending on the kind of tree. Stumps always drop ordinary wood.","titleZh":"树木","titleEn":"Trees"},"p-10b86caa1a176c41e2e7.html":{"zh":"矮人木结构 是 迷雾之地 阶段的构件，建造和修复需要 世界之树木 ，且附近须有 黑熔炉 。","en":"Dvergr Wood Structures are Mistlands -tier structures that require Yggdrasil Wood and the proximity of a Black Forge to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"矮人木结构","titleEn":"Dvergr Wood Structures"},"p-114663d5de683ac8c020.html":{"zh":"鹿皮斗篷 是一件 护甲 部件，可在 工作台 处使用 鹿皮 和 白骨碎片 制作。拾取过每种材料至少一个后解锁。","en":"Deer Hide Cape is an armor piece made of Deer Hides and Bone Fragments at the Workbench . It is unlocked after picking up one of each of the materials.","titleZh":"鹿皮斗篷","titleEn":"Deer Hide Cape"},"p-117d3c5bad0c35da1372.html":{"zh":"燃烧中 是受到 火焰 伤害导致的 状态效果 ，例如走入火中或被火球命中。持续五秒，每秒结算一次。继续受到火焰伤害会在现有燃烧效果上叠加，并重新计算每次伤害。可按以下公式计算： T o T a L d a m a g e d u r a T i o n 燃烧造成 纯粹伤害 伤害。护甲和火抗通过降低初始火焰伤害，间接影响效果，但不影响已获得的燃烧。","en":"Burning is a status effect caused by taking Fire damage, for example by walking into a fire or getting hit by a fireball. It lasts for five seconds and ticks every second. Taking additional fire damage will stack damage on top of the current burning effect and recalculate the tick damage. Tick damage can be calculated with:","titleZh":"燃烧中","titleEn":"Burning"},"p-1186848d7a453feba09c.html":{"zh":"北境拳链 是一种 极北之地 级别的 拳类 。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境拳链铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Knucklechains are Deep North -tier Fists . They cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Knucklechains and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境拳链","titleEn":"Nord Knucklechains"},"p-118a2bb728d3e4705b01.html":{"zh":"地精村落 是常见于 北境平原 的 兴趣地点 。村落由各种丑地精建筑和农田组成。","en":"A Fuling Village is a point of interest commonly found in the Plains . The village is made up of various Fuling structures and farms.","titleZh":"地精村落","titleEn":"Fuling Village"},"p-119096d2823dd87da52f.html":{"zh":"烟熏炉 用于升级 铸铁锅 ，须建在大锅5米以内才能连接。","en":"The Smoker is an upgrade for the Cauldron . It must be built within 5 meters of a Cauldron to connect to it.","titleZh":"烟熏炉","titleEn":"Smoker"},"p-11d604bf8a96b131c1fd.html":{"zh":"雷血战矛 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境战矛 得到的版本。 它获得额外的 穿刺 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境战矛在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thunderblood Spear is a version of Nord Spear upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra Pierce and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Spear will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷血战矛","titleEn":"Thunderblood Spear"},"p-12400ad0838ff0fa04b1.html":{"zh":"大型软泥怪 是 泥泞沼泽 中的敌对 生物 ，是大型胶状、有意识的软泥团，散发有毒黄气。死亡后分裂成两只 软泥怪 。","en":"Oozers are aggressive creatures found in Swamps . They are large, gelatinous piles of sentient ooze that emit poisonous yellow gasses. Upon death, they split into two Blobs .","titleZh":"大型软泥怪","titleEn":"Oozer"},"p-12593033bc5d791a872e.html":{"zh":"数百年来，这个世界在不安中沉睡，却没有死去……冰河时代不断流逝，王国在诸神视线之外兴起又衰亡。 奥丁听闻敌人再次壮大，便望向米德加尔特，派女武神搜寻战场，寻找最伟大的战士。他们已在尘世死去，却将在此重生…… ……在英灵神殿！","en":"For centuries, this world slumbered uneasily. But it did not die... As glacial ages passed, kingdoms rose and fell out of sight of the gods. When Odin heard his enemies were growing once again in strength, he looked to Midgard and sent his Valkyries to scour the battlefields for the greatest of their warriors. Dead to the world, they would be born again...","titleZh":"背景故事","titleEn":"Lore"},"p-129a525d7ee7f882f8c1.html":{"zh":"风暴之牙 是使用 堇青石 改造 灰烬之牙 得到的版本。与所有使用 堇青石 强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 闪电 伤害 ；但这把弓比较特殊，其命中效果有20%概率施加 连锁闪电 。 已升级的灰烬之牙在改造为风暴之牙时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Storm Fang is the modified form of Ash Fang using Iolite . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Iolite , they gain 10 lightning damage , however, the bow is unique in that its hit effect has a 20% chance to apply Chain lightning . An upgraded Ash Fang will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Storm Fang.","titleZh":"风暴之牙","titleEn":"Storm Fang"},"p-12cce28e437bb04fce18.html":{"zh":"冰霜之杖 是 迷雾之地 更新加入的四种 魔法 武器之一。主要攻击快速发射低精度的冰冻碎片。虽然精度较差严重限制了有效射程，但冰冻效果会减缓被命中的敌人，让玩家能够连续命中体型小、速度快的敌人，并与其保持距离。 法杖伤害和埃达之能消耗取决于施法者的 元素魔法 技能等级。与其他魔法武器一样，它没有次要攻击。 处于 潮湿 状态的敌人弱于 冰霜伤害 ，会受到该法杖的额外伤害。","en":"Staff of Frost is one of four Magic weapons introduced in the Mistlands update. Its primary attack fires freezing shards of ice at a rapid pace with low accuracy. While its poor accuracy limits the staff's effective range severely, the freezing effect slows any enemies hit by the attack. This allows even small and fast enemies to be hit repeatedly and kept at a distance.","titleZh":"冰霜之杖","titleEn":"Staff of Frost"},"p-12d95f450c74a120a7f0.html":{"zh":"矮人板条箱 是资源节点，可在 迷雾之地 各处 矮人 聚落找到。 找到此结构是推进迷雾之地阶段的必要条件，因为破坏它是获取关键制作材料 矮人提取器 的唯一方式。但矮人零件箱所在建筑住有 矮人刺客 或 矮人法师 ，玩家直接损伤箱子或其 守护石 保护的其他建筑，会使其敌对。间接伤害或非玩家来源可安全损伤箱子，不激怒矮人。","en":"Dvergr Component Crates are resource nodes that can be found in Dvergr settlements throughout the Mistlands . Finding this structure is necessary to progress through the Mistlands tier, as destroying it is the only way to obtain the Dvergr Extractor , a crucial crafting component. However, doing so can be dangerous, since the structures that the Dvergr Component Crate is found at are home to Dvergr Rogues and/or Dve…","titleZh":"矮人板条箱","titleEn":"Dvergr Component Crate"},"p-12e29dba51068fb584d2.html":{"zh":"丑地精萨满 是 北境平原 中的敌对 生物 ，占据 地精村落 。它们类似哥布林，进行仪式，似乎拥有自己的部落文化。 符文石 和 图腾 暗示它们崇拜早已死去的国王 亚格鲁斯 。","en":"Fuling shamans are aggressive creatures found in Plains occupying Fuling Villages . They are ritualistic, goblin-like beings that appear to possess their own tribalistic culture. It is implied through runestones and totems that they worship Yagluth , a long dead king.","titleZh":"丑地精萨满","titleEn":"Fuling Shaman"},"p-12ff393b061d94ebc405.html":{"zh":"睡眠 需要 床铺 、 龙床 或 灰烬之木床榻 ，仅夜间可进行，会将 白天 与夜间循环 推进至次日清晨。","en":"Sleeping requires a Bed , Dragon Bed or Ashwood Bed and can only be done at night, which will progress the Day and Night Cycle to the start of the next day (morning).","titleZh":"睡眠","titleEn":"Sleeping"},"p-1328568776f0d0a4cf4d.html":{"zh":"冰火宝剑 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境宝剑 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 劈砍 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境宝剑在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Frostfire Greatsword is a version of Nord Greatsword upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of Slash damage in exchange of a larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. An upgraded Nord Greatsword will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"冰火宝剑","titleEn":"Frostfire Greatsword"},"p-1344c892061bb2f1129f.html":{"zh":"动物低语酒 是一种 凛冽雪山 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：动物低语 发酵 而成。","en":"Brew of animal whispers is a Mountain -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Animal whispers .","titleZh":"动物低语酒","titleEn":"Brew of Animal Whispers"},"p-134c1125a5e029dae10d.html":{"zh":"芬里 是夜间出现在 凛冽雪山 的敌对 生物 ，外形明显像狼人，披黑色皮毛，双腿站立。与其 冰霜洞穴( 洞穴) 同类 不同，芬里只有后腿用于行走。","en":"Fenrings are aggressive creatures found in the Mountains during the night. Their appearance is distinctly werewolf-like, standing on two legs with a black fur coat. Unlike their Frost cave counterparts , Fenrings only walk on their hind-legs.","titleZh":"芬里","titleEn":"Fenring"},"p-13a1e8464c6154d79e84.html":{"zh":"废弃前哨 是在 黑暗林山 中发现的 地点 ，是主要由 石制结构 建成的破败建筑，由 灰矮人 和 骷髅怪 守卫，共有9种版本。 所有版本都有两只 乌鸦 在周围飞翔。","en":"Abandoned Outposts are Points of interest found in the Black Forest . They are ruined buildings made mainly of Stone Structures and are guarded by Greydwarfs and Skeletons . They come in 9 different versions. All versions have two Crows flying around.","titleZh":"废弃前哨","titleEn":"Abandoned Outpost"},"p-13b9a13264be7d118df2.html":{"zh":"血金箭 是供 弓 使用的 弹药 。","en":"Bloodgold Arrow are ammunition for bows .","titleZh":"血金箭","titleEn":"Bloodgold Arrow"},"p-13da3e1afcd577d3a71d.html":{"zh":"沼泽墓地 是 幽暗沼泽 中的 地点 ，六块大石环绕，中央另两石。","en":"Swamp Graves are Points of interest found in the Swamp . They are a circle of six large stones with two additional stones in the center.","titleZh":"沼泽墓地","titleEn":"Swamp Grave"},"p-13f745dcf1c5c37a52a8.html":{"zh":"雷击法杖 是一根 极北之地 元素魔法 法杖。 雷击的主要攻击消耗40点 埃达之能 发射一枚弹体。弹体命中时会召来一道闪电，在3米半径内造成 闪电 伤害。","en":"Lightning Strike is a Deep North Elemental magic staff. The Lightning Strike primary attack use 40 Eitr to launch a projectile, on hit the projectile calls a lighting strike than deals Lightning damage in a 3 meters radius.","titleZh":"雷击法杖","titleEn":"Lightning Strike"},"p-13fdc5f43095033d7619.html":{"zh":"被囚禁的矮人 是 墨尔克哈拉 中的中立 极北之地 生物。 与其他 矮人 一样，不主动攻击玩家。玩家伤害其中一名时，它及20米内其他中立生物，包括其他矮人，都变敌对。它们与包含 巨人战士 和 巨人巫师 的 北方深境阵营 敌对，双方互战。","en":"Imprisoned Dvergr are neutral Deep North creatures found in Mörkhalla . Like other Dvergr , they don't attack players on their own. When a player damages one, it and all other neutral creatures within 20 meters, including other Dvergr, become hostile. They are enemies of the Deep North faction , which includes Krigen and Hexen , and the two sides fight each other.","titleZh":"被囚禁的矮人","titleEn":"Imprisoned Dvergr"},"p-1431dd9e4d6387622eff.html":{"zh":"棕色珠饰连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付550 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的青铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Beaded dress brown is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 550 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's bronze chest .","titleZh":"棕色珠饰连衣裙","titleEn":"Beaded dress brown"},"p-145b4ccc4dcfdf3b6f9e.html":{"zh":"罐子碎片 是破坏 腐朽之穴 或 焦骨废墟 内 上古之坛 获取的物品，可在 灰烬头颅 附近作为掉落物找到。","en":"Pot shard is an item found by destroying Ancient Pots inside Putrid Hole or Charred Ruins . You can find them as a droppable item near to Charred Skull","titleZh":"罐子碎片","titleEn":"Pot Shard"},"p-145c3776759b85ad1b41.html":{"zh":"北方深境小屋 是 极北之地 中的特殊地点。","en":"Deep North Hut is a point of interest found in the Deep North .","titleZh":"北方深境小屋","titleEn":"Deep North Hut"},"p-148c837566db80d01943.html":{"zh":"雄伟甲壳 由蛊虫之后掉落，是建造 工艺液压机 所需材料。","en":"Majestic carapace is an item dropped by The Queen. It is required to build the Artisan Press .","titleZh":"雄伟甲壳","titleEn":"Majestic Carapace"},"p-1500704d1f33f31ceae5.html":{"zh":"美味鱼汤 是一种 极北之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Fish Soup is a Deep North -tier food .","titleZh":"美味鱼汤","titleEn":"Fish Soup"},"p-156193387bc71c75f505.html":{"zh":"凛冽雪山 是 生物群系 ，冰冻积雪山峰间点缀 冷杉 。这片寒冷无情的区域是 巨狼 及其他 芬瑞尔 儿子们 的家园。 冰霜龙母 的后代 霜龙 在空中飞翔，并在峰顶筑巢，产下 龙蛋 。小心移动的石堆，它们可能比看起来更有生命，那是沉睡的 石魔 被惊醒了。 山地也有 冰霜洞穴 ，里面住着 狂信徒 及其宠物 巨狼 。 邪蝠 同样栖居此处，会惊吓毫无防备的维京人。墙上自然生长 水晶 ，有时还有巨大的地下湖，要小心别惊醒可能沉睡其中的 石魔 。 进入山地会使玩家获得 冻僵 。饮用 抗霜蜜酒 ，穿 平原牦牛披风 、 狼毛披风 、 芬里之甲 、 轻羽斗篷 或 狼皮护甲 宝箱 可消除； 狼皮护甲双腿 不提供冰霜抗性。附近营火也可消除此效果。","en":"The Mountain is a biome which features frozen snow covered peaks framed with Fir trees. This frozen and unforgiving region is home to Wolves and others sons of Fenrir . Drakes , the offspring of Moder , can be found in the skies making their nests at its peaks where they lay their Dragon Eggs . Beware shifting piles of stone, they might be more alive than you think, stirring the resting Stone Golem .","titleZh":"凛冽雪山","titleEn":"Mountain"},"p-1570488ba4adde9e21cd.html":{"zh":"冰火精华 用于将诺德武器升级为霜火变体，由 堕落战士 掉落。将三个 纪念用炭 放在 纪念地 祭坛上即可召唤。 霜火武器的主要伤害类型降低，但增加 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害，总伤害高于基础武器。","en":"Frostfire Essence is a material used to upgrade Nord weapons to their Frostfire variants. They are dropped by Fallen Warriors summoned by placing three Memorial Coal on the altar found at the Memorial Place . Frostfire weapons have a decreased amount of their main damage type, but gain Fire and Frost damage, combining to a greater amount of total damage than the base weapon.","titleZh":"冰火精华","titleEn":"Frostfire Essence"},"p-16354fd1bf736e8edc9d.html":{"zh":"铁制火炉 是可放在任何表面上的光源。","en":"The Iron Fire Pit is a light source that can be placed on any surface.","titleZh":"铁制火炉","titleEn":"Iron Fire Pit"},"p-16437a1d61a391a00e48.html":{"zh":"金枪鱼 是 无尽之海 中的被动 生物 （ 鱼 ）。 钓竿配 重磅鱼饵 捕获，鱼饵在 灶台 用 鱼饵 和一个 蛟龙战利品 制作。 用于制作 钓鱼帽","en":"Tuna are passive creatures ( fish ) found in the Ocean biome. They can be caught with a fishing pole using Heavy fishing bait which can be crafted at a Food Preparation Table using Fishing Bait and a Serpent Trophy . Needed to craft a Fishing Hat","titleZh":"金枪鱼","titleEn":"Tuna"},"p-1676f81be4640d72df67.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣鞍 让玩家能够骑乘驯服的 灰烬刚鬣 。","en":"Asksvin Saddles grant the ability to ride tamed Asksvins .","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣鞍","titleEn":"Asksvin Saddle"},"p-168bab265c26142e0344.html":{"zh":"奥丁蜜酒角杯 是额外下载内容物品，仅向 英灵神殿 早期支持者提供。Iron Gate工作室向报名 《英灵神殿》测试 者发送含Steam兑换码的邮件。若曾报名，检查邮箱。","en":"Mead Horn of Odin is a DLC item. It is only available for the early supporters of Valheim via a Steam code sent out in an email from Iron Gate Studios to those who signed up for the Valheim Beta . Check your email if you signed up!","titleZh":"奥丁蜜酒角杯","titleEn":"Mead Horn of Odin"},"p-16b1fde967e644e22886.html":{"zh":"尼德霍格：原始 是使用 翡翠 强化 尼德霍格 得到的版本。与所有使用翡翠强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 毒素伤害 ，且命中效果有20%概率施加 定身 。 已升级的尼德霍格在改造为尼德霍格：原始时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Nidhögg the Primal is the upgraded form of Nidhögg using Jade . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Jade, they gain 10 poison damage and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply Immobilized . An upgraded Nidhögg will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Nidhögg the Primal.","titleZh":"尼德霍格：原始","titleEn":"Nidhögg the Primal"},"p-16d9b8cca47b877b223d.html":{"zh":"吊火盆 是可挂在表面下方的光源，须在 熔炉 范围内建造。","en":"The Hanging brazier is a light source that can be placed on the underside of a surface, and must be built within the range of a Forge .","titleZh":"吊火盆","titleEn":"Hanging Brazier"},"p-1707716a9bbdc8d93c3d.html":{"zh":"矮人板条箱 是资源节点，可在 迷雾之地 各处 矮人 聚落找到。 没有功能，但破坏后掉落多种有用资源。不过，箱子所在建筑住有 矮人刺客 或 矮人法师 ，玩家直接损伤箱子或其 守护石 保护的其他建筑，会使其敌对。间接伤害或非玩家来源可安全损伤箱子，不激怒矮人。","en":"Dvergr Crates are resource nodes that can be found in Dvergr settlements throughout the Mistlands . They have no function, but drop several useful resources when destroyed. However, destroying them can be dangerous, since the structures that crates are found at are home to Dvergr Rogues and/or Dvergr Mages , who will turn hostile if a crate (or any other structure under protection of their Wards ) is damaged directl…","titleZh":"矮人板条箱","titleEn":"Dvergr Crate"},"p-17aa464d9865a8a7a39a.html":{"zh":"古钟碎片 是 灰烬城堡 内塔祭坛上的物品，位于 灰烬之地 天空可见绿色光锥正下方。摧毁钟祭坛掉落2至4块碎片。 碎片用于在 黑熔炉 制作 古钟 ，召唤首领 青焰龙王 。","en":"Bell fragments are an item found on an altar in the inner tower of a Charred Fortress , directly under the green cone of light visible in the sky in the Ashlands . A bell altar drops 2 to 4 fragments when destroyed. The fragments are used to craft a Bell at the Black Forge that is used for summoning the boss Fader .","titleZh":"古钟碎片","titleEn":"Bell Fragment"},"p-17ade7cd79559b3770b2.html":{"zh":"撕裂者：嗜血 是使用 血石 强化 撕裂者 得到的版本。与所有使用血石强化的武器一样，玩家每缺少1点 生命值 ，其伤害就提高0.2% （不要与生命值百分比混淆） 。 已升级的撕裂者在改造为撕裂者：嗜血时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Splitnir the Bleeding is the upgraded form of Splitnir using the Bloodstone . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, its damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of health the player is missing (not to be confused with health percentage) . An upgraded Splitnir will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Splitnir the Bleeding.","titleZh":"撕裂者：嗜血","titleEn":"Splitnir the Bleeding"},"p-182d36cf46bc2fe2630e.html":{"zh":"丑地精小屋 是 北境平原 中的特殊地点，共有三种变体。","en":"Fuling Huts are points of interest found in the Plains . They come in three variants.","titleZh":"丑地精小屋","titleEn":"Fuling Hut"},"p-183093b435b35d733d5b.html":{"zh":"常春藤种子 在沼泽女巫更新加入，可向 沼泽女巫 以65枚 钱币 购买三个。常春藤种子可用 耕地耙 种成 常春藤 。","en":"Ivy seeds were added in the Bog Witch update, three of which can be purchased from The Bog Witch for 65 Coins . Ivy seeds can be used to plant an Ivy with a Cultivator .","titleZh":"常春藤种子","titleEn":"Ivy Seeds"},"p-190e598c1c7db724b7ca.html":{"zh":"铁烹饪台 可将生肉原料烤熟，放得过久则变成 木炭 。铁烹饪台下方必须有 灶 或两个 营火 。 铁烹饪台能烹饪所有肉类，包括普通 烹饪台 放不下的大块肉。但由于体积较大，烹饪小块肉时的空间利用率略低。 铁烹饪台最多可同时烹饪五份肉。","en":"The Iron Cooking Station is used to cook raw meat type ingredients into their cooked form, or if left too long, into Coal . For the meat to be cooked, it is necessary to have a Hearth or two Campfires underneath the iron cooking station. An Iron Cooking Station can be used to cook all meat, including those meats too large for a regular Cooking Station . Due to the size of the iron cooking station, it is slightly les…","titleZh":"铁烹饪台","titleEn":"Iron Cooking Station"},"p-191045cee4ae67297ca6.html":{"zh":"斯库尔和哈提 是第六种 刀 ，也是第一种双手刀。","en":"Skoll and Hati is the sixth knife and the first two-handed knife.","titleZh":"斯库尔和哈提","titleEn":"Skoll and Hati"},"p-194f34b1e32b84f99c44.html":{"zh":"灰烬之树 有概率掉落 碳化树脂 。","en":"Charcoal resin has a chance of dropping from Scorched Trees .","titleZh":"碳化树脂","titleEn":"Charcoal Resin"},"p-1964260e2e296c33c3f3.html":{"zh":"英灵神殿 体现多种 季节活动 ，目前包括仲夏、万圣节及圣诞。期间限定物品仅可在该时段制作或购买。 主要装饰，部分提供少量 舒适度 。季节结束后已制物品保留，但毁坏后无法重制。","en":"There are a number of seasonal events reflected in Valheim . Currently, these include Midsummer, Halloween, Yule (Christmas). These events are marked by the availability of items that can only be crafted (or purchased) during this time. These items are mainly cosmetic, but some provide a small amount of Comfort . Items created during these seasons remain once the season ends, but once destroyed cannot be remade.","titleZh":"季节活动","titleEn":"Seasonal events"},"p-1976a5863e7c98dd63a0.html":{"zh":"灰巨人 是 极北之地 中的敌对生物，形似冰冻的 古树长老 。 对多数物理伤害有抗性，但对 砍伐 为正常抗性。","en":"The Barka is a hostile creature found in the Deep North . It resembles a frozen The Elder . It is resistant to most physical damage types, but neutral to Chop .","titleZh":"灰巨人","titleEn":"Barka"},"p-1988cfabdbf3a7860ceb.html":{"zh":"黑金属匕首 是第五种 刀 。","en":"Black Metal Knife is the fifth knife .","titleZh":"黑金属匕首","titleEn":"Black Metal Knife"},"p-199165add8588843fdbf.html":{"zh":"驼鹿鞍 是可制作物品，让玩家骑乘驯服 驼鹿 。","en":"Moose Saddle is a craftable item that grants the ability to ride tamed Moose .","titleZh":"驼鹿鞍","titleEn":"Moose Saddle"},"p-199cb1c488fd759af819.html":{"zh":"可用 耕地耙 种植 洋葱种子 ，长成1x 洋葱 。","en":"Onion seeds can be planted using the Cultivator in order to grow 1x Onion .","titleZh":"洋葱种子","titleEn":"Onion Seeds"},"p-199e60bb991bda4446a7.html":{"zh":"战斧 是第一种双手 斧 。","en":"Battleaxe is the first two-handed axe .","titleZh":"战斧","titleEn":"Battleaxe"},"p-19a477292b9bd42a432a.html":{"zh":"火源类设施在点燃时提供火源效果和舒适度。","en":"Fires are structures which provide the Fire effect and Comfort, while lit.","titleZh":"分类：火源","titleEn":"Category:Fires"},"p-19e667dbe36cd74e7c1b.html":{"zh":"温顺生物 不攻击玩家或其他生物，但击杀或采集后提供有用资源。有时看似难杀，合适策略可大幅简化。","en":"Passive creatures do not attack the player or other creatures, but provide useful resources when killed (or harvested). Sometimes, these creatures seem to be difficult to kill, but using the right strategy will make killing them much easier.","titleZh":"被动生物攻略","titleEn":"Passive creature strategies"},"p-19f226cc3b9780d7bd02.html":{"zh":"雕纹方桌 是用 巨木 建造的 极北之地 桌子 。放在附近提高一点 舒适度 ，属于桌子舒适度组，因此只有附近舒适度最高的桌子生效。","en":"Square Carved Table is a Deep North table built from Timberwood . It increases Comfort by one when placed nearby; it belongs to the table comfort group, so only the highest-comfort table nearby counts.","titleZh":"雕纹方桌","titleEn":"Square Carved Table"},"p-19fec6566c7436e1d9fa.html":{"zh":"枯骨 是位于 地下圣堂 中 泥泞的废料堆 ，及 泥泞沼泽 生物群系 中 宝箱 的物品。","en":"Withered bones are items found in Muddy Scrap Piles in Sunken Crypts and in Chests in the Swamp biome .","titleZh":"枯骨","titleEn":"Withered Bone"},"p-1a234744f50cea328de9.html":{"zh":"石魔 是 凛冽雪山 中的 敌对生物 ，是覆雪的人形石体，身上可见银矿脉。受扰后从沉睡中苏醒，攻击玩家及其他生物。","en":"Stone Golems are aggressive creatures found in the Mountains . They are snow-covered stone humanoids with silver veins visible on their bodies. When disturbed, they awake from their slumber, attacking both the players and other creatures.","titleZh":"石魔","titleEn":"Stone Golem"},"p-1aac609b895c61d52438.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 锛斧 铁砧 工匠台 理发台 蜂房 鸟巢 黑熔炉 黑熔炉冷却器 高炉 屠夫台 铸铁锅 木炭窑 劈柴墩 烹饪台 埃达之力提炼器 永恒火堆 轻羽花环 发酵桶 灶台 熔炉 锻造风箱 冷却桶 熔炉工具架 寒冰窑 霜铸熔炉 古咒法台 宝石切割器 砂轮 铁烹饪台 蜜酒壶 金属切割器 杵与臼 湮灭者 锅碗瓢盆 擀面杖和菜板 符文台 树汁提取器 护盾发生器 冶炼炉 锻造铁砧 铁匠围裙 烟熏炉 调料架 纺车 立式织布机 石砌烤炉 切石机 皮革架 工具架 永恒之烛 台钳 风车 冥火之泉 工作台","en":"Pages in category Adze Anvils Artisan Table Barber Station Beehive Birds' Nest Black Forge Black Forge Cooler Blast Furnace Butcher's Table Cauldron Charcoal Kiln Chopping Block Cooking Station Eitr Refinery Eternal Pyre Feathery Wreath Fermenter Food Preparation Table Forge Forge Bellows Forge Cooler Forge Toolrack Frigid Kiln Frost Foundry Galdr Table Gem Cutter Grinding Wheel Iron Cooking Station Mead Ketill Meta…","titleZh":"分类：制作设施","titleEn":"Category:Crafting structures"},"p-1ab538b2a8e5515aaedf.html":{"zh":"东星斑 是 无尽之海 生态区水域中的被动 生物 （ 鱼 ）。鱼群可能位于 无尽之海 中央，有时也靠近其他 生态区域 海岸。 可用 鱼竿 配 重磅鱼饵 捕获。鱼饵可在 灶台 以20份 鱼饵 和一个 蛟龙战利品 制作。 用于制作 钓鱼帽","en":"Coral cod are passive creatures ( fish ) found in the waters of the Ocean biome. The schools can be in the middle of the Ocean or sometimes near other biomes ' shores. They can be caught with a Fishing Rod using Heavy Fishing Bait which can be made at the Food Preparation Table by combining 20 Fishing Bait and a Serpent Trophy .","titleZh":"东星斑","titleEn":"Coral Cod"},"p-1b176cfdc3c69a76b7f7.html":{"zh":"黑色大理石防护神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Black Marble Protection Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"黑色大理石防护神像","titleEn":"Black Marble Protection Idol"},"p-1b355bf8c0fa7e824e48.html":{"zh":"效果 区域是在部分生物、物品和建筑周围形成的隐形区域。","en":"Effects areas are invisible areas created around some creatures, items and structures.","titleZh":"效果区域","titleEn":"Effect areas"},"p-1b5d43e2a3aab828de3f.html":{"zh":"用于 弃誓者祭坛 召首领的物品，除战利品外无其他用途。","en":"Items used for the purpose of summoning the bosses at Forsaken Altars . Other than the trophies, none are used for any other purposes.","titleZh":"分类：首领召唤祭品","titleEn":"Category:Forsaken offerings"},"p-1b5d5dec2cf294305c33.html":{"zh":"铁制护甲 是一套 泥泞沼泽 级别的 护甲 ，比 巨魔套装 、 青铜护甲 和 熊皮套装 高一级，之后会被 芬里套装 或 狼皮护甲 替代。","en":"Iron Armor is a Swamp -tier armor . This set is the tier above the Troll Set , Bronze Armor , and the Bear Set , and is replaced by the Fenris Set or Wolf Armor .","titleZh":"铁制护甲","titleEn":"Iron Armor"},"p-1bc37bb8b18bdc5578fe.html":{"zh":"血金防护神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Bloodgold Protection Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"血金防护神像","titleEn":"Bloodgold Protection Idol"},"p-1bc407b4ba011c641ecf.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣骨架 是用 灰烬之地 中找到的 灰烬刚鬣 骨骼制作的装饰家具。它可以像 鞍 或 椅子 一样挂置，但不会提供额外的 舒适度 加成。","en":"Asksvin Skeleton is decorative furniture made from Asksvin bones found in the Ashlands . It can be mounted like a saddle or a chair but it does not provide any additional Comfort bonus.","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣骨架","titleEn":"Asksvin Skeleton"},"p-1c03b18b4dbd616be579.html":{"zh":"胆汁袋 是一件物品，可由 迷雾之地 生物群系 中的 加尔 掉落。","en":"Bilebag is an item and can be dropped from Gjall in the Mistlands biome .","titleZh":"胆汁袋","titleEn":"Bilebag"},"p-1c15d6be540f1a1f9ca9.html":{"zh":"子分类 分类：斧 分类：镐 分类中的页面 工具 鹿角镐 斧 黑金属斧 黑金属镐 青铜斧 青铜镐 耕地耙 矮人酒杯 鱼竿 燧石斧 钩绳 工具锤 锄头 庆祝号角 铁镐 奥丁蜜酒角杯 镐 镰刀 餐盘 石斧 大酒杯 火把","en":"Subcategories Category:Axes Category:Pickaxes Pages in category Tools Antler Pickaxe Axes Black Metal Axe Black Metal Pickaxe Bronze Axe Bronze Pickaxe Cultivator Dvergr Tankard Fishing Rod Flint Axe Grappling Hook Hammer Hoe Horn of Celebration Iron Pickaxe Mead Horn of Odin Pickaxes Scythe Serving Tray Stone Axe Tankard Torch","titleZh":"分类：工具","titleEn":"Category:Tools"},"p-1c3819ec0a3f5a38c218.html":{"zh":"焰金属 是用 焰金属矿 在 高炉 冶炼的制作材料，以 木炭 为燃料。","en":"Flametal is a crafting material that can be smelted from Flametal Ore in a Blast Furnace using Coal as fuel.","titleZh":"焰金属","titleEn":"Flametal"},"p-1c76ca00ad911f70b747.html":{"zh":"灰烬长船 是大型高速 船只 ，储物容量极大，但操纵性较差。它也是唯一能穿越 灰烬之地 沸腾海水而不受损的船只。 灰烬长船是建造成本最高的船只，速度几乎与 维京长船 相同，但以灵活性换取更高耐久度和储物空间，适合携带大量货物并承受较多伤害。","en":"Drakkars are large, high-speed boats with exceptional storage capacity but poor maneuverability, and the only boats capable of traversing the boiling waters of the Ashlands without being damaged. Drakkars are the most expensive boats to construct compared to other boats. They can move nearly as fast as Longships , but trade agility for greater durability and storage space, which makes them suitable for withstanding…","titleZh":"灰烬长船","titleEn":"Drakkar"},"p-1ca043baf9853a9ca09f.html":{"zh":"弃誓者祭坛 是 地点 ，用于召唤 首领 。每位首领有自身祭坛，需要献祭一定数量的特定物品。","en":"Forsaken Altars are points of interest . They are used to summon bosses , each having its own altar that requires the sacrifice of a number of specific items.","titleZh":"弃誓者祭坛","titleEn":"Forsaken Altars"},"p-1ceec0adb67778d6ee86.html":{"zh":"蓟草 位于 黑暗林山 及 幽暗沼泽 生态区域 。蓝光夜间更明显，最容易寻找。蓟可1-5株成群，采后240分钟，即4小时重新生成。","en":"Thistle are found within both the Black Forest and Swamp biomes . They are most easily found at night, as the blue glow that surrounds it is more visible in the dark. Thistle can spawn in groups of 1-5. Picked thistle will respawn after 240 minutes (4 hours).","titleZh":"蓟草","titleEn":"Thistle"},"p-1d12d56e1e52be71333e.html":{"zh":"海豹油脂 是通过击杀 海豹 获得的 极北之地 阶段食物。 在 石砌烤炉 中烹饪50秒可制成 熟海豹脂肪 ；若任其烧焦，则会变成 木炭 。","en":"Seal Blubber is a Deep North -tier food obtained by killing Seals . It can be cooked in a Stone Oven for 50 seconds to obtain Cooked Seal Blubber , or Coal if left to burn.","titleZh":"海豹油脂","titleEn":"Seal Blubber"},"p-1e6dc9ac4767bb09dca9.html":{"zh":"吉尔与吞格尔 是 封印之塔 内 北境平原 中的敌对双人小首领。","en":"Zil & Thungr is an aggressive duo miniboss found in Plains inside Sealed tower .","titleZh":"吉尔与吞格尔","titleEn":"Zil & Thungr"},"p-1efc15f88e540ae4a852.html":{"zh":"洋芋儿 是 极北之地 阶段的 食物 ，也是一种作物。","en":"Poteitr is a Deep North -tier food and crop.","titleZh":"洋芋儿","titleEn":"Poteitr"},"p-1f1a48ed4526c128eb4d.html":{"zh":"护甲架 是一件家具，可在 工作台 范围内使用 工具锤 建造。摆放后会提高1点 舒适度 ，无论是否放置装备。 用于展示一套 护甲 、一件 武器 和一面 盾 。玩家可混搭任何护甲部件，以及大多数武器和盾牌组合。护甲架也可代替 宝箱 用于存放护甲。","en":"The Armor stand is a furniture item that can be built using the Hammer within the range of a Workbench . It also increases the Comfort level by 1 when placed, regardless if any equipment is placed on it. Its purpose is to display a set of Armor , a Weapon and a Shield . The player can mix and match any armor piece and most weapon / shield combos. The Armor Stand is an alternative to storing armor in a Chest .","titleZh":"护甲架","titleEn":"Armor Stand"},"p-1f1acaa7215f18f7b5da.html":{"zh":"铁头箭 是供弓使用的 弹药 ，也是 青铜箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Ironhead arrows are ammunition for bows and are the next direct upgrade from Bronzehead Arrows .","titleZh":"铁头箭","titleEn":"Ironhead Arrow"},"p-1fdcca91d9496878c4ab.html":{"zh":"冥雾 是 幽灵 掉落的材料。","en":"Ectoplasm is a material dropped by Ghosts .","titleZh":"冥雾","titleEn":"Ectoplasm"},"p-200a49a2c9a58149698a.html":{"zh":"蒲公英 位于 青青草原 生物群系 地面。采摘后240分钟在原处重新生成，也由 灰矮人暴徒 掉落。","en":"Dandelions are found on the ground in the Meadows biome . Picked dandelions will respawn in the same location after 240 minutes. They are also dropped by Greydwarf Brute .","titleZh":"蒲公英","titleEn":"Dandelion"},"p-2114562c195aebab31ae.html":{"zh":"镐 是与 镐 武器类别相关的 技能 。","en":"Pickaxes is a skill related to Pickaxes weapon class.","titleZh":"镐（技能）","titleEn":"Pickaxes (skill)"},"p-2137f629c29e42bb4641.html":{"zh":"从 灰烬藤蔓 采 藤莓果串 可获 灰烬藤蔓种子 ，用 耕地耙 种灰烬藤蔓。 采藤莓果簇有20%概率产1-4种子。 灰烬藤蔓种子需要依附墙面生长。","en":"Vineberry seeds can be acquired when harvesting Vineberry clusters from Ashvine . They are used to plant ashvine with a cultivator . When harvesting Vineberry clusters, there is a 20% chance to produce 1-4 Vineberry seeds. Vineberry seeds require a wall to grow.","titleZh":"灰烬藤蔓种子","titleEn":"Vineberry Seeds"},"p-2145bebc852505b79bf8.html":{"zh":"洋葱汤 是 凛冽雪山 阶段的食物。","en":"Onion soup is a Mountains -tier food.","titleZh":"洋葱汤","titleEn":"Onion Soup"},"p-216c64177f4e0d333d3d.html":{"zh":"细木堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 细木 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。 与多数材料堆不同，细木堆可以直接上下叠放。","en":"Finewood Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Finewood or simply decorate a homestead. Unlike most other types of stacks, Finewood stacks can be vertically stacked one on top of another.","titleZh":"细木堆","titleEn":"Finewood Stack"},"p-21c91c6e07b580346b4b.html":{"zh":"火辣猪猪煲 是 灰烬之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Fiery svinstew is an Ashlands -tier food.","titleZh":"火辣猪猪煲","titleEn":"Fiery Svinstew"},"p-21e902d728e9dd2da2b8.html":{"zh":"投石机 是使用配重机构和投篮将物体抛向远处的攻城器械，可越过墙壁、护城河等障碍。 投石机可以发射任何物品，但 灰石弹药 、 爆炸弹药 和 血金弹药 是专用弹药。发射物可损伤任何能受到伤害的建筑，包括 灰烬城堡 的门和墙。","en":"Catapults are siege engines that use a bucket with a counterweight mechanism to throw an object over a great distance, thus avoiding possible obstacles such as walls and moats. The Catapult can launch any items, but Grausten Payload , Explosive Payload and Bloodgold Payload are specially made for the catapult. Fired payloads can cause damage to any structure that is able to receive damage, including Charred Fortress…","titleZh":"投石机","titleEn":"Catapult"},"p-22a72bb05bba1846e209.html":{"zh":"铁火炉 是在希尔德的请求更新加入的物品，用于建造 铁制火炉 。铁坑没有 石制传送门 就无法传送。","en":"Iron pit is an item which got introduced in the Hildir's Request update and is used to construct the Iron Fire Pit . Iron pit cannot be teleported without a Stone portal .","titleZh":"铁火炉","titleEn":"Iron Pit"},"p-23587538efbd5dcd8abd.html":{"zh":"割颈者 是一种 极北之地 级别的 饰物 。","en":"Neckstabber is an Deep North -tier trinket .","titleZh":"割颈者","titleEn":"Neckstabber"},"p-23a2134a342f76b06d2f.html":{"zh":"冥火之光 是一件饰品，可在 工作台 处使用 银 和 冥火 制作。首次获得 冥火 后解锁。","en":"The Wisplight is an accessory made of Silver and Wisp at a Workbench . It is unlocked after acquiring a Wisp for the first time.","titleZh":"冥火之光","titleEn":"Wisplight"},"p-23c19d538ab15b532b2b.html":{"zh":"抗毒蜜酒 是一种 黑暗林山 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：抗毒 发酵 而成。","en":"Poison resistance mead is a Black Forest -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Poison resistance .","titleZh":"抗毒蜜酒","titleEn":"Poison Resistance Mead"},"p-23cb0665a95e0f5b8b05.html":{"zh":"钓鱼 是与 钓鱼 相关的玩家 技能 。","en":"Fishing is a player skill related to Fishing .","titleZh":"钓鱼(技能)","titleEn":"Fishing (skill)"},"p-23d2fac29e6a2055ed13.html":{"zh":"极北之地 的 灰矮人萨满 是敌对生物，属于 灰矮人萨满 的北方深境变体。","en":"The Greydwarf Shaman of the Deep North is a hostile creature, a Deep North variant of the Greydwarf Shaman .","titleZh":"灰矮人萨满（北方深境）","titleEn":"Greydwarf Shaman (Deep North)"},"p-23d47dc826f3fa8b3f7e.html":{"zh":"甲壳箭 是供弓使用的 弹药 ，也是 蜂针箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Carapace arrows are ammunition for bows and are the next direct upgrade from Needle Arrows .","titleZh":"甲壳箭","titleEn":"Carapace Arrow"},"p-23eb79ff27e177809039.html":{"zh":"虫巢 是仅通过 控制台命令 可获得的首领。","en":"The Hive is a boss which is only available via Console Commands .","titleZh":"虫巢","titleEn":"The Hive"},"p-243a61654865d3e93f68.html":{"zh":"甲壳护甲 是一套 迷雾之地 级别的 护甲 ，比 厚垫护甲 高一级，之后会被 焰金属护甲 、 阿斯克套装 和 恩布拉套装 替代。","en":"Carapace Armor is a Mistlands -tier armor . This set is the tier above Padded Armor and is replaced by Flametal Armor , the Ask Set , and the Embla Set .","titleZh":"甲壳护甲","titleEn":"Carapace Armor"},"p-245e9b4f1372e0b782e6.html":{"zh":"青铜护甲 是一套 黑暗林山 级别的 护甲 。与青铜时代的另一套护甲 巨魔套装 相比，它的护甲值更高，但会降低玩家的移动速度。青铜护甲没有套装加成。 这套护甲比 碎布护甲 和 皮甲 高一级，之后会被 树根套装 或 铁制护甲 替代。","en":"Bronze Armor is a Black Forest -tier armor . Compared with the other armor set available in the Bronze Age, the Troll Set , it provides higher armor values but reduces the player's movement speed. There is no set bonus for bronze armor. This set is the tier above Rag Armor and Leather Armor and is replaced by Root Set or Iron Armor .","titleZh":"青铜护甲","titleEn":"Bronze Armor"},"p-2460d6b4380a231e9e8b.html":{"zh":"北境之盾 是第七种圆 盾 。 北境盾的格挡能力低于 北境重盾 ，但可以用于 弹反 敌人的攻击。其格挡能力高于 北境圆盾 ，但弹反加成较小。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境之盾铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Shield is the seventh round shield . The Nord Shield has less block power compared to the Nord Greatshield , but can be used to parry enemy attacks. It has more block power compared to the Nord Buckler , but with a smaller parry bonus. It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Shield and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境之盾","titleEn":"Nord Shield"},"p-2493167703018e599e0f.html":{"zh":"钩绳 是用于移动穿行的 迷雾之地 级工具。","en":"The Grappling Hook is a Mistlands -tier tool used for traversal.","titleZh":"钩绳","titleEn":"Grappling Hook"},"p-24bafb0b2477f80fafd0.html":{"zh":"软泥怪 是 泥泞沼泽 中的敌对 生物 ，形似有意识的巨大胶状软泥堆，会释放有毒绿色气体。","en":"Blobs are aggressive creatures found in the Swamps . They are large, gelatinous piles of sentient ooze that emit poisonous green gasses.","titleZh":"软泥怪","titleEn":"Blob"},"p-24bcdc723efb8b45b9de.html":{"zh":"这是 弓 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 武器 。","en":"This is a category for bows which are a type of weapons .","titleZh":"分类：弓","titleEn":"Category:Bows"},"p-25189e7ca28b9e1a2540.html":{"zh":"这是 刀 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 武器 。","en":"This is a category for knives which are a type of weapons .","titleZh":"分类：刀","titleEn":"Category:Knives"},"p-2518e3c0149d728e994f.html":{"zh":"树脓 是 幽暗沼泽 中 邪煞之树 及 树脓囊 掉落的资源。树脓囊不受远程攻击伤害，必须用斧或镐开采，需搭高台或梯子抵达。 树脓可为 常设绿色-燃烧中 铁火炬 补充燃料。","en":"Guck are resources dropped by Abominations and Gucksacks in the Swamp biome. Gucksacks are not damaged by ranged attacks and must be mined with an axe or pickaxe. Players must build elevated platforms or ladders to reach the Gucksacks. Guck can be used to refuel Standing Green-burning Iron Torches .","titleZh":"树脓","titleEn":"Guck"},"p-25521701981e1ad3ad97.html":{"zh":"表情 是表达情感或改变姿态的角色动画。 可通过动作轮盘执行表情动作，参阅 控制 。 表情动作可通过 开发者控制台 命令执行，但通常按Enter，在聊天窗口输入相应命令。","en":"Emotes are character animations used to express feelings or change stance. Emotes can be perfomed by using the emote radial menu. See Controls . Emotes may be executed as a command through the developer console , but usually are performed using the in-game chat commands by pressing \"Enter\".","titleZh":"表情","titleEn":"Emotes"},"p-258ed517d60c478072ee.html":{"zh":"永恒之烛 用于升级 古咒法台 。","en":"The Unfading Candles are used as an upgrade for the Galdr Table .","titleZh":"永恒之烛","titleEn":"Unfading Candles"},"p-25db18bc8bc87f52de1a.html":{"zh":"吊桥 是可升降的桥梁，收起后可阻断通行。共有 朴实吊桥 和 巨木吊桥 两种。","en":"Drawbridges are functional structures that act as retractable bridges, which can be closed to prevent passage. There are two variants: Rustic Drawbridge and Timberwood Drawbridge .","titleZh":"吊桥","titleEn":"Drawbridges"},"p-2608729251008c9658e7.html":{"zh":"血怒 是 饰物 使用的个人资源，在 状态界面 中显示为橙色条。","en":"Adrenaline is a personal resource used by Trinkets . It is represented by an orange bar in the HUD .","titleZh":"血怒","titleEn":"Adrenaline"},"p-26310cdc747e67e5638e.html":{"zh":"灰烬之木堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 灰烬之木 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Ashwood Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Ashwood or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"灰烬之木堆","titleEn":"Ashwood Stack"},"p-265ef7152f1037ea008b.html":{"zh":"火盆 是一种可放在任何表面上的光源，需要在 熔炉 范围内建造。","en":"The Standing Brazier is a light source that can be placed on any surface, and must be built within the range of a Forge .","titleZh":"火盆","titleEn":"Standing Brazier"},"p-26ad75954c8fee984bf6.html":{"zh":"焰金属塔盾 是第六种塔 盾 。 其格挡能力高于 焰金属盾 ，但会使玩家的 移动速度 降低10%，并使 闪避 翻滚消耗增加10%。 作为塔盾，它不能用于 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Flametal Tower Shield is the sixth tower shield . It has more block power compared to Flametal Shield , but it reduces the player's movement speed by 10% and increases dodge roll cost by 10%. As a tower shield, it cannot be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"焰金属塔盾","titleEn":"Flametal Tower Shield"},"p-2722ea8fb327e9b8e55d.html":{"zh":"石围栏 是可建造构件。 与大多数 石制结构 不同，它在 工作台 处而非 切石机 处建造。耐久度为1,500，远高于 圆柱形篱笆 的200。与其他石制建筑一样，对镐类伤害较弱，对火焰和冰霜伤害具有抗性。","en":"Stone Fence is a buildable structure. Unlike most stone structures , it is built at the Workbench rather than the Stonecutter . With 1,500 durability, it is considerably sturdier than the Roundpole Fence (200), and it is weak to pickaxe damage and resistant to fire and frost like other stone structures.","titleZh":"石围栏","titleEn":"Stone Fence"},"p-278317f07a574f7f85ba.html":{"zh":"余烬炸药 是 极北之地 级别的 炸弹 ，在3米半径内造成140点 钝击 、100点 砍伐 和50点 镐击 伤害。 值得注意的是，余烬炸药具有足够的 工具级 来炸毁 石化巨魔长老 ，获得可冶炼为 血金 的 石化组织 。 余烬炸药直接命中时还会造成1点砍伐伤害和1点镐击伤害。","en":"Ember Charges are Deep North -tier Bombs . They deals 140 Blunt , 100 Chop and 50 Pickaxe damage in a 3 meters radius. Notably, Ember Charges has enough tool tier to blow up Petrified Gammeltrolls in order to obtain Petrified Tissue , which can be smelted into Bloodgold . Ember Charges also deal 1 Chop and 1 Pickaxe damage on a direct hit.","titleZh":"余烬炸药","titleEn":"Ember Charge"},"p-2787ea728b28387177aa.html":{"zh":"狂信徒 是 冰霜洞穴 内 凛冽雪山 中的敌对 生物 ，外形明显像狼人，但与 芬里 和 乌尔夫 不同，穿着破旧红色连帽披风。","en":"Cultists are aggressive creatures found in Mountains inside Frost Caves . Their appearance is distinctly werewolf-like, however, unlike Fenrings and Ulvs , they wear tattered red hooded cloaks.","titleZh":"狂信徒","titleEn":"Cultist"},"p-279cfb15a3eca28e89ab.html":{"zh":"芬里之爪 仅可在 凛冽雪山 生物群系 的 冰霜洞穴 找到。 芬里利爪不由冰霜洞穴敌人掉落，而放在地下城内神秘支座上。","en":"Fenris claw can only be found in Frost Caves in the Mountain biome . Fenris claws are not dropped by enemies in Frost Caves, but instead are found atop mysterious pedestals located within the dungeons.","titleZh":"芬里之爪","titleEn":"Fenris Claw"},"p-286cafb7ebd26f06c509.html":{"zh":"游泳 是一种 技能 。","en":"Swimming is a skill .","titleZh":"游泳（技能）","titleEn":"Swimming (skill)"},"p-286d1cb12daf5f2bc914.html":{"zh":"青青草原 是温和无害的 生态区域 ，草地覆盖着缓缓起伏的丘陵。作为玩家在 英灵神殿, 最早接触的生物群系，也最容易生存。宽阔空地与斜坡间散布 山毛榉 、 桦树 和 橡树 林，脚下有蕨类、幼树和偶尔一簇 浆果灌木 。 鹿 及野生 鬓猪 安静吃草，小小 灰宝宝 则四处窜动，寻找建筑和玩家攻击。溪流河川蜿蜒切过地貌，有时汇成内海和湖泊，敦实的 蜥蜴精 在岸边晒太阳。整体而言，草原拥有第十世界最宜人的景致之一。 不过这里也有危险。树木及前人留下的许多 建筑 之间，玩家可能遇到 地点 ，例如 维京墓地 和尤其致命的 尸鬼村庄 。","en":"The Meadows are calm, innocuous biomes covered in grass and gentle rolling hills. They are the very first biome the player encounters in Valheim, making them simultaneously the least difficult. Large clearings and sloping hillsides are punctuated by thickets and forests of Beech , Birch , and Oak trees; underfoot is a carpet of ferns, saplings, and the occasional cluster of berry bushes . Deer and wild Boars graze p…","titleZh":"青青草原","titleEn":"Meadows"},"p-28b83cdfa67e72b64a89.html":{"zh":"扭曲者 是 泥泞沼泽 中罕见的敌对生物。","en":"Writhan is an aggressive creature found rarely in the Swamp .","titleZh":"扭曲者","titleEn":"Writhan"},"p-28de037618d3dbf3402c.html":{"zh":"这是 武器 的 分类 。","en":"This is a category for weapons .","titleZh":"分类：武器","titleEn":"Category:Weapons"},"p-29968c38d1fa7324ee99.html":{"zh":"花冠 可能指：","en":"Crown may refer to:","titleZh":"花冠","titleEn":"Crown"},"p-29b52bfcccd01518e9de.html":{"zh":"部分建筑工作时会产生烟雾。若没有足够空间供烟雾消散，烟雾会使建筑停止工作。处于烟雾中的玩家会获得 烟雾笼罩 效果，持续受到伤害。 以下建筑工作时，若64米内有玩家，就会产生烟雾： 由于烟雾移动较慢，实际约每2秒产生一团烟雾，即每分钟30团。 建筑若连续4秒无法产生烟雾，就会停止工作。 每团烟雾半径为0.42米，因此需要约1米宽的空间才能通过。可用横梁阻挡烟雾移动，同时留下空隙供玩家与建筑互动。 每团烟雾都有目标水平速度和垂直速度： 这意味着不水平的烟道排烟量较低，因为水平速度较慢，且部分烟雾会卡在转角。不过，建筑只需每4秒产生一次烟雾，因此通常不需要完美通风。 烟雾团也会彼此碰撞。每团烟雾的质量随时间降低，使新产生的烟雾更容易推动旧烟雾。 默认情况下，烟雾在60秒后开始消失。不过，烟雾总数上限为100团；超过上限时，最旧的烟雾立即开始消失。","en":"Smoke is created by some structures when they are active. Smoke can prevent structures from working if there is not enough space for the smoke to disappear. Players inside the smoke get Smoked effect which deals damage over time. Following structures generate smoke when active and if there is a player within 64 meters: Realistic output is about one smoke every 2 seconds (30 instances per minute) because of the slow…","titleZh":"烟雾","titleEn":"Smoke"},"p-2a1a6355ed7e30b0eea3.html":{"zh":"冰霜 是 极北之地 中的 材料 。","en":"Ice is a material found in the Deep North .","titleZh":"冰霜","titleEn":"Ice"},"p-2a57bdb36b1f5ddbe2a7.html":{"zh":"北境巨斧 是第五种双手 斧 ，属于 极北之地 级别。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境巨斧铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"The Nord Greataxe is the fifth, Deep North -tier two-handed axe . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Greataxe and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境巨斧","titleEn":"Nord Greataxe"},"p-2a77d60f653d15539295.html":{"zh":"蛟龙肉羹 是 泥泞沼泽 阶段的食物。","en":"Serpent Stew is a Swamp -tier food.","titleZh":"蛟龙肉羹","titleEn":"Serpent Stew"},"p-2ae7b97e93aa4fd89350.html":{"zh":"调料架 用于升级 铸铁锅 。成本较低，通常是大锅的第一项升级。","en":"The Spice rack is used as an upgrade for the Cauldron . It will typically be the first upgrade for the cauldron due to its low cost.","titleZh":"调料架","titleEn":"Spice Rack"},"p-2af8986090a5b9ad83ec.html":{"zh":"世界种子 是初始化 英灵神殿的 伪随机数生成器 的 地图 种子 ，决定 世界 生成。同一游戏版本、同种子布局相同。 创建世界可输入名称种子，种子框预填随机值，可换自定义。","en":"A world seed is a map seed used to initialize Valheim 's pseudorandom number generator that determines how a world is generated. All worlds generated from the same seed will have the same layout for any given game version. When creating a new world in the main menu, the game opens a dialog where the player can enter the world name and seed. The input field for entering the seed is initially filled with a random seed…","titleZh":"世界种子","titleEn":"World seed"},"p-2b0302084b324e315136.html":{"zh":"虫巢矿洞 是位于 迷雾之地 的 地下城 。","en":"Infested mines are dungeons found in the Mistlands .","titleZh":"腐疫矿区","titleEn":"Infested Mine"},"p-2b1ab97ba1b096d438eb.html":{"zh":"铁砧 用于升级 熔炉 。","en":"Anvils are used as an upgrade for the Forge .","titleZh":"铁砧","titleEn":"Anvils"},"p-2b8592bee86de9531d09.html":{"zh":"血肉撕裂者 是一种使用 凛冽雪山 中的材料制作的武器，是游戏中除 徒手 之外的5种 拳类武器 之一。","en":"Flesh Rippers are a weapon crafted from materials found in the Mountains . This is one of the 5 fist weapons in the game other than Bare Fists .","titleZh":"血肉撕裂者","titleEn":"Flesh Rippers"},"p-2c3e40087c8659f22dac.html":{"zh":"邪恶之冰 是与 巨人入侵 相关的特殊资源节点。","en":"Malicious Ice is a special resource node related to Jotun Invasions .","titleZh":"邪恶之冰","titleEn":"Malicious Ice"},"p-2c5cc137169abef6de5e.html":{"zh":"硫磺 是 灰烬之地 中的材料。","en":"Sulfur is a material found in Ashlands .","titleZh":"硫磺","titleEn":"Sulfur"},"p-2c83f6ee7f46ee61781e.html":{"zh":"圆木 用于早期 建造 和 制作 配方。与普通 木材 相比，圆木的主要优势是更强的支撑能力，可以建造 更大、更高的建筑 。","en":"Corewood is a type of wood used in early building and crafting recipes. The main benefit of Corewood compared with common Wood is a greater support factor, which allows construction of larger and taller buildings .","titleZh":"圆木","titleEn":"Corewood"},"p-2c85f09f54ed6248ece1.html":{"zh":"血魔法 是一类 武器 ，在 迷雾之地 更新中加入。 使用血魔法类武器施放任何法术，都会消耗使用者的一部分生命值。消耗量为使用者 当前 生命值的固定百分比（因此无法因使用该武器而使自己死亡）。","en":"Blood magic is a weapon class which was added in the Mistlands update. To cast any spell with a Blood Magic type weapon costs the user some health. The cost is a set amount in percent, relating to the users current health (thus it is not possible to kill yourself by using the weapon).","titleZh":"血魔法","titleEn":"Blood magic"},"p-2ca8837b7a3dea59afb7.html":{"zh":"铁剑 是第二种 剑 。","en":"Iron Sword is the second sword .","titleZh":"铁剑","titleEn":"Iron Sword"},"p-2cff92a535d2412de532.html":{"zh":"巨木冷杉 是 极北之地 中的一种 树 。 巨木树是北方深境木材 巨木 的主要来源。","en":"Timber Tree is a type of tree encountered in the Deep North biome. Timber trees are the primary source of Timberwood , the Deep North-tier wood.","titleZh":"巨木冷杉","titleEn":"Timber Tree"},"p-2d2921be4ad81f0dc325.html":{"zh":"雷血拳链 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境拳链 得到的版本。它们获得额外的 钝击 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境拳链在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thunderblood Knucklechains are a version of Nord Knucklechains upgraded with Thunderblood Essence . They gain extra Blunt and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. Upgraded Nord Knucklechains will NOT keep their upgrade level when they are modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷血拳链","titleEn":"Thunderblood Knucklechains"},"p-2d29a54b38708ec99488.html":{"zh":"永恒火堆 是用于收集 余烬 的 基础 设施。功能类似 冥火之泉 ，但吸引余烬无须等到天黑。 建造需要 切石机 。","en":"Eternal Pyres are base structures used for collecting Embers . They are similar to Wisp Fountains in their function, but do not require it to be dark to attract Embers. They require a Stonecutter to be built.","titleZh":"永恒火堆","titleEn":"Eternal Pyre"},"p-2d7e4757dca1740ae496.html":{"zh":"索尔 是雷暴中随机触发的 事件 ，乘两山羊坦格里斯尼尔和坦格乔斯特拉的战车横穿天空，发蓝闪电。击败 冰霜龙母 后，雷暴中50%概率出现索尔。纯客户端事件，每次仅一玩家可见。","en":"Thor is an event that is randomly triggered during thunderstorms. He appears flying across the sky in a chariot being pulled by his two goats Tanngrisnir and Tanngnjóstr, emitting blue lightning. Thor has a 50% chance to appear in thunderstorms once Moder has been defeated. He is a purely clientside event and can only be seen by one player at a time.","titleZh":"索尔","titleEn":"Thor"},"p-2d8560183cbfca6b2d9c.html":{"zh":"骨堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 白骨碎片 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Bone Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Bone Fragments or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"骨堆","titleEn":"Bone Stack"},"p-2dacd81877f2fb963c18.html":{"zh":"条纹铁盾 是第二种圆 盾 。 其格挡能力低于 铁塔盾 ，但可以用来 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Banded Shield is the second round shield . It has less block power compared to the Iron Tower Shield , but can be used used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"条纹铁盾","titleEn":"Banded Shield"},"p-2dc9e8c16804bb7b3bfa.html":{"zh":"战利品宝箱 功能类似普通 宝箱 ，但在 世界创建 按一定 地点 生成，战利品与所在 生物群系 相符，有时还有能与 霍尔德 交易的贵重物品。","en":"A loot chest functions like regular chest , but is spawned at World Creation at a certain point of interest and contains loot appropriate to the biome where it appears, and sometimes treasure than can be used to barter with Haldor .","titleZh":"战利品宝箱","titleEn":"Loot chest"},"p-2dfcc75035c36fefa223.html":{"zh":"季节性家具 是只能在一年中特定时段建造的装饰物。","en":"Seasonal Furniture are decorative items which can only be built during certain times of the year.","titleZh":"分类：节日家具","titleEn":"Category:Seasonal Furniture"},"p-2e5877cfa505a3390af1.html":{"zh":"血金弩箭 是供 弩 使用的 弹药 。","en":"Bloodgold Bolt are ammunition for crossbows .","titleZh":"血金弩箭","titleEn":"Bloodgold Bolt"},"p-2e8734905c79cd8f3087.html":{"zh":"焰金属锤 是第六种 棍棒 。","en":"Flametal Mace is the sixth club .","titleZh":"焰金属锤","titleEn":"Flametal Mace"},"p-2e8cba99499c41b12436.html":{"zh":"肉类拼盘 是一种 迷雾之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Meat Platter is a Mistlands -tier food .","titleZh":"肉类拼盘","titleEn":"Meat Platter"},"p-2ef15ac2866f955969bd.html":{"zh":"开发者控制台 ，简称 控制台 ，是输入文本 命令 的游戏内界面，用于调试、作弊和服务器管理。","en":"The developer console , or just console , is an in-game interface for entering text-based commands used for debugging, cheating and server administration.","titleZh":"开发者控制台","titleEn":"Developer console"},"p-2f14fd616ff9904ca1c3.html":{"zh":"北境平原 是开阔的 生物群系 ，丘陵起伏，树木稀疏。岩体多样，既有巨大可破坏石柱等天然岩体，也有当地 丑地精 建造的结构。用 鹿皮 和 白骨碎片 建成、有人居住的 地精村落 散布各处。 虽然起初看似宁静，平原行进困难且危险。独有资源可用于制作 黑金属 和 亚麻线 武器，以及 大麦面粉 和 平原牦牛肉 食物。 焦油坑 及周围还有 焦油 ，可用来制作高级家具、暗木建筑和装饰。 驶近平原时要小心， 杀人蜂 可能在海滩生成，并追到远处水面。","en":"The Plains are a wide open biome with rolling hills and sparse trees. They are home to many different kinds of rock formations, some appearing to be natural (such as enormous destructible stone monoliths), and some constructed by the native Fulings . Populated Fuling Villages can be seen spread across the Plains, built from Deer Hide and Bone Fragments .","titleZh":"北境平原","titleEn":"Plains"},"p-2f16b0e600c213a764fe.html":{"zh":"Ulf 也称 勇敢的乌尔夫 ，是在 英灵神殿 提及的 角色 。","en":"Ulf , also known as Ulf, the Brave , is a mentioned character in Valheim .","titleZh":"Ulf","titleEn":"Ulf"},"p-2f2387d52bf867b37eda.html":{"zh":"绿色扭结头巾 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付250 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的白银宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Twisted headscarf green is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 250 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's silver chest .","titleZh":"绿色扭结头巾","titleEn":"Twisted headscarf green"},"p-2fb8e50e798a0f6935bb.html":{"zh":"封印破除者碎片 是从 迷雾之地 的 腐疫矿区 获得的资源，用于建造 封印破除者 。 制作一个封印破除者共需九块碎片。","en":"Sealbreaker fragments are resources obtained from Infested Mines in the Mistlands that are used to build the Sealbreaker . Nine total fragments are required to build one Sealbreaker.","titleZh":"封印破除者碎片","titleEn":"Sealbreaker Fragment"},"p-3037242e1e42b23ebef2.html":{"zh":"克罗姆 是第一种双手 剑 。 克罗姆可以驱散9米半径内 迷雾之地 的 雾 。","en":"Krom is the first two-handed sword . The Krom is capable of dispelling the Mist of Mistlands in a 9-meter radius.","titleZh":"克罗姆","titleEn":"Krom"},"p-3048886e495cf472ac35.html":{"zh":"镐 是一类 武器 。 它们可用于开采 矿石 ，其他玩家武器类型都无法做到。镐以前只能命中单个目标，但在炉火与家园更新后获得了多目标劈击能力。 主要攻击为向下挥击，没有次要攻击。","en":"Pickaxes are a weapon class. They can be used to mine ores , which no other type of player-weapon can do. Pickaxes formerly only hit a single target, but as of the Hearth and Home update, gained a cleaving attribute. Their primary attack is a downward swing. They do not have a secondary attack.","titleZh":"镐","titleEn":"Pickaxes"},"p-3082841070261fdaee95.html":{"zh":"砍倒 树 后留下 树桩 ，提供少量 木材 ，采集最多获得2份木材。 与树一样，树桩也可能 \"太硬了\" ，取决于斧或镐等级。 斧及镐均可伤害树桩，始终掉两份对应基础木材：多数树为 木材 ， 灰烬之树 为 灰烬之木 ，松树形 巨木冷杉 为 巨木 。 部分生物群系也自然生成并非伐树留下的旧树桩，掉木更多。","en":"A Tree Stump is left after a tree is chopped down. It acts as a small source of Wood . Harvesting these stumps provide up to a maximum of 2 Wood. Like trees, stumps can also be \"too hard\" , depending on the tier of the axe or pickaxe used. Stumps can be damaged with both axes and pickaxes. A stump always drops two pieces of the tree's basic wood: Wood for most trees, Ashwood for Scorched Trees and Timberwood for the…","titleZh":"树桩","titleEn":"Stump (Tree)"},"p-30ac8372a37b84d5adbe.html":{"zh":"磨刀石 在 切石机 用五份 石头 制作。 可稀有地在 地精村落 、 地精前哨 及 地精废墟 的 平原宝箱 找到。","en":"Sharpening stone is an item made at the Stonecutter with five Stone . It can rarely be found in Plains Chests in Fuling Villages , Fuling Outposts and Fuling Ruins .","titleZh":"磨刀石","titleEn":"Sharpening Stone"},"p-30fad4c6c77bdfc1ef9b.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以220枚 钱币 购买5个 葫芦调味料 ，仅在击败 凌冽·芬布尔使者 后出售。","en":"Seasoning of the Gourd can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 220 Coins for 5 items. It is only sold after Kall Fimbulbringer has been defeated.","titleZh":"葫芦调味料","titleEn":"Seasoning of the Gourd"},"p-30ff8a3aeb8ab4bbfcb5.html":{"zh":"黑金属镐 是第四种 镐击 。除之前的镐能够开采的资源外，它还可开采 黑大理石 、 软组织 、 上古之剑 、 远古护甲 和 炎金属矿脉 。 主要攻击为能够破坏地面的近战攻击。它没有次要攻击。","en":"Black Metal Pickaxe is the fourth pickaxe . It can be used to mine Black Marble , Soft Tissue , Ancient Sword , Ancient Armor , and Flametal Ore Vein , in addition to what previous pickaxes can mine. Its primary attack is a melee attack that destroys ground. It does not have a secondary attack.","titleZh":"黑金属镐","titleEn":"Black Metal Pickaxe"},"p-31275f474c8dde34ff2b.html":{"zh":"烟花棒 是一种武器，可向 希尔德 支付150 货币 购买。","en":"Sparkler is a weapon which can be purchased from Hildir for 150 Coins .","titleZh":"烟花棒","titleEn":"Sparkler"},"p-312d88cf9740313e8a98.html":{"zh":"利维坦 是 无尽之海 中的被动 生物 ，形似巨大岩石。每次 深渊藤壶 受损，都有10%概率开始下潜。 利维坦本身无法移动或破坏，只有背上的藤壶能用采矿方式摧毁。 无法在利维坦上建造。 每一个 深渊藤壶 开采时掉落以下物品： 如何开采藤壶，详见 主页 。 每次击中藤壶，有10%概率惊动利维坦，表现为震动和声响。首次被惊动20秒后，开始永久沉入海中，震动和声响更明显。这20秒内，后续每次击中仍有10%概率触发额外震动。 开始下潜至整个身体沉到水面以下，约需25秒。最初几秒会稍微抬高身体，再逐渐加速下降，最终超过1 m/s。 利维坦在世界生成时产生，沉入深海后不会重新生成。 每个完全位于海洋的 区域 有1%概率生成，水深至少须30米。","en":"Leviathans are passive creatures found in Oceans . They are massive rock-type beings that have a 10% chance of submerging each time their Abyssal Barnacles are damaged. Leviathans themselves are immovable and indestructible; only the barnacles on their back can be destroyed by mining them. It is not possible to build on Leviathans.","titleZh":"利维坦","titleEn":"Leviathan"},"p-3130c93463f2c96ec7ea.html":{"zh":"符文台 用于升级 古咒法台 ，与 永恒之烛 和 轻羽花环 一起，是目前古咒法台的三项升级之一。建造材料可通过 传送门 运输。 与其他可任意放在范围内的制作设施升级不同，此设施必须连接 古咒法台 才能有效放置。","en":"The Rune table is used as an upgrade for the Galdr Table . It is one of the three upgrades currently available to the Galdr table, along with Unfading Candles and Feathery wreath . Its building materials can be taken through a portal . Also, unlike the other craft station upgrades which can be placed anywhere and provides buffs within range, this upgrade building's placement is only valid connected to the Galdr Tabl…","titleZh":"符文台","titleEn":"Rune Table"},"p-314e6196bc38d7ee4050.html":{"zh":"矮人提取器 是 迷雾之地 中的物品，是制作 汁液提取器 的关键部件。与其他杂项材料不同，没有 石制传送门 就无法传送。","en":"The Dvergr extractor is an item found in the Mistlands . It is a key component in the creation of Sap Extractors . Unlike other miscellaneous materials, it cannot be teleported without a stone portal .","titleZh":"矮人提取器","titleEn":"Dvergr Extractor"},"p-31dfb229ef783e53a90d.html":{"zh":"锛斧 放在 工作台 五米以内时，可为其升级。放置时附近需要 熔炉 ，建好后运行则不再需要。不过，用锤子拆除时仍需要熔炉。","en":"The Adze serves as an upgrade for the Workbench when placed within five meters of it. It must be placed near a Forge , but does not require one in order to function afterward. However, it does still require a Forge to remove it with the Hammer.","titleZh":"锛斧","titleEn":"Adze"},"p-31f72c32db4243a68b3c.html":{"zh":"平原牦牛鞍 是可制作物品。 牦牛鞍让玩家骑乘驯服 平原牦牛 。放入快捷栏，瞄准驯服 平原牦牛 使用即可装上。随后按使用键，默认E，像操作船舵一样移到鞍上。按Left-Shift + E取下。","en":"Lox Saddle is a craftable item. Lox Saddles grant the ability to ride tamed Lox . To attach, simply put the saddle on the hotbar then activate while aimed at a tamed Lox . The saddle can then be \"teleported\" to, like a boat rudder, by pressing the \"Use\" key (E by default). The saddle can be removed from the Lox by pressing Left-Shift + E.","titleZh":"平原牦牛鞍","titleEn":"Lox Saddle"},"p-32772ef7373ac96cd14f.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以80枚 钱币 购买5个 腌制松鼠腿筋 。","en":"Cured squirrel hamstring can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 80 Coins for 5 items.","titleZh":"腌制松鼠腿筋","titleEn":"Cured Squirrel Hamstring"},"p-3279a0c7570be13c687e.html":{"zh":"硫磺拱门 是 灰烬之地 中的 灰石 建筑，下方悬硫磺石。 硫磺拱可徒手采集，产2至3份 硫磺 。灰石拱可用任意镐开采。","en":"Sulfur Arches are Grausten structure found in the Ashlands with Sulfur Rocks hanging below. Sulfur Arches can be picked without tools and yield 2 to 3 Sulfurs . The Grausten arch can be mined with any pickaxe.","titleZh":"硫磺拱门","titleEn":"Sulfur Arch"},"p-32caead47d50063cd9bf.html":{"zh":"这是 防护神像 的 分类 。","en":"This is a category for Protection Idols .","titleZh":"分类：防护神像","titleEn":"Category:Protection Idols"},"p-32d32480fcd8c855220d.html":{"zh":"冰霜之核 是用于在 极北之地 建造 制作台 的材料。 每种设施各建一个，共需20份冰霜之核。","en":"Frostcores are materials used to build crafting stations in the Deep North . A total of 20 Frostcores is required to build one of each station.","titleZh":"冰霜之核","titleEn":"Frostcore"},"p-332e6a85b4285ff8858c.html":{"zh":"埃达之能 是使用 魔法 武器所需的个人资源，在 状态界面 显示为紫色条。 食用蕴含埃达之能的 食物 可获得该资源，并像 耐力 一样随时间恢复。穿 埃达织物套装 或 恩布拉套装 部件可加快恢复， 蛊虫之后 的 放逐之力 也能提高。","en":"Eitr is a personal resource necessary to use magic weapons. It is represented by a purple bar in the HUD . Eitr is generated by eating eitr-infused food and will regenerate over time, similarly to stamina . The regeneration rate is augmented while wearing pieces of Eitr-weave Set or Embla Set . It is also augmented by The Queen 's Forsaken power .","titleZh":"埃达之能","titleEn":"Eitr"},"p-3372a067f262afbc0bca.html":{"zh":"灰烬之鹫蛋 可在 灰烬之地 生物群系 的 秃鹫巢穴 内找到，也由 灰烬之鹫 掉落。 与其他蛋不同，灰烬之鹫蛋不会孵出灰烬之鹫。","en":"Volture Eggs can be found inside Volture Nests in the Ashlands biome . They are also dropped by Voltures . Unlike other eggs, Volture Eggs do not hatch into Voltures.","titleZh":"灰烬之鹫蛋","titleEn":"Volture Egg"},"p-33a1b31ed7fdb317a679.html":{"zh":"尖牙矛 是第四种 矛 。","en":"Fang Spear is the fourth spear .","titleZh":"尖牙矛","titleEn":"Fang Spear"},"p-33aa798ce77c099bcbde.html":{"zh":"矮人挖掘场 是 迷雾之地 各处的 矮人 建筑类型之一。营地用木桩墙围住挖掘坑，其中有部分出土 巨人遗骸 ，住有 矮人刺客 和 法师 。每处有居民的矮人挖掘场都含 矮人板条箱 ，是推进流程的重要制作材料。 三种挖掘场变体之一已 毁了 ，矮人离开，改由 邪蛛探索者 群占据。中央坑空无一物，巨人遗骸已完全挖走。","en":"Dvergr Excavation Sites are one of the types of Dvergr structures located throughout the Mistlands . A camp outlined by wooden stake walls surrounding a pit containing partially-excavated Giant Remains , it is one type of Dvergr structure and is home to Dvergr Rogues and mages . Each inhabited Dvergr Excavation Site contains a Dvergr Component Crate , an important crafting component for progression.","titleZh":"矮人挖掘场","titleEn":"Dvergr Excavation Site"},"p-33d4b0a276701e9c4057.html":{"zh":"硬鹿角 由第一位 首领 赤血灵鹿 掉落。击败赤血灵鹿必定获得三根（3）硬鹿角。","en":"The Hard antler is dropped by Eikthyr , the first Boss . Eikthyr is guaranteed to drop three (3) hard antlers upon defeat.","titleZh":"硬鹿角","titleEn":"Hard Antler"},"p-343681e663b75b395cf2.html":{"zh":"青铜堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 青铜 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Bronze Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Bronze or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"青铜堆","titleEn":"Bronze Stack"},"p-3443db2a931a457ce4cc.html":{"zh":"黑暗之核 是从 腐疫矿区 获取的资源，用于建造迷雾之地级制作设施。 每种设施各建一个，共需15份核心。","en":"Black cores are resources obtained from Infested Mines that are used to build Mistlands-tier crafting stations. 15 total cores are required to build one of each station.","titleZh":"黑暗之核","titleEn":"Black Core"},"p-3462e4f3ba7f65f1c466.html":{"zh":"木塔盾 是第一种塔 盾 。 其格挡能力高于 木盾 ，但会使玩家的 移动速度 降低10%，并使 闪避 翻滚消耗增加10%。 作为塔盾，它不能用于 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Wood Tower Shield is the first tower shield . It has more block power compared to Wood Shield , but it reduces the player's movement speed by 10% and increases dodge roll cost by 10%. As a tower shield, it cannot be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"木塔盾","titleEn":"Wood Tower Shield"},"p-34694871e698ba72f8ee.html":{"zh":"铁矿 是原矿，可用 木炭 作燃料，在 冶炼炉 冶炼为 铁 。","en":"Iron Ore is a raw metal which can be smelted into Iron at a Smelter using Coal as fuel.","titleZh":"铁矿","titleEn":"Iron Ore"},"p-34e7987e7eea26776ff1.html":{"zh":"古咒法台 是 基础 设施，用于制作和修复与 魔法 有关的 迷雾之地 和 灰烬之地 装备。使用需要屋顶和70%的 遮蔽 。修复物品不消耗材料。","en":"The Galdr Table is a base structure used for crafting and repairing Mistlands and Ashlands gear relating to magic . It requires a roof and 70% cover to be usable. Repairing items does not cost any resources.","titleZh":"古咒法台","titleEn":"Galdr Table"},"p-36312128a25cdae591cb.html":{"zh":"黑曜石箭 是供弓使用的 弹药 ，也是 铁头箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Obsidian arrows are ammunition for bows and are a direct upgrade from Ironhead Arrows .","titleZh":"黑曜石箭","titleEn":"Obsidian Arrow"},"p-36674a1de6a5e18d48dd.html":{"zh":"黑熔炉冷却器 用于升级 黑熔炉 。","en":"The Black forge cooler is used as an upgrade for the Black Forge .","titleZh":"黑熔炉冷却器","titleEn":"Black Forge Cooler"},"p-36786280d525703d057f.html":{"zh":"盾 是可与其他单手武器一起使用的 武器 。与盾一起使用时，武器的 格挡 能力、 弹反 冲击力和弹反加成会被所用盾的对应属性替代。 塔盾 提供最高的基础格挡能力和冲击力，但持握时通常会使移动速度降低10%（闪避翻滚消耗相应增加），而其他盾通常为5%。塔盾无法弹反，因此其他盾可通过弹反获得更高的格挡护甲。 小圆盾 提供最高的弹反格挡护甲，但普通格挡护甲和弹反冲击力最低。 圆盾 是介于两个极端之间最均衡的选择，格挡能力、冲击力和弹反加成都适中，移动减速与小圆盾相同，为-5%。","en":"Shields are weapons that can be used with other one-handed weapons. The block power, parry force and parry bonus of the weapons used with shields would be replaced by that of the shield used. Tower shields offer the highest raw block power and force at the cost of usually 10% slower movement (this equally increases dodge roll cost) when in hand compared to other shields' 5%, and no parrying, which allows other shiel…","titleZh":"盾","titleEn":"Shields"},"p-36ff87e1502da8a1d740.html":{"zh":"生成来源 共有五套生成敌人的系统，详情请参阅各自页面。 实体生成器 是可破坏实体，玩家在附近时会持续生成敌对 生物 。 生成点 是特定建筑和地下城中的固定位置，大多只能使用一次。 区生成 是随玩家移动而反复发生的生物生成。 事件生成器 会在袭击事件激活时生成特定生物。 弃誓者祭坛 会在玩家献上正确祭品时生成生物。 其他互动 玩家基地 是大多数玩家建造的建筑周围形成的隐形区域，阻止生物在其中生成，仅影响 事件生成器 、 生成点 和 区域生成 。","en":"Sources of spawning There are five systems which spawn enemies. See the individual pages for further details. Physical spawners are destructible entities that continuously spawn hostile creatures when a player is nearby. Spawn points are fixed positions at certain structures and dungeons. Most of them are single use. Zone spawning is the repeatable spawning of creatures that happens as players move around. Event spa…","titleZh":"生成机制","titleEn":"Spawning mechanics"},"p-37015441396c962e2e96.html":{"zh":"自 极北之地 更新起， 英灵神殿 对 生物 掉落采用伪随机系统，以避免获取稀有物品时连续多次判定失败。 每次物品成功掉落后，游戏会随机确定该物品再次掉落所需的尝试次数，范围为1至2 / chance，其中chance表示掉落概率。 此系统仅适用于掉落概率为30%或以下的物品。可通过全局键NoPseudoDrops关闭。","en":"Since the Deep North update, Valheim uses a pseudo-random system for creature drops. The system is designed to prevent long streaks of failed rolls when attempting to obtain rare items. Each time an item is successfully dropped, the game randomly determines the number of attempts required before that item can drop again. This number ranges from 1 to 2 / chance.","titleZh":"掉落物","titleEn":"Drops"},"p-370ead19cc64f4aef4ac.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以125枚 钱币 购买5个 臭臭石 。","en":"Pungent pebbles can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 125 Coins for 5 items.","titleZh":"臭臭石","titleEn":"Pungent Pebbles"},"p-37206d6d3611e39a6b45.html":{"zh":"矮人港口 是 迷雾之地 沿岸的 矮人 建筑类型之一，码头主要由 木材 建成，可能连着小型 黑大理石 建筑，住有 矮人刺客 和 法师 ，可能含推进流程的重要制作材料 矮人板条箱 。","en":"Dvergr Harbors are one of the types of Dvergr structures located throughout the Mistlands at the coast. A dock made mostly of Wood which might be connected to a small Black Marble building, it is one type of Dvergr structure and is home to Dvergr Rogues and mages . Dvergr Harbors may contain a Dvergr Component Crate , an important crafting component for progression.","titleZh":"矮人港口","titleEn":"Dvergr Harbor"},"p-376706b06d26bd81414e.html":{"zh":"鬓猪肉 是一种通过击杀 鬓猪 获得的基础食物。 可以在 烹饪台 或 铁烹饪台 上将其烤成 熟鬓猪肉 ；若烤得过久，则会变成 木炭 。","en":"Boar Meat is a basic food obtained by killing Boars . It can be cooked on a Cooking Station or Iron Cooking Station to obtain Cooked Boar Meat , or Coal if overcooked.","titleZh":"鬓猪肉","titleEn":"Boar Meat"},"p-37811b6c184a26a3e715.html":{"zh":"荧光幼虫 既是建筑材料也是食物，可从 极北之地 的 蜿蜒隧道 墙壁上采集。","en":"Luminous Larva is a building material and food item gathered from the walls in the Winding Tunnels in the Deep North .","titleZh":"荧光幼虫","titleEn":"Luminous Larva"},"p-378d83808237a4459f23.html":{"zh":"宝箱 是可制作的 储物 设施，具有10个（5x2）物品格。","en":"Chests are craftable storage structure. They have 10 (5x2) item slots.","titleZh":"宝箱","titleEn":"Chest"},"p-37c50c935cd2a9ad065f.html":{"zh":"鸡蛋 是一种物品，也是一种食物。初期可以向 霍尔德 购买，用来繁殖 鸡 。开始养鸡需要两枚蛋。 可以在 铸铁锅 中煮成 煎蛋 。","en":"Egg is an item and a food source, which can be initially purchased from Haldor to be able to breed Chickens . In order to start a chicken farm, two eggs are required. It can be cooked in a Cauldron to obtain a Cooked egg .","titleZh":"鸡蛋","titleEn":"Egg"},"p-38050ba6390bf4c7fe39.html":{"zh":"木制 防护 神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Wooden Protection Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"木制 防护 神像","titleEn":"Wooden Protection Idol"},"p-382ad5d9c7839bf6448e.html":{"zh":"甜蜜烤鸡 是 迷雾之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Honey Glazed Chicken is a Mistlands -tier food.","titleZh":"甜蜜烤鸡","titleEn":"Honey Glazed Chicken"},"p-384d8ee591ac47251ab9.html":{"zh":"尖木桩围墙 是可建造构件。与其他木制构件不同，尖桩墙不会因淋雨腐朽，适合作为聚落外围围墙。 尖桩墙不会伤害接触它的 生物 。会对生物造成伤害的设施见 尖桩 。","en":"Stakewall is a buildable structure. Unlike other Wooden building parts, Stakewalls do not deteriorate due to rain, making them perfect for perimeter walls around player settlements. Stakewalls do not damage creatures that come into contact with them. See Stakes for structures that deal damage to creatures.","titleZh":"尖木桩围墙","titleEn":"Stakewall"},"p-392759167cdc73d01ade.html":{"zh":"羽衣甘蓝 是 极北之地 阶段的 食物 ，也是一种作物。","en":"Kale is a Deep North -tier food and crop.","titleZh":"羽衣甘蓝","titleEn":"Kale"},"p-39552fb36d42345a5a10.html":{"zh":"开膛弩：邪根 是使用 翡翠 强化 开膛弩 得到的版本。与所有使用翡翠强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 毒素伤害 ，且命中效果有20%概率施加 定身 。 已升级的开膛弩在改造为开膛弩：邪根时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。 主要攻击发射 弩箭 。攻击前，必须先将一支弩箭装入弩中。技能等级为0时，装填需要3.5秒并消耗3点耐力；但加上发射、装填和准备动作，实际每6秒才能发射一次。跳跃和冲刺会重置装填进度，冲刺时也无法装填弩箭。装填完成后，可随时发射，且不消耗耐力。发射后需要重新装填一支弩箭。切换到其他武器时，弩箭不会保持装填状态，因此每次装备该物品时都需要装填。 弩箭飞行速度明显快于箭矢，沿直线飞行而非抛物线（不会因重力而下坠）。","en":"Root Ripper is the upgraded form of Ripper using the Jade . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Jade, they gain 10 poison damage and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply Immobilized . An upgraded Ripper will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Root Ripper. Its primary attack fires bolts . To attack, a bolt is first loaded into the crossbow. Loading takes 3.5 seconds and uses 3 stamina at level 0, ho…","titleZh":"开膛弩：邪根","titleEn":"Root Ripper"},"p-3977abc0bb8b16d3312d.html":{"zh":"血袋 是 幽暗沼泽 中 蚂蟥 掉落的物品。","en":"Bloodbag is an item dropped by Leeches in the Swamp .","titleZh":"血袋","titleEn":"Bloodbag"},"p-398464ae70d7dad80188.html":{"zh":"亚格鲁斯 是第五位 首领 ，是古老 丑地精 灵体，寄居在腐朽骸骨躯体中，仅剩头、双臂及躯干。头骨上的王冠暗示他曾是或仍是某种统治者。","en":"Yagluth is the fifth boss . He appears as an ancient Fuling spirit inhabiting a now decomposed skeletal body comprised of a head, two arms and a torso. The crown resting upon his skull implies he was once or still is a ruler of some sort.","titleZh":"亚格鲁斯","titleEn":"Yagluth"},"p-39bb840012648bac45cb.html":{"zh":"焰金属弩炮弹 是一种用作 弩炮 弹药的 弩炮弹 ，可在 工匠台 处制作。","en":"Flametal missile is a missile used as ammunition for the Ballista , and can be crafted at the Artisan Table .","titleZh":"焰金属弩炮弹","titleEn":"Flametal Missile"},"p-3a601ba5ca581dab754d.html":{"zh":"地下圣堂 是 泥泞沼泽 中的 地下城 。须用 古树长老 掉落的 沼泽密钥 解锁入口铁门才能进入。沼泽钥匙使用后 不会 消耗。 墓室似乎在 泥泞沼泽 中的随机地点以四个一组生成，组内各墓室只有位于 泥泞沼泽 足够深处才会出现。","en":"Sunken Crypts are dungeons found in Swamps . They can only be accessed by unlocking the iron gate to the entrance by using the Swamp Key dropped by The Elder . The Swamp Key is NOT consumed upon use. Crypts appear to generate in clusters of four at random points within the Swamp , and any crypts within that cluster will only generate if deep enough into the Swamp .","titleZh":"地下圣堂","titleEn":"Sunken Crypts"},"p-3a6396c120925fdde8d2.html":{"zh":"生成点分布在 地点 及地下城，包括 诡秘墓穴 、 巨魔洞穴 和 地下圣堂 附近。大多数生成点仅生效一次，部分生成点仅有一定概率出现。 以下是不完整的生成点列表：","en":"Spawns points are placed near points of interest and dungeons ( Burial Chambers , Troll Cave and Sunken Crypts ). Most spawn points only work once. Some spawn points only have a random chance of appearing. Below is an incomplete list of spawn points:","titleZh":"生成点","titleEn":"Spawn points"},"p-3a76e74fe93e73f666e2.html":{"zh":"熏鱼 是一种 极北之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Smoked Fish is a Deep North -tier food .","titleZh":"熏鱼","titleEn":"Smoked Fish"},"p-3a7e24c4c4922d9d4242.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣皮 由 灰烬之地 生态区域 中的 灰烬刚鬣 掉落。","en":"Asksvin hide is dropped by Asksvin in the Ashlands biome .","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣皮","titleEn":"Asksvin Hide"},"p-3a8068c27163067fb9d8.html":{"zh":"招魂之杖 是四种 迷雾之地 魔法 武器之一。施法时，施法者附近会生成一个 枯骨傀儡 （已驯服的 骷髅怪 ）。召唤骷髅会跟随召唤者，攻击靠近的任何未驯服生物，但中立的 矮人 除外。它们远强于普通骷髅，即使与 2- 巨星 - 巨星 - Star 变体相比也是如此。 施法除需要最多100点 埃达之能 外，还会消耗施法者当前 生命值 的最多40%（ 不是 最大生命值）。与其他魔法武器一样，它没有次要能力。 同样，施法消耗的生命值和所需埃达之能都会受到施法者 血魔法 等级影响：等级100时，两者均减少1/3。","en":"Dead Raiser is one of the four Mistlands Magic weapons. When cast, a Skelett (a tamed Skeleton ) spawns near the caster. The skelett will follow its summoner and attacks any non-tame creature that comes close, except for neutral Dvergr . They are much stronger than normal Skeletons, even compared to 2-star variants. In addition to requiring up to 100 eitr to be cast, the caster will lose up to 40% of their current H…","titleZh":"招魂之杖","titleEn":"Dead Raiser"},"p-3ae89e8a8fe1c4a5aec2.html":{"zh":"尸鬼 是 泥泞沼泽 及 尸鬼村庄 、 地下圣堂 、偶尔 凛冽雪山 塔楼中的敌对 生物 。它们是古老的维京亡灵，如今身体肿胀。","en":"Draugr are aggressive creatures found in Swamps and in Draugr villages , Sunken Crypts and sometimes Mountain towers. They are ancient undead Vikings that have since become bloated in appearance.","titleZh":"尸鬼","titleEn":"Draugr"},"p-3b4681f41a8e5f7a65ff.html":{"zh":"巨人泡泡 是生长在 迷雾之地 的作物，可在该生物群系中自然找到，也可用 耕地耙 种植。","en":"Jotun puffs are crops which grow in the Mistlands . They can be found naturally in the biome and farmed by planting them using a Cultivator .","titleZh":"巨人泡泡","titleEn":"Jotun Puffs"},"p-3b776eb0f07648f3c5a5.html":{"zh":"骨骺蛟龙肉 是生活在 灰烬之地 沸腾海水中的 骨骺蛟龙 必定掉落的物品。击杀海蛇后，肉会在水面上漂浮较长时间。 可以在燃烧的 营火 上方的 铁烹饪台 上将其烤成 熟骨骺蛟龙肉 ；若烤得过久，则会变成 木炭 。","en":"Bonemaw Meat is a guaranteed drop from Bonemaws located in the boiling waters of the Ashlands . After slaying the Serpent, the meat will float for a considerable time. It can be cooked on an Iron Cooking Station over a lit Campfire to obtain Cooked Bonemaw Meat , or Coal if overcooked.","titleZh":"骨骺蛟龙肉","titleEn":"Bonemaw Meat"},"p-3c1ab344285ce0aba736.html":{"zh":"木塞瓶 是一种材料，可向 沼泽女巫 以 150 钱币 购买一包五个，折合每个 30 金币。","en":"Corked Vial is a material that can be bought from The Bog Witch for 150 Coins for a pack of five, so 30 Coins each.","titleZh":"木塞瓶","titleEn":"Corked Vial"},"p-3c3615c6154bd8b14304.html":{"zh":"越橘 可从 极北之地 的灌木上采集，可以直接食用，也可以在 铸铁锅 处制作成多种餐食。","en":"Lingonberries can be harvested from bushes in the Deep North . They can be eaten directly or cooked into several meals using a Cauldron .","titleZh":"越橘","titleEn":"Lingonberries"},"p-3c4ebfaf8dfda0e4e10a.html":{"zh":"耶鲁节礼物 是带储物格的 季节性 可建造设施，须在 工作台 范围内放置。 有小、中、大三种，分别提供1、2和3个物品格。","en":"A Yuleklapp is a seasonal buildable structure which has item slots, for storing items inside. It needs to be built within the range of a Workbench . It comes in small, medium and large variants with 1, 2 and 3 slots, respectively.","titleZh":"耶鲁节礼物","titleEn":"Yuleklapp"},"p-3c5fbacbd8ddf71588a4.html":{"zh":"藤莓( 藤莓) 是由 灰烬藤蔓 种植的 食物 。可以生吃，但用于 铸铁锅 配方更有价值。","en":"Vineberries are food grown from Ashvine . They can be eaten raw, but are more useful in Cauldron recipes.","titleZh":"酒莓束","titleEn":"Vineberry Cluster"},"p-3cc5860183703a4d0207.html":{"zh":"冰霜软泥怪 是投掷 软泥怪炸弹：冰霜 生成的敌对 生物 。","en":"Frost Blobs are aggressive creatures spawned by throwing a Blob bomb: Frost .","titleZh":"冰霜软泥怪","titleEn":"Frost Blob"},"p-3cd1c65c229bacac00d1.html":{"zh":"鬓猪 、 巨狼 、 平原牦牛 、 灰烬刚鬣 和 驼鹿 可驯服，使其对玩家友好，并协助对抗敌对生物； 鸡 ／ 母鸡 从蛋孵出时已驯服。它们都可繁殖，方便获取掉落物。驯服狼可命令驻守或跟随战斗，驯服平原牦牛、灰烬刚鬣及驼鹿可骑乘。 驯服生物保留 星级 并传给后代，因此2星个体的掉落和战斗能力更强，非常值得驯服。","en":"Boars , Wolves , Lox , Asksvins , and Moose can be tamed to make them friendly with the players and help against fighting other hostile creatures, while Chickens / Hens are already tamed once they are hatched from an egg. They can all also be bred, which enables easy access to their drops. Tamed Wolves can be commanded to guard a specific place or to follow into a battle. Tamed Lox, Asksvin, and Moose can be ridden.","titleZh":"驯服","titleEn":"Taming"},"p-3d5398eff79d978272ba.html":{"zh":"青铜战斗神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Bronze Battle Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"青铜战斗神像","titleEn":"Bronze Battle Idol"},"p-3dc32513ac27fdb53aca.html":{"zh":"仲夏柱 是只能在仲夏季节建造的 季节性 设施，也可能在 青青草原 的 废弃村落 中央少量自然生成。它唯一的用途是提高1点 舒适度 。","en":"The Maypole is a seasonal structure that can be built exclusively during the midsummer season. It also can be found rarely in the middle of Abandoned Villages within the Meadows . Its sole purpose is to increase Comfort by 1.","titleZh":"仲夏柱","titleEn":"Maypole"},"p-3ddac61c7e4488b27517.html":{"zh":"狼皮 由 凛冽雪山 生物群系 的 巨狼 掉落。","en":"Wolf pelt is a drop from Wolves in the Mountain biome .","titleZh":"狼皮","titleEn":"Wolf Pelt"},"p-3de887dcf32fa43ceb3e.html":{"zh":"北境战戟 是一种 极北之地 级别的 长柄武器 。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境战戟铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Atgeir is a Deep North -tier Polearms . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Atgeir and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境战戟","titleEn":"Nord Atgeir"},"p-3df8b217198dc1e85b3a.html":{"zh":"古树皮 是一种用于中期建造及制作配方的木材。","en":"Ancient Bark is a type of wood used in mid-game building and crafting recipes.","titleZh":"古树皮","titleEn":"Ancient Bark"},"p-3e311d6c4044aa6ec8a3.html":{"zh":"死黏团 是 极北之地 中的材料。 死浆块只用于制作 树脓炸弹：黏团 ，还需同类敌人掉落的 黏团战利品 ，但后者掉率低得多。","en":"Dead Pulp is a materials found in Deep North . Dead Pulp is only used to craft Blob Bomb Pulp , which also requires a Pulp Trophy that drop from the same enemies but at a much lower rate.","titleZh":"死黏团","titleEn":"Dead Pulp"},"p-3e4f4dff84707681cd6b.html":{"zh":"英灵神殿 是与游戏同名的第十世界，作为 弃誓者 的炼狱。","en":"Valheim is the eponymous tenth world that serves as a purgatory for the Forsaken .","titleZh":"英灵神殿世界","titleEn":"Valheim (world)"},"p-3ed5d984c689609883de.html":{"zh":"虚空召唤者 是一种 刀 ，由 虚空 掉落。 主要攻击为突刺，消耗6点 耐力 。次要攻击造成三倍伤害，消耗18点耐力。对未警觉的敌人造成6x伤害。 当前游戏版本禁用了它的配方，因此无法在 古咒法台 或 潜能熔炉 处制作或升级。","en":"Voidcaller is a knife . It is dropped by The Void . Its primary attack is a stab costing 6 Stamina . Its secondary attack deals three times the damage and costs 18 Stamina. It deals 6x damage against unalerted enemies. Its recipe is disabled in the current game build, so it cannot be crafted or upgraded at a Galdr Table or the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"虚空召唤者","titleEn":"Voidcaller"},"p-3ee43cf9fe8c24f3cb1f.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以140枚 钱币 购买5个 香料包 ，仅在击败 冰霜龙母 后出售。","en":"Fragrant bundle can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 140 Coins for 5 items. It is only sold after Moder has been defeated.","titleZh":"香料包","titleEn":"Fragrant Bundle"},"p-3f32e3a294ed80195832.html":{"zh":"潜能熔炉 是 凛冽雪山 中独特的 地点 。","en":"The Forge of Potential is a unique Point of interest found in the Mountain .","titleZh":"潜能熔炉","titleEn":"Forge of Potential"},"p-3f3f8baad08c9ccc4a3e.html":{"zh":"鱼 是出现在岸边、湖泊及 无尽之海 的被动 生物 ，可通过 钓鱼 获得，也可捡起被冲上岸的个体。","en":"Fish are passive creatures found in shores, lakes and Oceans . They can be obtained through Fishing , or picked up when washed ashore.","titleZh":"鱼","titleEn":"Fish"},"p-3f9c34f5b2ef714be345.html":{"zh":"熔岩之核 是 灰烬之地 中的制作材料。","en":"Molten cores are a crafting material from the Ashlands .","titleZh":"熔岩之核","titleEn":"Molten Core"},"p-3fbc649b2c363d907df7.html":{"zh":"没有技能流失 是 死亡 后施加的 状态效果 ，在之后600秒，即10分钟内，防止再次死亡继续损失技能经验。每次死亡重置。 其他效果退出后消失，但 没有技能流失 仍保留在角色上，直至到期。","en":"No skill drain is a status effect applied upon death . The effect prevents any further skill experience loss upon new deaths in the next 600 seconds (10 minutes). This effect is reset after each death. Unlike all other effects which fade after the player logs out, the No skill drain effect still remains with the character until its duration is over.","titleZh":"没有技能流失","titleEn":"No skill drain"},"p-3fd3629196cf9578207e.html":{"zh":"桶箍 用于建造 木桶 ，可向 霍尔德 以100枚 钱币 购买3个。","en":"Barrel hoops are used to build Barrels . They can be brought from Haldor at 100 Coins for 3 items.","titleZh":"桶箍","titleEn":"Barrel Hoops"},"p-3fd512f6c9fbbb95fab7.html":{"zh":"召唤者披风 是在 古咒法台 处制作的 极北之地 级别 披风 。","en":"Cape of the Caller is a Deep North -tier Cape crafted at the Galdr Table .","titleZh":"召唤者披风","titleEn":"Cape of the Caller"},"p-403af4f314bc9613ee26.html":{"zh":"矮人酒杯 用于从背包饮用 蜜酒 ，不过没有酒杯也能饮用蜜酒。","en":"Dvergr Tankards are an item used to consume Mead from within an inventory. Mead can, however, be consumed without the use of a tankard.","titleZh":"矮人酒杯","titleEn":"Dvergr Tankard"},"p-40d8cab04cf76c6e2429.html":{"zh":"灶台 是用于制作盛宴、未烹饪食物、生鱼肉及鱼饵的设施。","en":"The Food Preparation Table is a crafting station used to create feasts, uncooked food, raw fish and baits.","titleZh":"灶台","titleEn":"Food Preparation Table"},"p-40f1e641581ff07af293.html":{"zh":"雷血战斧 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境战斧 得到的版本。 它获得额外的 劈砍 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境战斧在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。 主要攻击为3连击，最后一击造成双倍伤害。次要攻击是缓慢但强力的过顶劈砍，非常适合清除位置过低、普通挥砍无法命中的树桩。","en":"Thunderblood Axe is a version of Nord Axe upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra Slash and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Axe will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷血战斧","titleEn":"Thunderblood Axe"},"p-41105fc4feada813b4ae.html":{"zh":"圆木堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 圆木 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Corewood Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Corewood or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"圆木堆","titleEn":"Corewood Stack"},"p-41136f1d37fb4fb91554.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣披风 是一件可制作的 披风 部件，可在 灰烬之地 阶段获得。它使闪避耐力消耗降低-15%，并提供 疾跑 效果。疾跑根据 风 方向和风力强度，最多使奔跑速度提高+25%，并使奔跑耐力消耗降低至-100%。 另一种灰烬之地级别披风是 灰烬披风 ，其加成更侧重战斗。","en":"Asksvin Cloak is a craftable Cape piece available in Ashlands . It offers a -15% dodge stamina usage and the Wind Run effect. Wind Run increases running speed up to +25% and decreases running stamina usage down to -100% based on wind direction and wind strength. An alternative option for an Ashlands-tier cape is the Ashen Cape which offers more combat-focused bonuses.","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣披风","titleEn":"Asksvin Cloak"},"p-411492b0217c0b9906ea.html":{"zh":"粗弓 是第一种 弓 。 即使完全拉满，精度仍然很低，因此有些玩家更喜欢使用 燧石矛 狩猎，虽然射程较短，但精度更高。","en":"Crude Bow is the first bow . It is highly inaccurate, even at full draw, so some players prefer hunting with a Flint Spear instead, which has a lower range but higher accuracy.","titleZh":"粗弓","titleEn":"Crude Bow"},"p-4120d19c6799062fefe3.html":{"zh":"开膛弩 是第二种 弩 。 主要攻击发射 弩箭 。攻击前，必须先将一支弩箭装入弩中。技能等级为0时，装填需要3.5秒并消耗3点耐力；但加上发射、装填和准备动作，实际每6秒才能发射一次。跳跃和冲刺会重置装填进度，冲刺时也无法装填弩箭。装填完成后，可随时发射，且不消耗耐力。发射后需要重新装填一支弩箭。切换到其他武器时，弩箭不会保持装填状态，因此每次装备该物品时都需要装填。 弩箭飞行速度明显快于箭矢，沿直线飞行而非抛物线（不会因重力而下坠）。","en":"Ripper is the second crossbow . Its primary attack fires bolts . To attack, a bolt is first loaded into the crossbow. Loading takes 3.5 seconds and uses 3 stamina at level 0, however, with the firing, loading, and readying animations, it can only be fired every 6 seconds. Jumping and sprinting resets the loading progress, and bolts cannot be loaded while sprinting. After the crossbow is loaded, it can be fired at an…","titleZh":"开膛弩","titleEn":"Ripper"},"p-41518edc1eb4af3489b0.html":{"zh":"耶鲁树枝 是 季节性 装饰物，须在 工作台 范围内建在墙壁或屋顶上。","en":"Yule Garland is a seasonal decorative object. It needs to be built within the range of a Workbench and on a wall or roof.","titleZh":"耶鲁树枝","titleEn":"Yule Garland"},"p-416c11bc9912f6e07f24.html":{"zh":"灰烬之木尖围墙 是一种 尖桩 ，使用从 灰烬之地 获得的 灰烬之木 建造。任何碰到尖端的生物，包括玩家和驯养动物，都会受到120点 穿刺 伤害和40点 击退 。护甲和抗性可以降低玩家受到的伤害。每次造成伤害会损失34点耐久度；在 工作台 范围内可用 工具锤 修复。 与多数设施不同，灰烬之木尖围墙被锤子拆除，或因造成伤害而损毁时，不会返还建造材料。","en":"Ashwood stakewall is a stake built with Ashwood acquired from the Ashlands . It deals 120 pierce damage and 40 knockback to any creature, including players and tames, that touch the sharp end of the stakes. Damage to the player is reduced by armor and resistances. The structure will lose 34 durability whenever it deals damage, and can be repaired with a Hammer when within range of a Workbench .","titleZh":"灰烬之木尖围墙","titleEn":"Ashwood Stakewall"},"p-41737c37376738339ab1.html":{"zh":"辣辣柑橘酱 是 灰烬之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Spicy marmalade is an Ashlands -tier food.","titleZh":"辣辣柑橘酱","titleEn":"Spicy Marmalade"},"p-41817449618ef707eb0e.html":{"zh":"冰层 位于 极北之地 沿岸，可开采 冰霜 。 玩家行走其上会打滑。","en":"Ice Sheets are present along the cost of Deep North . They can be mined for Ice . They are slippery when players walk on them.","titleZh":"冰层","titleEn":"Ice Sheet"},"p-41c8bfc60226d7f15164.html":{"zh":"水晶战斧 是第二种双手 斧 。","en":"Crystal Battleaxe is the second two-handed axe .","titleZh":"水晶战斧","titleEn":"Crystal Battleaxe"},"p-41cfd561984685d54434.html":{"zh":"邪骨胸甲 是击杀 北境平原 中的 恶骨 获得的物品。","en":"Vile ribcage is an item found by killing Viles in the Plains .","titleZh":"邪骨胸甲","titleEn":"Vile Ribcage"},"p-41eff306595fabf3fe4b.html":{"zh":"血魔法（技能） 是与 血魔法 武器类别相关的 技能 。","en":"Blood magic (Skill) is a skill related to the Blood magic weapon class.","titleZh":"血魔法（技能）","titleEn":"Blood magic (skill)"},"p-41fa6c475731105f8d1e.html":{"zh":"黑大理石 是 迷雾之地 中的黑色坚硬石材。","en":"Black Marble is black hard stone found in the Mistlands .","titleZh":"黑大理石","titleEn":"Black Marble"},"p-423c677c12e0b601c34c.html":{"zh":"箭 是一种供 弓 使用的弹药。 在进行其他伤害计算之前，箭的 伤害 会加到弓的基础伤害上（详见 伤害机制 ）。 可以在 物品栏 中选择箭矢，明确指定使用哪一组。否则，或所选箭矢用尽后，将使用第一组箭矢。","en":"Arrows is a type of ammunition for Bows . Arrow damage is added to base bow damage before any other damage calculation (see damage mechanics for details). Arrows can be selected in the inventory to explicitly set which stack to use. Otherwise, or once the stack is depleted, the first stack is used.","titleZh":"箭","titleEn":"Arrows"},"p-425d7538f593b76e2627.html":{"zh":"余烬之杖 是 迷雾之地 更新加入的四种 魔法 武器之一。主要攻击发射一枚速度适中、沿弧线飞行的火球。火球直接命中时造成钝击伤害，并产生爆炸，使非玩家角色燃烧并受到范围伤害。伤害和埃达之能消耗取决于施法者的 元素魔法 技能等级。与其他魔法武器一样，它没有次要能力。 虽然法杖有两种攻击动作，先从右向左挥动，再反向挥回，但连续攻击不会获得连击加成。","en":"Staff of Embers is one of four Magic weapons introduced in the Mistlands update. Its primary attack launches a moderately slow fireball that flies in an arc. The fireball deals blunt damage on direct hits, and causes an explosion that ignites and deals Area of Effect damage against non-player characters. Damage and eitr usage are dependent on the caster's Elemental magic skill level. Like the other magic weapons, it…","titleZh":"余烬之杖","titleEn":"Staff of Embers"},"p-42b0bedf2737ab2cba46.html":{"zh":"灰烬僵尸 是 灰烬之地 中的敌人，正如名字所示，它们总在抽搐。 另有由 术士 召唤的变体，只有50生命值，详见 召唤的灰烬僵尸 。 灰烬亡灵抽搐者没有战利品","en":"Charred Twitchers are hostile enemies found in the Ashlands . These guys are always twitching, as their name suggests. There is an alternate summoned version, with only 50 health, invoked by Warlocks , see Summoned Twitcher . Charred Twitchers have no trophy.","titleZh":"灰烬僵尸","titleEn":"Charred Twitcher"},"p-4311ee02d22a215f72ae.html":{"zh":"女巫之冠 是一套 极北之地 级别的 饰物 。","en":"The Witch Crown is a Deep North -tier trinket .","titleZh":"女巫之冠","titleEn":"Witch Crown"},"p-433654d289cd5f9d232c.html":{"zh":"蜂后 是 蜂巢 掉落的材料。","en":"Queen bee is a material dropped by Bee Nests .","titleZh":"蜂后","titleEn":"Queen Bee"},"p-43692826e0db5ae7f081.html":{"zh":"耕作 是一种 技能 。","en":"Farming is a skill .","titleZh":"农耕（技能）","titleEn":"Farming (skill)"},"p-43700dd2ec1925d21636.html":{"zh":"建造和修复 灰木结构 需要 灰烬之木 ，且附近必须有 工作台 。","en":"Ashwood structures require Ashwood and the proximity of a workbench to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"灰木结构","titleEn":"Ashwood Structures"},"p-43a4282d378106764bd4.html":{"zh":"狂战之酒 是一种 北境平原 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：狂战士 发酵 而成。","en":"Berserkir mead is a Plains -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Berserkir .","titleZh":"狂战之酒","titleEn":"Berserkir Mead"},"p-43aaeb62ceede527074a.html":{"zh":"灰色皮毛帽 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付300 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的青铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Fur cap grey is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 300 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's bronze chest .","titleZh":"灰色皮毛帽","titleEn":"Fur cap grey"},"p-43c4ed095353ef056752.html":{"zh":"黑金属碎片 用于继 银 后的第四级装备材料。与此前金属不同，黑金属碎片不从矿床开采，由 丑地精 掉落，或在 北境平原 宝箱中找到。","en":"Black Metal Scrap is used to craft the fourth level of equipment materials, following Silver . Unlike previous metals, Black Metal Scrap is not mined from deposits. It is dropped by Fulings or found in chests in the Plains biome.","titleZh":"黑金属碎片","titleEn":"Black Metal Scrap"},"p-43d402ecd4c2568c0c04.html":{"zh":"棕色简朴连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付350 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的黄铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Simple dress brown is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 350 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's brass chest .","titleZh":"棕色简朴连衣裙","titleEn":"Simple dress brown"},"p-43f0757ce42769a01320.html":{"zh":"暗影面纱 是一种 北境平原 级别的 饰物 。","en":"Evasion Mantle is a Plains -tier trinket .","titleZh":"暗影面纱","titleEn":"Evasion Mantle"},"p-440f49671e99164315e3.html":{"zh":"丑地精狂战士 是 北境平原 中的敌对 生物 ，守卫 地精村落 和 巨石阵 。它们体形巨大、力气强，类似哥布林，似乎拥有自己的部落文化。 符文石 和 图腾 暗示它们崇拜早已死去的国王 亚格鲁斯 。","en":"Fuling Berserkers are aggressive creatures found in Plains guarding Fuling Villages and Stonehenges . They are large, strong goblin-like beings that appear to possess their own tribalistic culture. It is implied through runestones and totems that they worship Yagluth , a long dead king.","titleZh":"丑地精狂战士","titleEn":"Fuling Berserker"},"p-441cd56eacbb1fc689a9.html":{"zh":"希尔德 是 青青草原 中的 角色 ，与哥哥 霍尔德 一样属于 矮人 。她穿红白连衣裙，戴绿红项链和头带。营地最近遭劫，希尔德仍出售一些可用 钱币 购买的独特物品。","en":"Hildir is a character found in Meadows . Like her brother, Haldor , she is a Dvergr . She wears a red and white dress, a green and red necklace and a headband. At her camp, which was recently raided, Hildir sells several unique items that can be purchased for Coins .","titleZh":"希尔德","titleEn":"Hildir"},"p-442c1b755a0e4e41c6d6.html":{"zh":"劈柴墩 放在 工作台 五米以内时，可为其升级。","en":"The Chopping block serves as an upgrade for the Workbench when placed within five meters of it.","titleZh":"劈柴墩","titleEn":"Chopping Block"},"p-4485878be97fca435d93.html":{"zh":"极简连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付250 钱币 购买。","en":"Simple Undyed Dress is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 250 Coins .","titleZh":"本色简朴连衣裙","titleEn":"Simple dress natural"},"p-44cb005ee2e65d9cc817.html":{"zh":"树根 可能指：","en":"Root may refer to:","titleZh":"树根","titleEn":"Root"},"p-44d657ae1afd1497c503.html":{"zh":"邪蛛幼雏 是 迷雾之地 中 腐疫矿区 内部的敌对 生物 。 邪蛛是兼具甲虫、蚂蚁和蜜蜂特征的大型虫状生物。邪蛛幼体像缩小的普通 邪蛛探索者 ，但外壳较软、呈黄色。只在感染矿洞内防护严密的邪蛛巢穴出现，似乎是幼体而非独立阶级。","en":"Seeker Broods are aggressive creatures found within Infested Mines in the Mistlands . Seekers are large insect-like creatures with traits similar to beetles, ants, and bees. Seeker broods resemble a miniature version of the ordinary Seekers , though with a softer yellow carapace. As they are only found within well-protected Seeker nests within Infested Mines, they appear to be Seeker young and not a separate caste.","titleZh":"邪蛛幼雏","titleEn":"Seeker Brood"},"p-44faa0a1df6582bac373.html":{"zh":"蜜酒壶 是用于制作 蜜酒 原液的设施，运行时正下方需要 营火 或 灶 等火源。 蜜酒壶没有升级设施，所有配方在设施等级1时都可使用。 蜜酒原液必须用 发酵桶 发酵，才能成为可饮用的蜜酒。","en":"The Mead Ketill is a crafting station used to prepare mead bases. It requires a fire source underneath to operate, such as a campfire or hearth . The Mead Ketill has no upgrades. All recipes are accessible at station level 1. Mead bases must be fermented using a Fermenter to produce consumable meads.","titleZh":"蜜酒壶","titleEn":"Mead Ketill"},"p-459593cd5bf4160c10cf.html":{"zh":"巨木堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 巨木 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Timberwood Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Timberwood or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"巨木堆","titleEn":"Timberwood Stack"},"p-45c7d571c8ed6b80b6ee.html":{"zh":"蓝色黄麻帘幕 是装饰物。 在 迷雾之地 各处由 黑大理石 建成的 矮人 建筑中，也能找到蓝色黄麻帷幔。可将其破坏以获得 蓝黄麻 。不过，玩家若损伤它们，或矮人 守护石 范围内的其他建筑，附近矮人就会转为敌对并攻击玩家。","en":"Blue Jute Drapes are a decorative object. Blue Jute Drapes can also be found adorning the Dvergr structures built of Black Marble throughout the Mistlands . There, they can be broken to obtain their Blue Jute , although if a player damages them (or any other structure in range of a Dvergr Ward ), nearby Dvergr will become hostile and attack players.","titleZh":"蓝色黄麻帘幕","titleEn":"Blue Jute Drapes"},"p-45cbf453733ae34499cf.html":{"zh":"邪念之像 是 灰烬之地 内 灰烬亡灵堡垒 中的 生物生成点 ，可生成任意焦骨生物： 生成敌人有4.75%概率为1星，0.25%概率为2星。 玩家进入60米内时，邪念之像激活，每12秒尝试在四米内生成。","en":"The Effigy of Malice is a creature spawner found in Charred Fortresses within the Ashlands . The Effigy can spawn any Charred: Spawned enemies have a 4.75% chance to be 1-star and a 0.25% chance to be 2-star. The Effigy activates when there is a player within 60 meters. The effigy attempts to spawn within four meters every 12 seconds.","titleZh":"邪念之像","titleEn":"Effigy of Malice"},"p-45fafafd3c1c7371c274.html":{"zh":"建造和修复 铁木结构 需要 木材 和 铁 ，且附近须有 熔炉 。","en":"Wood iron structures require wood and iron and the proximity of a forge to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"铁木结构","titleEn":"Wood Iron Structures"},"p-4682c0bae6c85cc95e94.html":{"zh":"砂轮 用于升级 熔炉 。 它是两种不需要金属锭的熔炉升级设施之一，因此可以通过 传送门 运输；另一种是 风箱 。","en":"The grinding wheel is used as an upgrade for the forge . It is one of the two upgrades to the forge that does not use metal ingots, and thus can be taken through a portal . (The other is the bellows .)","titleZh":"砂轮","titleEn":"Grinding Wheel"},"p-4696ff19d71c753885a5.html":{"zh":"本页收集 铁门 正式公布的未来更新预览、透露信息和视频。随着内容加入游戏及新信息公开，会持续删除和添加条目。","en":"This page is dedicated to all sneak peeks, leaks, and videos that have been officially released by Iron Gate about upcoming updates. Content will be removed and added to this page as we see things added into the game and shown in leaks.","titleZh":"未来内容","titleEn":"Future content"},"p-46ab9a23765f285ff986.html":{"zh":"找到第二位商人 希尔德 后，就可以建造 理发台 ，无须完成她的任务。 理发套件 可向希尔德花费600金币购买。理发台还会提高1点 舒适度 。 理发台提供八种新发型： 理发台提供四种新胡须样式：","en":"The Barber station can be created once the player has found the second trader, Hildir . This does not require the completion of her quest to build. The Barber Kit can be purchased from Hildir for 600 gold. The Barber Station also increases the Comfort level by 1. Barber station provides eight new hairstyles: Barber station provides four new beard styles:","titleZh":"理发台","titleEn":"Barber Station"},"p-46ac202422dae22c8171.html":{"zh":"锡矿 可在 冶炼炉 用 木炭 作燃料，转为 锡 。 再在 熔炉 与两份 铜 加工，得到 青铜 。锡用于解锁更好食物的烹饪选项。","en":"Tin Ore can be turned into Tin in a Smelter using Coal as fuel. This can be further processed at a Forge with two Copper to yield Bronze . Tin is used to open up cooking options for better food.","titleZh":"锡矿","titleEn":"Tin Ore"},"p-46bd499d061c6fffa401.html":{"zh":"红色简朴上衣 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付350 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的黄铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Simple tunic red is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 350 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's brass chest .","titleZh":"红色简朴上衣","titleEn":"Simple tunic red"},"p-46ec01b3d5a9620eb783.html":{"zh":"巨魔之忍蜜酒 是一种 泥泞沼泽 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：巨魔之忍 发酵 而成。","en":"Mead of Troll endurance is a Swamp -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Troll endurance .","titleZh":"巨魔之忍蜜酒","titleEn":"Mead of Troll Endurance"},"p-46f381726b2ed645dcc6.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣骨盆 是破坏自然生成的 灰烬刚鬣腐尸 获得的资源，主要位于 腐朽之穴 入口或 秃鹫巢穴 附近。 破坏骸骨可能掉落灰烬刚鬣盆骨，或其他三种骸骨部件之一。","en":"Asksvin Pelvis is a resource gathered by breaking naturally spawned Asksvin Carrion , found mainly near Putrid Hole entrances or Volture Nests . Destroying the Skeletons can drop the Asksvin Pelvis or any of the other three Asksvin Skeleton pieces.","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣骨盆","titleEn":"Asksvin Pelvis"},"p-471ffac1e4e3fa20c26f.html":{"zh":"强弩 是第一种 弩 。 它可以驱散9米半径内 迷雾之地 的 雾 。 主要攻击发射 弩箭 。攻击前，必须先将一支弩箭装入弩中。技能等级为0时，装填需要3.5秒并消耗3点耐力；但加上发射、装填和准备动作，实际每6秒才能发射一次。跳跃和冲刺会重置装填进度，冲刺时也无法装填弩箭。装填完成后，可随时发射，且不消耗耐力。发射后需要重新装填一支弩箭。切换到其他武器时，弩箭不会保持装填状态，因此每次装备该物品时都需要装填。 弩箭飞行速度明显快于箭矢，沿直线飞行而非抛物线（不会因重力而下坠）。","en":"Arbalest is the first crossbow . It is capable of dispelling the Mist of Mistlands in a 9-meter radius. Its primary attack fires bolts . To attack, a bolt is first loaded into the crossbow. Loading takes 3.5 seconds and uses 3 stamina at level 0, however, with the firing, loading, and readying animations, it can only be fired every 6 seconds. Jumping and sprinting resets the loading progress, and bolts cannot be loa…","titleZh":"强弩","titleEn":"Arbalest"},"p-47373e84723cece15749.html":{"zh":"生物等级 决定 生物 的伤害、生命值及物品掉落数量。","en":"Creature level determines the damage, health and the amount of dropped items by creatures .","titleZh":"生物等级","titleEn":"Creature level"},"p-47542b2d69ecd600c908.html":{"zh":"虽然名称如此， 珍宝箱 只是 家园与炉火 更新加入的装饰家具，不能像 其他种类的箱子 一样储存物品。","en":"Treasure Chests are, despite their name, purely decorative furniture introduced in the Hearth & Home update. They cannot be used for storing items like other kinds of chests .","titleZh":"珍宝箱","titleEn":"Treasure Chest"},"p-47ad0b7c5a532ff07685.html":{"zh":"阴燃之墓 是 黑暗林山 中的 地下城 。","en":"Smouldering Tombs are dungeons found in Black Forests .","titleZh":"阴燃之墓","titleEn":"Smouldering Tomb"},"p-4814bd1350fce4db98ff.html":{"zh":"亚麻线 用于制作较高阶武器及装备。","en":"Linen thread is an item used in the creation of higher tier weapons and gear.","titleZh":"亚麻线","titleEn":"Linen Thread"},"p-482785cea1eef3bf1186.html":{"zh":"烹饪台 可将生肉原料烤熟，放得过久则会变成 木炭 。烹饪架下方必须有 营火 、 灶 或 吊火盆 。一个营火上可并排放七个烹饪架；若将架子放到半嵌入营火的位置，则可增加至10个。","en":"The Cooking Station is used to cook raw meat type ingredients into their cooked form, or if left too long, into Coal . For the meat to be cooked it is necessary to have a Campfire , Hearth or Hanging Brazier underneath the cooking station. It is possible to stack seven cooking stations in a row over a single campfire. This number increases to 10 if the cooking stations are placed halfway inside the campfire.","titleZh":"烹饪台","titleEn":"Cooking Station"},"p-483538232016e17e86f2.html":{"zh":"冰霜龙母 是第四位 首领 ，外形为巨大的冰幼龙，拥有黑鳞、白色毛鬃及破损双翼。多块 符文石 称她是所有 霜龙 的母亲。","en":"Moder is the fourth boss . She appears as a massive frost dragon with black scales, a white fur mane and tattered wings. According to numerous Runestones , she is the mother of all Drakes .","titleZh":"冰霜龙母","titleEn":"Moder"},"p-4843725b4a446c864a2c.html":{"zh":"狼牙 是 芬里 、 巨狼 及 乌尔夫 掉落的物品。","en":"Wolf fang is an item dropped by Fenrings , Wolves , and Ulvs .","titleZh":"狼牙","titleEn":"Wolf Fang"},"p-48b84a081b26bb2a55e9.html":{"zh":"盆罐 是可用于 存放 物品的装饰家具，不能用于种植。 盆罐使用摧毁 上古之坛 掉落的 罐子碎片 及 灰烬之树 掉落的 碳化树脂 制作。 建造不需要任何制作设施。","en":"Pots are decorative furniture pieces that can be used to store items. They cannot be used for planting. Pots are crafted from Pot Shards dropped from destroying Ancient Pots and Charcoal Resin dropped from Scorched Trees . They do not require any station to be built.","titleZh":"盆罐","titleEn":"Pots"},"p-49244ce80e04178e5e2e.html":{"zh":"巨木 是砍伐 极北之地 树木获得的制作资源，用于北境级武器，以及建造 巨木树 及 鳞木结构 。","en":"Timberwood is a crafting resource obtained by chopping down trees in the Deep North biome. It is used for crafting Nord-tier weapons and for building Timber and Scalewood Structures .","titleZh":"巨木","titleEn":"Timberwood"},"p-498074495620a217e7b5.html":{"zh":"这是 盾 的 分类 。","en":"This is a category for shields .","titleZh":"分类：盾","titleEn":"Category:Shields"},"p-4989b1ad82b895e78c73.html":{"zh":"燧石刀 是第一种 刀 。","en":"The Flint Knife is the first knife .","titleZh":"燧石刀","titleEn":"Flint Knife"},"p-4a05ec88daf9a8c27fbd.html":{"zh":"焰灵脚环 是一种 幽暗沼泽 级别的 饰物 。","en":"Nimble Anklet is a Swamp -tier trinket .","titleZh":"焰灵脚环","titleEn":"Nimble Anklet"},"p-4a282b0f72de9ac872c5.html":{"zh":"摩根之腱 是击杀 灰烬之地 中的 摩根 获取的物品。","en":"Morgen sinew is an item found by killing Morgen in Ashlands .","titleZh":"摩根之腱","titleEn":"Morgen Sinew"},"p-4a78754359766f59fb53.html":{"zh":"石铺路 是地面装饰，在 锄头 菜单中选择该功能后对地面使用即可。 将地面改为石铺路需要 耐力 ，并消耗1份 石头 。 铺设石路时，玩家必须位于 切石机 范围内。石路仅有外观作用，在上面奔跑不会加速，也不会减少耐力消耗。","en":"The Paved Road is a ground decoration applied by selecting the option in the Hoe menu and using it on the ground. Changing the ground type to Paved Road requires Stamina and costs 1 Stone . The player is required to be within the radius of a Stonecutter in order to place Paved Roads. Paved Roads are purely cosmetic, they do not give any speed boost or stamina reduction when running on them.","titleZh":"石铺路","titleEn":"Paved road"},"p-4aa758b98fde974e8eab.html":{"zh":"黑金属战斗神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Black Metal Battle Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"黑金属战斗神像","titleEn":"Black Metal Battle Idol"},"p-4aaf258215c52dfe0f3b.html":{"zh":"贵重物品是可商人换金币的 钱币 及物品，例如 霍尔德 和 希尔德 。除交易无实用用途，但 钱币 、 红宝石 、 银项链 可制基地装饰。","en":"Valuables are Coins and items that can be sold for coins to traders, like Haldor and Hildir . They are not used for any practical purpose other than buying and selling at their shops; however, Coins , Rubies and Silver necklaces can be used to create decorative items for the player's base.","titleZh":"分类：贵重物品","titleEn":"Category:Valuables"},"p-4afe1bcac00206e8540a.html":{"zh":"血块 是一件物品，可由 迷雾之地 生物群系 中的 壁虱幼虫 掉落。","en":"Blood clot is an item and can be dropped from Ticks in the Mistlands biome .","titleZh":"血块","titleEn":"Blood Clot"},"p-4b552030891c202f8db7.html":{"zh":"小耶梦加得 是一种 灰烬之地 级别的 饰物 。","en":"Jörmundling is an Ashlands -tier trinket .","titleZh":"小耶梦加得","titleEn":"Jörmundling"},"p-4b68d8c44569fe3a5879.html":{"zh":"槲寄生 是可挂在表面下方的 季节性 装饰物，须在 工作台 范围内建造。","en":"Mistletoe is a seasonal decorative object that can be placed on the underside of a surface. It needs to be built within the range of a Workbench .","titleZh":"槲寄生","titleEn":"Mistletoe"},"p-4b697af8e85b0da97b7f.html":{"zh":"生羽衣甘蓝脆片 是用于制作 羽衣甘蓝脆片 的 极北之地 级食材。","en":"Raw Kale Chips is a Deep North -tier food material used to make Kale Chips .","titleZh":"生羽衣甘蓝脆片","titleEn":"Raw Kale Chips"},"p-4b9a7dcf6feb50b4a876.html":{"zh":"拳类 是一类 武器 。","en":"Fists is a weapon class.","titleZh":"拳类","titleEn":"Fists"},"p-4bbe4e8b24c1e96d6276.html":{"zh":"黄色珠饰连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付550 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的青铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Beaded dress yellow is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 550 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's bronze chest .","titleZh":"黄色珠饰连衣裙","titleEn":"Beaded dress yellow"},"p-4bc0dcc10ff4cc6a5105.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣尾 是 灰烬刚鬣 掉落的 食物 。可以用燃烧的 营火 上方的 铁烹饪台 将其烤成 煮熟的灰烬刚鬣尾 ；若烤得过久，则会变成 木炭 。","en":"Asksvin tail is a food dropped by Asksvin . It can be cooked using an Iron Cooking Station over a lit Campfire to obtain a Cooked asksvin tail , or Coal if overcooked.","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣尾","titleEn":"Asksvin Tail"},"p-4bfa7f27bc4b06689920.html":{"zh":"北境之弓 是第七种 弓 。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境之弓铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Bow is the seventh bow . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Bow and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境之弓","titleEn":"Nord Bow"},"p-4c736a4367f131b73f93.html":{"zh":"青铜废料 是原金属，可用 木炭 作燃料，在 冶炼炉 转为 青铜 。","en":"Scrap Bronze is a raw metal that can be turned into Bronze in a Smelter using Coal as fuel.","titleZh":"青铜废料","titleEn":"Scrap Bronze"},"p-4c764cb6248ef9337fc1.html":{"zh":"影子 是阵亡战士灵魂，位于 废弃村落 ，有时夜间游荡 极北之地 。 不攻击，忽略所有伤害，有时低声说话。","en":"Shadow are the souls of fallen warriors, They are found in Abandoned Villages and sometime roaming in Deep North during the night. They have no attack and ignore all damage, but sometimes mumble sentences.","titleZh":"影子","titleEn":"Shadow"},"p-4c7eaec60cea58805c12.html":{"zh":"这是 弩 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 武器 。","en":"This is a category for crossbows which are a type of weapons .","titleZh":"分类：弩","titleEn":"Category:Crossbows"},"p-4c85ecaec998a3fc5f2c.html":{"zh":"冶炼炉 用于将特定金属原料冶炼成金属锭。","en":"The Smelter is a structure used to process certain raw metals into ingots.","titleZh":"冶炼炉","titleEn":"Smelter"},"p-4cbbe5b839033a5bbd72.html":{"zh":"燧石 仅自然生成于 青青草原 岸边，也可破坏 地精村落 的 皮革架 掉落。地形上的燧石拾取后4小时自然重新生成。","en":"Flint is found naturally on the shorelines of the Meadows biome only or dropped when destroying Tanning Racks in Fuling Villages . Flint which is found on the terrain will naturally respawn 4 hours after being picked.","titleZh":"燧石","titleEn":"Flint"},"p-4cc1d6e9f8574bb528cd.html":{"zh":"木炭 是 冶炼炉 及 高炉 所需燃料，也用于多种制作配方。","en":"Coal is a fuel necessary to power Smelters and Blast Furnaces while also being used by various crafting recipes.","titleZh":"木炭","titleEn":"Coal"},"p-4cc32fd4209724dbef35.html":{"zh":"紫御石 是在 极北之地 发现的 珍贵 。","en":"Veydris is a Valuable found in Deep North .","titleZh":"紫御石","titleEn":"Veydris"},"p-4d073ba68c011b38b412.html":{"zh":"小份耐力蜜酒 是一种 黑暗林山 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：小份耐力 发酵 而成。","en":"Minor stamina mead is a Black Forest -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Minor stamina .","titleZh":"小份耐力蜜酒","titleEn":"Minor Stamina Mead"},"p-4d5e4b52e8441f9f1f31.html":{"zh":"铁锤 是第三种单手 棍棒 ，也是 灰烬之地 之前最后一种只造成 钝击 伤害的棍棒。","en":"Iron Mace is the third one-handed club and the last pure blunt club until the Ashlands .","titleZh":"铁锤","titleEn":"Iron Mace"},"p-4d742200a20fc3803103.html":{"zh":"定身 是阻止移动和转身的 状态效应 ，不阻止攻击、格挡或翻滚。 定身生物无法移动或转向，但面前有范围内目标仍能攻击。 摩根 等攻击动画自带位移的生物，定身时仍能完成这些位移。","en":"Immobilized is a Status effect that prevents movement and character rotation, it does not prevent attacking, blocking or rolling. An immobilized creature cannot move or change the direction that they are facing, but can still attack if they are facing a target within their range. Creatures that have movements that are part of their attack animations, such as the Morgen , can still perform these movements while immob…","titleZh":"定身","titleEn":"Immobilized"},"p-4dd5afd38d7e95e67cca.html":{"zh":"用途 护盾发生器 穹顶保护范围内的玩家和建筑： 防御 雨水 ，避免玩家获得 潮湿效果 ，并防止建筑受损，类似 庇护效果 的效果。 在 灰烬之地 中防御 余烬雨 ，防止建筑被落下的余烬点燃。 阻挡外来投射物，例如 生物 攻击。 阻挡熔岩湖中随机飞出的 熔岩 球，适合在熔岩边缘开采 炎金属矿脉 时使用。 行为 护盾发生器可建在坚实地面或 笼子 、 石头 、 黑大理石 、 灰石 构件上。 作用区域为以护盾发生器为中心、半径30米的球体。 最多可装10份 白骨碎片 或 灰烬之骨 作为燃料，每吸收500点伤害消耗一份。起点在护盾外的投射物接触护盾边缘时，会被吸收并造成护盾损伤，包括环境余烬及玩家、生物发射的远程和魔法投射物。护盾也会阻挡雨水，但不会因此受损或消耗燃料。 多个护盾重叠时，交叠部分会合并，可将多个护盾连成更大的保护区域。 趣闻 护盾按投射物的起点判断是否拦截。因此，从护盾内部发射的投射物，即使先离开再进入保护区，也不会被吸收…","en":"Usage The Shield generator dome protects the player and structures within: Protects from Rain , prevents players from getting the Wet Effect and structures from being damaged. (Similar to the Shelter Effect ) Protects from Cinder rain in Ashlands , prevents the structure from catching on fire from falling cinder. Protects against incoming projectiles such as Creatures attacks. Protects against Lava balls randomly co…","titleZh":"护盾发生器","titleEn":"Shield Generator"},"p-4e1110ed84c464e78a88.html":{"zh":"矮人壁灯 是不需要燃料的光源，放在附近可提高1点 舒适度 。","en":"The Dvergr wall lantern is a light source and does not require any fuel. It increases Comfort by 1 when placed nearby.","titleZh":"矮人壁灯","titleEn":"Dvergr Wall Lantern"},"p-4e1648f201f09b705a4e.html":{"zh":"燕麦 是一种 极北之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Oats is a Deep North -tier food .","titleZh":"燕麦","titleEn":"Oats"},"p-4e7c41331a4464ad6e07.html":{"zh":"生物 通过感官察觉并寻找敌人，通常是玩家。这些感官包括视觉和听觉。生物无法闻到气味，因此 风 不会影响感知。 生物会选择能看见或听见的最近敌人作为目标。不过，仅听见声音不会使生物进入警戒。","en":"Creatures use their senses to detect and find enemies (usually players). These senses include seeing and hearing. Creatures cannot smell, so wind does not affect sensing. Creatures select the closest enemy as their target that they can see or hear. However, hearing never makes creatures alerted.","titleZh":"生物感知","titleEn":"Creature senses"},"p-4ebf26461bd87e0f7e7c.html":{"zh":"杀戮之戟 是第四种 长柄武器 。 杀戮之戟可以驱散9米半径内 迷雾之地 的 雾 。","en":"Himminafl is the fourth polearm . The Himminafl is capable of dispelling the Mist of Mistlands in a 9-meter radius.","titleZh":"杀戮之戟","titleEn":"Himminafl"},"p-4ecadf357515960ab905.html":{"zh":"钉子 可能指：","en":"Nails may refer to:","titleZh":"钉子","titleEn":"Nails"},"p-4edb2d15b8db5bf021b7.html":{"zh":"乌鸦 是 黑暗林山 中的被动 生物 ，体形小、长腿，喙粗直，全身包括腿脚都为黑色。","en":"Crows are passive creatures found in Black Forests . They are small birds with long legs and heavy, straight bills. These birds are entirely black, including their legs and feet.","titleZh":"乌鸦","titleEn":"Crow"},"p-4ef12a5c49d4e1ea8211.html":{"zh":"世界树嫩枝 是 迷雾之地 中的树，特征为细长、蛛状树干，需 黑金属斧 或更好工具伤害。 世界树嫩枝破坏产 木材 及 世界之树木 ，各数量似乎随机，但总计始终20份木材。","en":"Yggdrasil Shoot is a type of tree that can be found in the Mistlands biome. It is characterized by its thin, spidery trunk. A Black Metal Axe or better is required to damage it. Yggdrasil Shoot trees produce Wood and Yggdrasil Wood when destroyed. The yield of each type of wood appears to be random, however, a Yggdrasil Shoot will always drop 20 pieces of wood total.","titleZh":"世界树嫩枝","titleEn":"Yggdrasil Shoot"},"p-4f05aebd7d4a4b7ba48c.html":{"zh":"黄色披肩上衣 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付450 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的白银宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Cape tunic yellow is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 450 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's silver chest .","titleZh":"黄色披肩上衣","titleEn":"Cape tunic yellow"},"p-4fbbe60e2b61c20b58c4.html":{"zh":"铁大锤 是第二种双手 棍棒 。 它是单手 铁锤 的双手对应武器，后者的制作成本更低。虽然两者伤害相同，但铁大锤会伤害大范围内的所有目标，因此能够同时攻击大量敌人。","en":"Iron Sledge is the second two-handed club . It is a two-handed counterpart to the one-handed Iron Mace , which is cheaper to craft. While both weapons deal the same amount of damage, the Iron sledge damages everything in a large area-of-effect, and thus is capable of attacking large numbers of enemies simultaneously.","titleZh":"铁大锤","titleEn":"Iron Sledge"},"p-4ff26cad0ce14ca1aa88.html":{"zh":"皇后果酱 是 黑暗林山 阶段的 食物 。","en":"A Queen's jam is a Black Forest -tier food .","titleZh":"皇后果酱","titleEn":"Queen's Jam"},"p-504c96623c3e43c455d2.html":{"zh":"原始屠杀者 是使用 翡翠 强化 屠杀者 得到的版本。与所有使用 翡翠 强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 毒素伤害 ，且命中效果有20%概率施加 定身 。 已升级的屠杀者在改造为原始屠杀者时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Primal Slayer is the upgraded form of Slayer using the Jade . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Jade , they gain 10 poison damage and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply Immobilized . An upgraded Slayer will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Primal Slayer.","titleZh":"原始屠杀者","titleEn":"Primal Slayer"},"p-5083228b59c0831e6731.html":{"zh":"北境重锤 是一种 极北之地 级别的双手 棍棒 。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境重锤铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"The Nord Sledge is a Deep North -tier two handed Club . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Sledge and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境重锤","titleEn":"Nord Sledge"},"p-50a4466487cc461b0b2c.html":{"zh":"基本信息 铺平 是地面装饰，在 锄头 菜单中选择该功能后对地面使用即可。 修整路面消耗 耐力 ，但不需要材料或工作台。 小路仅有外观作用，在上面奔跑不会加速，也不会减少耐力消耗。 另见 石铺路","en":"General information Pathen is a ground decoration applied by selecting the option in the Hoe menu and using it on the ground. Building sections of the path costs Stamina , but require neither materials nor a Workbench. Paths are purely cosmetic, they do not give any speed boost or stamina reduction when running on them. See also Paved road","titleZh":"铺平","titleEn":"Pathen"},"p-50ec7a9ec9f14f1bcf8c.html":{"zh":"迷雾之地雕像 是 迷雾之地 中的特殊地点，共三种变体。","en":"Mistlands Statues are points of interest found in the Mistlands . They consist of three location variants.","titleZh":"迷雾之地雕像","titleEn":"Mistlands Statues"},"p-50ece796f111c9add4bb.html":{"zh":"北境圆盾 是第四种小圆 盾 。 凭借2.5x弹反加成，与同级别的其他盾相比，它在 弹反 攻击时提供的格挡护甲最高。但用于普通格挡时，它是最差的选择。北境圆盾目前具有游戏中所有盾里最高的弹反格挡护甲。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境圆盾铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Buckler is the fourth buckler shield . Its 2.5x parry bonus makes it the best option in regards to block armor when parrying attacks compared to every other shield in the same tier. But it is the worst option for regular blocking. The Nord Buckler currently has the highest parry block armor of any shield in the game.","titleZh":"北境圆盾","titleEn":"Nord Buckler"},"p-50ed6511896524fba31c.html":{"zh":"海豹 是 极北之地 岸边及 废弃村落 的被动生物，有0、1及2星变体。 海豹宝宝 是海豹幼崽，与成年海豹在相同岸边生成，每群一至三只，始终无星级。 海豹及海豹幼崽均没有攻击。","en":"Seals are passive creatures found on the shores and Abandoned Villages of the Deep North . They come in 0, 1 and 2-star variants. Baby Seals are seal pups. They spawn on the same shorelines as adult seals, in groups of one to three, and never have stars. Neither Seals nor Baby Seals have any attacks.","titleZh":"海豹","titleEn":"Seal"},"p-50efe6276f6a37255ac5.html":{"zh":"木箭 是最初的箭矢，建造 工作台 后即可获得。","en":"Wood arrows are the first arrows, available once the workbench has been created.","titleZh":"木箭","titleEn":"Wood Arrow"},"p-511ca2c2e3eb2e7aaa27.html":{"zh":"红色扭结头巾 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付300 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的青铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Twisted headscarf red is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 300 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's bronze chest .","titleZh":"红色扭结头巾","titleEn":"Twisted headscarf red"},"p-51334e444ea1ba3d23c9.html":{"zh":"雪球 是一种 极北之地 武器。","en":"Snowball is a Deep North weapon.","titleZh":"雪球","titleEn":"Snowball"},"p-513f4197192d95c75bcf.html":{"zh":"召唤的抽搐者 是 灰烬术士 召唤的敌对生物。","en":"Summoned Twitchers are aggressive creatures summoned by Charred Warlock .","titleZh":"召唤的灰烬僵尸","titleEn":"Summoned Twitcher"},"p-5171358f1eb44d41c785.html":{"zh":"甲壳圆盾 是第三种小圆 盾 。 凭借2.5x弹反加成，与同级别的其他盾相比，它在 弹反 攻击时提供的格挡护甲最高。但用于普通格挡时，它是最差的选择。","en":"Carapace Buckler is the third buckler shield . Its 2.5x parry bonus makes it the best option in regards to block armor when parrying attacks compared to every other shield in the same tier. But it is the worst option for regular blocking.","titleZh":"甲壳圆盾","titleEn":"Carapace Buckler"},"p-51878baee76a5b63436b.html":{"zh":"平原牦牛披风 是一件可制作的 护甲 部件。","en":"Lox Cape is a craftable armor piece.","titleZh":"平原牦牛披风","titleEn":"Lox Cape"},"p-519d3ffebebe9d0dfd12.html":{"zh":"灰烬之树 是 灰烬之地 中的一种 树 ，黑色、高大、阴森，枝条弯曲，身影压迫。 灰烬之树提供灰烬之地木材 灰烬之木 ，也提供少量 木材 及 碳化树脂 。 被灰烬之树的原木砸中时，除了正常的钝击伤害，还会受到 燃烧中 。","en":"Scorched Tree is a type of tree encountered in the Ashlands biome. They are black, tall, and menacing, with crooked branches and a looming figure. Scorched Trees are a source of Ashwood , the Ashlands-tier wood. In addition, small amounts of Wood and Charcoal Resin can be obtained from them. Getting struck by a Scorched Tree log inflicts Burning , alongside the normal blunt damage.","titleZh":"灰烬之树","titleEn":"Scorched Tree"},"p-51a50e8cfb857059df7f.html":{"zh":"冰火拳链 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境拳链 得到的版本。它们牺牲少量 钝击 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境拳链在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Frostfire Knucklechains are a version of Nord Knucklechains upgraded with Frostfire Essence . They lose a small amount of Blunt damage in exchange of a larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. Upgraded Nord Knucklechains will NOT keep their upgrade level when they are modified using essences.","titleZh":"冰火拳链","titleEn":"Frostfire Knucklechains"},"p-51a624ac9c7e893b13da.html":{"zh":"幽灵骷髅 是 鲁能黑暗林山 替代生态区中的光亮。 玩家靠近时变为 ghost 。","en":"Ghost Skull is a light found in Ruin Black Forest alternative biome. It transforms into a Ghost when a player get close.","titleZh":"幽灵骷髅","titleEn":"Ghost Skull"},"p-51fa427af7a1b873d911.html":{"zh":"冥火火炬 是一种特殊光源。","en":"The Wisp Torch is a special light source.","titleZh":"冥火火炬","titleEn":"Wisp Torch"},"p-52073f2ce43f20705c1a.html":{"zh":"海钓套餐 属于 无尽之海 阶段的 宴席 。","en":"Sailor's Bounty is the Ocean -tier Feast .","titleZh":"海钓套餐","titleEn":"Sailor's Bounty"},"p-524d2113008cc2bd18c4.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣颈骨 是破坏自然生成的 灰烬刚鬣腐尸 获得的资源，主要位于 腐朽之穴 入口或 秃鹫巢穴 附近。 破坏骸骨可能掉落灰烬刚鬣颈骨，或其他三种骸骨部件之一。","en":"Asksvin Neck is a resource gathered by breaking naturally spawned Asksvin Carrion , found mainly near Putrid Hole entrances or Volture Nests . Destroying the Skeletons can drop the Asksvin Neck or any of the other three Asksvin Skeleton pieces.","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣颈骨","titleEn":"Asksvin Neck"},"p-524dd22c05f3706530a1.html":{"zh":"沼泽女巫 是 泥泞沼泽 生物群系中的 灰矮人 商人 。她在沼泽小屋出售独特食材及物品，可用 钱币 购买，更多商品随世界进度解锁。她的香料及餐盘是制作、食用 宴席 所必需的。","en":"The Bog Witch is a Greydwarf trader found in the Swamp biome. She sells unique ingredients and items from her swamp hut which can be purchased with Coins , with additional items unlocking as the world progresses. Her spices and serving tray are required to prepare and eat a Feast .","titleZh":"沼泽女巫","titleEn":"The Bog Witch"},"p-525fa83a976582b6ba14.html":{"zh":"这是 战斗神像 的 分类 。","en":"This is a category for Battle Idols .","titleZh":"分类：战斗神像","titleEn":"Category:Battle Idols"},"p-52656e8104eef3fddd3d.html":{"zh":"树枝 是早期 资源 ，常见于 青青草原 及 黑暗林山 生物群系地面。 与树枝互动可拾取，获得一份 木材 。 树枝拾取后4小时自然重新生成。","en":"The Branch is an early game Resource that can be commonly found on the ground within the Meadows and Black Forest biomes. When interacted with, the branch will be picked up providing the player one Wood . Branches will naturally respawn 4 hours after being picked.","titleZh":"树枝","titleEn":"Branch"},"p-529e389aee2d9ba01753.html":{"zh":"铜匕首 是第二种 刀 。","en":"Copper Knife is the second knife .","titleZh":"铜匕首","titleEn":"Copper Knife"},"p-52bb0d7e2b11fcf47832.html":{"zh":"红色简朴帽 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付150 钱币 购买。","en":"Simple cap red is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 150 Coins .","titleZh":"红色简朴帽","titleEn":"Simple cap red"},"p-52bff7e1d16e23afe92e.html":{"zh":"屠夫刀 是一种实用型 刀 ，没有次要攻击。 它唯一的用途是在无需开启友军伤害的情况下杀死已驯服的动物。这把刀只能伤害已驯服的生物，也是目前唯一能够这样做的物品。","en":"The Butcher knife is a utility knife . It has no secondary attack. Its singular usage is to kill tamed animals without having to enable Friendly Fire. The knife can only hurt tamed creatures, and is the only item currently able to do so.","titleZh":"屠夫刀","titleEn":"Butcher Knife"},"p-52ef97f5f73eb461b6dd.html":{"zh":"血旺 是一种 北境平原 级别的 食物 。","en":"Blood Pudding is a Plains -tier food .","titleZh":"血旺","titleEn":"Blood Pudding"},"p-536ff5051d2541c9be59.html":{"zh":"钩子 是 迷雾之地 中 战利品宝箱 里的材料。","en":"Hook is a material found in Loot chests in Mistlands .","titleZh":"钩子","titleEn":"Hook"},"p-53a230d658f13bbf440e.html":{"zh":"巨熊利爪 是第一种可制作的 拳类武器 。","en":"Paws of the Bear is the first craftable fist weapon .","titleZh":"巨熊利爪","titleEn":"Paws of the Bear"},"p-53ce13b84c34826ecdb8.html":{"zh":"鹿角镐 是第一种 镐击 ，可用于开采 石头 、 铜 、 锡 、 泥泞的废料堆 和 深渊藤壶 。 主要攻击为能够破坏地面的近战攻击。它没有次要攻击。","en":"The Antler pickaxe is the first pickaxe . It can be used to mine Stone , Copper , Tin , Muddy Scrap Piles , and Abyssal Barnacles . Its primary attack is a melee attack that destroys ground. It does not have a secondary attack.","titleZh":"鹿角镐","titleEn":"Antler Pickaxe"},"p-53e9e085b2d11109d84b.html":{"zh":"杀人蜂 是 北境平原 中的敌对 生物 ，顾名思义，是放大的蚊子状昆虫，发出响亮嗡嗡声。","en":"Deathsquitos are aggressive creatures found in Plains . They are, as their name suggests, enlarged mosquito-type bugs that give off a loud buzzing noise.","titleZh":"杀人蜂","titleEn":"Deathsquito"},"p-54d2dc7150a6592180de.html":{"zh":"碧渊石 是在 极北之地 发现的 珍贵 。","en":"Grimvarn is a Valuable found in Deep North .","titleZh":"碧渊石","titleEn":"Grimvarn"},"p-55191b5988dd3c28ee5a.html":{"zh":"冰火十字弓 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境十字弓 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 穿刺 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境十字弓在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。 主要攻击发射 弩箭 。攻击前，必须先将一支弩箭装入弩中。技能等级为0时，装填需要3.5秒并消耗3点耐力；但加上发射、装填和准备动作，实际每6秒才能发射一次。跳跃和冲刺会重置装填进度，冲刺时也无法装填弩箭。装填完成后，可随时发射，且不消耗耐力。发射后需要重新装填一支弩箭。切换到其他武器时，弩箭不会保持装填状态，因此每次装备该物品时都需要装填。 弩箭飞行速度明显快于箭矢，沿直线飞行而非抛物线（不会因重力而下坠）。","en":"Frostfire Crossbow is a version of Nord Crossbow upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of Pierce damage in exchange of larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. An upgraded Nord Crossbow will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences. Its primary attack fires bolts . To attack, a bolt is first loaded into the crossbow. Loading takes 3.5 seconds and uses 3 stamina at level 0, h…","titleZh":"冰火十字弓","titleEn":"Frostfire Crossbow"},"p-551f15b06d0562ba68a8.html":{"zh":"平原牦牛皮 由 北境平原 中的 平原牦牛 掉落。","en":"Lox pelt drops from Lox , which can be found in the Plains .","titleZh":"平原牦牛皮","titleEn":"Lox Pelt"},"p-555709e943a81c92f352.html":{"zh":"材料堆 和 料堆 是由大量单一材料堆成的设施，用于储存材料或装饰家园。 与其他建筑一样，可用 工具锤 摧毁或拆除，返还全部材料。","en":"Stacks and Piles are structure made from a single materials in large quantity. They are used to store the materials, or simply decorate around a homestead. Like other structures, they can be destroyed or deconstructed with a Hammer to return all the materials.","titleZh":"堆叠与料堆","titleEn":"Stacks and Piles"},"p-5575ec78f741b82b269a.html":{"zh":"被黏住了 是 蛊虫之后的 喷吐施加的 状态效果 ，非常类似 被沥青黏住了 。","en":"Slimed is a status effect applied to a character by The Queen's spit attack. It is very similar to the Tarred effect.","titleZh":"被黏住了","titleEn":"Slimed"},"p-55898449eb74fb2e348d.html":{"zh":"生命值 决定可破坏物、 生物 、矿床、玩家、 建筑 和 树木 在死亡或被摧毁前能承受多少伤害。 生命值降至0会导致 死亡 。玩家会留下装有背包物品的墓碑，生物则会化为掉落物。","en":"Health determines how much damage destructibles, creatures , ore deposits, players, structures and trees can take before getting killed or destroyed. Reaching 0 health results in death . Players leave behind a tombstone with their inventory contents whereas creatures burst into loot.","titleZh":"生命值","titleEn":"Health"},"p-559265879963c6ce6fb7.html":{"zh":"巨木大门 是用 巨木 和 血金 建造的 极北之地 大门。","en":"Timberwood Gate is a Deep North gate built from Timberwood and Bloodgold .","titleZh":"巨木大门","titleEn":"Timberwood Gate"},"p-55dbdbafa072275bf0d2.html":{"zh":"邪煞之树 是在 泥泞沼泽 出现的敌对 生物 。它们是由多根树枝组成的巨大树状生物，用四根粗壮树根作腿移动。 由于怕火，使用 燃烧的箭 击杀它是可行的。 劈砍伤害 ，例如斧、剑和刀，也能快速将其击倒。使用 条纹铁盾 或更好的装备可招架其攻击，击败它会比想象中容易。","en":"Abominations are aggressive creatures found in the Swamps . They are large tree-like entities comprised of multiple branches and four sturdy roots, which it uses as legs to move around. Due to its weakness to fire damage, killing it with Fire Arrows is a valid option. Slashing damage (Axes, Swords, Knives) takes it down quite rapidly. With a Banded Shield or better, its attacks can be parried, and the creature defea…","titleZh":"邪煞之树","titleEn":"Abomination"},"p-560b1e430bbab9dc3807.html":{"zh":"石斑鱼 是 北境平原 近岸水域中的被动 生物 （ 鱼 ）。 可用钓竿配 针刺鱼饵 捕获，鱼饵在 灶台 以20份 鱼饵 和一个 丑地精战利品 制作。 用于制作 钓鱼帽","en":"Grouper are passive creatures ( fish ) found in the waters just offshore of the Plains biome. They can be caught with a fishing pole using Stingy fishing bait which can be crafted at the Food Preparation Table by combining 20 Fishing Bait and a Fuling Trophy . Needed to craft a Fishing Hat","titleZh":"石斑鱼","titleEn":"Grouper"},"p-5619f6d3c49c8c2717f0.html":{"zh":"北境丝线 是 巨人巫师 掉落的 极北之地 制作材料。 用于制作北方深境多数 魔法 相关物品。","en":"Nornathread is a Deep North crafting material dropped from Hexen . It is used to craft most Magic related items in Deep North.","titleZh":"北境丝线","titleEn":"Nornathread"},"p-562da4de7543d45f4d71.html":{"zh":"肉丸和洋芋儿 是一种 极北之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Meatballs and Poteitr is a Deep North -tier food .","titleZh":"肉丸和洋芋儿","titleEn":"Meatballs and Poteitr"},"p-5672be23b46f4be1c7ea.html":{"zh":"眼激凌 是一种 凛冽雪山 级别的 食物 。","en":"Eyescream is a Mountain -tier food .","titleZh":"眼激凌","titleEn":"Eyescream"},"p-5690f06c3e931ecfe35d.html":{"zh":"潮湿 是淋雨或浸水施加的 状态效果 。 持续120秒，淋雨或水过腰时不倒计时，再接触水重置120秒，降低生命耐力源质恢复。 幽暗沼泽 永久下雨，屋顶之外持续施加。","en":"Wet is a status effect applied when the player is caught out in the rain or immersed in water. The effect lasts for a duration of 120 seconds. The duration will not decrease while the player is exposed to rain or above the waist in water. The duration resets back to 120 seconds upon being exposed to water again. The effect provides a debuff to health, stamina and eitr regeneration.","titleZh":"潮湿","titleEn":"Wet"},"p-569c64a6c990dd0d296b.html":{"zh":"红色披肩上衣 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付450 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的白银宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Cape tunic red is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 450 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's silver chest .","titleZh":"红色披肩上衣","titleEn":"Cape tunic red"},"p-56a7d40e60030e0c3e48.html":{"zh":"斧 是一类 武器 。 它们是唯一可以砍伐树木的玩家武器类型。也可以用于攻击生物，相当于效果略逊的 剑 。 战斧的攻击距离足以穿过某些墙壁，让玩家攻击屏障另一侧的敌人。甚至可以隔着 腐疫地堡 内前厅的墙壁击中 蛊虫之后 ，这种取巧获胜方式比使用 歼灭者 还高效。","en":"Axes are a weapon class. They are the only type of player weapon that can be used to cut trees. They can also be used against creatures, which makes for a slightly worse sword . Battleaxes have enough reach to attack through some walls, enabling the player to hit enemies on the other side of barriers. They can even hit The Queen through the wall in the vestibule inside the Infested Citadel , making for a more effici…","titleZh":"斧","titleEn":"Axes"},"p-5711923b3c8ba46756ec.html":{"zh":"石头堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 石头 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。 用石堆储存多余石头，通常比箱子占空间。但只要方向一致，并放在 石地板 等平坦表面上，就可以将石堆紧密重叠在同一区域，形成非常节省空间的“超密集”石堆。","en":"Stone Pile is a buildable structure that is used to store Stone or simply decorate a homestead. Storing extra stones using stone piles is generally less space-efficient than using chests. However, it is possible to tightly pack stone piles in the same area, provided that the stone piles all have the same orientation, and are placed on a flat surface like a stone floor . This results in a \"hyper dense\" stone pile whi…","titleZh":"石头堆","titleEn":"Stone Pile"},"p-573be09b0663b44661af.html":{"zh":"锻造风箱 用于升级 熔炉 。它是两种不需要金属锭的熔炉升级设施之一，因此可以通过 传送门 运输，另一种是 砂轮 。与其他可随意放在范围内的升级设施不同，它必须连接熔炉才能有效放置。","en":"The forge bellows is used as an upgrade for the forge . It is one of the two upgrades to the forge that does not use metal ingots, and can thus be taken through a portal . (The other is the Grinding Wheel .) Also, unlike the other upgrades which can be placed anywhere and provides buffs within range, this upgrade building's placement is only valid connected to the forge.","titleZh":"锻造风箱","titleEn":"Forge Bellows"},"p-57782b83b0372f4dbadc.html":{"zh":"焰金属防护神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Flametal Protection Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"焰金属防护神像","titleEn":"Flametal Protection Idol"},"p-577cfab98de598e55bee.html":{"zh":"全局标记用于记录游戏世界进度。 首领标记决定哪些 事件 和 生成 处于启用状态。 倍率数值是默认速率的百分比：100为正常，50为一半，200为两倍。开关标记存在即启用；部分标记也接受数值，由代码检查。 （据英灵神殿0.217.29版，网络版本17，2023年十一月12日；编写中，以下部分标记仍待定义及澄清。） 可用以下 控制台命令 修改全局标记：","en":"Global keys are used to track progress in game worlds. Boss keys determine which events and spawns are active. Scalar values are percentages of the default rate: 100 is normal, 50 is half, and 200 is double. Toggle keys are enabled by being present; some keys also accept a numeric value where the code checks one. (( Taken from version Valheim 0.217.29 (network version 17), 12th November 2023; WIP Some keys listed be…","titleZh":"世界进度标记","titleEn":"Global Keys"},"p-57c8eea4069359cfdf37.html":{"zh":"封印破除者 是一件物品，由九块 封印破除者碎片 在 古咒法台 制作，用于开启 蛊虫之后 入口。使用时不消耗。","en":"Sealbreaker is an item, constructed on the Galdr Table from nine Sealbreaker Fragments . It is a key to the entrance of The Queen . It is not consumed on use.","titleZh":"封印破除者","titleEn":"Sealbreaker"},"p-57d879479389e5a887cc.html":{"zh":"黑曜石堆 是可建造设施，用于储存 黑曜石 或单纯装饰基地。","en":"Obsidian Pile is a buildable structure used to store Obsidian , or simply decorating a base.","titleZh":"黑曜石堆","titleEn":"Obsidian Pile"},"p-581cf45365ba83708784.html":{"zh":"铁塔盾 是第三种塔 盾 。 其格挡能力高于 条纹铁盾 ，但会使玩家的 移动速度 降低10%，并使 闪避 翻滚消耗增加10%。 作为塔盾，它不能用于 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Iron Tower Shield is the third tower shield . It has more block power compared to Banded Shield , but it reduces the player's movement speed by 10% and increases dodge roll cost by 10%. As a tower shield, it cannot be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"铁塔盾","titleEn":"Iron Tower Shield"},"p-581d7e65d47c66d253b8.html":{"zh":"带罩灯笼 既有可放置设施版本，也有手持物品版本。","en":"The Hooded Lantern exists both as a placeable structure and as a handheld item.","titleZh":"带罩灯笼","titleEn":"Hooded Lantern"},"p-5840cbec94f2b81bef56.html":{"zh":"矮人灯柱 是不需要燃料的光源，放在附近可提高1点 舒适度 。","en":"The Dvergr lantern pole is a light source and does not require any fuel. It increases Comfort by 1 when placed nearby.","titleZh":"矮人灯柱","titleEn":"Dvergr Pole Lantern"},"p-58540cb3738fdee12a1e.html":{"zh":"霜龙淋巴 是 霜龙 死亡掉落的物品。","en":"Freeze gland is an item which is dropped by Drakes upon death.","titleZh":"霜龙淋巴","titleEn":"Freeze Gland"},"p-58565db394dcbacc0ec7.html":{"zh":"本页按击败首领及可用资源介绍新玩家推进流程。不清楚如何游玩，参阅 入门玩法 指南。 提示：无需急着通关，慢慢探索享受冒险可能更有收获。许多玩家在两位首领之间花40至50小时战斗、探索，再继续推进。享受旅程！","en":"This page sets out a new player's progression, as determined by bosses killed and resources available. Check the How to play guide if you are confused as how to play. Tip: There is no need to rush through the game. Taking time to explore and enjoy the adventure can be more rewarding. Many players spend 40 to 50 hours between bosses, fighting and exploring biomes before progressing. Savor the journey!","titleZh":"流程攻略","titleEn":"Progression guide"},"p-587cfbbbcd42a71ba7f3.html":{"zh":"爪击 可能指：","en":"Claw may refer to:","titleZh":"爪击","titleEn":"Claw"},"p-5885f178c203bba9818d.html":{"zh":"狼肉 是一种通过击杀 巨狼 获得的基础食物。 生肉可用于制作均衡型食物 狼肉干 或生命值食物 狼肉串 。放在 烹饪台 或 铁烹饪台 上可烤成 熟狼肉 ；若任其烧焦，则会变成 木炭 。","en":"Wolf Meat is a basic food source obtained by killing Wolves . When uncooked, it may be used to make the balanced dish Wolf Jerky , or the health dish Wolf Skewer . When placed on a Cooking Station or Iron Cooking Station , it can be turned into Cooked Wolf Meat , or Coal if left to burn.","titleZh":"狼肉","titleEn":"Wolf Meat"},"p-5919dcd44e227bc472bf.html":{"zh":"剑 是一类 武器 。 剑的击退较低、耐力消耗较少，却能造成可观伤害。与大多数其他武器不同，剑在一次攻击命中多个敌人或物体时，伤害不会降低。","en":"Swords are a weapon class. Swords have low knockback and low stamina cost for good damage. Sword damage is not reduced when several enemies or objects are hit by a single attack, unlike most other weapons.","titleZh":"剑","titleEn":"Swords"},"p-593a88b963a3d3b392c7.html":{"zh":"野兔 是 迷雾之地 中的被动 生物 。迷雾野兔与现实野兔相似，但有珍贵的鳞皮。","en":"Hares are passive creatures found in the Mistlands . Mistlands Hares appear much like real life Hares, except for their valuable scaly hide.","titleZh":"野兔","titleEn":"Hare"},"p-5940fbd7b60e2df1851a.html":{"zh":"目前有四种航海船只： 木筏 、 维京船 、 维京长船 和 灰烬长船 。每种通常都比上一种更快，并具有更高耐久、储物空间和乘客座位。唯一例外是龙船，它比长船慢。","en":"There are currently four seafaring vessels: the Raft , the Karve , the Longship and the Drakkar . Each vessel is significantly faster than its previous version with increased durability, storage space, and player seating. The only exception is the Drakkar, which is slower than the Longship.","titleZh":"船只","titleEn":"Boats"},"p-5954d0c13f55417f74fb.html":{"zh":"生物 和玩家在步行、奔跑、游泳或飞行时具有不同的移动速度。 击退 会造成10米/秒的快速位移，覆盖击退方向上已有的移动。 冰霜效果 最多使移动速度降低90%，该效果逐渐消退，平均降速65%。","en":"Creatures and players have a different movement speeds depending on whether they are walking, running, swimming, or flying. Knockback causes rapid movement of 10 m/s, overwriting any existing movement on the knockback direction. Frost Effect slows movement speed by up to 90%, which gradually wears off (on average 65% reduction).","titleZh":"移动速度","titleEn":"Movement speed"},"p-595b73c69495a3442025.html":{"zh":"蕨菜花 是一种可生吃的均衡型 灰烬之地 食物，可用于多种配方。","en":"Fiddlehead is a raw balanced Ashlands food which is used in various recipes.","titleZh":"蕨菜花","titleEn":"Fiddlehead"},"p-597681510516fa91b735.html":{"zh":"所有 旗帜 都使用 细木 、 皮革碎片 以及一种或多种用于着色的其他材料制作。","en":"All banners are made from Finewood , Leather Scraps , and one or more other materials for the color.","titleZh":"旗帜","titleEn":"Banners"},"p-59ca9b71a893dcb072a7.html":{"zh":"闪避 是一种 技能 。","en":"Dodge is a skill .","titleZh":"闪避(技能)","titleEn":"Dodge (skill)"},"p-59d4cc5f6fa0a833f0f1.html":{"zh":"蜂房 是用于生产 蜂蜜 的 基础 设施。 建造蜂房所需的 蜂后 ，可通过摧毁 蜂巢 获得。","en":"Beehives are base structures used for producing Honey . The Queen Bee requires to craft a Beehives can be found by destroying Bee Nests .","titleZh":"蜂房","titleEn":"Beehive"},"p-5a5971d35e2fd9f092df.html":{"zh":"小蓝莓 是在 青青草原 找到的 角色 ，是一只驯养 平原牦牛 ，在商人营地陪伴 希尔德 。","en":"Blåbär is a character found in Meadows . It is a tamed Lox that accompanies Hildir at her trading camp.","titleZh":"小蓝莓","titleEn":"Blåbär"},"p-5a78a27ab62e843ac33d.html":{"zh":"根须之盾 是一种 泥泞沼泽 级别的 盾 。 根须之盾是游戏中唯一没有移动速度惩罚的盾，还使攻击的 耐力 消耗降低-10%。","en":"Shield of Roots is a Swamp tier Shield . The Shield of Roots is the only shield in the game that does not have any movement speed penalty. It also gives -10% attack Stamina usage.","titleZh":"根须之盾","titleEn":"Shield of Roots"},"p-5a9def304a0a9dfb5bfe.html":{"zh":"细木 是砍伐 青青草原 或 北境平原 中的 桦树 、 橡树 树获得的制作资源。平原桦树丰富，但敌人与危险使其通常到后期才适合采细木。青青草原森林也散布桦树及橡树。采伐应保留种子，以后可种植补充木材，橡树的 橡果 尤其稀有。 桦树和橡树至少需 青铜斧 砍伐，通常意味着先击败 赤血灵鹿 ，制作 鹿角镐 ，才能开采青铜斧所需矿石。 细木也可在 黑暗林山 沿岸 沉船 获取，或从废弃 废墟塔楼 家具回收。仅需 石斧 就能拆除细木物体，沉船尤其产量可观。也可推倒或滚动附近树木、原木，撞倒桦树或橡树，再反复将原木互撞或撞树造成伤害，岩石无效。这可提前收集细木。类似地，可引 巨魔 或其他大型生物毁树，虽慢但可行。","en":"Finewood is a crafting resource obtained by chopping down Birch and Oak trees in the Meadows or Plains biomes. The Plains feature plentiful Birch trees, though the dangerous enemies and hazards within tend to make farming Finewood there infeasible until later in the game. Both Birch and Oak trees can be found scattered through forested parts of the Meadows biome. When harvesting them, the player should be careful to…","titleZh":"细木","titleEn":"Finewood"},"p-5ab16ac6fe68d84b678f.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 奥丁披风 奥丁兜帽 奥丁蜜酒角杯 奥丁套装","en":"Pages in category Cape of Oden Hood of Oden Mead Horn of Odin Odin Set","titleZh":"分类：追加内容","titleEn":"Category:DLC"},"p-5ac03ba6efdc56d5b7b5.html":{"zh":"本文详述 生物行为 ，即决定 生物 寻找目标、移动、攻击及逃跑的逻辑。敌对生物用怪物人工智能， 鹿 及 野兔 等被动动物用较简单的动物人工智能。","en":"This page details the creature AI , the logic that decides how creatures find targets, move, attack and flee. Hostile creatures use the monster AI, while passive animals such as Deer and Hares use a simpler animal AI.","titleZh":"生物行为","titleEn":"Creature AI"},"p-5ac76ece7ac21dd54b02.html":{"zh":"休息好了 是一种 状态效果 ，在获得 休息中 效果 20 秒后生效。它提供 +50% 生命值 恢复、+50% 耐力 恢复、+50% 埃达之能 恢复和 +50% 经验值 获取量。 效果持续时间取决于玩家周围环境的 舒适度 等级。休息好了的基础持续时间为 7 分钟，每级舒适度额外增加一分钟。 玩家角色退出游戏时，此效果会被移除，不会保留到下一次游戏。","en":"Rested is a status effect applied after having the Resting effect for 20 seconds. It provides +50% Health regeneration, +50% Stamina regeneration, +50% Eitr regeneration and +50% Experience gain. The duration of the effect depends on the Comfort level from the player's surroundings. The base duration for the Rested effect is 7 minutes plus one additional minute per comfort level.","titleZh":"休息好了","titleEn":"Rested"},"p-5b27038949187a2f334b.html":{"zh":"无形黏团 是 极北之地 中 魔阁哈拉 内的敌对生物。玩家在20米内时， 六面浆块 每六秒生成一个，它们自身会变为 超小浆块 。","en":"Shapeless Pulp is a hostile creature found in Mörkhalla in the Deep North . They are spawned by Hexahedric Pulp every six seconds while a player is within 20 meters, and themselves turn into Tiny Pulp .","titleZh":"无形黏团","titleEn":"Shapeless Pulp"},"p-5b44a252436c3bd614e3.html":{"zh":"树汁提取器 用于从 迷雾之地 生物群系 的 远古树根 采集 树汁 。","en":"The Sap Extractor is a structure used to harvest Sap from Ancient Roots in the Mistlands biome .","titleZh":"树汁提取器","titleEn":"Sap Extractor"},"p-5b85dd09166fd038e337.html":{"zh":"巨人战士 是 魔阁哈拉 及 巨人入侵 期间出现的敌对 生物 。共有三种变体，分别使用双手剑、双斧或双手巨斧。","en":"Krigen are aggressive creatures found in Mörkhalla and during Jotun Invasions . They have three variants, wielding either a two-handed sword, two axes, or a two-handed greataxe.","titleZh":"巨人战士","titleEn":"Krigen"},"p-5be1159ff2e2a21a5051.html":{"zh":"香肠 是 泥泞沼泽 阶段的 食物 。","en":"Sausages are a Swamp -tier food .","titleZh":"香肠","titleEn":"Sausages"},"p-5be413549027a39f015f.html":{"zh":"地精废墟 是 北境平原 中的 地点 ，是中央有石楼梯的小型石制废墟。","en":"Fuling Ruins are Points of interest found in the Plains . They are small ruined stone buildings with a central stone staircase.","titleZh":"地精废墟","titleEn":"Fuling Ruin"},"p-5c5e425276ee6fca4e0e.html":{"zh":"这是 耶鲁节礼物 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 季节性家具 。","en":"This is a category for Yuleklapp which are a type of seasonal furniture .","titleZh":"分类：耶鲁节礼物","titleEn":"Category:Yuleklapp"},"p-5c75e6ba33d31ae0dfbe.html":{"zh":"矛 是一类 武器 。 矛攻击速度快，攻击范围短，耐力消耗低。 次要攻击会掷出矛，玩家可以将其拾回。","en":"Spears is a weapon class. Spears have a fast attack with short range and low stamina cost. The secondary attack throws the spear, which can be retrieved by the player.","titleZh":"矛","titleEn":"Spears"},"p-5c7fa08d109160d222b0.html":{"zh":"世界边缘 是地图上 英灵神殿 世界的边缘。","en":"World Edge is the edge of the world of Valheim as seen on the map.","titleZh":"世界边缘","titleEn":"World Edge"},"p-5c99392e1fa9de4ac061.html":{"zh":"巨人之戮 是第六种单手 斧 ，可用于砍伐 山毛榉 、 桦树 、 橡树 、 冷杉 、 松树 、 古老的 、 世界树 和 烧焦的 树木。 巨人之戮可以驱散9米半径内 迷雾之地 的 雾 。","en":"Jotun Bane is the sixth one-handed axe . It can be used to chop down Beech , Birch , Oak , Fir , Pine , Ancient , Yggdrasil and Scorched trees. The Jotun Bane is capable of dispelling the Mist of Mistlands in a 9-meter radius.","titleZh":"巨人之戮","titleEn":"Jotun Bane"},"p-5ca34aad858e8834fded.html":{"zh":"凌冽·芬布尔使者 是第八位，也是最后一位 首领 。","en":"Kall Fimbulbringer is the eighth and final boss .","titleZh":"凌冽·芬布尔使者","titleEn":"Kall Fimbulbringer"},"p-5d1b493260cc626aca86.html":{"zh":"冰霜 是降低移动和转向速度的负面 状态效果 。速度惩罚在效果持续期间按指数衰减。 初始减速100%，逐渐趋向0%。刷新效果会重置为100%。 持续时间取决于损失生命值。玩家基础持续15秒，生物50秒： d u r a T i o n = b a s e d u r a T i o n ⋅ d a m a g e m a x h e a L T h 例如，最大生命150、护甲50时，受到200冰霜伤害，会损失50生命并获得5秒 冰霜效果 。 5 s = 15 s ⋅ 50 150","en":"Frost is a negative status effect that applies a movement and turn speed penalty on the affected entity. This speed penalty decays exponentially over the duration of the status effect. Movement speed reduction starts at 100% and gradually decays towards 0%. Refreshing the effect resets the reduction back to 100%. The debuff duration depends on the amount of health lost; The base duration is 15 seconds for players an…","titleZh":"冰霜(效果)","titleEn":"Frost (effect)"},"p-5d22cb3356d717620a73.html":{"zh":"迷雾法弹 是仅由 矮人法师 生成的追踪光球，接触敌人造成 钝击 伤害。玩家可用远程或近战攻击，命中后无害消散。","en":"Mistiles are homing balls of light spawned exclusively by Dvergr Mages . They deal blunt damage upon contact with the enemy. They can be targeted by the player's ranged and melee weapons, and disperse harmlessly if hit.","titleZh":"迷雾法弹","titleEn":"Mistile"},"p-5d492b9ada0630a7eb56.html":{"zh":"长柄武器 是与 长柄武器 武器类别相关的 技能 。","en":"Polearms is a skill related to Polearms weapon class.","titleZh":"长柄武器（技能）","titleEn":"Polearms (skill)"},"p-5d8023cc8c2a27f03c93.html":{"zh":"此为 金属 的 分类 ，属于用于 制作 的 材料 。","en":"This is a category for metals which are a type of materials used for crafting .","titleZh":"分类：金属","titleEn":"Category:Metals"},"p-5dda4e4546c6601983ac.html":{"zh":"灰石堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 灰石 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Grausten Pile is a buildable structure that is used to store Grausten or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"灰石堆","titleEn":"Grausten Pile"},"p-5e013ab4eb8fcc447818.html":{"zh":"棍棒 是与 棍棒 武器类别相关的 技能 。","en":"Clubs is a skill related to Club weapons class.","titleZh":"棍棒（技能）","titleEn":"Clubs (skill)"},"p-5e35185a08fb4df3e0c2.html":{"zh":"两种设施被称为尖桩：","en":"Two types of structures are called stakes:","titleZh":"尖桩","titleEn":"Stakes"},"p-5e9d864ffd15264fd0a4.html":{"zh":"轻盈蜜酒 是一种 迷雾之地 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：轻盈 发酵 而成。","en":"Lightfoot mead is a Mistlands -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Lightfoot .","titleZh":"轻盈蜜酒","titleEn":"Lightfoot Mead"},"p-5eda385e3028a40f4d93.html":{"zh":"耶鲁花环 是 季节性 装饰物，须在 工作台 范围内建在平坦水平表面上，或表面下方。","en":"Yule Wreath is a seasonal decorative object. It needs to be built within the range of a Workbench and on a flat, horizontal surface or underside of a surface.","titleZh":"耶鲁花环","titleEn":"Yule Wreath"},"p-5efec94c2f47d66bf020.html":{"zh":"废弃小屋 是在 凛冽雪山 生态区发现的 地点 ，是主要由 原木结构 建成的破败建筑。","en":"Abandoned Cabins are Points of interest found in the Mountain biome. They are dilapidated buildings made mostly of Log Structures .","titleZh":"废弃小屋","titleEn":"Abandoned Cabin"},"p-5f6a8f6ed50a878de648.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 灰烬披风 灰烬刚鬣披风 奥丁披风 召唤者披风 测试披风 鹿皮斗篷 埃达织物套装 轻羽斗篷 皮甲 亚麻披风 平原牦牛披风 牦牛皮套装 驼鹿皮披风 厚垫护甲 巨魔皮斗篷 巨魔套装 狼皮护甲 狼毛披风","en":"Pages in category Ashen Cape Asksvin Cloak Cape of Oden Cape of the Caller CAPE TEST Deer Hide Cape Eitr-weave Set Feather Cape Leather Armor Linen Cape Lox Cape Lox Fur Set Moose Hide Cape Padded Armor Troll Hide Cape Troll Set Wolf Armor Wolf Fur Cape","titleZh":"分类：披风","titleEn":"Category:Capes"},"p-5f6ddf7932adbe8cad5c.html":{"zh":"青铜钉 在 熔炉 用一份 青铜 锭制作，每份得到20x钉子。 与 铜矿 、 锡矿 或制作青铜的冶炼金属不同，钉子可通过 传送门 。","en":"Bronze nails are crafted at a Forge with a single Bronze ingot which yields 20x nails each. Unlike Copper Ore , Tin Ore , or the smelted metals which are used for Bronze, the nails can be brought through a Portal .","titleZh":"青铜钉","titleEn":"Bronze Nails"},"p-5fa2a14095a0dcd8b785.html":{"zh":"血金战斗神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Bloodgold Battle Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"血金战斗神像","titleEn":"Bloodgold Battle Idol"},"p-5fa397acc774b4311598.html":{"zh":"树脂蜡烛 是装饰光源，可燃烧4h 10m，不能补充燃料。 建造需要 工作台 及 沼泽女巫 的材料。","en":"Resin candle is a decorative light source. It lasts 4h 10m and cannot be refueled. It requires a Workbench and materials from The Bog Witch to be built.","titleZh":"树脂蜡烛","titleEn":"Resin Candle"},"p-5fcb3ab81da2a8dd3adf.html":{"zh":"木制火炬 是一种光源。 最多装四份树脂。装入1/4容量的燃料可燃烧2小时46分钟，装满可燃烧11小时06分钟。","en":"The Standing Wood Torch is a light source. It can hold up to four Resin at once. With 1/4 fuel, a standing wood torch will last for 2 hours and 46 minutes. At maximum capacity, a standing wood torch should burn for 11 hours and 06 minutes.","titleZh":"木制火炬","titleEn":"Standing Wood Torch"},"p-5ff7bb095fdf00e8c280.html":{"zh":"弩 是与 弩 武器类别相关的 技能 。","en":"Crossbows is a skill related to Crossbows weapon class.","titleZh":"弩（技能）","titleEn":"Crossbows (skill)"},"p-6015c626285afc891d22.html":{"zh":"扭曲根须 是从罕见 扭曲者 获取的 幽暗沼泽 阶段材料。","en":"Writhan Roots is a Swamp -tier material obtained from the rare Writhan .","titleZh":"扭曲根须","titleEn":"Writhan Roots"},"p-6024244b9b6c775a5607.html":{"zh":"建造和修复 焰金属结构 需要 焰金属 ，且附近必须有 黑熔炉 。 它们目前是唯一可以直接建在 灰烬之地 生物群系的 熔岩 中的构件。虽然使用更坚固的金属，但立柱和横梁提供的支撑与 铁木结构 相同，耐久度却只有一半。","en":"Flametal structures require Flametal and the proximity of a Black Forge to be built and repaired. They are currently the only structures that can be built directly in the lava in the Ashlands biome. Despite being made of a stronger metal, the pole and beam provide as much support as Wood Iron Structures , while having half the durability.","titleZh":"焰金属结构","titleEn":"Flametal Structures"},"p-60338a8caa8f2ce878f3.html":{"zh":"青铜坠饰 是 黑暗林山 阶段的 饰物 ，也是游戏中最早可获得的此类物品之一。","en":"Bronze Pendant is a Black Forest -tier trinket , and one of the first available in the game.","titleZh":"青铜坠饰","titleEn":"Bronze Pendant"},"p-60958b009a9e0b5dd0b6.html":{"zh":"每个 区域 都有取决于其生态区的生物生成器。生成器是否激活取决于昼夜、天气和 世界进度 。 玩家基地 会阻止生成。","en":"Each zone has its own spawners that depend on its biome. Spawners are active depending on the time of day, weather and world progression . Spawns are prevented with player bases .","titleZh":"生成区域","titleEn":"Spawn zones"},"p-60a4e61f87d8c52a3c15.html":{"zh":"黑暗林山 生态区域 是危险的针叶林，植被浓密繁茂。地面铺满蕨类、倒木、树桩、 浆果灌木 和 蓟草 ，上方覆盖 松树 与 冷杉 的树冠。起伏丘陵和宽阔谷地间散布巨大裸岩及沉睡的 铜矿源 。海岸有许多小湾、入海口甚至湿地，岸边闪亮的 锡矿源 等待采集。这是唯一可开采 铜 和 锡 矿的生物群系；玩家击败 赤血灵鹿 并获得 鹿角镐 后即可开采。 大量 灰矮人 在林海中游荡，偶尔还有 巨魔 和成群的 骷髅怪 。这里也有游戏最早的独立地牢 诡秘墓穴 ，是玩家最初获取 焰灵之核 的地方，可用于建造 冶炼场 并开启冶金。通常玩家会在 青青草原 之后，将黑森林作为第二个探索的生物群系。","en":"Black Forest biomes are dangerous, coniferous forests full of dense and lush vegetation. A low blanket of ferns, felled logs, stumps, berry bushes , and Thistle plants is towered over by a canopy of Pine and Fir trees. Rolling hills and spacious dales are broken up by huge exposed boulders and slumbering Copper Deposits . The coastline features many coves, inlets, and even marshlands. The shore is lined with glisten…","titleZh":"黑暗林山","titleEn":"Black Forest"},"p-60e4daffb5de9c2270ec.html":{"zh":"愿望骨 是一件饰品，击杀 泥泞沼泽 中的首领 邪骨恶灵 后获得。","en":"The Wishbone is an accessory gained by killing the boss Bonemass in the Swamps .","titleZh":"愿望骨","titleEn":"Wishbone"},"p-6101c09641b9c08fb631.html":{"zh":"埃达之力提炼器 用于将 树汁 和 软组织 加工成 埃达精华 。","en":"The Eitr Refinery is a structure used for processing Sap and Soft Tissue into Refined Eitr .","titleZh":"埃达之力提炼器","titleEn":"Eitr Refinery"},"p-6169218d77192c74e562.html":{"zh":"黑金属斧 是第五种单手 斧 ，可用于砍伐 山毛榉 、 桦树 、 橡树 、 冷杉 、 松树 、 古老的 、 世界树 和 灰烬之树 。","en":"Black Metal Axe is the fifth one-handed axe . It can be used to chop down Beech , Birch , Oak , Fir , Pine , Ancient , Yggdrasil and Scorched Trees .","titleZh":"黑金属斧","titleEn":"Black Metal Axe"},"p-61bf3cf0d02b54e3f0eb.html":{"zh":"炭窑 可能指：","en":"Kiln may refer to:","titleZh":"炭窑","titleEn":"Kiln"},"p-61c103b240328031ad76.html":{"zh":"海豹毛皮 是从 海豹 获取的制作材料。","en":"Seal Pelt is a crafting material obtained from Seals .","titleZh":"海豹毛皮","titleEn":"Seal Pelt"},"p-61e7ef0f8303187e7886.html":{"zh":"灰矮人巢穴 是 黑暗林山 中的 生物生成点 。 巢穴可生成任意灰矮人： 生成的敌人有15%概率为1星，2.25%概率为2星。 玩家进入60米内时巢穴激活，每12秒尝试在四米内生成生物，直到20米内已有三只灰矮人。","en":"The Greydwarf Nest is a creature spawner found in Black Forest . The nest can spawn any Greydwarf: Spawned enemies have a 15% chance to be 1-star and a 2.25% chance to be 2-star. The nest activates when there is a player within 60 meters. The nest attempts to spawn within four meters every 12 seconds until there are three Greydwarfs within 20 meters.","titleZh":"灰矮人巢穴","titleEn":"Greydwarf Nest"},"p-6231271f1c6cafb4eadf.html":{"zh":"矮人灯笼 是一种单手实用工具。装备后可用作光源（类似 火把 ），但没有耐久度。","en":"The Dvergr Lantern is a one-handed utility tool. It acts as a light source when equipped (similarly to a torch ), only that it has no durability.","titleZh":"矮人灯笼","titleEn":"Dvergr Lantern"},"p-62aaca8dfae62082ea3a.html":{"zh":"光 来源 可能指：","en":"Light source may refer to:","titleZh":"光 来源","titleEn":"Light source"},"p-62c7d31b1bc6239b57ad.html":{"zh":"这是 镐 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 工具 。","en":"This is a category for pickaxes which are a type of tools .","titleZh":"分类：镐","titleEn":"Category:Pickaxes"},"p-62e37a6a46a2399d13e8.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣胸腔 是破坏自然生成的 灰烬刚鬣腐尸 获得的资源，主要位于 腐朽之穴 入口或 秃鹫巢穴 附近。 破坏骸骨可能掉落灰烬刚鬣胸骨，或其他三种骸骨部件之一。","en":"Asksvin Ribcage is a resource gathered by breaking naturally spawned Asksvin Carrion , found mainly near Putrid Hole entrances or Volture Nests . Destroying the Skeletons can drop the Asksvin Ribcage or any of the other three Asksvin Skeleton pieces.","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣胸腔","titleEn":"Asksvin Ribcage"},"p-62fd80d58c3ac0504fb2.html":{"zh":"胡萝卜汤 是一种 黑暗林山 级别的 食物 。","en":"Carrot soup is a Black Forest -tier food .","titleZh":"胡萝卜汤","titleEn":"Carrot Soup"},"p-6377a611414395082b00.html":{"zh":"锡 是将 锡矿 放入 冶炼炉 冶炼得到的制作材料。 与 铜矿 一样， 锡矿 只出现在 黑暗林山 生物群系 。它是水边地面上的小型闪亮矿石，包括海岸、河岸及内陆小湖旁。 至少需要 鹿角镐 才能开采，每块产出2-4份锡矿。 一份锡与两份 铜 可在 熔炉 处制成一份 青铜 。材料足够时，也可用另一配方一次制作5份青铜，需要10份铜和5份锡。","en":"Tin is a crafting material smelted from Tin Ore in a Smelter . Just like Copper Ore , Tin Ore can only be found in the Black Forest biome . It takes the form of small shiny rock-like deposits on the ground near water (ocean & river shorelines, or small inland lakes). An Antler Pickaxe or better is required to mine the rocks, which yield 2-4 Tin ore each.","titleZh":"锡","titleEn":"Tin"},"p-63a1828ce85cc73870cb.html":{"zh":"伐木 是与 斧 伐木伤害相关的 技能 。","en":"Wood cutting is a skill , related to the chop damage dealt by Axes .","titleZh":"伐木(技能)","titleEn":"Wood cutting (skill)"},"p-63af1f5974e26c125721.html":{"zh":"驼鹿 是 极北之地 中的敌对 生物 。可被 驯养生物 并 骑行 ，类似 平原牦牛 和 灰烬刚鬣 。","en":"Moose are aggressive creatures found in the Deep North . They can be tamed which allows them to be ridden , akin to Lox and Asksvin .","titleZh":"驼鹿","titleEn":"Moose"},"p-63d31e195d552c9f6809.html":{"zh":"黑金属盾 是第四种圆 盾 。 用于格挡时，其格挡能力低于 黑金属塔盾 ，但可以用来 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Black Metal Shield is the fourth round shield . It has lower block power compared to the Black Metal Tower Shield when used to block, but may be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"黑金属盾","titleEn":"Black Metal Shield"},"p-63fb6321e57204246d6b.html":{"zh":"乘骑 是一种 技能 。","en":"Riding is a skill .","titleZh":"乘骑(技能)","titleEn":"Riding (skill)"},"p-64008c593d461bdac030.html":{"zh":"木盾 是第一种圆 盾 。 与 木塔盾 相比，其格挡能力少4，格挡冲击力少80，但可以用于 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Wood Shield is the first round shield . It has 4 less block power and 80 less block force compared to the Wood Tower Shield , but can be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"木盾","titleEn":"Wood Shield"},"p-6474457bc3def5aec795.html":{"zh":"羽衣甘蓝脆片 是一种 极北之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Kale Chips is a Deep North -tier food .","titleZh":"羽衣甘蓝脆片","titleEn":"Kale Chips"},"p-6487772f9698effbd17e.html":{"zh":"冰火之弓 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境之弓 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 穿刺 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境之弓在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Frostfire Bow is a version of Nord Bow upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of Pierce damage in exchange of larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. An upgraded Nord Bow will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"冰火之弓","titleEn":"Frostfire Bow"},"p-64aee8c6cbd026d9ea92.html":{"zh":"玩家角色 是玩家创建并控制的 角色 。","en":"The player character is the character created and controlled by the player.","titleZh":"玩家","titleEn":"Player"},"p-64ce5020ea3cb24237b2.html":{"zh":"物品架 是装饰设施，可展示战利品及其他收集到的资源，有垂直和水平两种变体。","en":"Item stands are decorative structures that can be used to display trophies or other resources a player may have collected. They come in two variants, vertical and horizontal.","titleZh":"物品架","titleEn":"Item Stand"},"p-653ad1341602680a7b93.html":{"zh":"铁制防护神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Iron Protection Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"铁制防护神像","titleEn":"Iron Protection Idol"},"p-65b5580cf3b874623896.html":{"zh":"可用 耕地耙 种植 胡萝卜种子 ，长成1x 胡萝卜 。","en":"Carrot seeds can be planted using the Cultivator in order to grow 1x Carrot .","titleZh":"胡萝卜种子","titleEn":"Carrot Seeds"},"p-65fbbda83314bbefaffc.html":{"zh":"大麦面粉 是一件物品，可用 大麦 在 风车 制作。","en":"Barley Flour is an item and can be crafted using Barley in the Windmill .","titleZh":"大麦面粉","titleEn":"Barley Flour"},"p-66a625cd37f6c21cc8df.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 蓝色珠饰连衣裙 棕色珠饰连衣裙 黄色珠饰连衣裙 蓝色珠饰上衣 红色珠饰上衣 黄色珠饰上衣 蓝色披肩上衣 红色披肩上衣 黄色披肩上衣 丰收之裙 丰收上衣 蓝色披肩连衣裙 棕色披肩连衣裙 黄色披肩连衣裙 蓝色简朴连衣裙 棕色简朴连衣裙 本色简朴连衣裙 黄色简朴连衣裙 蓝色简朴上衣 本色简朴上衣 红色简朴上衣 黄色简朴上衣","en":"Pages in category Beaded dress blue Beaded dress brown Beaded dress yellow Beaded tunic blue Beaded tunic red Beaded tunic yellow Cape tunic blue Cape tunic red Cape tunic yellow Harvest Dress Harvest Tunic Shawl dress blue Shawl dress brown Shawl dress yellow Simple dress blue Simple dress brown Simple dress natural Simple dress yellow Simple tunic blue Simple tunic natural Simple tunic red Simple tunic yellow","titleZh":"分类：上身装备","titleEn":"Category:Body"},"p-66b06e996553a4e70d0f.html":{"zh":"焦油怪 是 北境平原 中、具体位于 焦油坑 的敌对 生物 。它们与 软泥怪 和 大型软泥怪 一样，是大型胶状、有意识的焦油团，散发有毒黑气。","en":"Growths are aggressive creatures found in Plains , specifically in Tar pits . They, like Blobs and Oozers , are large, gelatinous piles of sentient tar that emit poisonous black gasses.","titleZh":"焦油怪","titleEn":"Growth"},"p-66cb03cdfff414ca75f4.html":{"zh":"世界之树木 用于后期 建造 及 制作 配方，仅从 迷雾之地 生物群系获取。","en":"Yggdrasil Wood is a type of wood used in late game building and crafting recipes. It is obtained exclusively from the Mistlands biome.","titleZh":"世界之树木","titleEn":"Yggdrasil Wood"},"p-66cecccef75acdb32ad3.html":{"zh":"熏驼鹿肉 是一种 极北之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Smoked Moose Meat is a Deep North -tier food .","titleZh":"熏驼鹿肉","titleEn":"Smoked Moose Meat"},"p-66d0f523a379b2de6f8d.html":{"zh":"技能 是玩家成长系统，反复进行相应行为，会提高特定动作或武器、工具的效能。 每种技能独立获取经验，并有各自的升级触发条件。发生 死亡 时，有效技能等级会降低。 每项技能的最高等级为100。","en":"Skills are a player progression system that improves effectiveness with certain actions or weapon types/tools by repeatedly performing matching actions. Experience is gained independently for each skill with its own trigger for advancement. Effective skill levels are reduced upon Death . The maximum level for each skill is 100.","titleZh":"技能","titleEn":"Skills"},"p-67165b4bbaff882a051f.html":{"zh":"血金堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 血金 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Bloodgold Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Bloodgold or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"血金堆","titleEn":"Bloodgold Stack"},"p-671c6e1323916f506ee1.html":{"zh":"废铁 是原金属，可用 木炭 作燃料，在 冶炼炉 转为 铁 。","en":"Scrap Iron is a raw metal that can be turned into Iron in a Smelter using Coal as fuel.","titleZh":"废铁","titleEn":"Scrap Iron"},"p-671d5c5da32fbfaae65f.html":{"zh":"棕色披肩连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付450 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的白银宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Shawl dress brown is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 450 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's silver chest .","titleZh":"棕色披肩连衣裙","titleEn":"Shawl dress brown"},"p-6789ac95e9d8aed0a004.html":{"zh":"希尔德的宝箱 是三件任务物品，分别作为 希尔德的请求 三个部分的奖励。每件体积大、重量高，无法通过 木制传送门 传送，但可用 石制传送门 传送。 希尔德有三种箱子： 黄铜 、 银 和 青铜 。每种只能在对应一种任务 地点 中找到。","en":"Hildir's Chests are three quest-related items obtained as the rewards to each of the three parts of Hildir's Request . Each are large, heavy items which cannot be teleported through a Wood portal but can be teleported with a stone portal . Hildir has three types of chests: brass , silver and bronze . Each type of chest can only be found in one type of quest point of interest .","titleZh":"希尔德的宝箱","titleEn":"Hildir's Chests"},"p-67d1d48c790de798b03a.html":{"zh":"燕麦粉 是将 燕麦 在 风车 加工而成的 极北之地 级物品。","en":"Oat Flour is a Deep North -tier item made from processing Oats in the Windmill .","titleZh":"燕麦粉","titleEn":"Oat Flour"},"p-681927e34b77e4b91b1f.html":{"zh":"法杖 可能指：","en":"Staff may refer to:","titleZh":"法杖","titleEn":"Staff"},"p-68498d9c4c93e298db25.html":{"zh":"焦骨废墟 或 教堂废墟 是 灰烬之地 中由 灰石 建成的大型建筑。焦黑废墟特别高，可用 灰石陡梯 到达上层，无法用 切石机 修复。","en":"Charred ruins or Cathedral ruins are large structures built from Grausten found in the Ashlands . The charred ruins are particularly high, with the upper floors accessible by Grausten Steep Stairs . The structures cannot be repaired with a Stonecutter .","titleZh":"焦骨废墟","titleEn":"Charred Ruins"},"p-684c8abccd8ed2836ab6.html":{"zh":"灰烬之地限定美味碗 属于 灰烬之地 阶段的 宴席 。","en":"Ashlands Gourmet Bowl is the Ashlands -tier Feast .","titleZh":"灰烬之地限定美味碗","titleEn":"Ashlands Gourmet Bowl"},"p-690671ff0febe865c611.html":{"zh":"焰灵 是 泥泞沼泽 中 火焰喷口 附近的敌对 生物 ，为较弱的小型燃烧魔物，尤其在 泥泞沼泽 ，持续降雨显著降低其远程火球伤害。","en":"Surtlings are aggressive creatures found near Fire geysers in Swamps . They are small flaming imps that are relatively weak, especially in Swamps where the constant raining significantly reduces the damage from their ranged fireball attack.","titleZh":"焰灵","titleEn":"Surtling"},"p-6943aa20eb53b4bf232d.html":{"zh":"霜箭 是供弓使用的 弹药 。大多数箭以穿刺伤害为主，也可能像 银制箭 一样附带次要伤害。不过，霜箭的伤害主要来自 冰霜 效果，穿刺伤害反而较少。","en":"Frost arrows are ammunition for bows. Most arrows' damage comes primarily from their pierce damage, with potential secondary damage, like Silver Arrows . However, frost arrows' damage primarily comes from their frost effect, with pierce damage being the lesser.","titleZh":"霜箭","titleEn":"Frost Arrow"},"p-696a8dcce2d20a1964cc.html":{"zh":"黑金属剑 是第四种 剑 。","en":"Black Metal Sword is the fourth sword .","titleZh":"黑金属剑","titleEn":"Black Metal Sword"},"p-69b80dff4f3766977169.html":{"zh":"断脊 是第五种 弓 ，在 埃达之能时代 阶段制作。 它还会为箭矢附加 灵魂伤害 。 断脊可以驱散9米半径内 迷雾之地 的 雾 。","en":"Spinesnap is the fifth bow and made during the Eitr Age . It also adds spirit damage to the arrows. The Spinesnap is capable of dispelling the Mist of Mistlands in a 9-meter radius.","titleZh":"断脊","titleEn":"Spinesnap"},"p-69dedf1c7d59019fecd9.html":{"zh":"尼德霍格：雷电 是使用 堇青石 强化 尼德霍格 得到的版本。与所有使用 堇青石 强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 闪电 伤害 ，且命中效果有25%概率施加 连锁闪电 。 已升级的尼德霍格在改造为尼德霍格：雷电时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Nidhögg the Thundering is the upgraded form of Nidhögg using the Iolite . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Iolite , they gain 10 lightning damage and their hit effect has a 25% chance to apply Chain Lightning . An upgraded Nidhögg will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Nidhögg the Thundering.","titleZh":"尼德霍格：雷电","titleEn":"Nidhögg the Thundering"},"p-69e79995c287260cbd14.html":{"zh":"野生之杖 是一种召唤 邪煞之根 的 魔法 武器。 法杖发射绿色弹体，造成 钝击 和 毒素伤害 ，并在命中区域立即长出带刺藤蔓。因此，一次施法有两种伤害来源：弹体的初始伤害，以及藤蔓后续攻击造成的钝击和毒素伤害。 根须无法移动，会自动攻击范围内的所有敌人。同时最多可生成10条根须，最长持续25秒。","en":"Staff of the Wild is a magic weapon that summons Root . The staff casts a green projectile that causes blunt and poison damage and a thorny vine grows immediately from the area of impact. This gives two sources of damage from one cast: the initial projectile damage, and the lingering blunt/poison damage of the vine's attacks.","titleZh":"野生之杖","titleEn":"Staff of the Wild"},"p-69efaaad1615db204335.html":{"zh":"风暴之星 是使用 堇青石 强化 焰金属锤 得到的版本。与所有使用 堇青石 强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 闪电 伤害 ，且命中效果有25%概率施加 连锁闪电 。 已升级的焰金属锤在改造为风暴之星时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Storm Star is the upgraded form of Flametal Mace using the Iolite . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Iolite , they gain 10 lightning damage and their hit effect has a 25% chance to apply Chain Lightning . An upgraded Flametal Mace will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Storm Star.","titleZh":"风暴之星","titleEn":"Storm Star"},"p-6a45cdfbff0ce4a089a0.html":{"zh":"镰刀 是收割作物的工具，不能作武器。","en":"The Scythe is a tool used to harvest crops. It cannot be used as a weapon.","titleZh":"镰刀","titleEn":"Scythe"},"p-6aed8812d68d8790c628.html":{"zh":"霜龙 是 凛冽雪山 中的敌对 生物 ，细长无足，鳞片冰蓝，有四只角。霜龙是母亲 冰霜龙母 的雄性后代。","en":"Drakes are aggressive creatures found in the Mountains . They are slender, legless frost dragons with ice-blue scales and four horns. Drakes are the male offspring of their mother, Moder .","titleZh":"霜龙","titleEn":"Drake"},"p-6af035a989f3dffb518d.html":{"zh":"铜堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 铜 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Copper Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Copper or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"铜堆","titleEn":"Copper Stack"},"p-6af2365c71febf178a76.html":{"zh":"甲壳 由 邪蛛探索者 及 邪蛛士兵 掉落，是 迷雾之地 级重甲 甲壳护甲 的主要材料。与其他重甲主要材料不同，甲壳可通过 传送门 。 截至迷雾之地发布，甲壳箭及弩箭通常优于其他箭和弩箭。","en":"Carapace is dropped from Seekers and Seeker Soldiers . It is the primary component in the Mistlands -tier heavy armor: Carapace Armor . Unlike all other primary heavy armor components, carapace can be carried through Portals . As of the Mistlands release, arrows and bolts crafted using Carapace are generally superior to all other arrows and bolts.","titleZh":"甲壳","titleEn":"Carapace"},"p-6b27a97151bbf20fa8b0.html":{"zh":"蜥蜴精 是 青青草原 近水处的敌对 生物 。它们为两栖生物，长四只眼睛，身体伸出荷叶。","en":"Necks are aggressive creatures found in Meadows near water. They are amphibious in nature with four eyes and lily pads protruding out of their bodies.","titleZh":"蜥蜴精","titleEn":"Neck"},"p-6b56233688ee8cf9b1eb.html":{"zh":"蜥蜴精尾巴 是一种通过击杀 蜥蜴精 获得的基础食物。可以在 烹饪台 或 铁烹饪台 上烤成 烧烤蜥蜴精尾肉 ；若烤得过久，则会变成 木炭 。也可用于 铸铁锅 或 蜜酒壶 配方。","en":"Neck Tail is a basic food obtained from killing Necks . It can be cooked on a Cooking Station or Iron Cooking Station to obtain Grilled Neck Tail or Coal if overcooked. It may also be used for a Cauldron recipe or Mead Ketill recipe.","titleZh":"蜥蜴精尾巴","titleEn":"Neck Tail"},"p-6b6778739c7c1e6052de.html":{"zh":"铁匠围裙 用于升级 黑熔炉 。虽然黑熔炉随 迷雾之地 加入，但铁匠围裙需要 极北之地 生物群系的材料。","en":"The Smith's Aprons is used as an upgrade for the Black Forge . While the Black Forge was introduced in Mistlands , the Smith's Aprons requires materials from the Deep North biome.","titleZh":"铁匠围裙","titleEn":"Smith's Aprons"},"p-6bf08869ef37bb95e534.html":{"zh":"加固型宝箱 是大型 宝箱 ，具有24个（6x4）物品格。","en":"Reinforced chests are large chests that have 24 (6x4) item slots.","titleZh":"加固型宝箱","titleEn":"Reinforced Chest"},"p-6bf216d9ac04fe66b810.html":{"zh":"渍蔬菜 是 灰烬之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Marinated Greens are an Ashlands -tier food.","titleZh":"渍蔬菜","titleEn":"Marinated Greens"},"p-6bf255121d987f7b705f.html":{"zh":"龙蛋 是 凛冽雪山 的 霜龙巢穴 中找到的物品，比看起来重得多，并发出微弱嗡鸣。","en":"Dragon eggs are items found in Drake Nests in the Mountains . They are far heavier than they look, with a faint humming sound.","titleZh":"龙蛋","titleEn":"Dragon Egg"},"p-6bfdef456ff9b5ad484a.html":{"zh":"芬里之发 可在 凛冽雪山 生物群系 的 冰霜洞穴 找到。","en":"Fenris hair can be found in Frost Caves in the Mountain biome .","titleZh":"芬里之发","titleEn":"Fenris Hair"},"p-6cb3ed4f574eaf56e084.html":{"zh":"不稳定的火山岩石 是 灰烬之地 中的资源节点，提供 淡红银矿石粉 。 受到任意武器或 镐击 至少50点伤害后破坏并爆炸。爆炸伤害附近玩家、生物及建筑，并形成小坑。","en":"Unstable Lava Rocks are resource nodes found in the Ashlands biome, being a source of Proustite Powder . When destroyed by receiving 50 or more damage from any weapon or a pickaxe , they explode. The explosion damages surrounding objects, including players, creatures and structures. Additionally, it creates a small crater in the ground.","titleZh":"不稳定的火山岩石","titleEn":"Unstable Lava Rock"},"p-6cb46a0883f7253fb1a1.html":{"zh":"子分类 分类：宴席 分类：蜜酒 分类中的页面 宴席 食物 灰烬之地限定美味碗 灰烬刚鬣尾 烘焙洋芋儿 巨熊肉 黑暗林山限定套餐 黑血汤 血旺 蓝蘑菇 蓝莓 鬓猪肉干 鬓猪肉 骨骺蛟龙肉 面包 兔兔梅 胡萝卜 胡萝卜汤 鸡肉 云莓 鹿肉 鹿肉炖锅 鸡蛋 眼激凌 蕨菜花 火辣猪猪煲 鱼和面包 美味鱼汤 鱼肉卷 糖霜甜甜包 野兔肉 山珍佛跳墙 蜂蜜 甜蜜烤鸡 巨人泡泡 羽衣甘蓝 羽衣甘蓝脆片 越橘 越橘汁 平原牦牛肉 平原牦牛肉派 荧光幼虫 法师帽菇 渍蔬菜 肉泥 肉夹馍 肉类拼盘 肉丸和洋芋儿 肉酱 迷雾野兔至尊餐 驼鹿肉 敲克力冰沙 蘑菇 蘑菇煎蛋卷 迷雾之地限定菇菇大杂烩 蜥蜴精尾巴 北境早茶 燕麦奶 燕麦粥 燕麦 洋葱 洋葱汤 烤箱松饼 松饼 火辣派派 平原限定馅饼套餐 洋芋儿 手撕熊肉 皇后果酱 覆盆子 生鱼肉 烘烤酥派 腐坏的肉 皇家果冻 海钓套餐 沙拉 香肠 炙烤杂蔬 海豹油脂 海豹汤 邪蛛肉冻 邪蛛肉 蛟龙肉 蛟龙肉…","en":"Subcategories Category:Feast Category:Mead Pages in category Feast Food Ashlands Gourmet Bowl Asksvin Tail Baked Poteitr Bear Meat Black Forest Buffet Platter Black Soup Blood Pudding Blue mushroom Blueberries Boar Jerky Boar Meat Bonemaw Meat Bread Bukeperries Carrot Carrot Soup Chicken Meat Cloudberries Deer Meat Deer Stew Egg Eyescream Fiddlehead Fiery Svinstew Fish 'n' Bread Fish Soup Fish Wraps Frosted Sweetbre…","titleZh":"分类：食物","titleEn":"Category:Food"},"p-6cbc369855e29a8c7d92.html":{"zh":"阿斯克之忍 是穿戴 阿斯克护甲套装 获得的 状态效果 。 奔跑和跳跃耐力消耗-10%，攻击耐力消耗-20%， 穿刺 伤害 提高+10%。","en":"Ask's Endurance is a status effect granted by wearing the Ask armor set . It reduces the stamina cost of running and jumping by -10%, attacking by -20% and increases your pierce damage by +10%.","titleZh":"阿斯克之忍","titleEn":"Ask's endurance"},"p-6d2d59aed44f1efab446.html":{"zh":"板车 用于储存和运输物品，由人力拉动。玩家可用交互键连接或脱离板车，也可通过闪避脱离，最好向前闪避，以免撞翻板车。 板车内物品总重量及地形坡度都会影响拉车难度。板车遵循物理规律，在斜坡上松手后会向下滚动，也能在游泳时拉动。 板车无法用 工具锤 拆除回收，只能通过造成伤害将其摧毁。 板车高速撞击生物、建筑或地形时，自身及目标最多受到20点 钝击 伤害。伤害随碰撞速度从3 m/s到5 m/s线性增加。与玩家和 鱼 的碰撞不触发此效果，每0.5秒检查一次碰撞。 板车被毁后，物品会装入掉出的货箱，玩家可交互取回。货箱耐久度为50，可受到钝击、劈砍、穿刺、火焰和雷电伤害，免疫其他伤害，滚动时也不会造成伤害。板车与其他建筑一样可用锤子修复，但附近需要 工作台 。","en":"Carts are used to store items and transport them over distances, and are pulled under human power. The player can \"attach\" and \"detach\" themselves to/from the Cart using the interact key to pull the Cart. A player can also \"detach\" themselves by dodging, preferably forwards, so as not to knock over the Cart. Both the total weight of all the items in the Cart and the steepness of the terrain affect the difficulty of…","titleZh":"板车","titleEn":"Cart"},"p-6d42cc8acee3e39810ab.html":{"zh":"雷血战戟 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境战戟 得到的版本。 它获得额外的 穿刺 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境战戟在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thunderblood Atgeir is a version of Nord Atgeir upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra Pierce and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Atgeir will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷血战戟","titleEn":"Thunderblood Atgeir"},"p-6d9ba285db208fa17eed.html":{"zh":"内脏 由 幽暗沼泽 生物群系 及 青青草原 生物群系的 尸鬼 、 尸鬼精英 掉落。也可在 凛冽雪山 的 冰霜洞穴 及 哀啸之穴 内肉堆，或 灰烬之地 中的 腐朽之穴 获得。","en":"Entrails is an item and drops from Draugr and Draugr Elite in the Swamp biome and Meadows biome. They can also be obtained from meat piles inside Frost Caves and Howling Cavern in the Mountain biome, or Putrid Holes in the Ashlands .","titleZh":"内脏","titleEn":"Entrails"},"p-6dafe0a8c4dcea659ebe.html":{"zh":"英灵神殿 让玩家探索受北欧神话和维京文化启发的巨大奇幻世界。冒险从相对平静的世界中心开始，越远离中心，挑战越大，但也能发现更珍贵材料，制作更致命武器和坚固护甲。玩家会在各处建造维京要塞与前哨，最终打造强大长船，航向远海寻找异域土地……但要小心，别驶得太远……","en":"Valheim is a game about exploring a huge fantasy world inspired by Norse mythology and Viking culture. You start your adventure at the relatively peaceful center of Valheim. The further from the center you travel, the more challenging the world becomes. But you will also find more valuable materials that you can use to craft deadlier weapons and sturdier armor. You will also build your own Viking strongholds and out…","titleZh":"英灵神殿","titleEn":"Valheim"},"p-6e2d16d378cd010402f2.html":{"zh":"焰金属盾 是第六种圆 盾 。 其格挡能力低于 焰金属塔盾 ，但可以用来 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Flametal Shield is the sixth round shield . It has less block power compared to the Flametal Tower Shield , but can be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"焰金属盾","titleEn":"Flametal Shield"},"p-6eb00b4b2614a144d41c.html":{"zh":"英灵神殿 拥有由瑞典及澳大利亚作曲家帕特里克·亚尔斯坦（Patrik Jarlestam） 创作的原创 原创原声音乐 。此外还包含两首由丹尼斯·菲拉托夫（Dennis Filatov）和伊内兹·孔蒂奥（Inez Kontio）组成的二人组合Ghostwood Empire 创作并演奏的附加曲目。 根据用户设置，音乐会间歇作为环境音乐播放，或持续播放。 自2021年十月起，原声音乐可通过 购买 获取，也可在多个主流平台上流媒体播放。","en":"Valheim features its own original soundtrack written by Patrik Jarlestam , a Swedish/Australian composer. It also features two bonus tracks composed and performed by the duo Ghostwood Empire , consisting of Dennis Filatov and Inez Kontio. Music either plays ambiently or continuously depending on user setting. Since October 2021, the soundtrack available for purchase and streaming on several major platforms.","titleZh":"音乐","titleEn":"Music"},"p-6ef10e611aae7ccf4cfb.html":{"zh":"燃烧的箭 是一种游戏前期的 箭 ，适合对付 青青草原 和 黑暗林山 生物群系中数种惧怕火焰或弱于火焰的敌人。","en":"Fire arrow is an early game arrow . It is useful against several enemies in both the Meadows and the Black Forest biomes which fear or are weak to fire.","titleZh":"燃烧的箭","titleEn":"Fire Arrow"},"p-6f0a62e3e3763713fd85.html":{"zh":"岩浆软泥怪 是 灰烬之地 中的敌对 生物 ，是 软泥怪 的熔岩变体，能传播火焰。 与其 软泥怪 同类一样，熔岩软泥怪会四处跳跃，因此可迅速缩短与玩家之间的距离。","en":"Lava Blobs are aggressive creatures found in the Ashlands . They are the lava counterparts of Blobs that can spread fire. Similar to their Blob counterparts, the Lava Blob jumps around, and so can close large distance between itself and the player.","titleZh":"岩浆软泥怪","titleEn":"Lava Blob"},"p-6f2254e25e9af41f76a3.html":{"zh":"黄蘑菇 常见于 黑暗林山 的 诡秘墓穴 或 巨魔洞穴 ，以及 泥泞沼泽 的 地下圣堂 。 可以生吃，也可在 蜜酒壶 处用作制作材料。 与多数植物一样，采集后会自然再生：蘑菇每240分钟（4h）重新生成。它们是地下洞室中 唯一 会重新生成的部分。 鬓猪 不会吃黄蘑菇。","en":"Yellow Mushrooms are commonly found in Burial Chambers or Troll Caves in the Black Forest , and Sunken Crypts in the Swamp . They can be eaten raw, or used in a Mead Ketill for crafting. As with most plants, these regrow naturally after being picked up. Picked mushrooms will respawn after 240 minutes, 4h . They are the only part of an underground chamber that regenerates.","titleZh":"黄蘑菇","titleEn":"Yellow Mushroom"},"p-6f2d4017e32c37c2c439.html":{"zh":"白骨碎片 是主要从 骷髅怪 获取的制作材料。","en":"Bone Fragments are a crafting material primarily obtained from Skeletons .","titleZh":"白骨碎片","titleEn":"Bone Fragments"},"p-6f64ca7df2f378bf5f30.html":{"zh":"灰烬之鹫肉 是 灰烬之鹫 掉落的食物。可以在 铁烹饪台 上烤成 煮熟的灰烬之鹫肉 ，但不能使用木制 烹饪台 ；若烤得过久，则会变成 木炭 。","en":"Volture meat is a food dropped by Voltures . It can be cooked using an Iron Cooking Station , but not on a wooden Cooking Station , to obtain Cooked volture meat , or Coal if overcooked.","titleZh":"灰烬之鹫肉","titleEn":"Volture Meat"},"p-6f71b32080395e757b3b.html":{"zh":"石斧 是第一种单手 斧 ，可用于砍伐 山毛榉 、 冷杉 和 松树 树木。","en":"Stone Axe is the first one-handed axe . It can be used to chop down Beech , Fir and Pine trees.","titleZh":"石斧","titleEn":"Stone Axe"},"p-6fd76d96b2be8f37e3e0.html":{"zh":"隐秘钥匙 用于开启 极北之地 中的 墨尔克哈拉 大门。","en":"The Intricate Key is used to open Gates of Mörkhalla in the Deep North .","titleZh":"隐秘钥匙","titleEn":"Intricate Key"},"p-6ffa6b8b1c9fa11cb67a.html":{"zh":"石头 是基础 资源 。可作 材料 ，用 工具锤 建造 建筑 ，或在 工作台 及 熔炉 制作 武器 和 工具 。","en":"Stone is a basic resource . It can be used as a material to build Structures with the Hammer , or craft weapons and tools from the Workbench and the Forge .","titleZh":"石头","titleEn":"Stone"},"p-70ea1983c983deacc1b6.html":{"zh":"核心 可能指：","en":"Core may refer to:","titleZh":"核心","titleEn":"Core"},"p-70f633914b7f44413cde.html":{"zh":"锻造铁砧 用于升级 熔炉 。","en":"Smith's anvil is used as an upgrade for the Forge .","titleZh":"锻造铁砧","titleEn":"Smith's Anvil"},"p-710442950fccf29da37f.html":{"zh":"灰石 是 灰烬之地 生态区域 加入的 资源 ，可作为 材料 ，用 工具锤 建造 建筑 。","en":"Grausten is a resource introduced in the Ashlands biome . It can be used as a material to build structures with the Hammer .","titleZh":"灰石","titleEn":"Grausten"},"p-718334d05eddfafab318.html":{"zh":"青铜矛 是第二种 矛 。","en":"Bronze Spear is the second spear .","titleZh":"青铜矛","titleEn":"Bronze Spear"},"p-719e60e92b1f3d671690.html":{"zh":"歼灭者 是第三种双手 棍棒 。 歼灭者可以驱散9米半径内 迷雾之地 的 雾 。","en":"Demolisher is the third two-handed club . The Demolisher is capable of dispelling the Mist of Mistlands in a 9-meter radius.","titleZh":"歼灭者","titleEn":"Demolisher"},"p-721cd45c909fba45b310.html":{"zh":"母鸡 是被动生物，仅会在 鸡蛋 孵化后出现，是 鸡 的成年阶段。","en":"Hen are passive creatures that can only appear when an Egg hatches. They are the grown stage of Chickens .","titleZh":"母鸡","titleEn":"Hen"},"p-724de16046651b352c27.html":{"zh":"乌弗 是 冰霜洞穴 内部 凛冽雪山 中的敌对 生物 ，外形明显像狼人，但与 芬里 不同，用四肢小跑。","en":"Ulve are aggressive creatures found in Mountains inside Frost Caves . Their appearance is distinctly werewolf-like, however unlike Fenrings , they trot on all-fours.","titleZh":"巨狼","titleEn":"Ulv"},"p-72c467785868e8d8de87.html":{"zh":"甲壳盾 是第五种“圆” 盾 。 与 甲壳圆盾 相比，它的弹反格挡护甲较低，但格挡冲击力和普通格挡护甲较高。","en":"Carapace Shield is the fifth \"round\" shield . It offers less parry block armor, but greater block force and block armor than the Carapace Buckler .","titleZh":"甲壳盾","titleEn":"Carapace Shield"},"p-72c882b758975bacd53f.html":{"zh":"以下是 物品ID 列表，可通过控制台生成实体。另见 数据标识 。","en":"This is a list of item IDs , which can be used to spawn entities using the console. See also: Data IDs .","titleZh":"物品ID","titleEn":"Item IDs"},"p-72e81feaa8a14fac7f1f.html":{"zh":"棍棒 是第一种单手 棍棒 。","en":"The Club is the first one-handed club .","titleZh":"棍棒","titleEn":"Club"},"p-72f206d7ed46f128957d.html":{"zh":"树根套装 是一套 泥泞沼泽 级别的 护甲 ，比 青铜护甲 和 巨魔套装 高一级。与另一套沼泽级别护甲 铁制护甲 相比，它提供的 护甲值 更少，但移动速度惩罚也更小。每个部件都会使穿戴者弱于火焰，但胸甲提供穿刺抗性，面具提供毒素抗性。其独特套装加成使穿戴者的弓技能提高15级 (见:树根套装 ) 。 面具提供50%的 毒素 抗性，因此这套护甲在有许多毒素攻击敌人的 泥泞沼泽 中非常有用。此外， 穿刺 伤害 抗性适合对付 北境平原 和 迷雾之地 中的敌人，其中许多敌人具有穿刺攻击。不过，强烈建议使用 大麦红酒 来抵消任一护甲部件带来的火焰弱点。","en":"The Root Set is a Swamp -tier armor . This set is in the tier above Bronze Armor and the Troll Set . It provides less armor points , but also a lower movement speed penalty compared to the other swamp-tier armor, Iron Armor . Each piece provides weakness to fire, but individual parts give resistance to pierce (in the harnesk) and poison (in the mask). Its unique set bonus increases the wearer's Bow skill by 15 level…","titleZh":"树根套装","titleEn":"Root Set"},"p-731140284eac4aca18aa.html":{"zh":"木材 是常见 材料 ，用于通过 工具锤 建造 建筑 ，或在 工作台 及 熔炉 制作 武器 和 工具 。 不要与其他 木材 类型 混淆。","en":"Wood is a common material . It is used to build structures with the Hammer , or craft weapons and tools from the Workbench and the Forge . Not to be confused with other wood types .","titleZh":"木材","titleEn":"Wood"},"p-7348b12393f91d5684b0.html":{"zh":"尤弥尔之身 是制作材料，击败第二位 首领 古树长老 后才可向商人 霍尔德 购买，用于两种武器。","en":"Ymir Flesh is a crafting material that can only be purchased from the trader Haldor after The Elder , the second boss , has been defeated. It is used to craft two weapons.","titleZh":"尤弥尔之身","titleEn":"Ymir Flesh"},"p-7353d906fac7ce1ba754.html":{"zh":"冰块堆 是用2份 冰霜 建造的构件，可作为建筑构件或装饰。","en":"Ice Block stack is a buildable structure made with 2 Ice . It can be used as a building block, or as a decorative piece.","titleZh":"冰块","titleEn":"Ice Block"},"p-739a8c074dfbbb9a37c9.html":{"zh":"可用 耕地耙 种植 山毛榉种子 ，长成新的 山毛榉 。种下后需要几个游戏日长大。幼苗周围须留出少量空间，空间不足便无法长成大树。 禁止区域 （这些种子无法在以下生物群系或区域生长）：","en":"Beech seeds can be planted using the Cultivator to produce new Beech trees. Once planted, the seeds take a few in-game days to grow to full size. Seedlings require a small amount of space directly around where they are planted; if they do not have enough space they will not grow into full trees. Prohibited areas (These seeds cannot grow in these Biome/Areas):","titleZh":"山毛榉种子","titleEn":"Beech Seeds"},"p-73a1e307b3c18141bf70.html":{"zh":"坠落女武神 是 灰烬之地 中的敌对生物，常悬停于离地一段距离处，定期飞往附近位置，仿佛正在侦察。它们与将玩家带到 英灵神殿 的 女武神 相似，但有明显腐朽迹象。","en":"The Fallen Valkyrie is a hostile enemy found in the Ashlands . They often appear hovering some distance above ground, and periodically fly to nearby locations, as if scouting. They resemble Valkyries who brings the players to Valheim , but showing noticeable signs of decay.","titleZh":"坠落女武神","titleEn":"Fallen Valkyrie"},"p-73ac135c3e1788fdf80f.html":{"zh":"长效治疗蜜酒 是一种 灰烬之地 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：持久生命值 发酵 而成。","en":"Lingering healing mead is an Ashlands -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Lingering health .","titleZh":"长效治疗蜜酒","titleEn":"Lingering Healing Mead"},"p-73b16bdb5bbf9fb9f39e.html":{"zh":"维京墓地 是位于 青青草原 的 地点 。","en":"Viking Graveyards are Points of interest found in the Meadows .","titleZh":"维京墓地","titleEn":"Viking Graveyard"},"p-73c6b321bffb1e983d73.html":{"zh":"青铜盾 是第一种小圆 盾 。 凭借2.5x弹反加成，与同级别的其他盾相比，它在 弹反 攻击时提供的格挡护甲最高。但用于普通格挡时，它是最差的选择。","en":"Bronze Buckler is the first buckler shield . Its 2.5x parry bonus makes it the best option in regards to block armor when parrying attacks compared to every other shield in the same tier. But it is the worst option for regular blocking.","titleZh":"青铜盾","titleEn":"Bronze Buckler"},"p-73e2ff38702b3fb1ff06.html":{"zh":"一个土地面的小区域，中央有树桩祭坛，周围树木环绕，位于 青青草原 生态区域 。 通常由一群 灰矮人 保护。击败后，树桩顶部出现随机奖励。","en":"It was a small area with dirt covered ground and a stump-altar in the middle, surrounded by trees. It can be found in Meadows biome . A group of Greydwarfs is usually protecting it. Upon defeating them, a random reward appears on top of the stump.","titleZh":"林间空地","titleEn":"Glade"},"p-73eafa45a823a1c94589.html":{"zh":"回响锁链 是一种 迷雾之地 级别的 饰物 。","en":"Resounding Shackle is a Mistlands -tier trinket .","titleZh":"回响锁链","titleEn":"Resounding Shackle"},"p-740bef9b70abc6fbb5b5.html":{"zh":"银矿 是原矿，可用 铁镐 或更好工具从海拔120米以上 凛冽雪山 的 银矿脉 开采，再用 冶炼炉 冶炼为 银 。","en":"Silver Ore is a raw metal that can be mined from Silver Veins found in Mountain biomes above 120 meters using an Iron Pickaxe or better. The ore can be smelted into Silver using a Smelter .","titleZh":"银矿","titleEn":"Silver Ore"},"p-743f3692aaa42a7fe3b6.html":{"zh":"嗜血之牙 是使用 血石 强化 灰烬之牙 得到的版本。与所有使用血石强化的武器一样，玩家每缺少1点 生命值 ，其伤害就提高0.2% （不要与生命值百分比混淆） 。 已升级的灰烬之牙在改造为嗜血之牙时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Blood Fang is the upgraded form of Ash Fang using Bloodstone . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, its damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of health the player is missing (not to be confused with health percentage) . An upgraded Ash Fang will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Blood Fang.","titleZh":"嗜血之牙","titleEn":"Blood Fang"},"p-7446aff7f46efd7a9b4b.html":{"zh":"金币堆 是可建造设施，用于储存 钱币 或装饰。","en":"Coin Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Coins or for decoration.","titleZh":"金币堆","titleEn":"Coin Stack"},"p-745fa587f0b89e2f9dcc.html":{"zh":"灰烬之地废墟 是由 灰石 建成、散布在 灰烬之地 各处的破损建筑。 最大的废墟变体是 焦骨废墟 。","en":"Ashlands ruins are broken structures built from Grausten scattered throughout the Ashlands . The largest variants of ruins are Charred Ruins .","titleZh":"灰烬之地废墟","titleEn":"Ashlands ruins"},"p-7488b5a189518632f0ba.html":{"zh":"蓝色披肩上衣 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付450 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的白银宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Cape tunic blue is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 450 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's silver chest .","titleZh":"蓝色披肩上衣","titleEn":"Cape tunic blue"},"p-74a2e696113c0f53a5aa.html":{"zh":"六面浆块 是 极北之地 中 墨尔克哈拉 内的结构，每5秒生成 无形黏团 。","en":"Hexahedric Pulp is a structure found in Mörkhalla in the Deep North . It spawns Shapeless Pulp every 5 seconds.","titleZh":"六面浆块","titleEn":"Hexahedric Pulp"},"p-74b63e6b349912c14355.html":{"zh":"此为不同 木材 的 分类 。","en":"This is a category for different types of wood .","titleZh":"分类：木材","titleEn":"Category:Wood"},"p-74c5dd7691ca9ea67bd4.html":{"zh":"巨魔皮斗篷 是一件属于 巨魔套装 的护甲部件。 同时穿戴套装的全部四件可获得 不易被发现效果 。","en":"Troll Hide Cape is an armor piece that is part of the Troll Set . Wearing all four pieces of the set adds the Sneaky Effect .","titleZh":"巨魔皮斗篷","titleEn":"Troll Hide Cape"},"p-74cf2bc63fe122206c82.html":{"zh":"成就 在PlayStation上称为奖杯，完成击杀 首领 、探索 世界 等行为即可获得。 成就以玩家统计为依据，可用聊天命令/stats或 开发者控制台 命令stats查看。","en":"Achievements (Trophies on PlayStation) are awarded by performing certain actions, like slaying bosses or exploring the world . Achievements are based on the player stats visible with the chat command /stats or the developer console command stats .","titleZh":"成就","titleEn":"Achievements"},"p-74ea9fd6feded58a1fb2.html":{"zh":"矮人之力 是在20秒内提高20%全部技能伤害的 状态效应 。 战斗中，辅助 矮人法师 可施放增益，为周围8米内所有 矮人 和玩家施加矮人之力。","en":"Dvergr Power is a Status effect that increases damage from all skills by 20% for 20 seconds. During battle, Support Dvergr Mages can cast a support spell that applies Dvergr Power to all Dvergr and players in an 8-meter radius around them.","titleZh":"矮人之力","titleEn":"Dvergr power"},"p-75154c3cc4a4e3de284e.html":{"zh":"血金弹药 是一种 投石机 弹药。命中时对目标造成20点钝击伤害并爆炸，在2米半径内造成200点纯粹伤害、5点钝击伤害、200点砍伐伤害和600点镐击伤害。","en":"The Bloodgold Payload is a catapult ammo. It deals 20 blunt damage to whatever it hits and explodes on impact, dealing 200 pure, 5 blunt, 200 chop and 600 pickaxe damage in a 2-meter radius.","titleZh":"血金弹药","titleEn":"Bloodgold Payload"},"p-752c784fa0ea96c4689b.html":{"zh":"赫沃克·血齿 是在 英灵神殿 中提及的 角色 。 她是预告 极北之地 发布及1.0 版本 的十集视频系列主角。","en":"Hervor Bloodtooth is a mentioned character in Valheim . She is the main characters of a series of ten videos made to tease the release of Deep North and the 1.0 Version .","titleZh":"赫沃克·血齿","titleEn":"Hervor Bloodtooth"},"p-752ff48636e07c4fe558.html":{"zh":"皮革碎片 是制作材料，可在 青青草原 的 宝箱 找到，由 鬓猪 及 邪蝠 掉落，或从 泥泞的废料堆 开采。","en":"Leather Scraps are a crafting material that can be found in Chests in the Meadows , dropped from Boars and Bats , or mined from Muddy Scrap Piles .","titleZh":"皮革碎片","titleEn":"Leather Scraps"},"p-754cdcc1815796486c87.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 阿斯克套装 熊皮套装 蓝色绳结头巾 青铜护甲 召唤者套装 甲壳护甲 庆典帽 根须王冠 英灵神殿之冠 矮人头环 埃达织物套装 恩布拉套装 绿色华丽帽 橙色华丽帽 芬里套装 钓鱼帽 焰金属护甲 棕色皮毛帽 灰色皮毛帽 头带 奥丁兜帽 铁制护甲 皮甲 牦牛皮套装 仲夏之冠 厚垫护甲 巫师帽 守护者护甲 树根套装 紫色简朴帽 红色简朴帽 草帽 黄色绳结头巾 巨魔套装 绿色扭结头巾 红色扭结头巾 先锋套装 邪骨套装 狼皮护甲 圣诞帽","en":"Pages in category Ask Set Bear Set Blue Tied Headscarf Bronze Armor Caller Set Carapace Armor Celebratory Cap Crown of Roots Crown of Valheim Dverger Circlet Eitr-weave Set Embla Set Extravagant cap green Extravagant cap orange Fenris Set Fishing Hat Flametal Armor Fur cap brown Fur cap grey Headband Hood of Oden Iron Armor Leather Armor Lox Fur Set Midsummer Crown Padded Armor Pointy Hat Protector Armor Root Set Si…","titleZh":"分类：头部装备","titleEn":"Category:Head"},"p-758f487fe8e9fcc59cec.html":{"zh":"物品栏 用于携带装备和物品。","en":"The inventory is what the player uses to carry equipment and gear.","titleZh":"物品栏","titleEn":"Inventory"},"p-75e2002942a86ff1e76d.html":{"zh":"爱之药 是一种消耗品，由 沼泽女巫 出售，五瓶售价110 钱币 。","en":"Love potion is a consumable item sold by The Bog Witch at 110 Coins for five potions.","titleZh":"爱之药","titleEn":"Love Potion"},"p-760b7f489fb87003e2a4.html":{"zh":"长爪 是 极北之地 中 蜿蜒隧道 的 无眼者 掉落的材料。","en":"Long Claws is a material dropped by the Eyeless One found in the Winding Tunnels in the Deep North .","titleZh":"长爪","titleEn":"Long Claws"},"p-76b810a969b12473dd43.html":{"zh":"砍倒 巨木冷杉 掉落 巨木冷杉果 。","en":"Timberwood Cone are dropped by cutting down Timber Trees .","titleZh":"巨木冷杉果","titleEn":"Timberwood Cone"},"p-76d0b256c2dbf7f296a4.html":{"zh":"银 战斗 神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Silver Battle Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"银 战斗 神像","titleEn":"Silver Battle Idol"},"p-771139a20b8180dd5219.html":{"zh":"不易被发现 是穿齐 巨魔 护甲 套装 四件获得的 状态效果 ，提高15 潜行 技能，不超过100上限。","en":"Sneaky is a status effect granted by wearing all four pieces of the Troll armor set . It increases Sneak skill by 15 but does not exceed the skill cap of 100.","titleZh":"不易被发现","titleEn":"Sneaky"},"p-776bd0b0f66331bc9131.html":{"zh":"燧石箭 是供 弓 使用的 弹药 ，也是 木箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Flinthead arrows are ammunition for bows and are the next direct upgrade from Wood Arrows .","titleZh":"燧石箭","titleEn":"Flinthead Arrow"},"p-777dc22afe7bd827ad30.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣腐尸 是资源节点，可在 灰烬之地 生物群系 各处、 秃鹫巢穴 及 腐朽之穴 内外找到。 没有实际功能，但破坏后会掉落多种有用资源。 灰烬刚鬣腐尸有两种外观，功能完全相同。","en":"Asksvin Carrion are resource nodes that can be found throughout the Ashlands biome , in Volture Nests and in or around Putrid Holes . They have no function, but drop several useful resources when destroyed. Asksvin Carrion comes in two different varieties, both of which are functionally identical.","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣腐尸","titleEn":"Asksvin Carrion"},"p-77d75bbb1f4401161034.html":{"zh":"银盾 是第三种圆 盾 。 其格挡能力与 蛟龙鳞盾 相同，并可用于 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Silver Shield is the third round shield . It has equal block power compared to a Serpent Scale Shield and can be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"银盾","titleEn":"Silver Shield"},"p-77ddf6c3049b46cb5ceb.html":{"zh":"灵灵微光 是装饰物，须在 工作台 范围内建造。它会产生漂浮并发出蓝光的小粒子。","en":"Fey lights is a decorative object. It needs to be built within the range of a Workbench . It produces small particules that float around and emit blue light.","titleZh":"灵灵微光","titleEn":"Fey Lights"},"p-78051eec1c5071da80d7.html":{"zh":"灰烬之地 是熔岩地狱般的 生物群系 ，位于世界最南端，呈新月形岛屿。这片火焰领域越往内陆，地貌变化越明显，中央主要由 熔岩 占据。除其他生物外，焦骨亡灵军团是这里的主要居民。 灰烬之地大陆周围海水沸腾，会摧毁试图驶入的所有木制船只。只有击败 蛊虫之后 后能制作的 灰烬长船 ，可以承受这段危险航程。 这里会出现破坏建筑的 余烬雨 ，须建造 护盾发生器 保护基地。此外，火焰会在此处的 木制 建筑 之间蔓延。 此生物群系是同名 灰烬之地更新 的主要更新内容，进度上位于 迷雾之地 之后。","en":"The Ashlands is a molten hellscape biome that takes the form of a crescent shaped island in the southernmost part of the world. A fiery realm, the terrain changes the more inland one travels, with central parts taken up by lava . The undead army of Charred make up the population, among other creatures. The water surrounding the Ashlands mainland is boiling, which will destroy all wooden ships attempting to sail to t…","titleZh":"灰烬之地","titleEn":"Ashlands"},"p-7859fff77202a94fe959.html":{"zh":"松树是 黑暗林山 中的 树 ，树干细长高耸，至少需要 石斧 才能砍伤。 松树被毁后掉落 木材 和 圆木 ，各自数量似乎随机，但总共固定30份木材。 用 耕地耙 种下 松果 可培育更多松树，能种在 青青草原 。松果掉率低，因此松树及其圆木无法持续自给。","en":"Pine is a type of tree that can be found in the Black Forest biome. It is characterized by its tall, skinny trunk. A Stone Axe or better is required to damage it. Pine trees produce Wood and Corewood when destroyed. The yield of each type of wood appears to be random, however, a pine tree will always drop 30 pieces of wood total.","titleZh":"松树","titleEn":"Pine"},"p-785b852b0f40b0591c98.html":{"zh":"木筏 是小型 船只 ，速度慢、没有储物空间，操纵性较差。建造成本极低，适合探索时作为跨越水域的临时船只，但不适合长途海上航行。 满帆速度为1.59–3.02米/秒，半帆为1.12–2.13米/秒，划桨为1.58米/秒。","en":"Rafts are small boats with a low sailing speed, no storage and poor maneuverability. Their extremely low cost of construction makes them ideal \"disposable\" solutions to overcoming water obstacles while exploring, but they are not a good choice for long ocean voyages. They travel 1.59–3.02 meters per second with full sails, 1.12–2.13 meters per second with half sails and 1.58 meters per second when paddling.","titleZh":"木筏","titleEn":"Raft"},"p-785c966f56f2a88ef0c5.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 带罩灯笼 材料 圆柱大门 失衡 练兵傀儡","en":"Pages in category Hooded Lantern Materials Roundpole Gate Stagger T.W.I.G.","titleZh":"分类：待完善页面","titleEn":"Category:Work in progress"},"p-78abb2034b16d2bc7ece.html":{"zh":"锅碗瓢盆 用于升级 铸铁锅 。由于金属成本较高，通常是大锅的第三项升级。","en":"Pots and pans are used as an upgrade for the Cauldron . It will typically be the third upgrade for the cauldron due to its high metal cost.","titleZh":"锅碗瓢盆","titleEn":"Pots and Pans"},"p-78d961cf671304480d66.html":{"zh":"黑金宝箱 是最大的 宝箱 ，具有32个（8x4）物品格。","en":"Black metal chests are the largest chest , with 32 (8x4) item slots.","titleZh":"黑金宝箱","titleEn":"Black Metal Chest"},"p-792a4ddd151a20201635.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 灰烬之木堆 黑大理石堆 黑金属堆 血金堆 骨堆 青铜堆 煤块堆 金币叠 金币堆 铜堆 圆木堆 细木堆 焰金属堆 燧石堆 灰石堆 铁堆 头骨堆 银矿堆 堆叠与料堆 石头堆 巨木堆 锡堆 木材堆 世界之树木材堆","en":"Pages in category Ashwood Stack Black Marble Pile Black Metal Stack Bloodgold Stack Bone Stack Bronze Stack Coal Pile Coin Pile Coin Stack Copper Stack Corewood Stack Finewood Stack Flametal Stack Flint Pile Grausten Pile Iron Stack Pile of Skulls Silver Stack Stacks and Piles Stone Pile Timberwood Stack Tin Stack Wood Stack Yggdrasil Wood Stack","titleZh":"分类：材料堆","titleEn":"Category:Stacks & Piles"},"p-7937089f60a173e6685a.html":{"zh":"这是 矛 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 武器 。","en":"This is a category for spears which are a type of weapons .","titleZh":"分类：矛","titleEn":"Category:Spears"},"p-794f7b66a4a8566b04e0.html":{"zh":"北境匕首 是一种 极北之地 级别的单手 刀 。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境匕首铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"The Nord Dagger is an Deep North -tier one handed Knives . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Dagger and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境匕首","titleEn":"Nord Dagger"},"p-7951b6eeb50bd5924488.html":{"zh":"皮革架 放在 工作台 五米以内时，可为其升级。在 地精村落 中也可找到鞣皮架。","en":"The Tanning rack serves as an upgrade for the Workbench when placed within five meters of it. Tanning racks can also be found in Fuling Villages .","titleZh":"皮革架","titleEn":"Tanning Rack"},"p-798ef75822d02501800d.html":{"zh":"血金弩炮弹 是一种用作 弩炮 弹药的 弩炮弹 ，可在 工匠台 处制作。","en":"Bloodgold Missile is a missile used as ammunition for the Ballista , and can be crafted at the Artisan Table .","titleZh":"血金弩炮弹","titleEn":"Bloodgold Missile"},"p-7992e9fec07bd5ca48d5.html":{"zh":"影渊石 是在 极北之地 发现的 珍贵 。","en":"Draumyx is a Valuable found in Deep North .","titleZh":"影渊石","titleEn":"Draumyx"},"p-799c269135742a36ae48.html":{"zh":"以下是 英灵神殿 默认操作。设置菜单可重新绑定键盘按键，并调整部分手柄选项。 此外，还有以下操作：","en":"These are default controls for Valheim . In the settings menu, keyboard keys can be reassigned, and certain options can be adjusted for controllers. furthermore, some additional controls exist:","titleZh":"控制","titleEn":"Controls"},"p-79cea8ff2ba190bbb1bd.html":{"zh":"获得一些 鱼饵 和一根 鱼竿 后即可进行 钓鱼 ，获取食物和装饰物。迷雾之地更新引入了不同种类的 鱼 和 鱼饵 。 基础鱼饵只能从 商人 处获得，但钓竿既可购买，也可在 冰霜洞穴 中找到。不用钓竿也能直接捡鱼，因为鱼有时会搁浅在岸上，甚至偶尔跳进 轮船 。","en":"Fishing is an activity unlocked by obtaining some Bait and a Fishing Rod , which allows a source of food and decoration items. Different types of fish and bait were introduced in the Mistlands update. The basic bait can only be obtained from the merchant , but the rod can either be bought or found in a Frost Caves . It is possible to simply pick up fish without a rod, as they can sometimes be found stranded on shore…","titleZh":"钓鱼","titleEn":"Fishing"},"p-7a5f6212333582eb45f4.html":{"zh":"获得 铁 并建造 切石机 后，可建造 石制结构 。建造和修复需要 石头 ，且附近须有切石机。 石制防御工事比木制更坚固，因此更能抵挡 突袭 。","en":"Stone structures become available after the acquisition of iron and subsequently a stonecutter . They require stone and the proximity of a stonecutter to be built and repaired. Stone fortifications are stronger than those from wood, which can make them more resistant against raids .","titleZh":"石制结构","titleEn":"Stone Structures"},"p-7a773b5b23a0dccec98c.html":{"zh":"冰火重锤 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境重锤 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 钝击 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境重锤在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Frostfire Sledge is a version of Nord Sledge upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of Blunt damage in exchange of a larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. An upgraded Nord Sledge will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"冰火重锤","titleEn":"Frostfire Sledge"},"p-7a8478ced215b368ea1b.html":{"zh":"铁铸火炬 是一种光源。 最多装六份树脂。装入1/6容量的燃料可燃烧5小时33分钟，装满可燃烧33小时20分钟，与 铁铸绿光火炬 、 铁铸蓝光火炬 和 壁灯 相同。","en":"The Standing iron torch is a light source. It can hold up to six Resin at once. With 1/6 fuel, a standing iron torch will last for 5 hours and 33 minutes. At maximum capacity, a standing iron torch should burn for 33 hours and 20 minutes. This duration is the same for the Standing Green-Burning Iron Torch , Standing Blue-Burning Iron Torch and Sconce .","titleZh":"铁铸火炬","titleEn":"Standing Iron Torch"},"p-7a850ff504f5d0a8b1f5.html":{"zh":"下颌骨 是一件物品，可由 迷雾之地 生物群系 中的 邪蛛士兵 掉落。","en":"Mandible is an item and can be dropped from Seeker Soldiers in the Mistlands biome .","titleZh":"下颌骨","titleEn":"Mandible"},"p-7aa9a065ffc71b094534.html":{"zh":"平原限定馅饼套餐 属于 北境平原 阶段的 宴席 。","en":"Plains Pie Picnic is the Plains -tier Feast .","titleZh":"平原限定馅饼套餐","titleEn":"Plains Pie Picnic"},"p-7ac754f099610eed2d6f.html":{"zh":"蜿蜒隧道 是 极北之地 中的 地下城 。 蜿蜒隧道入口位于 废弃村落 的大屋内。每个世界最多放置40座大厅，远离北方深境边缘，海拔至少两米，彼此相隔至少256米。如名称所示，地下城由曲折隧道组成。 内部栖息大量 厄妖 及一些 无眼者 。 内部始终昏暗，但既不寒冷，也不冰冻。","en":"The Winding Tunnels is a Dungeon found in the Deep North . The entrance to the Winding Tunnels can be found inside large houses in Abandoned Villages . Up to 40 of these Great Halls are placed in each world, away from the edges of the Deep North, at least two meters above sea level and at least 256 meters apart. As the name suggests, the dungeon consists of convoluted tunnels.","titleZh":"蜿蜒隧道","titleEn":"Winding Tunnels"},"p-7ac8781d3aef470818e2.html":{"zh":"蓝黄麻 是一种材料，破坏 迷雾之地 中装饰 矮人 建造的 黑大理石 建筑的 窗帘 及 窗帘 获得。","en":"Blue jute is a material. It is obtained by destroying the curtains and drapes which adorn Dvergr -made Black Marble structures in the Mistlands .","titleZh":"蓝黄麻","titleEn":"Blue Jute"},"p-7ae57d9d0e8c44f9756c.html":{"zh":"钱币 是所有 生态区域 中都能找到的材料物品，主要用于交易。 击杀 巨魔 、 丑地精 、 丑地精萨满 、 丑地精狂战士 或 矮人 ，搜刮 宝箱 、 地下城 及其他一些 地点 ，可获取金币。也可向商人出售具有“ 珍贵 ”属性的物品，例如 红宝石 、 琥珀 、 琥珀珍珠 和 银项链 。 1000枚金币可立即兑换为100个 木炭 ，使用 湮灭者 。也可以购买2000份 鱼饵 ，花费1000枚金币，购买来源为 霍尔德 ，再用雷神毁灭者将其转化为200块煤炭。","en":"Coins are a material item found in all biomes that are mainly used to trade. Coins can be acquired by killing Troll , Fuling , Fuling Shaman , Fuling Berserker or Dvergr , looting chests , and looting dungeons and some other points of interest . They can also be obtained by selling items with the \" Valuable \" quality to traders, such as Ruby , Amber , Amber Pearl and Silver Necklace .","titleZh":"钱币","titleEn":"Coins"},"p-7b0bc5ade0d5a44b1bad.html":{"zh":"丰收上衣 与 草帽 组成一套服装，同时穿戴两件时，玩家的 耕作技能 增加+25。 丰收之裙 可以代替上衣，提供相同效果。取回 黄铜宝箱 并交给 希尔德 后，即可向她购买。","en":"Harvest Tunic is a part of a set together with Straw Hat that increases the player's Farming skill by +25 so long as both pieces are worn. The Harvest Dress can be used in place of the tunic for the same effect. It is sold by Hildir after retrieving and bringing her the Brass Chest .","titleZh":"丰收上衣","titleEn":"Harvest Tunic"},"p-7b1dab345d386b4f40a5.html":{"zh":"剑 是与 剑 武器类别相关的 技能 。","en":"Swords is a skill related to Swords weapon class.","titleZh":"剑（技能）","titleEn":"Swords (skill)"},"p-7b86f4791baa9f180bf2.html":{"zh":"大酒杯 用于从背包饮用 蜜酒 ，不过没有酒杯也能饮蜜酒。","en":"Tankards are items used to consume mead from within an inventory. Mead can, however, be consumed without the use of a tankard.","titleZh":"大酒杯","titleEn":"Tankard"},"p-7bd2f51d015c23c52912.html":{"zh":"大型枯骨 是可在 泥泞沼泽 、 北境平原 和 迷雾之地 的替代 枯骨 变体中找到的结构。","en":"Large Bone is a structure found in Swamp , Plains , Mistlands , in the alternative Bones version.","titleZh":"大型枯骨","titleEn":"Large Bone"},"p-7bdbab2112e374391620.html":{"zh":"这是 斧 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 武器 。","en":"This is a category for axes which are a type of weapons .","titleZh":"分类：斧","titleEn":"Category:Axes"},"p-7c234cbffc5ef6544813.html":{"zh":"面粉 可能指：","en":"Flour may refer to:","titleZh":"面粉","titleEn":"Flour"},"p-7c7db3ddff1ecbe86862.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以160枚 钱币 购买5个 平原草药师的采摘 ，仅在击败 亚格鲁斯 后出售。","en":"Grasslands herbalist harvest can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 160 Coins for 5 items. It is only sold after Yagluth has been defeated.","titleZh":"平原草药师的采摘","titleEn":"Grasslands Herbalist Harvest"},"p-7ca0d7d3189029fe56e1.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 宴席 灰烬之地限定美味碗 黑暗林山限定套餐 山珍佛跳墙 迷雾之地限定菇菇大杂烩 北境早茶 平原限定馅饼套餐 海钓套餐 沼泽居民限定套餐 草原烤全猪","en":"Pages in category Feast Ashlands Gourmet Bowl Black Forest Buffet Platter Hearty Mountain Logger's Stew Mushrooms Galore á la Mistlands Northern Morning Fare Plains Pie Picnic Sailor's Bounty Swamp Dweller's Delight Whole Roasted Meadow Boar","titleZh":"分类：宴席","titleEn":"Category:Feast"},"p-7caa0fa619e382ef655d.html":{"zh":"巨剑 可能指：","en":"Greatsword may refer to:","titleZh":"巨剑","titleEn":"Greatsword"},"p-7ccff83707410786a1c4.html":{"zh":"宝石切割器 用于升级 黑熔炉 。虽然黑熔炉随 迷雾之地 加入，但宝石切割台需要 灰烬之地 生物群系的材料。","en":"The gem cutter is used as an upgrade for the Black Forge . While the black forge was introduced in Mistlands , the gem cutter requires materials from the Ashlands biome.","titleZh":"宝石切割器","titleEn":"Gem Cutter"},"p-7d5de2b5ce6e1781ff69.html":{"zh":"冰火匕首 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境匕首 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 劈砍 和 穿刺 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境匕首在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Frostfire Dagger is a version of Nord Dagger upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of Slash and Pierce damage in exchange of a larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. An upgraded Nord Dagger will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"冰火匕首","titleEn":"Frostfire Dagger"},"p-7dc5f032c897d1140e14.html":{"zh":"甲壳弩箭 是供 弩 使用的 弹药 ，也是 黑金属弩箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Carapace bolts are ammunition for Crossbows and are the next direct upgrade from Black Metal Bolts .","titleZh":"甲壳弩箭","titleEn":"Carapace Bolt"},"p-7ddc50d536fdf8c1f48e.html":{"zh":"羽毛 用途之一是制作除 木箭 外全部 箭 。","en":"Feathers are a material used to craft all types of arrows excluding Wood Arrows , among other uses.","titleZh":"羽毛","titleEn":"Feathers"},"p-7de45d323a92478f4381.html":{"zh":"子分类 分类：种子 分类中的页面 橡果 灰烬藤蔓 大麦 山毛榉种子 桦树种子 胡萝卜 胡萝卜种子 耕地耙 冷杉球果 亚麻 巨人泡泡 羽衣甘蓝 羽衣甘蓝种子 法师帽菇 燕麦种子 燕麦 洋葱 洋葱种子 松果 洋芋儿 洋芋儿种子 巨木冷杉果 芜菁 芜菁种子 灰烬藤蔓种子","en":"Subcategories Category:Seeds Pages in category Acorns Ashvine Barley Beech Seeds Birch Seeds Carrot Carrot Seeds Cultivator Fir Cone Flax Jotun Puffs Kale Kale Seeds Magecap Oat Seeds Oats Onion Onion Seeds Pine Cone Poteitr Seed Poteitr Timberwood Cone Turnip Turnip Seeds Vineberry Seeds","titleZh":"分类：农耕","titleEn":"Category:Farming"},"p-7e5fc427a43025ede9c9.html":{"zh":"砍倒 松树 掉落 松果 ，可用 耕地耙 种成松树。需要几个游戏日长大，幼苗周围须留足空间，否则无法成树。","en":"Pine Cones are dropped by cutting down Pines . They can be planted using the Cultivator to produce Pine trees. Once planted, the cones take a few in-game days to grow to full size. Tree saplings require a fair amount of space directly around from where they are planted. Without it, they will not grow into trees.","titleZh":"松果","titleEn":"Pine Cone"},"p-7e83dcca2a707552d3af.html":{"zh":"锡矿源 是 黑暗林山 中的资源节点，需 鹿角镐 或更好工具采锡矿石。","en":"Tin Deposits are resource nodes and are found in the Black Forest biome. An Antler Pickaxe or better is required to harvest Tin ore from the deposit.","titleZh":"锡矿源","titleEn":"Tin Deposit"},"p-7eac399dd505bdc78a2f.html":{"zh":"召唤者套装 是一套 极北之地 级别的法师 护甲 。","en":"The Caller Set is a Deep North -tier mage armor .","titleZh":"召唤者套装","titleEn":"Caller Set"},"p-7ebf5abf272adb559353.html":{"zh":"邪恶之血 是挑战 极北之地 首领 凌冽·芬布尔使者 所需的特殊物品。","en":"Malicious Blood is a special item required to fight the Deep North boss Kall Fimbulbringer .","titleZh":"邪恶之血","titleEn":"Malicious Blood"},"p-7edb13216ea71ee17f74.html":{"zh":"真●丑地精 是被动 生物 ，只能通过 控制台命令。 生成。","en":"Riktig Fulings are passive creatures can only be spawned via Console Commands.","titleZh":"真●丑地精","titleEn":"Riktig Fuling"},"p-7f17af1d94f3b34d1167.html":{"zh":"木材营 是在 极北之地 发现的 地点 。 一座独立木屋，周围许多 小作品 和 木材堆 。","en":"Lumber Camp is a Point of interest found in Deep North . It is a single wooden house surrounded by many Stubs and Wood Stacks .","titleZh":"木材营","titleEn":"Lumber Camp"},"p-7f63c6b2aabc8c06356e.html":{"zh":"上古之坛 是一种非 可建设 建筑，可在 灰烬之地 生物群系 各处的 焦骨废墟 和 腐朽之穴 中找到。 没有实际功能，但破坏后会掉落多种有用资源。 远古陶罐有三种不同形状和大小，功能完全相同。","en":"Ancient Pots are a non- buildable structure that can be found in Charred Ruins and Putrid Holes throughout the Ashlands biome . They have no function, but drop several useful resources when destroyed. Ancient pots come in three different shapes and sizes, all of which are functionally identical.","titleZh":"上古之坛","titleEn":"Ancient Pot"},"p-7fda4c9ba90a43c53c04.html":{"zh":"铁戟 是第二种 长柄武器 。","en":"Iron Atgeir is the second polearm .","titleZh":"铁戟","titleEn":"Iron Atgeir"},"p-7fffccf059f52f3fbb6f.html":{"zh":"制图台 随 家园与炉火 更新加入。它是建造菜单中的一张桌子，可让玩家与其他玩家共享 地图 和标记。 桌子一端有地图，可将共享数据加入自己的地图；另一端有箱子，可将自己的发现记录到共享地图。通过制图台获得的数据与自行探索的数据可在地图上区分，也能方便地关闭显示。","en":"The Cartography Table was added in the Hearth & Home update. It is a table available in the build menu that allows the player to share their map and markers with another player. One end of the table has a map, allowing players to add data to their own map, and the other end has a box to record their own discoveries onto the communal map. Map data discovered through the Cartography table can be distinguished from sel…","titleZh":"制图台","titleEn":"Cartography Table"},"p-8008a1c8d263eb3c60aa.html":{"zh":"芬里之佑 是提供抗火并使 拳类 技能提高15的 状态效果 ，但不超过100技能上限。","en":"Fenris blessing is a status effects which provides the player with Fire resistance and increases the Fists skill by 15, but does not exceed the skill cap of 100.","titleZh":"芬里之佑","titleEn":"Fenris blessing"},"p-803ba5ee8e70c4ee75f7.html":{"zh":"迷雾之地 是崎岖多山的 生物群系 ，终年浓雾笼罩，难以看清内部。谷地、山凹、峡谷和高原间耸立巨大的黑色峭岩，常露出雾顶， 世界树嫩枝 生长其上。地面上有较大、发光的 世界树树根 ，常能透过雾看见。海岸同样险恶，长船面对的是陡崖、陡峭岸台和岩质沙洲。 冥火之光 及可放置的 冥火火炬 能驱散雾气，但都需要先击败 亚格鲁斯 。 这里压迫感强，地形难以穿行，常使人迷失方向。敌人强大，往往先看见玩家。 邪蛛探索者 和 邪蛛士兵 最常见，几乎能持续追击；普通邪蛛必要时还能飞到更高山坡。这里也有对玩家中立的 矮人 ，会主动与敌人作战保卫据点。玩家若攻击它们，也将面对强大敌手。 迷雾之地与 其内容更新 一起引入了名为 埃达之能 的新战斗机制。食用本地作物和生物制成的特定食物，例如 法师帽菇 ，可获得埃达之能，使玩家使用各种 魔法 能力应对严酷环境。","en":"The Mistlands is a jagged, mountainous biome covered in a perpetual mist that hangs over its entirety and makes it difficult to see inside. It is full of valleys, dales, ravines, and even plateaus punctuated by gargantuan black crags that often peek over the mist. Yggdrasil Shoots grow on these rocks. Larger, glowing Yggdrasil roots can be found lining the ground, often visible through the mist. Its coastline is equ…","titleZh":"迷雾之地","titleEn":"Mistlands"},"p-803e400343cc5524069f.html":{"zh":"命运之鳍 是 无尽之海 阶段的 饰物 。","en":"Fins of Destiny are an Ocean -tier trinket .","titleZh":"命运之鳍","titleEn":"Fins of Destiny"},"p-806891f52a7296f021eb.html":{"zh":"弩 是一类 武器 。 弩发射已装备的 弩箭 ，射出的弩箭无法回收。装填本身需要3.5秒并消耗4点耐力；但加上发射、装填和准备动作，实际每6秒才能发射一次。 跳跃和冲刺会重置装填进度，冲刺时无法装填弩箭。装填完成后，可随时发射，且不消耗耐力。发射后需要重新装填一支弩箭。切换到其他武器时，弩箭不会保持装填状态，因此每次装备该物品时都需要装填。","en":"Crossbows is a weapon class. Crossbows shoot equipped bolts and cannot be retrieved. Loading itself takes 3.5 seconds and uses 4 stamina, however, with the firing, loading, and readying animations, it can only be fired every 6 seconds. Jumping and sprinting resets the loading progress, and bolts cannot be loaded while sprinting. After the crossbow is loaded, it can be fired at any time at no stamina cost. After firi…","titleZh":"弩","titleEn":"Crossbows"},"p-80bc9506aa37a383add5.html":{"zh":"鸟巢 是用于生产 羽毛 的 基础 设施。","en":"Birds' Nest is a base structures used for producing feathers .","titleZh":"鸟巢","titleEn":"Birds' Nest"},"p-80d980b15b4badb8ba69.html":{"zh":"烟雾弹 是一种在 灰烬之地 生物群系中加入的投掷武器。 投掷后会留下烟雾区域，对任何不免疫该效果的生物施加 烟雾笼罩 状态，包括投掷它的玩家。 烟雾弹会熄灭落点周围3米半径内的火焰。","en":"Smoke bomb is a thrown weapon introduced in the Ashlands biome. When thrown, it will leave an area of smoke that sets the Smoked status effect to any creature not immune to it, such as the player that threw it Smoke bombs extinguish fire in a 3-meter radius around the impact.","titleZh":"烟雾弹","titleEn":"Smoke Bomb"},"p-80feee21634633cb14b9.html":{"zh":"弩炮 是用于自动防御的 杂项设施 。 弩炮可装载40发同类弹药，每次发射消耗一发。默认会攻击前方28米内、±45度扇形范围中的任何 生物 ，包括 玩家角色 和 被驯服 动物。装弹时应小心：只要装入第一发，若玩家位于射界内，弩炮就会开始攻击。 伤害完全取决于装载的 弩炮弹 ，即 木制弩炮弹 、 黑金属弩炮弹 或 焰金属弩炮弹 。","en":"Ballistae are misc structures that act as an automated defense. A Ballista can hold 40 missiles of the same type, which will be depleted one at a time as it fires. By default, a Ballista will shoot at any creature in an arc (±45 degrees) within a 28 meters range in front of it, including player characters and tamed animals. Care should be taken when loading the Ballista, as it will begin shooting after the first mis…","titleZh":"弩炮","titleEn":"Ballista"},"p-812b9a072cfeeda8b48c.html":{"zh":"驼鹿皮披风 是侧重战斗的 极北之地 级别 披风 。 它使穿戴者对 冰霜 抗性 ，并降低 20% 的攻击 耐力 消耗和 20% 的奔跑耐力消耗。","en":"Moose Hide Cape is the combat focused Deep North -tier Cape . It makes the wearer Resistant VS Frost and reduces attack stamina usage by 20% and run stamina usage by 20%.","titleZh":"驼鹿皮披风","titleEn":"Moose Hide Cape"},"p-8157112c61b5aaee0185.html":{"zh":"奥丁套装 是一套DLC护甲，仅供《英灵神殿》的早期支持者使用。Iron Gate Studios通过电子邮件，向报名参加《英灵神殿》测试的人发送Steam代码。它与 碎布护甲 属于同一级别，两套之后都会被 皮甲 替代。 这套护甲由两件组成，初始制作和修理所需设施等级均为1。 奥丁兜帽 的耐久度为300， 奥丁披风 的耐久度为1500。两者可在 工作台 处制作和升级： 制作整套需要20个 皮革碎片 和8个 木炭 ，共提供2点护甲。制作满级整套需要80个 皮革碎片 和32个 木炭 ，共提供8点护甲。","en":"The Odin Set is a DLC armor set only available for the early supporters of Valheim via a Steam code sent out in an email from Iron Gate Studios to those who signed up for the Valheim Beta. It is the same tier as Rag Armor . Both sets are replaced by Leather armor . The set of armor has two pieces which have repairing and initial crafting level at 1. Hood of Oden has a durability of 300 and Cape of Oden has a durabil…","titleZh":"奥丁套装","titleEn":"Odin Set"},"p-81629dd6f277eebecea6.html":{"zh":"亚麻 可在 北境平原 的 地精村落 小块耕地或宝箱中找到，也可在 极北之地 的 废弃村落 内 木桶 中找到。 地精村落 耕地更常见 大麦 ，可能需搜索多个村庄。 亚麻只能用 耕地耙 在 北境平原 重新种植，成熟需4,000至5,000秒，即66分40秒至83分20秒，约游戏内2.22-2.78天。找到后建议尽快在安全地点留种。 成熟亚麻受武器伤害即可收获。 鹿角战锤 、 铁大锤 或 长柄战戟 副攻击等范围攻击可快速收割，不损失亚麻，但不提供 耕作技能 经验或触发额外产出。因此用 镰刀 或手动收获可能更高产。","en":"Flax is a material that can be found in Fuling Villages within the Plains biome, as a small patch of cultivated land or in chests, as well as in the Barrels inside the Abandoned Villages in the Deep North . It is more common to find Barley in cultivated spots in the Fuling Villages , so it may be necessary to search multiple villages.","titleZh":"亚麻","titleEn":"Flax"},"p-816e9a6b76bb85197818.html":{"zh":"青焰龙王 是第七位 首领 ，外形为焦黑的骸骨巨龙，身体孔洞和缝隙透出绿色光芒。","en":"Fader is the seventh boss . He appears as a charred, skeletal dragon which emanates a green glow from orifices and gaps in his body.","titleZh":"青焰龙王","titleEn":"Fader"},"p-817d479b464e35bf8ad2.html":{"zh":"灰烬齿轮 是在 灰烬之地 更新加入的物品，主要用于建造 投石机 。 只能用 传送门 - 石 传送，普通 传送门 无法传送。","en":"The Charred cogwheel is an item introduced in the Ashlands update and is used primarily to construct the Catapult . They can only be teleported by using the Portal Stone , not the regular Portal .","titleZh":"灰烬齿轮","titleEn":"Charred Cogwheel"},"p-81a37186696840131cbc.html":{"zh":"世界之树木材堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 世界之树木 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Yggdrasil Wood Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Yggdrasil Wood or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"世界之树木材堆","titleEn":"Yggdrasil Wood Stack"},"p-81ca00792c9790e33ef2.html":{"zh":"焰金属战斗神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Flametal Battle Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"焰金属战斗神像","titleEn":"Flametal Battle Idol"},"p-81d80473b87da072d8b4.html":{"zh":"北境鲑鱼 是 极北之地 生态区水域中的被动 生物 （ 鱼 ）。 可用钓竿配 冰霜鱼饵 捕获，鱼饵在 灶台 以20份 鱼饵 和一个 霜龙战利品 制作。 用于制作 钓鱼帽","en":"Northern salmon are passive creatures ( fish ) found in the waters of the Deep North biome. They can be caught with a fishing pole using Frosty fishing bait which can be made at the Food Preparation Table by combining 20 Fishing Bait and a Drake Trophy . Needed to craft a Fishing Hat","titleZh":"北境鲑鱼","titleEn":"Northern Salmon"},"p-81efe84f7d78a374de44.html":{"zh":"厄妖 是夜间在 极北之地 游荡的敌对生物，身上栖居着 蜿蜒隧道 。 有持灯笼和不持灯笼两种，攻击方式和掉落物不同。","en":"The Elaking is a hostile creature that roams around the Deep North at night, and is home to the Winding Tunnels . They come in two variants, with and without lantern. This change their attack patterns and drops.","titleZh":"厄妖","titleEn":"Elaking"},"p-821543256c5e9ebdd565.html":{"zh":"北境之剑 是一种 极北之地 级别的 剑 。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境之剑铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Sword is a Deep North -tier sword . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Sword and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境之剑","titleEn":"Nord Sword"},"p-82161fa2e260940cbbf5.html":{"zh":"银 防护 神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Silver Protection Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"银 防护 神像","titleEn":"Silver Protection Idol"},"p-82211bb8aaaf9a17f1da.html":{"zh":"雪铲 是用于清除 极北之地 积雪的工具，必须清雪后才能在当地地面上建造。 尽管 凛冽雪山 生物群系也覆盖着积雪，但那里不需要雪铲。 主要攻击消耗5点 耐力 。次要攻击消耗20点耐力，覆盖玩家周围全部方向（360度）。雪铲使用 耕作 技能。 雪铲只会清除极北之地的积雪。主要攻击清除两米半径内的积雪，次要攻击以更高强度清除三米半径内的积雪。两种攻击也都会清除建筑上积累的雪。","en":"The Snow Shovel is a tool used to clear snow in the Deep North , which is necessary to be able to build on the ground there. Despite the Mountain biome also being covered in snow, the Snow Shovel is not needed there. The primary attack costs 5 Stamina . The secondary attack costs 20 Stamina and reaches all around the player (360 degrees). The Snow Shovel uses the Farming skill.","titleZh":"雪铲","titleEn":"Snow Shovel"},"p-822cef620b4e4b52e6d2.html":{"zh":"棕色皮毛帽 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付200 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的黄铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Fur cap brown is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 200 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's brass chest .","titleZh":"棕色皮毛帽","titleEn":"Fur cap brown"},"p-82432259cb9a7ce6d819.html":{"zh":"肉酱 是一种 黑暗林山 级别的 食物 。","en":"Minced meat sauce is a Black Forest -tier food .","titleZh":"肉酱","titleEn":"Minced Meat Sauce"},"p-82a076d63fec3860f9ab.html":{"zh":"酿蘑菇 是一种 迷雾之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Stuffed Mushroom is a Mistlands -tier food .","titleZh":"酿蘑菇","titleEn":"Stuffed Mushroom"},"p-82c92710b240754f31a5.html":{"zh":"烘焙洋芋儿 是 极北之地 阶段提供埃达之能的 食物 。","en":"Baked Poteitr is a Deep North -tier Eitr food .","titleZh":"烘焙洋芋儿","titleEn":"Baked Poteitr"},"p-82e0da97aaccc783ff13.html":{"zh":"木炭窑 用于将木材烧成 木炭 。每15秒将一份 木材 、 细木 或 圆木 转化为1份木炭。 一次最多装入25份木材。添料时，会按以下顺序优先使用背包中的木材：","en":"The Charcoal Kiln is used to create Coal from wood. It converts single units of Wood , Finewood , or Corewood into coal at a rate of 1 every 15 seconds. It can hold up to 25 wood at a time. When adding wood to the kiln, the game will prioritize wood from the player inventory in the following order:","titleZh":"木炭窑","titleEn":"Charcoal Kiln"},"p-833327bd5d8c8f8a6be9.html":{"zh":"草原烤全猪 属于 青青草原 阶段的 宴席 。","en":"Whole Roasted Meadow Boar is the Meadows -tier Feast .","titleZh":"草原烤全猪","titleEn":"Whole Roasted Meadow Boar"},"p-83a642855d3701653086.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以140枚 钱币 购买5份 山顶胡椒粉 ，仅在击败 冰霜龙母 后出售。","en":"Mountain peak pepper powder can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 140 Coins for 5 powders. It is only sold after Moder has been defeated.","titleZh":"山顶胡椒粉","titleEn":"Mountain Peak Pepper Powder"},"p-83b4009eb50d67eff316.html":{"zh":"堕落战士 是 极北之地 中的敌对 生物 。","en":"Fallen Warriors are aggressive creatures found in the Deep North .","titleZh":"堕落战士","titleEn":"Fallen Warrior"},"p-84274968e74d5c84c593.html":{"zh":"松饼 是 极北之地 阶段提供耐力的 食物 。","en":"Pancakes are a Deep North -tier stamina food .","titleZh":"松饼","titleEn":"Pancakes"},"p-849ea0d7dafd6be1e0b4.html":{"zh":"奥丁 是 英灵神殿 中的 角色 。他是身披黑斗篷的神秘身影，只有一只发蓝光的眼睛，右手拄杖，现身时周围始终有微弱蓝色光环。","en":"Oden is a character found in Valheim . He is a mysterious black cloaked figure with a single glowing blue eye, holding a walking stick in his right hand. A faint blue aura persists around him as long as he remains.","titleZh":"奥丁","titleEn":"Oden"},"p-84c7dd9ff271cde93ffd.html":{"zh":"此为 矿石 的 分类 ，属于用于 制作 的原始 金属 。","en":"This is a category for ores which are a type of raw metal used for crafting .","titleZh":"分类：矿石","titleEn":"Category:Ores"},"p-851fa8afdd0ebcefd8bf.html":{"zh":"燧石矛 是第一种 矛 。","en":"Flint Spear is the first spear .","titleZh":"燧石矛","titleEn":"Flint Spear"},"p-858272134aab1e045d09.html":{"zh":"跳跃 是一种 技能 。","en":"Jumping is a skill .","titleZh":"跳跃（技能）","titleEn":"Jumping (skill)"},"p-859752ac3f8b88df5497.html":{"zh":"腐坏的肉 是一种消耗品。 食用腐肉会获得 感觉不舒服 效果，与 兔兔梅 相同，可用于更换 食物 。","en":"Rotten meat is a type of consumable. Consuming rotten meat gives the Feeling sick effect, the same as Bukeperries . It is useful to switch to different Foods .","titleZh":"腐坏的肉","titleEn":"Rotten Meat"},"p-85a8450116220944c355.html":{"zh":"金属切割器 用于升级 黑熔炉 。虽然黑熔炉随 迷雾之地 加入，但金属切割台需要 灰烬之地 生物群系的材料。","en":"The Metal cutter is used as an upgrade for the Black Forge . While the Black forge was introduced in Mistlands , the Metal cutter requires materials from the Ashlands biome.","titleZh":"金属切割器","titleEn":"Metal Cutter"},"p-85f46c63db9a98e0476d.html":{"zh":"此分类收录提供舒适度的床。","en":"This is a category for bed structures which provide comfort.","titleZh":"分类：床","titleEn":"Category:Beds"},"p-85fb49e051915a77ef6d.html":{"zh":"诺德 可指以下 极北之地 阶段诺德武器或盾牌：","en":"Nord may refer to one of the Deep North -tier Nord weapons and shields:","titleZh":"诺德","titleEn":"Nord"},"p-863da206cde41dc4550e.html":{"zh":"银制箭 是供弓使用的 弹药 。其穿刺伤害与 黑曜石箭 相同，但附加 灵魂 伤害。灵魂伤害并非对所有敌人都有效，因此它们并不是黑曜石箭的直接升级版本。","en":"Silver arrows are ammunition for bows. They have the same pierce damage as Obsidian Arrows but with added spirit damage. Spirit damage does not affect all enemies, so this is not a direct upgrade to obsidian arrows.","titleZh":"银制箭","titleEn":"Silver Arrow"},"p-8641b1aa063ce6e4ca83.html":{"zh":"巨人入侵 是与 极北之地 进度相关的特殊 活动 。","en":"The Jotun Invasions is a special Event linked to Deep North progression.","titleZh":"巨人侵略","titleEn":"Jotun Invasion"},"p-8667371f498ac13d37cf.html":{"zh":"废弃村落 也称 废弃农场 ，是在 青青草原 中发现的 地点 。通常包含2–5座建筑和几块破损菜地。 青青草原中独立的房屋请参阅 废弃房屋 ；若村庄由 尸鬼 占据，请参阅 尸鬼村落 。","en":"Abandoned Villages , also referred has Abandoned Farms , are Point of interest found in the Meadows . They commonly spawn with 2–5 buildings and a couple of broken garden plots. For lone houses found in the Meadows, see Abandoned House . See Draugr Village if Draugr inhabit the village.","titleZh":"废弃农场","titleEn":"Abandoned Farm"},"p-86c337f6a005a35e0880.html":{"zh":"Astrid 是在 英灵神殿 中提及的 角色 。","en":"Astrid is a mentioned character in Valheim .","titleZh":"Astrid","titleEn":"Astrid"},"p-86d9b272fe41188e1b48.html":{"zh":"红色黄麻窗帘 是装饰物，需要在 工作台 范围内建造。 冰霜洞穴 内也可找到红色黄麻窗帘，可将其破坏以获得 红色黄麻 。 蓝色和红色黄麻窗帘是仅有的提供2点舒适度的旗帜或窗帘。","en":"Red Jute Curtain is a decorative object. It needs to be built within the range of a Workbench . Red Jute Curtains can also be found inside Frost Caves , where they can be destroyed for their Red Jute . The blue and the red jute curtain are the only banners/curtains providing 2 comfort.","titleZh":"红色黄麻窗帘","titleEn":"Red Jute Curtain"},"p-8700ed7f6dfa19f5974d.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以100枚 钱币 购买50个 烛芯 。","en":"Candle wick can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 100 Coins for 50 items.","titleZh":"烛芯","titleEn":"Candle Wick"},"p-871cf7476fc46f9cf444.html":{"zh":"灰烬之鹫 是 灰烬之地 中的敌对生物。 秃鹫巢穴 会一次性生成 灰烬之鹫 。灰烬之鹫也可在灰烬之地沿岸水面上方飞行。","en":"Voltures are aggressive enemies found in the Ashlands . Volture nests will spawn Voltures one time. Voltures can also be found flying above the water along the Ashlands coast.","titleZh":"灰烬之鹫","titleEn":"Volture"},"p-873816691c3b6262a359.html":{"zh":"铁制胸针 是 幽暗沼泽 阶段饰品。","en":"The Iron Brooch is a Swamp -tier trinket.","titleZh":"铁制胸针","titleEn":"Iron Brooch"},"p-873db753df55b37f59b5.html":{"zh":"黄色珠饰上衣 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付550 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的青铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Beaded tunic yellow is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 550 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's bronze chest .","titleZh":"黄色珠饰上衣","titleEn":"Beaded tunic yellow"},"p-876ec659916ad521068f.html":{"zh":"连锁闪电 是用 堇青石 或 雷血精华 升级的武器触发的命中效果。","en":"Chain lightning is an on-hit effect triggered by weapons upgraded with Iolite or Thunderblood Essence .","titleZh":"连锁闪电","titleEn":"Chain lightning"},"p-879687ceb6851d62d031.html":{"zh":"蛊虫之后 是第六位 首领 ，是巨大的 邪蛛探索者 族母，外观与其他邪蛛明显不同。躯体像幼虫，类似邪蛛幼体，四条“手臂”均靠近头部，独特口部排列细小尖牙。与其他邪蛛共有的特征包括类似 邪蛛士兵 的大口钳、普通邪蛛的触角，以及两种邪蛛都有的稀薄细毛。","en":"The Queen is the sixth boss . She is a monstrous Seeker Matriarch, and her appearance differs substantially from other Seekers. Her body is larva-like (similar to Seeker Broods), her four \"arms\" are all located nearer to the head, and she has a distinctive mouth lined with small, sharp teeth. Some features she shares with other Seekers are a set of large mandibles like the Seeker Soldier , antennae like regular Seek…","titleZh":"蛊虫之后","titleEn":"The Queen"},"p-880d6fb8a599e8f2479e.html":{"zh":"蓝色简朴上衣 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付350 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的黄铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Simple tunic blue is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 350 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's brass chest .","titleZh":"蓝色简朴上衣","titleEn":"Simple tunic blue"},"p-883177524590266e875b.html":{"zh":"皮甲 是一套 青青草原 级别的 护甲 ，强于 碎布护甲 ，之后会被 巨魔套装 或 青铜护甲 替代。皮甲没有套装加成。","en":"Leather Armor is a Meadows -tier armor . It is superior to Rag Armor and is replaced by the Troll Set or Bronze Armor . There are no set bonus effects for leather armor.","titleZh":"皮甲","titleEn":"Leather Armor"},"p-88965e0ca8d0b69c9158.html":{"zh":"琵琶鱼 是 迷雾之地 近岸海域的沿海 鱼 。可用 鱼竿 配合 迷雾鱼饵 捕获；鱼饵可在 灶台 以20份 鱼饵 和一个 平原牦牛战利品 制作。","en":"Anglerfish are coastal fish found offshore the Mistlands . They can be caught with a Fishing Rod using Misty Fishing Bait which can be crafted at the Food Preparation Table by combining 20 Fishing Bait and a Lox Trophy .","titleZh":"琵琶鱼","titleEn":"Anglerfish"},"p-8899ecd1626db63dd12b.html":{"zh":"熔炉 是用于 建造 、 制作 和修复金属物品的 基础 设施。使用需要屋顶和70%的 遮蔽 。修复物品不消耗材料。","en":"Forges are base structures used for building , crafting and repairing metal items. They require a roof and 70% cover to be usable. Repairing items does not cost any resources.","titleZh":"熔炉","titleEn":"Forge"},"p-88aba2210f482e31d16d.html":{"zh":"北境复仇者 是一根 极北之地 血魔法 法杖。 施法时，北境复仇者会对玩家及5米半径内的所有盟友施加 复仇宝珠 。法术每级持续60秒，消耗100点 埃达之能 和玩家当前生命值的40%。 带有 复仇宝珠 的单位受到伤害时，会自动朝攻击者发射一枚反击弹体，造成固定的 冰霜 伤害。 与 佑护之杖 不同，北境复仇者不会吸收或降低受到的伤害。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境复仇者铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Northern Vengeance is a Deep North Blood magic staff. On cast the Northern Vengeance launches Vengeance Sphere on the player and all allies in a 5-meters radius. The spell lasts 60 seconds per levels, cost 100 Eitr and 40% of the player current health. When a unit with Vengeance Sphere receive damage, it automatically launches back a projectile toward the attacker dealing a fixed amount of Frost damage.","titleZh":"北境复仇者","titleEn":"Northern Vengeance"},"p-892d8219d44484ff7ea1.html":{"zh":"蛟龙鳞 是位于 无尽之海 的 材料 。","en":"Serpent scales are materials found in the Ocean .","titleZh":"蛟龙鳞","titleEn":"Serpent Scale"},"p-89a945cde38e3b7e6ca1.html":{"zh":"鱼竿 是用于 钓鱼 的工具。","en":"The Fishing Rod is a tool used for Fishing .","titleZh":"鱼竿","titleEn":"Fishing Rod"},"p-8a25041181016026fdd1.html":{"zh":"岩浆鱼 是 灰烬之地 生态区水域中的被动 生物 （ 鱼 ）。 可用钓竿配 热辣鱼饵 捕获，鱼饵在 灶台 以20份 鱼饵 和一个 灰烬战士战利品 制作。 用于制作 钓鱼帽","en":"Magmafish are passive creatures ( fish ) found in the waters of the Ashlands biome. They can be caught with a fishing pole using Hot fishing bait which can be made at the Food Preparation Table by combining 20 Fishing Bait and a Warrior trophy . Needed to craft a Fishing Hat","titleZh":"岩浆鱼","titleEn":"Magmafish"},"p-8a27b0cad26bc97071ab.html":{"zh":"世界修改器 可定制参数增减挑战，位于加入世界界面，也可 专用服务器 命令行或 游戏内F5控制台 开发命令设置。 除参数滑块，还有简单、困难、硬核、休闲、锤子及沉浸预设。 改难度不阻止 成就 ，仅部分成就要求特定修正，详下 § 成就 。","en":"World Modifiers allow the player to customize a variety of parameters to increase or decrease the challenge of the game. They can be found on the Join World screen. Modifiers can also be set on a dedicated server via command line, or using devcommands in the in-game F5 console . As well as sliders for each of the changeable parameters, there are also a selection of difficulty presets: Easy, Hard, Hardcore, Casual, H…","titleZh":"世界修改器","titleEn":"World Modifiers"},"p-8a925df9f049ff4ed5d8.html":{"zh":"战利品 是击败 生物 掉落的 物品 ，堆叠20。","en":"Trophies are items dropped by defeated creatures and can stack to 20.","titleZh":"战利品","titleEn":"Trophies"},"p-8acc99b3a7721f0aa451.html":{"zh":"刀 是一类 武器 。 刀攻击速度快，攻击范围短，耐力消耗低。 刀对未警觉的敌人造成6x伤害，而大多数其他武器为3x。","en":"Knives are a weapon class. Knives have fast attacks with short range and low stamina cost. Knives deal 6x damage against unalerted enemies, whereas most other weapons do 3x.","titleZh":"刀","titleEn":"Knives"},"p-8b110a049214c6d8c310.html":{"zh":"余烬 是击杀 青焰龙王 后获取的材料，限制进入 极北之地 的进度；该区域本可在更早时候抵达。","en":"Embers are a material obtainable after killing Fader . It gates the progression into the Deep North , which can otherwise be accessed earlier in the game.","titleZh":"余烬","titleEn":"Embers"},"p-8b4c3701309d7b4b5735.html":{"zh":"弩炮弹药 是可由 弩炮 发射的物品。没有弹药时，无法装填弩炮。","en":"Missiles are items that can be shot by the Ballista . Ballistae cannot be armed without missiles.","titleZh":"弩炮弹药","titleEn":"Missiles"},"p-8bdbeb7e6f8dda986454.html":{"zh":"铁骨腕饰 是一种 北境平原 级别的 饰物 。","en":"Bracelets of the Brave is a Plains -tier trinket .","titleZh":"铁骨腕饰","titleEn":"Bracelets of the Brave"},"p-8c032098bf9f19b9834b.html":{"zh":"鱼和面包 是一种 迷雾之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Fish 'n' Bread is a Mistlands -tier food .","titleZh":"鱼和面包","titleEn":"Fish 'n' Bread"},"p-8c0453320ff81336c4bc.html":{"zh":"苦难之碑 是 灰烬之地 中的 生物生成点 。 纪念碑可生成 灰烬战士 ，概率17%，及 灰烬僵尸 ，概率83%。 生成的焦黑生物有4%概率为1星，0.2%概率为2星。 玩家进入60米内时纪念碑激活，每10秒尝试在4米内生成生物。","en":"The Monument of Torment is a creature spawner found in the Ashlands . The Monument can spawn Charred Warrior (17% chance) and Charred Twitcher (83% chance). Spawned Charred have a 4% chance to be 1-star and a 0.2% chance to be 2-star. The Monument activates when there is a player within 60 meters. The Monument attempts to spawn within 4 meters every 10 seconds.","titleZh":"苦难之碑","titleEn":"Monument of Torment"},"p-8c2754a7524f4f062915.html":{"zh":"小份治疗蜜酒 是一种 黑暗林山 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：小份治疗 发酵 而成。","en":"Minor healing mead is a Black Forest -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Minor healing .","titleZh":"小份治疗蜜酒","titleEn":"Minor Healing Mead"},"p-8c578ed3e9d5fec6f0f1.html":{"zh":"巨熊 是 黑暗林山 中的敌对生物，体形壮硕、毛发浓密，爪牙巨大。","en":"Bears are aggressive creatures found in the Black Forest . They are bulky, furry beasts with large claws and teeth.","titleZh":"巨熊","titleEn":"Bear"},"p-8c5db7faa13a10f0f375.html":{"zh":"根须王冠 是一件护甲部件。 玩家击败 扭曲者 后， 沼泽女巫 会以3000 钱币 的价格出售它。 根须王冠只提供1点护甲，没有其他已知效果，主要用于装饰。","en":"Crown of Roots is an armor piece. It is sold by The Bog Witch for 3000 coins , after the player defeated a Writhan . The Crown of Roots gives only 1 armor and has no other known effects, it is mainly a cosmetic piece.","titleZh":"根须王冠","titleEn":"Crown of Roots"},"p-8c6a9c05a436d29ecc5a.html":{"zh":"阿斯克套装 是一套灰烬之地级别的 护甲 ，比 甲壳护甲 和 埃达织物套装 高一级。其护甲值低于 焰金属护甲 ，但高于 恩布拉套装 ，因此应视为“中甲”。穿戴全部三件可获得 阿斯克之忍 套装加成，减少奔跑、跳跃和攻击的耐力消耗，并提供+10%的 穿刺 伤害。","en":"The Ask Set is an Ashlands-tier armor . This set is one tier above Carapace Armor and the Eitr-weave Set , and should be considered a \"medium armor,\" as it has a lower armor value than Flametal Armor , but a higher armor value than the Embla Set . Wearing all three pieces provides the Ask's Endurance set bonus, reducing stamina usage from running, jumping, and attacking, and providing +10% Pierce damage.","titleZh":"阿斯克套装","titleEn":"Ask Set"},"p-8ca9fed624e61c18088b.html":{"zh":"可用 耕地耙 种植 芜菁种子 ，长成1x 芜菁 。","en":"Turnip seeds can be planted using the Cultivator in order to grow 1x Turnip .","titleZh":"芜菁种子","titleEn":"Turnip Seeds"},"p-8cbcddb340a7a34f4f6b.html":{"zh":"岩石尖塔 是在 迷雾之地 发现的 地点 。 极高岩石结构，由连续阶地及多个 矮人路哨 组成。","en":"Rock Spire is a Point of interest found in Mistlands . It is a very high rocky formation made up of a succession of terraces and multiple Dvergr Road Post .","titleZh":"岩石尖塔","titleEn":"Rock Spire"},"p-8cc03a50da5b93a777e8.html":{"zh":"此分类收录已移除内容。","en":"This category is for content that has been removed from the game.","titleZh":"分类：已移除内容","titleEn":"Category:Removed"},"p-8cc8df2f762d0ef75c17.html":{"zh":"银刀 是第四种 刀 。","en":"Silver Knife is the fourth knife .","titleZh":"银刀","titleEn":"Silver Knife"},"p-8d14f6e72de8f18ab1ee.html":{"zh":"随机事件会在玩家周围生成大量敌人。随着击败首领、推进世界进度，更难的事件会出现。根据使用的世界修正设置，事件可依据世界进度或玩家进度触发；默认采用世界进度。 大多数事件需要玩家留在正在进行的事件区域内，直至计时结束才能结束。若事件区域内没有玩家，计时暂停，“你正在被追猎……”事件除外。 每46分钟有20%概率触发随机事件；","en":"Randomly happening events cause lots of enemies to spawn around the players. Progressing in the game world by defeating bosses causes harder events to appear. Events can be world-based or player-based depending on the world modifier settings in use. World-based events are the default mode. For most events to end, a player must stay in the active event area until the timer runs out. The event timer is paused if there…","titleZh":"事件","titleEn":"Events"},"p-8d406e8ddc75cd437d40.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 战利品","en":"Pages in category Trophies","titleZh":"分类：战利品","titleEn":"Category:Trophies"},"p-8d42760b47c705e0f237.html":{"zh":"废墟塔楼 可指多个 生态区域 中的各种 地点 地点，外形像部分损毁石塔。 位于 青青草原 ，仅木墙建成，二层宝箱含多种战利品。 位于 黑暗林山 ，较完整石塔带木门，门前木桶。侧面可能有指向 古树长老的 祭坛的符文石，由一群 灰矮人 守卫。 塔内楼梯下有战利品宝箱，门前木桶打破也掉多种材料。 位于 黑暗林山 ，石塔半毁，多只 骷髅怪 守卫，顶部可能有宝箱。 位于 黑暗林山 ，几乎全毁仅留地基。中央战利品宝箱由一群 灰矮人 守卫，偶尔有野生蜂巢。 位于 幽暗沼泽 ，多种以圆塔为主的变体，部分由 尸堆 守卫，部分顶部带小屋，可作临时基地或前哨。 位于 幽暗沼泽 ，半毁圆塔带指向 邪骨恶灵 祭坛的符文石，其前有 尸体堆 。 位于 凛冽雪山 ，大小不同，可比其他塔废墟大得多，通常有较完整塔。可找 骷髅怪 ，偶尔 冰霜龙母 导向符文石 。","en":"A Ruined tower can refer to various points point of interest found in several biomes . They look like partially destroyed stone towers. Found on the Meadows biome, built solely with wooden walls. The second floor has a chest containing various loot. Found on the Black Forest biome, a somewhat complete stone tower with a wooden door and a barrel in front of it. It can also have a rune stone on its side that points to…","titleZh":"废墟塔楼","titleEn":"Ruined Tower"},"p-8d7b2e4882044d922d62.html":{"zh":"腐臭遗骸 是 诡秘墓穴 中的敌对 生物 。如名称所示，它们是死后复生的人类骸骨。腐臭遗骸也比普通 骷髅怪 略大且更强，攻击会施加毒素。","en":"Rancid remains are aggressive creatures found in Burial Chambers . They are, as their name suggests, human skeletal remains which have since been resurrected from the dead. Rancid remains are also slightly larger and stronger than regular Skeletons . Their hits inflict poison.","titleZh":"腐臭遗骸","titleEn":"Rancid Remains"},"p-8dbd6bbd219b7a580789.html":{"zh":"斧 是与 斧 武器相关的 技能 。","en":"Axes is a skill related to the Axes weapons.","titleZh":"斧（技能）","titleEn":"Axes (skill)"},"p-8de95317fe2979a35071.html":{"zh":"糖霜甜甜包 是 北境平原 阶段的均衡型 食物 。","en":"Frosted Sweetbread is a Plains -tier balanced food .","titleZh":"糖霜甜甜包","titleEn":"Frosted Sweetbread"},"p-8df50a2a4af355935eba.html":{"zh":"芜菁肉汤 是一种 泥泞沼泽 级别的 食物 。","en":"Turnip stew is a Swamp -tier food .","titleZh":"芜菁肉汤","titleEn":"Turnip Stew"},"p-8e062471b1c989e54bcb.html":{"zh":"巨魔鱼 是 黑暗林山 近岸水域中的被动 生物 （ 鱼 ）。 钓竿配 苔藓鱼饵 捕获，鱼饵在 灶台 以20份 鱼饵 及一个 巨魔战利品 制作。 用于制作 钓鱼帽","en":"Trollfish are passive creatures ( fish ) found in the waters just offshore of the Black Forest biome. They can be caught with a fishing pole using Mossy fishing bait , which can be crafted at the Food Preparation Table by combining 20 Fishing Bait and a Troll Trophy . Needed to craft a Fishing Hat","titleZh":"巨魔鱼","titleEn":"Trollfish"},"p-8e2663d71683c75f715b.html":{"zh":"矮人高架桥 是 迷雾之地 中由 黑大理石 建成的结构，含1至3根柱子，内部由 铁牢地板 2x2 和 铁牢栅栏 2x2 构成。","en":"Dvergr viaducts are structure made of Black Marble found in the Mistlands . They have from 1 to 3 pillars and an internal structure made of Cage Floor 2x2 and Cage Wall 2x2 .","titleZh":"矮人高架桥","titleEn":"Dvergr viaduct"},"p-8e48fba7d83f5eb6ee71.html":{"zh":"普通烟花 可向 希尔德 购买，每个50枚 钱币 ，交还 希尔德的青铜宝箱 后才会出售。","en":"Basic fireworks are items which can be purchased from Hildir for 50 Coins each. This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's bronze chest .","titleZh":"普通烟花","titleEn":"Basic fireworks"},"p-8e7b7dcfe4cf86e9bc6e.html":{"zh":"雷血宝剑 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境宝剑 得到的版本。 它获得额外的 劈砍 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境宝剑在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thunderblood Greatsword is a version of Nord Greatsword upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra Slash and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Greatsword will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷血宝剑","titleEn":"Thunderblood Greatsword"},"p-8e7f84dc1e0751430df8.html":{"zh":"巨魔皮 是主要从被击败 巨魔 获取的蓝色皮。","en":"Troll hide is the recovered blue hide from, mainly, defeated Trolls .","titleZh":"巨魔皮","titleEn":"Troll Hide"},"p-8e80b2b4b22af3a71ca0.html":{"zh":"古钟 是用于召唤 灰烬之地 首领 青焰龙王 的物品。 用从 灰烬亡灵堡垒 获得的3份 古钟碎片 ，在 黑熔炉 处制作古钟。 召唤青焰龙王需要三口古钟，共9份古钟碎片。","en":"A Bell is an item used to summon the Ashlands boss Fader . Bells are crafted at the Black Forge using 3 Bell Fragments obtained from Charred Fortresses . Three bells are used to summon Fader, requiring a total of 9 bell fragments.","titleZh":"古钟","titleEn":"Bell"},"p-8f1913f50e8a3aa0c0dd.html":{"zh":"毒针 是 北境平原 生物群系 中 杀人蜂 掉落的制作材料，也可在 地精村落 及 地精废墟 宝箱中找到。","en":"Needle is a crafting material dropped from Deathsquitoes in the Plains biome . It can also be found in chests in Fuling Villages and Fuling Ruins .","titleZh":"毒针","titleEn":"Needle"},"p-8fc676d1663b858994bc.html":{"zh":"燕麦粥 是一种 极北之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Oatmeal is a Deep North -tier food .","titleZh":"燕麦粥","titleEn":"Oatmeal"},"p-9003d53b2bb27008b8ed.html":{"zh":"佑护之杖 是 迷雾之地 更新加入的四种 魔法 武器之一。主要用途是在施法者及其身旁的其他玩家和已驯服生物周围生成保护屏障。施法除需要60点 埃达之能 外，还会消耗施法者当前 生命值 的最多40%（ 不是 最大生命值）。与其他魔法武器一样，它没有次要能力。 屏障吸收的伤害量很大程度上取决于施法者的 血魔法 技能等级：等级0时基础吸收量为200，每级增加5，等级100时最高可吸收700点伤害。同样，施法消耗的生命值和所需埃达之能都受血魔法等级影响：等级100时，两者均减少1/3。 法杖每级提供一分钟的护盾持续时间。","en":"Staff of Protection is one of four Magic weapons introduced in the Mistlands update. Its primary use creates a protective barrier around the caster, as well as other players and tamed creatures next to the user. In addition to requiring 60 Eitr to be cast, the caster will lose up to 40% of their current Health ( not their maximum health). Like the other magic weapons, it has no secondary ability.","titleZh":"佑护之杖","titleEn":"Staff of Protection"},"p-9048ee852ad9fd0a254a.html":{"zh":"沼泽钥匙 是击败 古树长老 后的掉落物，用于开启 幽暗沼泽 生态区域 中的 地下圣堂 。","en":"Swamp key is an item dropped from The Elder after defeating him. It is used to open Sunken Crypts in Swamp biomes .","titleZh":"沼泽钥匙","titleEn":"Swamp Key"},"p-90710e8a3a0e7b87e3a7.html":{"zh":"煎饼 可能指两种对象之一： 极北之地 级别的食物：","en":"Pancake may refer to one of two Deep North -tier foods:","titleZh":"煎饼","titleEn":"Pancake"},"p-907bdf2f550bb0b4237e.html":{"zh":"商人 是以 钱币 出售物品的 友善角色 ，也可用贵重物品换金币。 有三个商人:","en":"Traders are NPCs that sell items in exchange for Coins . They can also exchange valuables for coins. There are three traders:","titleZh":"商人","titleEn":"Trader"},"p-90c35a37232354a16cc5.html":{"zh":"这是 血魔法 的 分类 ，它属于一种 魔法 。","en":"This is a category for blood magic which is a type of magic .","titleZh":"分类：血魔法","titleEn":"Category:Blood magic"},"p-914164a5c1139a096548.html":{"zh":"盖尔哈法 是 哀啸之穴 内 凛冽雪山 中的敌对小首领。外形与 狂信徒 完全相同，但皮毛为白色，披风为带红色调的黑色。","en":"Geirrhafa is an aggressive miniboss found in Mountains inside Howling Cavern . He looks exactly like a Cultist , but his fur is white and his cloak is black with red tints.","titleZh":"盖尔哈法","titleEn":"Geirrhafa"},"p-915851ca924f23befcaf.html":{"zh":"鲳鱼 是 凛冽雪山 生态区 冰霜洞穴 底部极罕见湖泊中的被动 生物 （ 鱼 ）。 用 鱼竿 配 冷鱼饵 捕获，鱼饵在 灶台 以20份 鱼饵 及一个 芬里战利品 制作。 用于制作 钓鱼帽 。","en":"Tetra are passive creatures ( fish ) found in the super-rare lakes at the bottom of Frost Caves of the Mountain biome. They can be caught with a Fishing Rod using Cold Fishing Bait which can be crafted at the Food Preparation Table by combining 20 Fishing Bait and a Fenring Trophy . It is needed to craft a Fishing Hat .","titleZh":"鲳鱼","titleEn":"Tetra"},"p-9176f0e37d1cac2c7e9c.html":{"zh":"半埋藏墓穴 是未使用的 黑暗林山 地点，是 诡秘墓穴 的开放世界变体，由半埋墓穴房间组成。","en":"The Half-buried Burial Chambers is an unused Black Forest location. It is an open world variant of the Burial Chambers made from half-buried crypt rooms.","titleZh":"半埋藏墓穴","titleEn":"Half-buried Burial Chambers"},"p-91a302e0c4bd935e64e5.html":{"zh":"青铜锤 是第二种单手 棍棒 。","en":"Bronze Mace is the second one-handed club .","titleZh":"青铜锤","titleEn":"Bronze Mace"},"p-91c0ad2e8db8219f0845.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 黑金属 黑金属碎片 血金 青铜 灰烬齿轮 铜 铜矿 铜碎屑 龙蛋 矮人提取器 焰金属 焰金属矿 希尔德的宝箱 铁 铁矿 铁火炉 机械弹簧 石化组织 青铜废料 废铁 银 银矿 锡 锡矿","en":"Pages in category Black Metal Black Metal Scrap Bloodgold Bronze Charred Cogwheel Copper Copper Ore Copper Scrap Dragon Egg Dvergr Extractor Flametal Flametal Ore Hildir's Chests Iron Iron Ore Iron Pit Mechanical Spring Petrified Tissue Scrap Bronze Scrap Iron Silver Silver Ore Tin Tin Ore","titleZh":"分类：不可传送物品","titleEn":"Category:Can't be Teleported"},"p-91cdb651ff27f3964d0d.html":{"zh":"切石机 是 基础 设施，用于制作 磨刀石 ，以及建造 石制结构 、 黑色大理石结构 、 灰石结构 等石制构件。修复石制建筑也需要它。 制作需要屋顶和70%的 遮蔽 ；建造构件不需要屋顶或遮蔽。","en":"Stonecutters are base structures used for crafting Sharpening Stones and building Stone Structures , Black Marble Structures , Grausten Structures and other stone based building elements. They are also needed to repair stone structures. Crafting requires a roof and 70% cover . Building structures does not require a roof or any cover.","titleZh":"切石机","titleEn":"Stonecutter"},"p-91d49c01d271ef58860d.html":{"zh":"熔炉工具架 用于升级 熔炉 ，必须放在墙壁或屋顶上。 工具架使熔炉等级提高1。","en":"The Forge toolrack is used as an upgrade for the Forge . It must be placed on a wall or roof. The toolrack increases the forge level by 1.","titleZh":"熔炉工具架","titleEn":"Forge Toolrack"},"p-91d529d6eb40fef0534d.html":{"zh":"冰火战斧 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境战斧 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 劈砍 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境战斧在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。 主要攻击为3连击，最后一击造成双倍伤害。次要攻击是缓慢但强力的过顶劈砍，非常适合清除位置过低、普通挥砍无法命中的树桩。","en":"Frostfire Axe is a version of Nord Axe upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of Slash damage in exchange of a larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. An upgraded Nord Axe will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences. Its primary attack is a 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit. Its secondary attack is a slow but powerful overhead swing. This is perfect for…","titleZh":"冰火战斧","titleEn":"Frostfire Axe"},"p-91f31ad59dc47d5c7bd5.html":{"zh":"唤灵法杖 是一根 极北之地 血魔法 召唤法杖。 唤灵法杖可以召唤 巨熊 、 驼鹿 、 狼 和 鬓猪 的灵体版本。与对应的野生生物相比，它们的生命值和伤害更高，外观呈透明的紫色。 每种生物的召唤数量上限等于唤灵法杖等级：等级1时每种一个，等级2时每种两个，以此类推。每次施法都会随机选择下一次召唤的生物类型；若该类型已达上限，施法就会失败。因此，要将四种类型全部召唤至上限，可能需要施法很多次。 召唤生物会跟随召唤它的玩家。若距离该玩家超过150米，或玩家离开游戏120秒后，召唤物会消失。 每次施法消耗100点 埃达之能 和40%的 生命值 。持握该法杖时，移动速度降低5%。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先在等级3的 古咒法台 处制作对应的 唤灵法杖铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化，耗时50秒。它在 古咒法台 处升级：品质2需要设施等级4，品质4需要设施等级6。该法杖的 潜能熔炉 强化使用 血金战斗神像 。","en":"Spirit Caller is a Deep North Blood magic summoning staff. The Spirit Caller can summon Spirit versions of Bear , Moose , Wolf and Boar . These creatures have increased Health and damage compared to their wild counterparts. They have a transparent violet hue. The maximum number of summons for each creature type is equal to the Spirit Caller's level: one of each type at level 1, two of each at level 2, and so on. On…","titleZh":"唤灵法杖","titleEn":"Spirit Caller"},"p-91f9f70df0cdcd9e5be3.html":{"zh":"毒箭 是供弓使用的 弹药 。大多数箭以穿刺伤害为主，也可能像 银制箭 一样附带次要伤害。不过，毒箭的伤害主要来自 毒素 持续伤害效果，穿刺伤害反而较少。","en":"Poison arrows are ammunition for bows. Most arrows' damage comes primarily from their pierce damage, with potential secondary damage, like Silver Arrows . However, poison arrows' damage primarily comes from their damage over time poison effect, with pierce damage being the lesser.","titleZh":"毒箭","titleEn":"Poison Arrow"},"p-92041933936d20a6d315.html":{"zh":"黄色绳结头巾 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付250 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的白银宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Tied headscarf yellow is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 250 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's silver chest .","titleZh":"黄色绳结头巾","titleEn":"Tied headscarf yellow"},"p-9207c13686070ccc5130.html":{"zh":"建造和修复 灰石结构 需要 灰石 ，且附近必须有 切石机 。","en":"Grausten structures require Grausten and the proximity of a stonecutter to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"灰石结构","titleEn":"Grausten Structures"},"p-92375f997ffe65ab7f04.html":{"zh":"要了解目前正在开发的内容，请阅读未来内容页面！ 以下更新 已列入名单 原始2021路线图：","en":"To check out what is currently being worked on, please read the future content page! The following updates were listed on the original 2021 Roadmap:","titleZh":"路线图","titleEn":"Roadmap"},"p-929a2b40551ead4abd16.html":{"zh":"布伦娜 是 阴燃之墓 内 黑暗林山 及“她紧追着你！” 事件 中的敌对小头目。她是燃烧的 骷髅怪 ，骨骼炭黑，带火焰特征，挥舞火焰版 克罗姆 。 发音相近的瑞典语“bränna”意为“燃烧”。","en":"Brenna is an aggressive miniboss found in the Black Forest inside Smouldering Tomb as well as during the \"She's hot on your tail!\" event . She is a burning Skeleton with charcoal black bones and fire aspects wielding a fiery version of Krom . The Swedish word \"bränna\", with similar pronunciation, means \"to burn\".","titleZh":"布伦娜","titleEn":"Brenna"},"p-92abadfd417d43f4ae1d.html":{"zh":"海豹皮地毯 是用 海豹毛皮 制作的 极北之地 兽皮毯 。放在附近提高一点 舒适度 ，属于地毯舒适度组，不与其他兽皮毯或地毯叠加。","en":"Sealskin Rug is a Deep North rug made from Seal Pelts . It increases Comfort by one when placed nearby; it belongs to the carpet comfort group, so it does not stack with other rugs or carpets.","titleZh":"海豹皮地毯","titleEn":"Sealskin Rug"},"p-92ff88ccd7b498dcebf6.html":{"zh":"黑金属 是一种可建造设施，可储存 黑金属 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Black Metal is a buildable structure that is used to store Black Metal or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"黑金属堆","titleEn":"Black Metal Stack"},"p-93064cdf4f97e90ef521.html":{"zh":"金币叠 是可建造设施，用于储存 钱币 或装饰。","en":"Coin Pile is a buildable structure that is used to store Coins or for decoration.","titleZh":"金币叠","titleEn":"Coin Pile"},"p-9370da30ce01f9205f06.html":{"zh":"液态冰霜 是用于为 冰霜铸造所 提供燃料的消耗品。","en":"Liquid Frost is a consumable used to fuel the Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"液态冰霜","titleEn":"Liquid Frost"},"p-93ce372f4a0b81294581.html":{"zh":"上古种子 是击杀 灰矮人暴徒 和摧毁 灰矮人巢穴 掉落的物品。","en":"Ancient seeds are items dropped by killing Greydwarf Brutes and destroying Greydwarf Nests .","titleZh":"上古种子","titleEn":"Ancient Seed"},"p-941720cb206e9e4c85d3.html":{"zh":"获取方式 在 诡秘墓穴 掉落来源 焰灵 回收已占领 地精村落 中 篝火 的材料。 破坏或回收自然生成 矮人灯笼 时有概率获得。 用途 建材 攻城锤 高炉 篝火 木炭窑 传送门 冶炼炉 石砌烤炉 守护石 制作 矮人灯笼 盾牌核心 余烬之杖 杂项 烟花","en":"Availability In Burial Chambers Dropped by Surtlings Recycling the materials of bonfires in captured Fuling Villages . Chance from destroying/recycling naturally spawned Dvergr Lanterns Usage Building Battering Ram Blast Furnace Bonfire Charcoal Kiln Portal Smelter Stone Oven Ward Crafting Dvergr Lantern Shield Core Staff of Embers Miscellaneous Fireworks","titleZh":"焰灵之核","titleEn":"Surtling Core"},"p-9428317ccd76e32daef4.html":{"zh":"狼牙棒 是第五种单手 棍棒 。 钝击 和 穿刺 伤害 伤害的组合使它难以充分利用敌人的弱点，因为大多数弱于钝击的目标会抵抗穿刺，反之亦然。不过，这也让狼牙棒对大多数敌人的伤害输出较为稳定，因为敌人要么对两者都没有抗性或弱点，要么对其中一种承受更多伤害、对另一种承受更少伤害。","en":"Porcupine is the fifth one-handed club . Its combination of blunt and pierce damage makes it struggle to take advantage of weaknesses, as most things that are weak to blunt resist pierce, and vice versa; however, this also gives the Porcupine consistent damage output against most enemies because they will be neutral to both or take more from one and less from the other.","titleZh":"狼牙棒","titleEn":"Porcupine"},"p-947829bc03f09c7bc144.html":{"zh":"丰收之裙 与 草帽 组成一套服装，同时穿戴两件时，玩家的 耕作技能 增加+25。 丰收上衣 可以代替连衣裙，提供相同效果。取回 黄铜宝箱 并交给 希尔德 后，即可向她购买。","en":"Harvest Dress is a part of a set together with Straw Hat that increases the player's Farming skill by +25 so long as both pieces are worn. The Harvest Tunic can be used in place of the dress for the same effect. It is sold by Hildir after retrieving and bringing her the Brass Chest .","titleZh":"丰收之裙","titleEn":"Harvest Dress"},"p-94a374c69dfcd83340c1.html":{"zh":"深渊剃刀 是第三种 刀 。","en":"Abyssal Razor is the third knife .","titleZh":"深渊剃刀","titleEn":"Abyssal Razor"},"p-9530bfe0e8d8b57314e7.html":{"zh":"洞穴 可能指以下地牢之一：","en":"Cave may refer to one of the following dungeons:","titleZh":"洞穴","titleEn":"Cave"},"p-9531904bea0cd6a43951.html":{"zh":"这是 弩箭 的 分类 ，它们是一种供 弩 使用的弹药。","en":"This is a category for bolts which are a type of ammunition for crossbows .","titleZh":"分类：弩箭","titleEn":"Category:Bolts"},"p-9555cb438b768818f92d.html":{"zh":"猎户弓 是第三种 弓 ，在 铁器时代 阶段制作。 它攻击和命中时比其他弓更安静，只产生四米范围的 噪声 。","en":"Huntsman Bow is the third bow and made during the Iron Age . It is more silent compared to other bows with attacking and hitting, only creating four meters of noise .","titleZh":"猎户弓","titleEn":"Huntsman Bow"},"p-9579745d5beb9038910d.html":{"zh":"秃鹫巢穴 是 灰烬之地 中的 地点 。 巢附近最多4只 灰烬之鹫 初始生成，概率分别100%、75%、50%、25%。不重生，巢不是 生物生成点 。 巢下藏最多6个 灰烬之鹫蛋 ，每个50%概率。 周围最多6个 灰烬刚鬣腐尸 ，首个100%，其余50%。","en":"The Volture Nest is a Point of interest found in the Ashlands . Up to 4 Voltures spawn initially close to a Volture Nest with a 100%, 75%, 50% and 25% chance, respectively. These Voltures do not respawn, the Volture nest is not a Creature spawner . Up to 6 Volture eggs can be found hidden below the nest, with a 50% chance to spawn each.","titleZh":"秃鹫巢穴","titleEn":"Volture Nest"},"p-95b953f5fa03892ae459.html":{"zh":"滋滋莓果汤 是 灰烬之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Sizzling Berry Broth is an Ashlands -tier food.","titleZh":"滋滋莓果汤","titleEn":"Sizzling Berry Broth"},"p-95c1a4897c327f140f96.html":{"zh":"火焰 是靠近热源获得的 状态效果 ，移除 寒冷 和 冻僵 ，并使 潮湿 消退速度提高至10倍。 附近无敌对 生物 时，具有火源效果并坐下，会开始 休息中 ， 舒适度 等级为1。但处于 庇护 后，火源效果不再额外提供舒适度；火源与庇护共同允许不坐下也休息，庇护至少提供舒适度2。仅篝火和壁炉会在火源之外额外提供舒适度，分别为1和2。","en":"Fire is a status effect granted when in close proximity to a heat source. It removes Cold and Freezing effects as well as reduces the duration of the Wet effect 10 times faster. If there are no hostile creatures nearby, sitting while having the fire effect will cause the player to begin Resting , with a comfort level of 1. Once the player is under Shelter however, the fire effect no longer provides additional comfor…","titleZh":"火(效果)","titleEn":"Fire (effect)"},"p-96151cf5701a65816d5d.html":{"zh":"鳞皮 由 迷雾之地 生态区域 的 野兔 掉落。","en":"Scale hide is a drop from Hares in Mistlands biomes .","titleZh":"鳞皮","titleEn":"Scale Hide"},"p-96256f81b664a8e26bcc.html":{"zh":"铜碎屑 可在 冶炼炉 精炼为 铜 。","en":"Copper Scrap can be refined into Copper in a Smelter .","titleZh":"铜碎屑","titleEn":"Copper Scrap"},"p-96594bdffd3ae74a6eee.html":{"zh":"余烬泡泡 是一种可生吃的均衡型 灰烬之地 阶段食物，可用于多种配方。","en":"Smoke puff is a raw balanced Ashlands -tier food which is used in various recipes.","titleZh":"余烬泡泡","titleEn":"Smoke Puff"},"p-967d8dc9bad11687f87e.html":{"zh":"种子 是可收集种植的 物品 ，形成持续 蔬菜 农田供食用。","en":"Seeds are items that players can collect and grow, allowing them to create fields of sustainable vegetables to eat.","titleZh":"分类：种子","titleEn":"Category:Seeds"},"p-96c0727e4b1222ae05e3.html":{"zh":"栅栏 可能指：","en":"Fence may refer to:","titleZh":"栅栏","titleEn":"Fence"},"p-98348a90362db8bb804d.html":{"zh":"棍棒 是一类 武器 。 棍棒主要造成 钝击 伤害，击退效果较强。棍棒的击退使玩家能够与敌人保持距离，并足以将部分敌人推出其有效攻击范围。","en":"Clubs is a weapon class. Clubs primarily deal blunt damage and feature high knockback. The knockback from clubs allows the player to keep enemies at arms' length and is sufficient to displace some enemies out of their effective attack range.","titleZh":"棍棒","titleEn":"Clubs"},"p-989455de321081e48a32.html":{"zh":"石砌烤炉 用于烘烤已经准备好的未熟食物。 烤炉有两个入口，下方加 木材 ，上方放配方食材。最多装10份木材，同时烘烤四件物品。每份木材作为燃料持续2000秒，约33分钟，装满可燃烧约五个半小时。点燃时会冒烟，烘烤约需50秒，超过100秒则变成 木炭 。","en":"The Stone Oven is used to cook prepped uncooked foods. The oven has two inputs. The lower input is for Wood and the upper input is for the recipe ingredient. It can hold 10 wood and bake up to four items at once. Each wood lasts 2000 seconds, or about 33 minutes as fuel, meaning a fully fuelled stone oven will burn for approximately five and a half hours, before running out of fuel. Smoke is emitted while it's lit.…","titleZh":"石砌烤炉","titleEn":"Stone Oven"},"p-98a0cffc58c978ab87e5.html":{"zh":"敲克力冰沙 是一种 泥泞沼泽 级别的 食物 。","en":"Muckshake is a Swamp -tier food .","titleZh":"敲克力冰沙","titleEn":"Muckshake"},"p-98aaa88ba645d6ae6a11.html":{"zh":"雷托领主 是 灰烬之地 中的 小首领 ，属于制作 火龙剑 的支线任务。 可在地下城 雷托领主之墓 中找到他。依次追踪3处 指路符文 可获知地下城位置，详情见 神秘的地点 。","en":"Lord Reto is a miniboss found in the Ashlands . He is part of the sub-quest to craft the Dyrnwyn . He can be found inside the dungeon Tomb of Lord Reto . The location of the dungeon is given by following a series of 3 Vegvisirs , see Mysterious Location for details.","titleZh":"雷托领主","titleEn":"Lord Reto"},"p-98c95268220bddfe87be.html":{"zh":"蜱虫是 迷雾之地 中的敌对生物，外形像巨大版本的 同名对象 。唯一攻击是附着目标并持续造成伤害。","en":"Ticks are aggressive creatures found in the Mistlands . Ticks look like giant versions of their namesakes . Their only attack is to latch onto their target and deal constant damage.","titleZh":"壁虱幼虫","titleEn":"Tick"},"p-98dbb7726a1543762470.html":{"zh":"开膛弩：皲裂 是使用 血石 强化 开膛弩 得到的版本。与所有使用血石强化的武器一样，玩家每缺少1点 生命值 ，其伤害就提高0.2% （不要与生命值百分比混淆） 。 已升级的开膛弩在改造为开膛弩：皲裂时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。 主要攻击发射 弩箭 。攻击前，必须先将一支弩箭装入弩中。技能等级为0时，装填需要3.5秒并消耗3点耐力；但加上发射、装填和准备动作，实际每6秒才能发射一次。跳跃和冲刺会重置装填进度，冲刺时也无法装填弩箭。装填完成后，可随时发射，且不消耗耐力。发射后需要重新装填一支弩箭。切换到其他武器时，弩箭不会保持装填状态，因此每次装备该物品时都需要装填。 弩箭飞行速度明显快于箭矢，沿直线飞行而非抛物线（不会因重力而下坠）。","en":"Wound Ripper is the upgraded form of Ripper using Bloodstone . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, its damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of health the player is missing (not to be confused with health percentage) . An upgraded Ripper will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Wound Ripper.","titleZh":"开膛弩：皲裂","titleEn":"Wound Ripper"},"p-98eb4ff2e56049c46e8b.html":{"zh":"胆汁炸弹 是一种投掷武器，会生成半径4米、持续10秒的 火焰 和 毒素 范围云雾。云雾中的任何人（投掷者除外）都会在5秒内受到15点火焰伤害，并在6秒内受到30点毒素伤害。敌人停留在云雾中时，火焰伤害会叠加（每秒重新施加），毒素持续时间也会刷新，因此最大伤害为15*10火焰 + 30*(10+6)/6毒素 = 150火焰 + 80毒素。 伤害值不受玩家任何技能影响，但可能因敌人的抗性而改变。","en":"Bile bomb is a thrown weapon that creates a Fire and Poison 4-meter radius AoE cloud, which stays for 10 seconds. Anyone in the cloud (excluding the thrower) takes 15 fire damage over 5 seconds, and 30 poison damage over 6 seconds. If an enemy stays in the cloud, the fire damage stacks (reapplying every second) and the poison duration is refreshed, so the maximum damage is 15*10 fire + 30*(10+6)/6 poison = 150 fire…","titleZh":"胆汁炸弹","titleEn":"Bile Bomb"},"p-995262c002119be37f3e.html":{"zh":"弓术强化 是穿齐 邪煞之根 护甲 套装 三件套后获得的 状态效果 。 使 弓技能 提高15，但不超过100技能上限。","en":"Improved archery is a status effect granted by wearing all three pieces of the Root armor set . It increases the Bows skill by 15 but does not exceed the skill cap of 100.","titleZh":"弓术强化","titleEn":"Improved archery"},"p-99a52df3ff3d499488e2.html":{"zh":"钥匙 可能指：","en":"Key may refer to:","titleZh":"钥匙","titleEn":"Key"},"p-99b60de679e8976fc592.html":{"zh":"英灵神殿 的 建筑系统 采用稳定性机制，鼓励较合理的建筑设计并影响玩法。放置的 建筑构件 若不够稳定就会坍塌。稳定性主要取决于材料、位置、朝向及所连接的其他构件。 在机制上，构件稳定性用一个称为“ 支撑 ”的数值表示。系统计算并检查它，以决定构件是否应该断裂。支撑值越高，越稳定，越不容易损毁。 支撑系统与现实材料受力不同，更像管道中压力的传递，或从地面和树木流入构件的魔法力量。例如，一根横梁能够支撑的其他构件数量没有上限。","en":"The construction system in Valheim implements a stability mechanic to encourage more realistic buildings and drive gameplay. If the player places a building piece that is not sufficiently stable, it will collapse. Stability is primarily dictated by a piece's material, its position and orientation, and the pieces to which it is attached.","titleZh":"建筑稳定性","titleEn":"Building stability"},"p-9a0f531d35e4302af68f.html":{"zh":"矮人头环 是一件护甲部件。装备后，会朝玩家视线方向提供永不熄灭的锥形光源。 头环提供2点护甲，装备时其光源会抵消所有潜行加成。头环不能与任何其他头部护甲同时穿戴。 可通过物品架将头环固定在表面上，用作无需补充燃料的光源。","en":"Dverger circlet is an armor piece. It grants the player a never-ending light source when equipped in the form of a cone wherever the player is looking. The circlet provides 2 armor, and its light source negates any sneak bonus while equipped. The circlet cannot be worn concurrently with any other head armor. The circlet can be attached to surfaces with item stands to be used as a light source that does not need refu…","titleZh":"矮人头环","titleEn":"Dverger Circlet"},"p-9a195343479daa2bb6ae.html":{"zh":"闪电 是仅提供视觉效果的 状态效应 。 生物或玩家每次受到 闪电 伤害时施加，持续3秒。","en":"Lightning is a Status effect that is only a visual effect. It is applied every time a creature or player receives Lightning damage and lasts 3 seconds.","titleZh":"闪电(效果)","titleEn":"Lightning (effect)"},"p-9a3431e37b489b7ba652.html":{"zh":"立式织布机 是用 极北之地 阶段材料建造的 古咒法台 升级设施。","en":"The Standing Loom is used as an upgrade for the Galdr Table made from Deep North materials.","titleZh":"立式织布机","titleEn":"Standing Loom"},"p-9a4790a900bcfa64750a.html":{"zh":"矮人路哨 是 迷雾之地 各处非常常见的结构。 具有15米 雾 驱离半径，破坏不产出资源。","en":"Dvergr Road Post is a structure very commonly found across Mistlands . They have a 15-meter mist repulsion radius. Destroying them doesn't yield any resources.","titleZh":"矮人路哨","titleEn":"Dvergr Road Post"},"p-9a7f012873d75d96c1a1.html":{"zh":"欢庆之角 是纪念 英灵神殿 发布一周年的华丽 大酒杯 ，用于从背包饮用 蜜酒 ，不过不用庆典号角也能喝蜜酒。","en":"Horns of Celebration are ornate tankards marking the first anniversary of the release of Valheim . They are used to consume mead from within the inventory. Mead can, however, be consumed without a Horn of Celebration.","titleZh":"庆祝号角","titleEn":"Horn of Celebration"},"p-9a88e2e120491bf19147.html":{"zh":"这是所有类型 建筑 的 分类 。","en":"This is a category for all types of structures .","titleZh":"分类：建筑","titleEn":"Category:Structures"},"p-9a9036ab0f9ad5acbb24.html":{"zh":"台钳 用于升级 黑熔炉 ，材料成本与另一种黑熔炉升级设施 黑熔炉冷却器 相近。","en":"The Vice is used as an upgrade for the Black Forge . It has similar material costs as the Black Forge Cooler , another black forge upgrade.","titleZh":"台钳","titleEn":"Vice"},"p-9af45f597989dafca137.html":{"zh":"抗霜蜜酒 是一种 泥泞沼泽 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：抗霜 发酵 而成。","en":"Frost resistance mead is a Swamp -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Frost resistance .","titleZh":"抗霜蜜酒","titleEn":"Frost Resistance Mead"},"p-9b63d91eaa1ecddce259.html":{"zh":"铜矿源 是 黑暗林山 中的资源节点，需 鹿角镐 或更好工具采集铜矿石。","en":"Copper Deposits are resource nodes and are found in the Black Forest biome. An Antler Pickaxe or better is required to harvest Copper ore from the deposit.","titleZh":"铜矿源","titleEn":"Copper Deposit"},"p-9b96bbeda8ba4194841f.html":{"zh":"尸鬼村庄 是 青青草原 中距世界中心超过2000米的 地点 ，由多座大木屋组成，住有 尸鬼 ，外围始终带部分原木墙。 尸鬼通常关在屋内，仅在玩家开门后出来。 屋内家具可破坏以获取 细木 。","en":"Draugr Villages are a Point of interest found in Meadows more than 2000 meters away from world center. It's a gathering of large wooded houses inhabited by Draugr and they always feature partial log wall perimeters. Draugrs are generally locked inside houses and only emerge if the player opens the doors. Furnitures inside house can be destroyed for Finewood .","titleZh":"尸鬼村落","titleEn":"Draugr Village"},"p-9b98e9b9ff1e6d43b9e0.html":{"zh":"乡村 可能指：","en":"Village may refer to:","titleZh":"乡村","titleEn":"Village"},"p-9bac25686c53aa859d61.html":{"zh":"巨魔 是 黑暗林山 中的敌对 生物 ，为巨大笨拙的人形生物，四肢粗壮，长硬质金发。可能生成时手持大树干。","en":"Trolls are aggressive creatures found in Black Forests . They are massive, bumbling humanoids with brutish limbs and wiry blonde hair. They may spawn with a large tree trunk in their hand.","titleZh":"巨魔","titleEn":"Troll"},"p-9be24257a96ca6dfd0bd.html":{"zh":"圣诞帽 是一件护甲部件，可向 霍尔德 支付100 钱币 购买。","en":"Yule hat is an armor piece which can be purchased from Haldor for 100 Coins .","titleZh":"圣诞帽","titleEn":"Yule Hat"},"p-9c02806a24a7117538a1.html":{"zh":"恶骨 是 北境平原 夜间的敌对生物，属于更强的 巨熊 亡灵变体。","en":"Viles are aggressive creatures found in Plains during the night. They are a stronger, undead variant of Bears .","titleZh":"恶骨","titleEn":"Vile"},"p-9c1a458613f18d5ebb1d.html":{"zh":"冥火之泉 是用于收集 冥火 的 基础 设施。任何生物群系中，只要天色够暗，例如夜间或雨天，冥火就会被吸引。火把和其他人工光源不会阻止召唤冥火。 建造需要 切石机 。","en":"Wisp Fountains are base structures used for collecting Wisps , which will be attracted to the fountain when it is dark; either when it is night, or raining, in any biome. Torches and other artificial light sources do not prevent it from summoning wisps. They require a Stonecutter to be built.","titleZh":"冥火之泉","titleEn":"Wisp Fountain"},"p-9c2ea31a6311715a1e8e.html":{"zh":"另见: 分类：饰品 子分类 分类：上身装备 分类：披风 分类：头部装备 分类：腿部装备 分类中的页面 护甲 灰烬披风 阿斯克套装 灰烬刚鬣披风 蓝色珠饰连衣裙 棕色珠饰连衣裙 黄色珠饰连衣裙 蓝色珠饰上衣 红色珠饰上衣 黄色珠饰上衣 熊皮套装 蓝色绳结头巾 青铜护甲 召唤者套装 奥丁披风 召唤者披风 测试披风 蓝色披肩上衣 红色披肩上衣 黄色披肩上衣 甲壳护甲 庆典帽 根须王冠 英灵神殿之冠 鹿皮斗篷 矮人头环 埃达织物套装 恩布拉套装 绿色华丽帽 橙色华丽帽 轻羽斗篷 芬里套装 钓鱼帽 焰金属护甲 棕色皮毛帽 灰色皮毛帽 丰收之裙 丰收上衣 头带 奥丁兜帽 铁制护甲 皮甲 亚麻披风 平原牦牛披风 牦牛皮套装 仲夏之冠 驼鹿皮披风 奥丁套装 厚垫护甲 巫师帽 守护者护甲 碎布护甲 树根套装 蓝色披肩连衣裙 棕色披肩连衣裙 黄色披肩连衣裙 紫色简朴帽 红色简朴帽 蓝色简朴连衣裙 棕色简朴连衣裙 本色简朴连衣裙 黄色简朴连衣裙 蓝…","en":"See also: Category:Accessories Subcategories Category:Body Category:Capes Category:Head Category:Legs Pages in category Armor Ashen Cape Ask Set Asksvin Cloak Beaded dress blue Beaded dress brown Beaded dress yellow Beaded tunic blue Beaded tunic red Beaded tunic yellow Bear Set Blue Tied Headscarf Bronze Armor Caller Set Cape of Oden Cape of the Caller CAPE TEST Cape tunic blue Cape tunic red Cape tunic yellow Cara…","titleZh":"分类：护甲","titleEn":"Category:Armor"},"p-9c81c169b5ea4da92da9.html":{"zh":"屠夫台 用于升级 铸铁锅 。由于成本中等，通常是大锅的第二项升级。","en":"The Butcher's table is used as an upgrade for the Cauldron . It will typically be the second upgrade for the cauldron due to its medium cost.","titleZh":"屠夫台","titleEn":"Butcher's Table"},"p-9cdfc3cc59b965ed09e0.html":{"zh":"巨人遗骸 是 迷雾之地 中的 资源 地点，可用 黑金属镐 开采 黑大理石 。 巨人遗骸由胸腔、头骨或两者组成。肋骨只掉黑色大理石，头骨还包含可开采获取 软组织 的大脑节点。","en":"Giant Remains are a resource location in the Mistlands biome where the player can mine for Black Marble with a Black Metal Pickaxe . Giant Remains consist of a rib cage, a skull, or both. While the ribs only drop black marble, the skulls also contain a brain, a resource node which can be mined to obtain Soft Tissue .","titleZh":"巨人遗骸","titleEn":"Giant Remains"},"p-9d1262757db8399e12e9.html":{"zh":"远古石圈 可在 青青草原 生态区找到，由5根从地面突起、呈环形排列的大石柱组成。 此结构没有特定用途，中心也没有埋藏宝箱。不过，石柱不可破坏，可为建筑提供最大支撑。","en":"Ancient Stone Circles can be found within the Meadows Biome and consists of 5 large stone pillars protruding from the ground arranged in a circle. The formation has no specific purpose, and there is no chest buried in the center. However, the stone pillars are indestructible and provide maximum support for building.","titleZh":"远古石圈","titleEn":"Ancient Stone Circle"},"p-9d4d57bcafe893d0c2c8.html":{"zh":"作弊大锤 是一种只能通过控制台命令获得的 棍棒 ，外观与 铁大锤 相同。 主要攻击在较长的挥击延迟后砸向地面，造成半径20米的球形范围伤害，能够清除该范围内几乎所有东西。它没有次要攻击。 它对所有生物、岩石和树木造成巨额伤害。 作弊大锤持握时还会使移动速度降低-20%，并具有2x背刺加成和2x弹反加成。 与 作弊剑 一样，它具有发光的彩虹光环；但与那把剑不同，它的光环只在放在地上时出现，装备时不会发光。此外，与作弊剑不同，它具有耐久度，使用后最终会损坏。任何制作设施都无法修理它。","en":"The Cheat Sledge is a club that is only available with console commands. Its appearance is identical to the Iron Sledge . The primary attack slams the ground (after a lengthy swing delay), dealing damage in a spherical AOE attack with a 20 meter radius, being able to clear out almost anything within that radius. It has no secondary attack.","titleZh":"作弊大锤","titleEn":"Cheat Sledge"},"p-9d5ce60be807ae13498b.html":{"zh":"丑地精 是 北境平原 中的敌对 生物 ，尤其常见于 地精村落 。它们形似小地精，似乎有自己的部落文化。 符文石 和 图腾 暗示它们崇拜早已死去的国王 亚格鲁斯 。 丑地精的持棍、持矛、持剑及持火把变体，出现概率分别为33%、17%、33%和17%。 所有丑地精生成时都有一件护甲，提供60护甲值；头盔、臂环、肩甲和腿环各有25%概率。另有33%概率持 木盾 ，与玩家可制作的相同。死亡时不会掉落装备。","en":"Fulings are aggressive creatures found in Plains , especially within Fuling Villages . They resemble small, goblin-like beings that appear to possess their own tribalistic culture. It is implied through Runestones and totems that they worship Yagluth , a long dead king. Fulings appear 33% of the time as club variants, 17% of the time as spear variants, 33% of the time as sword variants and 17% of the time as torch v…","titleZh":"丑地精","titleEn":"Fuling"},"p-9d6a40ac23336bff8d20.html":{"zh":"子分类 分类：材料堆 分类中的页面 饰件 上古金属堆 箭靶 灰烬之木堆 灰烬之木尖围墙 弩炮 攻城锤 黑大理石堆 黑金属堆 血金堆 骨堆 篝火 青铜堆 营火 板车 制图台 投石机 煤块堆 金币叠 金币堆 铜堆 圆木堆 灰烬长船 矮人尖木桩防护栅栏 矮人桩墙 细木堆 焰金属堆 燧石堆 灰石堆 灶 带罩灯笼 铁制火炉 铁堆 维京船 维京长船 神秘的石头 黑曜石堆 铺平 石铺路 头骨堆 传送门 传送门 - 石 木筏 乌鸦装饰 圆柱形篱笆 圆柱大门 尖木桩防护栅栏 护盾发生器 银矿堆 尖桩 尖木桩围墙 石围栏 石头堆 练兵傀儡 巨木堆 锡堆 预告片船 陷阱 珍宝箱 守护石 狼头装饰 木制龙头装饰 木材堆 世界之树木材堆","en":"Subcategories Category:Stacks & Piles Pages in category Adornments Ancient Metal Stack Archery Target Ashwood Stack Ashwood Stakewall Ballista Battering Ram Black Marble Pile Black Metal Stack Bloodgold Stack Bone Stack Bonfire Bronze Stack Campfire Cart Cartography Table Catapult Coal Pile Coin Pile Coin Stack Copper Stack Corewood Stack Drakkar Dvergr Sharp Stakes Dvergr Stakewall Finewood Stack Flametal Stack Fli…","titleZh":"分类：杂项建筑","titleEn":"Category:Misc structures"},"p-9db22d416e293660fbf7.html":{"zh":"黑曜石 是 凛冽雪山 中的黑色火山玻璃。找到后解锁 工作台 的 工具架 升级设施及两种元素 箭 。","en":"Obsidian is black volcanic glass found in the Mountain . Finding it unlocks the Tool Shelf upgrade for the Workbench and two different kinds of elemental arrows .","titleZh":"黑曜石","titleEn":"Obsidian"},"p-9df901ab1475633f433e.html":{"zh":"黑金属弩箭 是供 弩 使用的 弹药 ，也是 铁弩箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Black Metal Bolts are ammunition for crossbows and are the next direct upgrade from Iron Bolts .","titleZh":"黑金属弩箭","titleEn":"Black Metal Bolt"},"p-9dfbe32b981b3194d5a6.html":{"zh":"矮人 灰烬之地 板条箱 是 矮人板条箱 的变体，位于 灰烬之地 中的 矮人焦毁塔楼废墟 。 受矮人焦黑塔废墟内的矮人 守护石 保护。攻击箱子或守护石会惊动附近 灰烬之地矮人 。","en":"The Dvergr Ashlands crate is a variant of the Dvergr Crate found in Dvergr Charred Tower Ruins in the Ashlands . They are protected by Dvergr Wards found inside the Dvergr Charred Tower Ruins. Attacking the crate or the Ward will alert nearby Ashlands Dvergr .","titleZh":"矮人 灰烬之地 板条箱","titleEn":"Dvergr Ashlands crate"},"p-9e0c7e0f51454d40f7f8.html":{"zh":"烹饪 是一种 技能 。","en":"Cooking is a skill .","titleZh":"烹饪(技能)","titleEn":"Cooking (skill)"},"p-9e326c21533625f034ac.html":{"zh":"蓝色珠饰连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付550 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的青铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Beaded dress blue is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 550 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's bronze chest .","titleZh":"蓝色珠饰连衣裙","titleEn":"Beaded dress blue"},"p-9e3737df0cca67a21a64.html":{"zh":"燕麦奶 是 极北之地 阶段提供耐力的 食物 。","en":"Oat Milk is a Deep North -tier stamina food .","titleZh":"燕麦奶","titleEn":"Oat Milk"},"p-9e471951a1b4106e54be.html":{"zh":"英灵神殿 中的 环境 会随昼夜循环、天气、生态区和事件不断变化。","en":"The environment in Valheim changes constantly, through a day and night cycle, weather, biome and event effects.","titleZh":"环境","titleEn":"Environment"},"p-9e6167f7cd882796ca91.html":{"zh":"轻羽花环 用于升级 古咒法台 。","en":"The Feathery wreath is used as an upgrade for the Galdr Table .","titleZh":"轻羽花环","titleEn":"Feathery Wreath"},"p-9e87ba4dd07da92b8eca.html":{"zh":"胡萝卜 是由 胡萝卜种子 种植的作物。可以生吃，但用于 铸铁锅 配方更有价值。","en":"Carrots are crops grown from Carrot Seeds . They can be eaten raw, but are more useful in Cauldron recipes.","titleZh":"胡萝卜","titleEn":"Carrot"},"p-9ea53a1e3370710198a9.html":{"zh":"黄麻 可能指：","en":"Jute may refer to:","titleZh":"黄麻","titleEn":"Jute"},"p-9ed66b1293841cd86ef5.html":{"zh":"冰雪灯 是 极北之地 装饰光源，放在附近可提高2点 舒适度 。 放在 凛冽雪山 和北方深境以外时，每次游戏更新建筑磨损，冰雪灯都会失去最大耐久度的25%，即17.5点，因此四次更新后就会损毁。","en":"Snow Lantern is a Deep North decorative light source. It increases Comfort by 2 when placed nearby. When placed outside the Mountain or Deep North biomes, the Snow Lantern loses 25% of its maximum durability (17.5 points) each time the game updates structure wear, so it breaks after four updates.","titleZh":"冰雪灯","titleEn":"Snow Lantern"},"p-9ef7d110cb8aa8020149.html":{"zh":"蓝蘑菇 是一件尚未实装的物品。","en":"Blue mushroom is an unimplemented item.","titleZh":"蓝蘑菇","titleEn":"Blue mushroom"},"p-9f08cfc9f00edf85d5e5.html":{"zh":"这是 徒手 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 武器 。","en":"This is a category for unarmed which are a type of weapons .","titleZh":"分类：徒手","titleEn":"Category:Unarmed"},"p-9f93460f4f17181442b5.html":{"zh":"覆盆子 是生长在 青青草原 灌木上的果实。每株灌木可采集1份覆盆子，数量受 农耕（技能） 影响，每5h重新结出果实。浆果灌木无法重新种植，被毁后也不会再生。 覆盆子在游戏初期是基础食物，中后期则是早期 皇后果酱 和 中份治疗蜜酒 的必需材料。因此，遇到覆盆子时通常建议顺手采集。","en":"Raspberries are fruits found growing on bushes in Meadows . The bushes can be harvested for 1 Raspberries, affected by Farming (Skill) , and replenish after 5h . There is no way to replant berry bushes, and if they are destroyed they will not grow back. Raspberries are valuable in both early game as a basic food item and in mid-to-late game as a necessary ingredient for the early-tier Queen's Jam and the Medium Heal…","titleZh":"覆盆子","titleEn":"Raspberries"},"p-9f99c40e4382e0c95f4d.html":{"zh":"凛冽雪山塔楼 是 凛冽雪山 中的 地点 。 主要由 石头 建成的大型废墟，共两种变体。","en":"Mountain Towers are a Point of interest found in the Mountain . They are large ruined structures made mostly of Stone . They come in two variants.","titleZh":"山地塔楼","titleEn":"Mountain Tower"},"p-9fa8b0ec4ec1f253780b.html":{"zh":"北境早茶 是 极北之地 阶段的 宴席 。摆放后可供食用十次。","en":"Northern Morning Fare is a Deep North -tier Feast . Once placed, it can be eaten from ten times.","titleZh":"北境早茶","titleEn":"Northern Morning Fare"},"p-9fbbe982e10d5be58107.html":{"zh":"翡翠 是一种材料，用于制作某些 灰烬之地 武器的“原初/根系”变体。在灰烬之地的 灰烬城堡 内的 灰烬宝箱 中有概率找到。 使用翡翠强化的武器会增加 10 毒素 伤害，其命中效果有 20% 的概率用藤根将目标 定身 ，持续 10 秒。","en":"Jade is a material used to craft the “Primal/Root” version of some Ashlands weapons. They have a chance to be found in the Charred chests inside Charred Fortresses located in Ashlands. A weapon upgraded with Jade gains 10 Poison damage, and their hit effect has a 20% chance to immobilize the target with roots for 10 seconds.","titleZh":"翡翠","titleEn":"Jade"},"p-a0237ec8ae1e3fc733e1.html":{"zh":"冰火战矛 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境战矛 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 穿刺 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境战矛在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Frostfire Spear is a version of Nord Spear upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of Pierce damage in exchange of a larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. An upgraded Nord Spear will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"冰火战矛","titleEn":"Frostfire Spear"},"p-a03fa219e6b708070031.html":{"zh":"火龙剑 是第七种 剑 。","en":"The Dyrnwyn is the seventh sword .","titleZh":"火龙剑","titleEn":"Dyrnwyn"},"p-a06381cc725eb09d315e.html":{"zh":"平原牦牛肉派 是一种 北境平原 级别的 食物 。","en":"Lox Meat Pie is a Plains -tier food .","titleZh":"平原牦牛肉派","titleEn":"Lox Meat Pie"},"p-a08bf07d189f4c5ec1eb.html":{"zh":"冷杉生长在 黑暗林山 、 泥泞沼泽 和 凛冽雪山 ，树干深褐，枝条细长尖锐，有大小两种，都可用 石斧 或更好的斧砍伐。小型产出4份 木材 ，大型产出20份 木材 ，树桩另产2份木材。有时还会掉落 冷杉球果 ，可用 耕地耙 种植。 冷杉砍倒后留下的树桩太低，普通挥斧无法击中。须用直向下劈砍的次要攻击清除。","en":"Fir is a type of tree that can be found in the Black Forest , Swamp , and Mountain biomes. It is characterized by its dark brown trunk and long pointed branches. Fir can be found in small and large variants. Both variants can be chopped with a Stone Axe or better. The small variant produces 4 Wood when destroyed. The large variant produces 20 wood when destroyed, and the stump will yield another 2 wood. Fir will som…","titleZh":"冷杉","titleEn":"Fir"},"p-a0ac9ecf9ca1f31bcf6d.html":{"zh":"测试披风 是一件护甲部件。","en":"CAPE TEST is an armor piece.","titleZh":"测试披风","titleEn":"CAPE TEST"},"p-a0b43df06f52085e62ab.html":{"zh":"银 用 木炭 作燃料，在 冶炼炉 冶炼 银矿 获得。也可破坏 灰烬之地 废墟及 腐朽之穴 中的 上古之坛 直接获得银。","en":"Silver is a crafting material smelted from Silver Ore in a Smelter using Coal as fuel. Silver can also be obtained directly from destroying Ancient Pots found in ruins and Putrid Holes within the Ashlands biome.","titleZh":"银","titleEn":"Silver"},"p-a0d1766092a174b035f3.html":{"zh":"凛冽雪山坟墓 是 凛冽雪山 中的 地点 ，由不同大小石头组成小圆圈。","en":"Mountain graves are Points of interest found in the Mountains . They consist of a small circle of stones of various sizes.","titleZh":"凛冽雪山 坟墓","titleEn":"Mountain grave"},"p-a0d4da6ea8199ae12a82.html":{"zh":"焰金属矿 是 灰烬之地 获取的金属矿石，可用 木炭 作燃料，在 高炉 冶炼为 焰金属 。","en":"Flametal Ore is a metal ore obtained in Ashlands . It can be smelted into Flametal in a Blast Furnace using Coal as fuel.","titleZh":"焰金属矿","titleEn":"Flametal Ore"},"p-a0e92c9d6efcf61e5b32.html":{"zh":"焰金属护甲 是一套 灰烬之地 级别的 护甲 ，比 甲壳护甲 和 埃达织物套装 高一级。同级套装包括 恩布拉套装 和 阿斯克套装 。 胸甲和护腿具有耐热效果，可降低 熔岩 造成的伤害，并延长在 沸水 中游泳而不受伤害的时间。此效果不影响 火焰伤害 或 燃烧中 造成的伤害。","en":"Flametal Armor is an Ashlands -tier armor . This set is the tier above Carapace Armor and Eitr-weave Set . Equal level sets include Embla Set and Ask Set . The breastplate and greaves have a heat resistance effect which reduces the damage done by Lava and extends the time that you can swim in Boiling water without taking damage. It does not affect fire damage or damage from burning .","titleZh":"焰金属护甲","titleEn":"Flametal Armor"},"p-a0ec12e20821847e7aac.html":{"zh":"厚垫护甲 是一套 北境平原 级别的 护甲 ，比 芬里套装 和 狼皮护甲 高一级，之后会被 甲壳护甲 或 埃达织物套装 替代。","en":"Padded Armor is a Plains -tier armor . This set is the tier above Fenris Set and Wolf Armor and is replaced by Carapace Armor or Eitr-weave Set .","titleZh":"厚垫护甲","titleEn":"Padded Armor"},"p-a0ec5cf71f77335f5c9b.html":{"zh":"黑熔炉 是用于制作和修复后期装备的 基础 设施，在 迷雾之地 阶段解锁。使用时需要屋顶和70%的 遮蔽 。修复物品不消耗材料。","en":"Black Forges are base structures used for crafting and repairing late-game gear, becoming available in Mistlands . They require a roof and 70% cover to be usable. Repairing items does not cost any resources.","titleZh":"黑熔炉","titleEn":"Black Forge"},"p-a1b6af2b7d7d4bfef86e.html":{"zh":"本页介绍设置和运行 英灵神殿专用服务器 的基础及详细信息。 专用服务器负责中转 RPC 通信并提供远程地图数据；启用时还会在Steam服务器查询的“其他”区域公布服务器。服务器不模拟游戏逻辑，也非服务器权威架构；权威角色由客户端在各自交互的局部区域承担。不过，服务器仍执行部分权威任务：客户端连接时，通过Steam API验证Steam ID，检查封禁和许可列表，并验证密码及版本代码。","en":"This page shows basics and details on how to set up and operate a Valheim dedicated server . The dedicated server is responsible for relaying RPC communication and providing remote map data, when enabled, advertising the server in the Steam Server Query (in the “other” region). The server does not simulate any of the game logic—it is not server-side authoritative. The authority role is claimed by the clients on loca…","titleZh":"专用服务器","titleEn":"Dedicated servers"},"p-a220d04583e4d5631662.html":{"zh":"古木矛 是第三种 矛 。","en":"Ancient Bark Spear is the third spear .","titleZh":"古木矛","titleEn":"Ancient Bark Spear"},"p-a2885e37ab1ff5c80d8c.html":{"zh":"这是 元素魔法 的 分类 ，它属于一种 魔法 。","en":"This is a category for elemental magic which is a type of magic .","titleZh":"分类：元素魔法","titleEn":"Category:Elemental magic"},"p-a2ba846ae92387c0345a.html":{"zh":"水晶之心 是一种 凛冽雪山 级别的 饰物 。","en":"Crystal Heart is a Mountain -tier trinket .","titleZh":"水晶之心","titleEn":"Crystal Heart"},"p-a3018626208e552613d1.html":{"zh":"模具 是 极北之地 各处的制作部件。 在 黑熔炉 或 古咒法台 作为材料，制作北方深境 武器 、 护甲 及 隐秘钥匙 的铸坯。再将铸坯投入以 液态冰霜 供能的 霜铸熔炉 ，获得最终物品。 模具不能复用，制作铸坯时消耗。","en":"Moulds are crafting components found in various places in the Deep North . They are used as crafting ingredients at a Black Forge or Galdr Table to craft Casts for Deep North Weapons , Armors and the Intricate Key . The Cast can then be placed in a Frost Foundry fueled by Liquid Frost to produce the final item. Moulds cannot be reused and are consumed to make a Cast.","titleZh":"模具","titleEn":"Moulds"},"p-a315f57c08a9b805c18b.html":{"zh":"皇冠珠宝 是一种 极北之地 材料。","en":"Crown Jewel is a Deep North material.","titleZh":"皇冠珠宝","titleEn":"Crown Jewel"},"p-a337b5b500bae140ed30.html":{"zh":"巨型鲱鱼 是 幽暗沼泽 近岸水域中的被动 生物 （ 鱼 ）。 可用钓竿配 腐臭鱼饵 捕获，鱼饵在 灶台 以20份 鱼饵 和一个 邪煞之树战利品 制作。 用于制作 钓鱼帽","en":"Giant herring are passive creatures ( fish ) found in the waters just offshore of the Swamp biome. They can be caught with a fishing pole using a Sticky fishing bait which can be crafted at the Food Preparation Table by combining 20 Fishing Bait and an Abomination Trophy . Needed to craft a Fishing Hat","titleZh":"巨型鲱鱼","titleEn":"Giant Herring"},"p-a352e4ff92727d54bf06.html":{"zh":"兔兔梅 是一种消耗品。","en":"Bukeperries are a type of consumable.","titleZh":"兔兔梅","titleEn":"Bukeperries"},"p-a35815f2b521ae923f48.html":{"zh":"黑金属 是由 黑金属碎片 冶炼的制作材料，用于继 银 后的第四级金属装备。","en":"Black Metal is a crafting material smelted from Black Metal Scrap . It is used to craft the fourth level of metal-wrought equipment, following Silver .","titleZh":"黑金属","titleEn":"Black Metal"},"p-a3ff2ed3cbd64ace9b1c.html":{"zh":"发酵桶是 基础 设施，可将蜜酒和葡萄酒原液发酵成成品。 运行需要屋顶和70%的 遮蔽 。摧毁发酵桶不会返还其中的蜜酒或葡萄酒原液。","en":"Fermenters are base structures used for fermenting mead and wine bases into meads and wines. They require a roof and 70% cover to function. Destroying a fermenter will not return the mead or wine base.","titleZh":"发酵桶","titleEn":"Fermenter"},"p-a4921a11df946d8c75a8.html":{"zh":"木瓦屋顶 是由 木材 和 沥青 制成的构件，可用来 庇护 ，避免 雨水 导致易受影响的建筑 潮湿效果 和 风化 。建造和修复时附近需要 工作台 。","en":"Shingle roofs are building pieces from wood and tar that can be used to shelter from the effect of rain , which causes the Wet Effect and weathering of susceptible structures. They require the proximity of a workbench to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"木瓦屋顶","titleEn":"Shingle Roofs"},"p-a4c7c843960e37334422.html":{"zh":"水晶墙 1x1 是可建造构件，需要 水晶 ，且须在 工作台 范围内建造。水晶墙适合做装饰窗，甚至可做类似温室的建筑，但十分脆弱。它本身不能提供支撑，因此不能直接相互叠放，除非由其他构件支撑。","en":"Crystal Wall 1x1 is a buildable structure. It requires Crystal to build and needs to be built within the range of a Workbench . Crystal walls are useful for making decorative windows (or even a greenhouse of sorts), but care should be taken as they are very fragile. As they provide no support of their own, they cannot be stacked off of each other directly, unless other structures are used to support them.","titleZh":"水晶墙 1x1","titleEn":"Crystal Wall 1x1"},"p-a4e733eebdd37c3ad6d3.html":{"zh":"工作台是 基础 设施，用于制作、修复物品，以及在20米内建造各种建筑。 建造不需要其他设施。 制作和修复时需要屋顶和70%的 遮蔽 。修复不消耗材料。范围内建造或阻止怪物生成的功能，则不需要屋顶或遮蔽。","en":"Workbenches are base structures used for crafting, repairing items and building various structures within 20 meters. They do not require any other structure to be built. They must have a roof and 70% cover to enable crafting and repairing. Repairing items does not cost any resources. The ability to build structures within the radius of the workbench, or to suppress monster spawning, does not require the workbench to…","titleZh":"工作台","titleEn":"Workbench"},"p-a53aa373c5e23e694a54.html":{"zh":"世界由多个区域组成，区域决定哪些地方加载并处于活动状态。每个区域大小为64米x64米。","en":"The world consists of zones that determine which areas are loaded and active. Each zone has a size of 64 meters x 64 meters.","titleZh":"区域","titleEn":"Zones"},"p-a5631971a67023f59a26.html":{"zh":"黄色简朴上衣 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付350 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的黄铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Simple tunic yellow is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 350 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's brass chest .","titleZh":"黄色简朴上衣","titleEn":"Simple tunic yellow"},"p-a5902860dd01a0b99591.html":{"zh":"神秘的地点 是 灰烬之地 中三处独特 地点 组成的系列，与制作独特剑 火龙剑 的任务相关。 每处神秘地点由仅生成2星焦黑生物的 苦难之碑（精英） 守卫。","en":"The Mysterious Location is a series of three unique Points of interest situated in the Ashlands . They are linked to the quest to craft the unique sword Dyrnwyn . Each Mysterious Location is guarded by a Monument of Torment (Elite) spawning only 2-starred Charred.","titleZh":"神秘的地点","titleEn":"Mysterious Location"},"p-a5b07ac50f06a2db8b61.html":{"zh":"北境战斧 是第七种单手 斧 ，属于 极北之地 级别。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境战斧铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Axe is the seventh, Deep North -tier one-handed axe . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Axe and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境战斧","titleEn":"Nord Axe"},"p-a5cccbcead7dcd65375e.html":{"zh":"琥珀 是一种 珍贵 物品。","en":"Amber is a Valuable item.","titleZh":"琥珀","titleEn":"Amber"},"p-a60e3ffa54216f176e19.html":{"zh":"子分类 分类：矿床 分类：树木 分类中的页面 深渊藤壶 远古护甲 远古树根 上古之剑 铜矿源 炎金属矿脉 巨人遗骸 发光金属 树脓囊 冰池 冰层 铁矿脉 泥泞的废料堆 黑曜石矿源 石化巨魔长老 银矿脉 软组织 硫磺拱门 锡矿源 不稳定的火山岩石","en":"Subcategories Category:Ore deposits Category:Trees Pages in category Abyssal Barnacle Ancient Armor Ancient Roots Ancient Sword Copper Deposit Flametal Ore Vein Giant Remains Glowing metal Gucksack Ice Pond Ice Sheet Iron vein Muddy Scrap Pile Obsidian Deposit Petrified Gammeltroll Silver Vein Soft Tissue Sulfur Arch Tin Deposit Unstable Lava Rock","titleZh":"分类：资源采集点","titleEn":"Category:Resource nodes"},"p-a67b85bd2843572198e0.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 护甲架 木桶 黑金宝箱 板车 宝箱 物品架 维京船 维京长船 神秘的石头 个人宝箱 盆罐 加固型宝箱 储物设施","en":"Pages in category Armor Stand Barrel Black Metal Chest Cart Chest Item Stand Karve Longship Mysterious Rock Personal Chest Pots Reinforced Chest Storage","titleZh":"分类：储物设施","titleEn":"Category:Storage"},"p-a67e58183d87dd3fa4ae.html":{"zh":"符文石 是 英灵神殿 中的一种建筑。","en":"A runestone is a type of structure in Valheim .","titleZh":"符文石","titleEn":"Runestone"},"p-a69c4dece144a46e40d4.html":{"zh":"本页介绍玩家可建造的储物设施。野外的箱子见 战利品宝箱 。","en":"This page is about storage options that can be built by the player. For chests found in nature, see Loot chest .","titleZh":"储物设施","titleEn":"Storage"},"p-a6d7eeb25f1fe9854a8b.html":{"zh":"玩家基地是特定建筑周围生成的隐形区域，具有以下效果：","en":"Player base is an invisible area created around certain structures. The effects are:","titleZh":"玩家基地","titleEn":"Player base"},"p-a6df11e706c514f13d6f.html":{"zh":"以下是 英灵神殿 的 版本历史 ，从新到旧，仅含稳定分支更新。 抢先体验发布后，按时间顺序推出以下更新：","en":"This is the version history of Valheim , listed from newest to oldest. Only patches released on the stable branch are included. Since the Early Access launch, the following updates have been released in chronological order:","titleZh":"版本历史","titleEn":"Version history"},"p-a6fe4421d488e706f3d3.html":{"zh":"冰霜洞穴 是位于 凛冽雪山 的 地下城 。","en":"Frost Caves are dungeons found in the Mountains .","titleZh":"冰霜洞穴","titleEn":"Frost Caves"},"p-a727dfb5e5dfd20317b4.html":{"zh":"黑色大理石战斗神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Black Marble Battle Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"黑色大理石战斗神像","titleEn":"Black Marble Battle Idol"},"p-a7349af4f9761f32ffee.html":{"zh":"撕裂者：飓风 是使用 堇青石 强化 撕裂者 得到的版本。与所有使用 堇青石 强化的武器一样，它额外获得10点 闪电 伤害 ，并有25%概率施加 连锁闪电 。 已升级的撕裂者在改造为撕裂者：飓风时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Splitnir the Storming is the upgraded form of Splitnir using Iolite . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Iolite , it has 10 additional lightning damage and a 25% chance to apply Chain Lightning . An upgraded Splitnir will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Splitnir the Storming.","titleZh":"撕裂者：飓风","titleEn":"Splitnir the Storming"},"p-a795055105729e71e344.html":{"zh":"太阳石 是在 极北之地 发现的 珍贵 。","en":"Solryth is a Valuable found in Deep North .","titleZh":"太阳石","titleEn":"Solryth"},"p-a7f78480ab3878bd9e3f.html":{"zh":"矮人焦毁塔楼废墟 位于 灰烬之地 ，由 灰烬之地矮人 居住。灰烬之地包含30座矮人焦黑塔废墟。","en":"Dvergr Charred Tower Ruins can be found in the Ashlands . These are inhabited by the Ashlands Dvergr . The Ashlands biome contains 30 Dvergr Charred Tower Ruins.","titleZh":"矮人焦毁塔楼废墟","titleEn":"Dvergr Charred Tower Ruins"},"p-a806c72efba316e4ef1b.html":{"zh":"鹿肉 是一种通过击杀 鹿 获得的基础食物。 可以在 烹饪台 或 铁烹饪台 上将其烤成 熟鹿肉 ；若烤得过久，则会变成 木炭 。","en":"Deer Meat is a basic food obtained by killing Deer . It can be cooked on a Cooking Station or Iron Cooking Station to obtain Cooked Deer Meat , or Coal if overcooked.","titleZh":"鹿肉","titleEn":"Deer Meat"},"p-a83e3e505f6a53f65e2e.html":{"zh":"熊掌 是击杀 黑暗林山 中的 巨熊 获得的物品。","en":"Bear paw is an item found by killing Bear in the Black Forest .","titleZh":"巨熊利爪","titleEn":"Bear Paw"},"p-a843fa0bbda9464a562e.html":{"zh":"皇室 是穿 英灵神殿之冠 获得的状态。 阻止非首领 生物 攻击玩家，使其逃跑。生物须先察觉玩家才逃跑。","en":"Royalty is a status effect obtained by wearing the Crown of Valheim . The effect prevents non-boss creatures from attacking the player and makes them flee. Creatures need to detect the player to start fleeing.","titleZh":"皇室","titleEn":"Royalty"},"p-a85d8339fc30546a789c.html":{"zh":"甲壳素 是 无尽之海 中的 材料 。 开采 无尽之海 中活体移动岛屿 利维坦 身上的 深渊藤壶 获得。钓到 东星斑 有13.33%概率获得1-2份甲壳素，但需使用较难获取的 重磅鱼饵 。","en":"Chitin is a material found in the Ocean . It is obtained by mining Abyssal Barnacles found on Leviathans which appear as living, moving islands in the Ocean . Catching a Coral Cod fish has a 13.33% of dropping 1-2 chitin, although catching them requires Heavy Fishing Bait (which can be difficult to obtain).","titleZh":"甲壳素","titleEn":"Chitin"},"p-a891bda2c5d502c3fde8.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以130枚 钱币 购买5份 海员的香草 ，仅在击杀 蛟龙 后出售。","en":"Seafarer's herbs can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 130 Coins for 5 herbs. It is only sold after killing a Serpent .","titleZh":"海员的香草","titleEn":"Seafarer's Herbs"},"p-a895294809364f17af35.html":{"zh":"铸铁锅 是用于制作 食物 的设施，运行时正下方需要 营火 或 灶 等火源。","en":"The Cauldron is a crafting station used to prepare food . It requires a fire source underneath to operate, such as a Campfire or Hearth .","titleZh":"铸铁锅","titleEn":"Cauldron"},"p-a8986b659293d96d0605.html":{"zh":"海豹汤 是一种 极北之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Seal Meat Soup is a Deep North -tier food .","titleZh":"海豹汤","titleEn":"Seal Meat Soup"},"p-a8d28da4f0578da4232e.html":{"zh":"钓鱼帽 是一件可在 工作台 处制作和升级的护甲部件，为 钓鱼 和 游泳 提供+20技能加成。 制作钓鱼帽需要捕获现有所有生物群系（从 青青草原 到 极北之地 ）中的每一种 鱼 。制作并将帽子升至等级4，总共需要每种鱼各八条。任何品质的鱼都可用于制作。","en":"The Fishing Hat is an armor piece which can be crafted and upgraded at the Workbench . It provides a +20 skill bonus to Fishing and Swimming . Players need to catch every single kind of fish from all existing biomes (from Meadows to the Deep North ) in order to craft the Fishing hat. A player who wishes to craft and upgrade the hat to rank 4 requires a total of eight of each kind of fish. Any quality level of fish m…","titleZh":"钓鱼帽","titleEn":"Fishing Hat"},"p-a8dc2a05596fceca7a2d.html":{"zh":"赤血灵鹿 是首位 首领 ，外形为异常巨大的雄鹿，通电的红鹿角上缠着铁链。","en":"Eikthyr is the first boss . He appears as an abnormally large stag with iron chains wrapped around his electrified red antlers.","titleZh":"赤血灵鹿","titleEn":"Eikthyr"},"p-a90ffd25de0084693933.html":{"zh":"狂战之斧：雷电 是使用 堇青石 强化 狂战之斧 得到的版本。与所有使用 堇青石 强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 闪电 伤害 ，且命中效果有25%概率施加 连锁闪电 。 已升级的狂战之斧在改造为狂战之斧：雷电时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thundering Berserkir Axes are the upgraded form of Berserkir Axes using the Iolite . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Iolite , they gain 10 lightning damage and their hit effect has a 25% chance to apply Chain Lightning . An upgraded Berserkir Axes will NOT keep their upgrade level when they are made into Thundering Berserkir Axes.","titleZh":"狂战之斧：雷电","titleEn":"Thundering Berserkir Axes"},"p-a959c466fafe0d9846f2.html":{"zh":"探索 英灵神殿 世界会遇不同 生物 ，部分战利品是 进展 必需，因此了解最佳战斗策略更有帮助。","en":"While exploring the world of Valheim , the player gets in contact with different creatures . The loot of some creatures is essential to progress in the game, which makes it even more convenient to know the best possible strategies on how to properly fight them.","titleZh":"策略攻略","titleEn":"Strategies"},"p-a9bf2cbee191c46fd22e.html":{"zh":"家具 是装饰物，可提高玩家的 舒适度等级 。","en":"Furniture are decorative items, they can increase the players comfort level .","titleZh":"分类：家具","titleEn":"Category:Furniture"},"p-a9f35559e8a1f171da3d.html":{"zh":"被沥青黏住了 是减缓玩家速度的 状态效果 ，由 焦油怪 或在 焦油坑 中游泳引起。 使玩家减速50%，并对 火焰 伤害变为 极弱 ，持续10秒。","en":"Tarred is a status effect that slows the player down. It is inflicted by Growths or by swimming in a Tar Pit . It slows the player by 50% and makes them very weak to fire damage. The effect lasts 10 seconds.","titleZh":"被沥青黏住了","titleEn":"Tarred"},"p-aa304703ffe892e5e90f.html":{"zh":"上古之剑 是遍布 迷雾之地 的资源节点，需 黑金属镐 或更好工具采集。与 远古护甲 一起，可让玩家在迷雾之地方便获取 废铁 及 铜碎屑 。","en":"Ancient Swords are resource nodes found throughout the Mistlands which require a Black Metal Pickaxe or better to harvest. Along with Ancient Armor , they can provide players with easy access to Scrap Iron and Copper Scrap from within the Mistlands biome.","titleZh":"上古之剑","titleEn":"Ancient Sword"},"p-aa45017133fbc8fecc6e.html":{"zh":"古树 是 幽暗沼泽 中的一种 树 ，特征为无叶、形状扭曲。需 青铜斧 、 初始双斧 或更好工具才能伤害。 古树破坏后提供 木材 和 古树皮 。每种木材数量似乎随机，但总会掉落10份木材。","en":"Ancient Trees are a type of tree that can be found in the Swamp biome. They are characterized by their lack of leaves, and gnarled shape. A Bronze Axe , Early Axes , or better is required to damage it. Ancient Trees produce Wood and Ancient Bark when destroyed. The yield of each type of wood appears to be random, however an ancient tree will always drop 10 pieces of wood in total.","titleZh":"古树","titleEn":"Ancient Tree"},"p-aa795a97aefe2b83274d.html":{"zh":"建造和修复 黑色大理石结构 需要 黑大理石 ，且附近必须有 切石机 。 它们拥有 石制结构 不具备的元素免疫能力，而且 建筑稳定性 略高。这一点在围护 埃达之力提炼器 时尤其有用。","en":"Black marble structures require Black Marble and the proximity of a stonecutter to be built and repaired. They have elemental immunity which Stone Structures do not, as well as slightly more Building stability . This is especially notable for encasing the Eitr Refinery .","titleZh":"黑色大理石结构","titleEn":"Black Marble Structures"},"p-aa8f3790a6a1e56b1d28.html":{"zh":"楼梯 是可用多种材料建造的结构：","en":"Stairs are building structures available in several materials:","titleZh":"楼梯","titleEn":"Stairs"},"p-aae31ec616122df43e88.html":{"zh":"银矿堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 银 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Silver Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Silver or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"银矿堆","titleEn":"Silver Stack"},"p-aba3be22737a5900a929.html":{"zh":"汁液 是通过 汁液提取器 获取的原始资源，主要精炼为 埃达精华 ，也用于制作某些消耗品。","en":"Sap is a raw resource obtained using Sap Extractors . Its primary use is to be refined into Refined Eitr , and is also used for creating certain consumable items.","titleZh":"汁液","titleEn":"Sap"},"p-abcdd27db10bd386ad85.html":{"zh":"盘子 可能指：","en":"Platter may refer to:","titleZh":"盘子","titleEn":"Platter"},"p-abcf3ad0e402b00191d2.html":{"zh":"餐盘 用于将 食物 、 蜜酒 或 宴席 放在地面或建筑上，玩家可直接食用。 沼泽女巫 以140枚 钱币 出售。 宴席需先用餐盘放置才能食用。 餐盘移除选项可拾回已放物品；宴席已部分吃掉时，则直接销毁。","en":"The Serving Tray is used to place Food , Mead or Feast items on the ground or on top of structures. Placed items can be eaten directly by players. It is sold by The Bog Witch for 140 Coins . Feasts can only be eaten after they have been placed with a Serving Tray. The Serving Tray remove option can be used to pick placed items. If a feast has already been partially eaten, it will be destroyed instead.","titleZh":"餐盘","titleEn":"Serving Tray"},"p-abf0cce4fbc5144f3100.html":{"zh":"铁铸蓝光火炬 是可在 熔炉 范围内使用 工具锤 建造的光源，需要 灰矮人之眼 作为燃料。 蓝焰立式铁火把最多装六份灰矮人之眼。装入1/6容量的燃料可燃烧5小时33分钟，装满可燃烧33小时20分钟，与 铁铸火炬 、 铁铸绿光火炬 和 壁灯 相同。","en":"The Standing blue-burning iron torch is a light source that can be built using the Hammer within range of a Forge . It requires Greydwarf Eye as fuel. The standing blue-burning iron torch can hold up to six Greydwarf eyes at once. With 1/6 fuel, a standing blue-burning iron torch will last for 5 hours and 33 minutes. At its maximum capacity, a standing blue-burning iron torch will last for 33 hours and 20 minutes. T…","titleZh":"铁铸蓝光火炬","titleEn":"Standing Blue-burning Iron Torch"},"p-abf4e9bf698901609e2d.html":{"zh":"蜜酒 是可饮用的物品，能暂时提升生命值和耐力，也可防止有害的 状态效果 。 制作蜜酒时，须先在 蜜酒壶 处制成蜜酒原液，再使用 发酵桶 发酵。 无论是否持有 大酒杯 、 矮人酒杯 或 庆祝号角 ，都可以饮用蜜酒。","en":"Meads are items which can be consumed for temporary health and stamina boosts, as well as preventing harmful status effects . Mead must first be crafted into a mead base at a Mead Ketill and then fermented using a Fermenter . Mead can be consumed with or without a Tankard , Dvergr Tankard or a Horn of Celebration .","titleZh":"蜜酒","titleEn":"Mead"},"p-ac1df70e9bcff283b54a.html":{"zh":"驼鹿宝宝 是 驼鹿 的幼体，位于 极北之地 。经过3,000秒，即50分钟，会成长为成年驼鹿。驯服驼鹿生出的幼崽长大后仍保持驯服。","en":"The Moose Calf is the young form of the Moose , found in the Deep North . It grows into an adult Moose after 3,000 seconds (50 minutes). A calf born to a tamed Moose stays tamed when it grows up.","titleZh":"驼鹿宝宝","titleEn":"Moose Calf"},"p-ac4a0986227688456383.html":{"zh":"铁斧 是第四种单手 斧 ，可用于砍伐 古老的 、 桦树 、 山毛榉 、 冷杉 、 橡树 和 松树 树木。","en":"Iron Axe is the fourth one-handed axe . It can be used to chop down Ancient , Birch , Beech , Fir , Oak and Pine trees.","titleZh":"铁斧","titleEn":"Iron Axe"},"p-ace347a7cc50c875e630.html":{"zh":"工匠台 是 基础 设施，可在40米范围内建造 高炉 、 纺车 、 风车 和 石砌烤炉 。 建造需要 巨龙之泪 ，因此必须先击杀 冰霜龙母 。要建造 灰烬长船 并前往 灰烬之地 ，还需升级工匠台；升级材料通过击杀 蛊虫之后 获得。 交互使用需要屋顶和70%的 遮蔽 ；建造设施则无须屋顶或遮蔽。","en":"Artisan Tables are base structures used for building Blast Furnaces , Spinning Wheels , Windmills , and Stone Oven within 40 meters. They require Dragon Tears , so they can only be built after killing Moder . Its upgrade is required to build the Drakkar to reach Ashlands and is obtained by killing The Queen . Interacting requires a roof and 70% cover . Building structures does not require roof or any cover.","titleZh":"工匠台","titleEn":"Artisan Table"},"p-ad15190e26c5bf6eb282.html":{"zh":"脉息耳环 是一种 迷雾之地 级别的 饰物 。","en":"Pulsating Earrings is a Mistlands -tier trinket .","titleZh":"脉息耳环","titleEn":"Pulsating Earrings"},"p-ad9a6b1417f88110dc1c.html":{"zh":"回音法杖 是一根 极北之地 血魔法 法杖。 主要攻击发射一枚不造成伤害、可穿过生物的弹体。弹体命中地形、建筑或其他实体物体时会反弹，或在4秒后自动反弹。随后，它会以相同速度沿来时的方向飞回。 反弹点会产生60点 火焰 伤害和60点 冰霜 伤害的范围攻击，也可能命中玩家。反弹后，弹体会穿过敌人，对接触到的每个生物只造成一次伤害。每次直接命中造成50点火焰伤害和50点冰霜伤害，并对2.42米半径内的敌人额外造成60点火焰伤害和60点冰霜伤害。弹体只能反弹一次，第二次命中地形或建筑时会停止。根据地形形状，返回的弹体可能在反弹后立即停止。如果连续飞行四秒未命中任何物体，就会消失。 返回的弹体不会伤害施法者。若穿过施法者，施法者会恢复10点 埃达之能 。","en":"Echo Spike is a Deep North Blood magic staff. The primary attack launches a projectile that deals no damage and passes through creatures. The projectile bounces when it hits terrain, a structure or another solid object, or automatically after 4 seconds. It then flies back in the direction it came from at the same speed.","titleZh":"回音法杖","titleEn":"Echo Spike"},"p-ad9da58b3924ebe14bfe.html":{"zh":"平原牦牛的祝福 是穿齐 牦牛皮套装 三件套后获得的 状态效果 。 它给出:","en":"Boon of the Lox is a status effect granted by wearing all three pieces of the Lox Fur Set . It gives:","titleZh":"平原牦牛的祝福","titleEn":"Boon of the Lox"},"p-adacf4ebb77cf80c9df6.html":{"zh":"手撕熊肉 是一种 黑暗林山 级别的 食物 。","en":"Pulled Bear is a Black Forest -tier food .","titleZh":"手撕熊肉","titleEn":"Pulled Bear"},"p-adf892bdf3b79a3f63b4.html":{"zh":"碎布护甲 是一套 青青草原 级别的 护甲 ，也是能够获得的最基础护甲。它的属性低于 皮甲 ，只提供少量防护。碎布护甲没有套装加成。每位玩家开始游戏时都装备着碎布上衣。","en":"Rag Armor is a Meadows -tier armor and the most basic armor that can be acquired. It is statistically inferior to Leather Armor , and provides minimal protection. There are no set bonuses for rag armor. Every player starts with a Rag Tunic equipped.","titleZh":"碎布护甲","titleEn":"Rag Armor"},"p-adfb90b90f37f86007fe.html":{"zh":"战斗废墟 是 青青草原 生态区中的 地点 ，外形像木制战斗场地。","en":"Combat Ruins are Points of interest found in the Meadows biome. They look like a wooden battle arena.","titleZh":"战斗废墟","titleEn":"Combat Ruin"},"p-ae0b2443183f9da7fa52.html":{"zh":"深渊藤壶 是 资源 资源点，可用 镐击 从 无尽之海 中的 利维坦 背上开采。","en":"Abyssal Barnacles are a resource node and can be mined with a pickaxe from the backs of Leviathans found in the Ocean biome.","titleZh":"深渊藤壶","titleEn":"Abyssal Barnacle"},"p-ae222f8397107dfae491.html":{"zh":"潜行 是一种 技能 。","en":"Sneaking is a skill .","titleZh":"潜行（技能）","titleEn":"Sneaking (skill)"},"p-ae81260e01e651f154b6.html":{"zh":"地毯 由对应 生物 的皮制作， 地毯 则由黄麻制作。两者都是提供 舒适度 的装饰物。","en":"Rugs are made from the hides of their respective creature types, while carpets are made from jute. Both are used as decorative objects that give comfort .","titleZh":"地毯","titleEn":"Rugs"},"p-ae833ab30e01b0857b89.html":{"zh":"黑曜石矿源 是 凛冽雪山 中的资源节点，需 铁镐 或更好工具采集。","en":"An Obsidian Deposit is a resource node and is found in the Mountains biome and require an Iron Pickaxe or better to harvest.","titleZh":"黑曜石矿源","titleEn":"Obsidian Deposit"},"p-ae8695893112e3113c47.html":{"zh":"木桶 是具有12个（6x2）物品格的 储物 设施，不会因淋雨而腐朽。 所需材料由 霍尔德 出售。","en":"Barrels are storage structures with 12(6x2) item slots. They do not degrade from rain. It requires materials sold by Haldor .","titleZh":"木桶","titleEn":"Barrel"},"p-aeaae7ed28e501193b2e.html":{"zh":"天境之羽 是 灰烬之地 中的材料。 堕落女武神 死亡掉落2至3根天境之羽，也可在 灰烬城堡 内 灰烬宝箱 找到。","en":"Celestial feather is a material found in Ashlands . Fallen Valkyries drop 2 to 3 Celestial feathers upon death. It can also be found in Charred chest inside Charred Fortress .","titleZh":"天境之羽","titleEn":"Celestial Feather"},"p-aeaeee06ac36a10d7822.html":{"zh":"阵营 决定哪些生物彼此敌对。","en":"Factions determine which creatures are hostile to each other.","titleZh":"阵营","titleEn":"Factions"},"p-aeea3b383fcf4f2f3c67.html":{"zh":"极北之地 位于 英灵神殿 最北端，是广阔积雪的 生物群系 ，被形容为“圣诞风景明信片”。与烈焰 灰烬之地 的成群敌人相比，这里生物更少，但更强。 与灰烬之地类似，北方深境由 无尽之海 与其他生物群系隔开，北侧接壤 世界边缘 。没有类似沸海的屏障阻止进入，但推进这里的进度仍需击败 青焰龙王 ，强敌也构成威胁。岸边漂浮冰层可能危及试图靠岸的船只。 与山地一样，北方深境昼夜所有天气都算严寒。没有抗霜衣物或 抗霜蜜酒 效果时，玩家在室外会持续受到 冻僵 伤害，详见下方 天气 。 此生物群系是 1.0更新 的主要更新内容。","en":"The Deep North is a vast, snowy biome , found in the northernmost part of Valheim . Described as a \"postcard of a Christmas landscape\", it contrasts the hordes of the fiery Ashlands with fewer but stronger creatures. Akin to the Ashlands, the Deep North landmass is separated from other biomes by an Ocean and borders the World Edge on the northern side. There is no equivalent of the boiling sea preventing access to t…","titleZh":"极北之地","titleEn":"Deep North"},"p-af2529873547caa541ad.html":{"zh":"建造和修复 黑木结构 需要 木材 和 焦油 ，附近还须有 工作台 。这些构件随“家园与炉火”更新加入。","en":"Darkwood structures require Wood and Tar and the proximity of a Workbench to be built and repaired. These structures were added in the 'Hearth and Home' update.","titleZh":"黑木结构","titleEn":"Darkwood Structures"},"p-af3c5d7c08fbc5312b7b.html":{"zh":"冥火 在夜间 冥火之泉 周围收集，主要制作 冥火之光 及部分物品、 家具 。","en":"Wisps are collected around Wisp Fountains at night. They are used primarily to craft the Wisplight as well as some items and Furniture .","titleZh":"冥火","titleEn":"Wisp"},"p-af48338f0994e599f5b7.html":{"zh":"蜂窝 是 首领 ，外观像重新贴图、升级的 邪骨恶灵 ，仅能通过 控制台命令 生成。 蜂巢的攻击以 灵魂伤害 取代 毒素伤害 ，生成 迷雾之地 相关随从，掉落类似 蛊虫之后 的物品。它可能是迷雾之地未完成的占位首领，最终由 蛊虫之后 替代。","en":"Hive is a boss resembling a retextured, upgraded version of Bonemass . It can only be spawned via Console Commands . Hive deals Spirit damage instead of Poison damage with its attacks, spawns Mistlands -related minions, and drops items similar to what The Queen drops. It could be an incomplete placeholder boss for the Mistlands, which was eventually replaced with The Queen .","titleZh":"蜂窝","titleEn":"Hive"},"p-af71d81d740fd399baa3.html":{"zh":"工具架 放在 工作台 五米以内时，可为其升级。放置时附近需要 熔炉 ，之后运行则不再需要。不过，用锤子拆除时仍需要熔炉。","en":"The Tool shelf serves as an upgrade for the Workbench when placed within five meters of it. It must be placed near a Forge , but does not require one in order to function afterward. However, it does still require a Forge to remove it with the hammer.","titleZh":"工具架","titleEn":"Tool Shelf"},"p-af7feccb0e866765116b.html":{"zh":"献祭石阵 是永久建筑， 女武神 将阵亡维京人送入 英灵神殿 时抵达这里。始终位于世界地图正中心，七块独立大石环绕小型圆形石基。","en":"The Sacrificial Stones are a permanent structure where the Valkyries ferry slain Vikings into Valheim . It is always located in the very center of the world map, and is set with seven individual large stones placed around a small circular stone foundation.","titleZh":"献祭石阵","titleEn":"Sacrificial Stones"},"p-af8004a394b2f359b9cb.html":{"zh":"嗜血重锤 是使用 血石 强化 焰金属锤 得到的版本。与所有使用血石强化的武器一样，玩家每缺少1点 生命值 ，其伤害就提高0.2% （不要与生命值百分比混淆） 。 已升级的焰金属钉锤在改造为嗜血重锤时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Bloodgeon is the upgraded form of Flametal Mace using the Bloodstone . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, its damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of health the player is missing (not to be confused with health percentage) . An upgraded Flametal Mace will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Bloodgeon.","titleZh":"嗜血重锤","titleEn":"Bloodgeon"},"p-afc73fba07d15f960daf.html":{"zh":"首领 是 英灵神殿 各处独特的 生物 ，生命值很高，伤害也与所在生态区相应地较高。","en":"Bosses are unique creatures found throughout Valheim . They possess high volumes of health and output large numbers of damage respective to their biome location.","titleZh":"首领攻略","titleEn":"Boss strategies"},"p-aff0bc3b88dcecd5945d.html":{"zh":"这是 饰品 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 物品 。","en":"This is a category for acessories which are a type of items .","titleZh":"分类：饰品","titleEn":"Category:Accessories"},"p-affb268e4b88178002b9.html":{"zh":"燧石堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 燧石 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Flint Pile is a buildable structure that is used to store Flint or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"燧石堆","titleEn":"Flint Pile"},"p-b0117b6d5e59b530ef75.html":{"zh":"铁盾 是一种物品。与所有塔盾一样，它无法弹反，拿出时会产生显著的-20%移动速度惩罚，但格挡能力高于其他变体。","en":"Iron shield is an item. Like all tower shields, it is incapable of parrying and has a dramatic -20% movement speed penalty when drawn, but provides superior block power to other variants.","titleZh":"铁盾","titleEn":"Iron shield"},"p-b023bbbeed6e3a4f9a9a.html":{"zh":"蛟龙肉 是 蛟龙 必定掉落的物品，每次掉落6-7份。可以在 铁烹饪台 上烤成 熟深海蛟龙肉 ，直接食用或用于制作其他食物。","en":"Serpent Meat is a guaranteed drop from Serpents , and drops in quantities of 6-7. It can be cooked on an Iron Cooking Station to obtain Cooked Serpent Meat and be eaten or crafted into other foods.","titleZh":"蛟龙肉","titleEn":"Serpent Meat"},"p-b05499af697f339a573a.html":{"zh":"蓝莓 是生长在 黑暗林山 生物群系中的浆果。每株灌木可采集1份蓝莓，数量受 农耕（技能） 影响。灌木每5h重新结出果实。目前无法重新种植浆果灌木，灌木被毁后也不会再生。 灰矮人塔楼 外面的木桶中有时也能找到蓝莓。","en":"Blueberries are berries found in the Black Forest biome. Bushes can be harvested for 1 Blueberries, affected by Farming (Skill) . Bushes replenish after 5h . There is currently no way to replant berry bushes, and if they are destroyed they will not grow back. They can also be found randomly in barrels outside Greydwarf Towers .","titleZh":"蓝莓","titleEn":"Blueberries"},"p-b08648dbd62b71bd0027.html":{"zh":"饰品 是可装备的物品，共用同一个装备栏位，一次只能装备一件饰品。","en":"Accessories are items that can equipped. They share the same equipment slot, only one accessory can be equipped at a time.","titleZh":"饰品","titleEn":"Accessories"},"p-b1289e1def0d9df1f331.html":{"zh":"福金 是 英灵神殿 中的 角色 。他是一只会说话的大渡鸦，为刚抵达 英灵神殿 世界的维京人提供指引。","en":"Hugin is a character found in Valheim . He is a large, talking raven who provides guidance to vikings that have newly arrived in the world of Valheim .","titleZh":"福金","titleEn":"Hugin"},"p-b1360540fd694c147391.html":{"zh":"冷却桶 用于升级 熔炉 。","en":"The Forge cooler is used as an upgrade for the Forge .","titleZh":"冷却桶","titleEn":"Forge Cooler"},"p-b192aaabbfff4cb8d2dd.html":{"zh":"这是 炸弹 的 分类 ；这些武器由角色投掷，使用后会被消耗。","en":"This is a category for bombs , which are weapons that are thrown by the character and consumed when used.","titleZh":"分类：炸弹","titleEn":"Category:Bombs"},"p-b1cbaed0c96d4424ed0f.html":{"zh":"亚麻披风 是一件 护甲 部件。 制作时，玩家可以选择颜色来自定义披风外观。","en":"Linen Cape is an armor piece. When crafting, players can customize the cape by choosing a color.","titleZh":"亚麻披风","titleEn":"Linen Cape"},"p-b202ed35c97590189d71.html":{"zh":"超重 是角色 携带多 重量 最大负重时施加的 状态效果 。穿 梅金吉奧德腰带 、获得 跑尸形态 、饮用 巨魔之忍蜜酒 或 冰霜龙母的放逐之力 可提高负重上限。 超重玩家耐力降至0后，在解除超重前不会恢复。 超重时无法跳跃，难以爬陡坡，也无法奔跑、闪避或格挡。移动每秒消耗五耐力，速度设为2米/秒，不受 奔跑 技能或 芬里套装 、 拉塔托斯克药剂 等装备效果影响，但仍受 被沥青黏住了 等其他速度效果影响。 移除超额重量后，效果立即结束。","en":"Encumbered is a status effect applied when a player character is carrying more weight than their maximum capacity. This capacity can be increased by wearing a Megingjord , benefitting from Corpse Run , drinking a Mead of Troll Endurance , and/or Moder's Forsaken power . Once an encumbered player's stamina reaches 0, they will not regenerate stamina until they are unencumbered again.","titleZh":"超重","titleEn":"Encumbered"},"p-b2268bc9439af24cf891.html":{"zh":"焦油坑 是 北境平原 中的 地点 ，是 焦油 的来源。","en":"Tar Pits are a point of interest found in Plains . They are the source of Tar .","titleZh":"焦油坑","titleEn":"Tar Pit"},"p-b245ad623761b6d2f7db.html":{"zh":"雷血巨斧 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境巨斧 得到的版本。它获得额外的 劈砍 和 闪电 伤害 ，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点 生命值 ，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境巨斧在改造为雷血巨斧时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thunderblood Greataxe is a version of Nord Greataxe upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra slash and lightning damage , a 25% chance per hit to trigger Chain Lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Greataxe will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Thunderblood Greataxe.","titleZh":"雷血巨斧","titleEn":"Thunderblood Greataxe"},"p-b311172dd9a45edf995b.html":{"zh":"守护石 通过锁住门和箱子、禁止新建建筑，保护区域免受其他玩家影响，但守护石本身仍可被其他玩家摧毁。范围内主人建筑遭敌对生物攻击时，区域周围的圆形穹顶会随每次攻击闪出蓝色脉冲。","en":"The Ward can be used to protect an area from other players, by locking doors, chests, and preventing new building. Wards can be destroyed by other players. If the Ward owner's buildings are attacked by an enemy creature within the Ward's radius, a circular dome around the area will pulsate in blue for each attack the enemy creature carries out on the owner's buildings.","titleZh":"守护石","titleEn":"Ward"},"p-b369a95d0828a4dde5d9.html":{"zh":"传送门 - 石 是改进版 传送门 ，进入 灰烬之地 后不久即可获得。允许玩家携带木制传送门禁止的物品传送，例如 矿石 、 金属 、 龙蛋 、 希尔德的宝箱 和 机械弹簧 。 建造石制传送门需要 切石机 。","en":"Portal – Stone is an improved Portal which becomes available soon into the Ashlands biome. It allows players to teleport with items that Wooden portals disallow, such as Ores , Metals , Dragon Eggs , Hildir's Chests and Mechanical Springs . A Stonecutter is required to construct the Stone portal.","titleZh":"传送门 - 石","titleEn":"Portal Stone"},"p-b445282ddae97b2a3175.html":{"zh":"格挡 是提高 武器 和 盾 格挡护甲的 技能 。","en":"Blocking is a skill that increases the blocking armor of weapons and shields .","titleZh":"格挡（技能）","titleEn":"Blocking (skill)"},"p-b45eb0a6b63b2b8efc3f.html":{"zh":"小份埃达之力蜜酒 是一种 迷雾之地 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：小份埃达之力 发酵 而成。","en":"Minor eitr mead is a Mistlands -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Minor eitr .","titleZh":"小份埃达之力蜜酒","titleEn":"Minor Eitr Mead"},"p-b4b5866d7c942bcab7ca.html":{"zh":"皮革肩带 是 巨人战士 掉落的制作材料。","en":"Leather Straps are a crafting material dropped from Krigen .","titleZh":"皮革肩带","titleEn":"Leather Straps"},"p-b4d9f35c4f6e999fb38c.html":{"zh":"烘烤酥派 是一种 灰烬之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Roasted Crust Pie is an Ashlands -tier food .","titleZh":"烘烤酥派","titleEn":"Roasted Crust Pie"},"p-b4e28741331b1513a72e.html":{"zh":"北境钉锤 是一种 极北之地 级别的单手 棍棒 。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境钉锤铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Mace is a Deep North -tier one handed Clubs . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Mace and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境钉锤","titleEn":"Nord Mace"},"p-b4e48ccee3ba935d6f3d.html":{"zh":"血石 用于制作部分 灰烬之地 武器的“鲜血”变体，可在灰烬之地 灰烬亡灵堡垒 内的 灰烬宝箱 中找到。 用血石升级的武器，玩家每缺少1点 生命值 ，伤害提高0.2%。","en":"Bloodstone is a material used to craft the \"Blood\" version of some Ashlands weapons. They have a chance to be found in the Charred chests inside Charred Fortresses located in Ashlands. A weapon upgraded with Bloodstone has its damage increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of health the player is missing.","titleZh":"血石","titleEn":"Bloodstone"},"p-b51c893126273664f160.html":{"zh":"枯骨塔盾 是第二种塔 盾 。 其格挡能力高于 木塔盾 ，但同样会使玩家的 移动速度 降低10%，并使 闪避 翻滚消耗增加10%。 作为塔盾，它不能用于 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Bone Tower Shield is the second tower shield . It has more block power compared to Wood Tower Shield , but similarly reduces the player's movement speed by 10% and increases dodge roll cost by 10%. As a tower shield, it cannot be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"枯骨塔盾","titleEn":"Bone Tower Shield"},"p-b51ea72f1c1ef2b0b1cf.html":{"zh":"矮人守卫塔 是 迷雾之地 各处较常见的 矮人 建筑，主要由 黑大理石 建成，住有 矮人刺客 和 法师 。每座有居民守卫塔包含 矮人板条箱 ，是推进流程的重要制作材料。 矮人守卫塔废墟 是破败的矮人守卫塔变体，改由 邪蛛探索者 占据。","en":"Dvergr Guard Towers are one of the more common types of Dvergr structures located throughout the Mistlands . A tower made mostly of Black Marble , it is one type of Dvergr structure and is home to Dvergr Rogues and mages . Each inhabited Dvergr Guard Tower contains a Dvergr Component Crate , an important crafting component for progression.","titleZh":"矮人守卫塔","titleEn":"Dvergr Guard Tower"},"p-b575a12ff4742c150d8d.html":{"zh":"失衡 是一种使目标短暂失去行动能力的战斗状态，非玩家 生物 在此状态下受到双倍伤害。以下两种情况会造成踉跄： 各生物踉跄时长不同，从近乎瞬间到数秒。招架某些攻击时，时长也可能不同。 非玩家生物踉跄期间，每次被击中受到双倍伤害。已踉跄时忽略新的踉跄。玩家通过伤害使生物踉跄时，获得3点 血怒 ，再乘以该生物的血怒倍率。 受到物理，即钝击、挥砍、穿刺，以及闪电 伤害类型 时会累积踉跄值。数值等于抗性及护甲计算后的实际伤害，乘以攻击踉跄倍率。部分状态可修改受到的踉跄值，目前只有 青焰龙王 的 放逐之力 会将其减半。格挡时，玩家还会依据穿透格挡的物理或闪电伤害额外累积踉跄值。 踉跄值每秒衰减上限的20%，达到上限时不会重置，也不会超过上限。 踉跄上限为最大生命的一定比例，通常越强的生物越难踉跄。上限为0%的生物免疫伤害导致的踉跄。玩家食用增加生命的 食物 会提高上限，也使踉跄值衰减更快。","en":"Stagger is a combat state that stuns the target and causes non-player creatures to take double damage. Stagger is caused in two cases: The stagger duration is different for each creature ranging from near instant to a few seconds. The duration may also be different when parrying certain attacks. While a non-player creature is staggered, every hit against it deals double damage. A new stagger is ignored while the tar…","titleZh":"失衡","titleEn":"Stagger"},"p-b5a91478d7556fe5d63b.html":{"zh":"远古护甲 是遍布 迷雾之地 的资源节点，需 黑金属镐 或更好工具采集。与 上古之剑 一起，可让玩家在迷雾之地方便获取 废铁 及 铜碎屑 。","en":"Ancient Armor are resource nodes found throughout the Mistlands which require a Black Metal Pickaxe or better to harvest. Along with Ancient Swords , they can provide players with easy access to Scrap Iron and Copper Scrap from within the Mistlands biome.","titleZh":"远古护甲","titleEn":"Ancient Armor"},"p-b5d49fc53623a568ae4f.html":{"zh":"壁灯 是可在 熔炉 范围内使用 工具锤 建造的光源，需要 树脂 作为燃料。 最多可装6份树脂。装入1/6容量的燃料可燃烧5小时33分钟，装满可燃烧33小时20分钟，与 铁铸火炬 、 铁铸绿光火炬 和 铁铸蓝光火炬 相同，比 木制火炬 更久。壁灯木制菱形的中点须在天花板下方至少1米，否则会熄灭。 安装在室外的壁灯不会被暴风雨熄灭。","en":"The Sconce is a light source that can be built using the Hammer within range of a Forge . It requires Resin as fuel. It can hold up to 6 Resin at once. With 1/6 fuel, a Sconce will last for 5 hours and 33 minutes. At maximum capacity a Sconce should burn for 33 hours and 20 minutes. This duration is the same for the Standing Iron Torch , Standing Green-Burning Iron Torch and Standing Blue-Burning Iron Torch , and la…","titleZh":"壁灯","titleEn":"Sconce"},"p-b5ed6f5e6de1829f0bb9.html":{"zh":"防叮特调 是一种 北境平原 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：防叮咬 发酵 而成。","en":"Anti-sting concoction is a Plains -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Anti-sting .","titleZh":"防叮特调","titleEn":"Anti-Sting Concoction"},"p-b65ffe0cec61786d5d09.html":{"zh":"传送门 按设置的标签相互连接，不受位置或建造者影响。","en":"Portals connect to each other based on their defined tag, no matter where or who built it.","titleZh":"传送门","titleEn":"Portal"},"p-b667253cf08d254697db.html":{"zh":"以下物品可用 . ，用于升级角色及属性。","en":"The following items are available . They can be used to upgrade your character and boost your stats.","titleZh":"分类：物品","titleEn":"Category:Items"},"p-b66e6b4aac20d45e813b.html":{"zh":"血金 是一种 极北之地 金属。 在 高炉 冶炼 石化组织 获得。","en":"Bloodgold is a Deep North metal. It is obtained by smelting Petrified Tissue in a Blast Furnace .","titleZh":"血金","titleEn":"Bloodgold"},"p-b6a1aa96c5a5306b50ab.html":{"zh":"疾跑 是穿戴 灰烬刚鬣披风 获得的 状态效果 。 顺风移动加速、降奔跑耐力，类似 轮船 顺风航行。","en":"Wind Run is a status effect granted by wearing the Asksvin Cloak . When moving in the same direction as the wind your movement speed is increased and your running stamina usage is decreased. Not much different to sailing with a tailwind on a boat .","titleZh":"疾跑","titleEn":"Wind run"},"p-b73c50dc78a6c46472b3.html":{"zh":"练兵傀儡 用于训练 武器 、 箭术 、 躲开 和 格挡 技能 。不会攻击敌对生物，只在玩家靠近时攻击玩家。其他生物，包括 被驯服 生物，都不会主动将它作为目标。 它提供完整的战斗 经验 ；与之相比， 箭靶 允许回收弹药，但只提供35%经验。 虽然开发者未正式确认，但假人的名称可能代表“Training With Iron Gate”，即“与Iron Gate一起训练”。","en":"The T.W.I.G. is a structure used to train weapons , archery , dodging and blocking skills . They do not attack hostile creatures and will only attack players when they get near. Other creatures, including tamed ones, never choose it as a target on their own. They grant full combat Experience , unlike the Archery Target which grants only 35% of XP in exchange for ammunition being retrievable.","titleZh":"练兵傀儡","titleEn":"T.W.I.G."},"p-b7ec07967c530f469258.html":{"zh":"英灵神殿之冠 是一件在击败 极北之地 后获得的头盔。","en":"Crown of Valheim is a post- Deep North helmet.","titleZh":"英灵神殿之冠","titleEn":"Crown of Valheim"},"p-b7efc9ad09ba270f8511.html":{"zh":"小红莓 是 青青草原 中的 角色 ，是一只驯服的 平原牦牛 ，在 希尔德 的贸易营地陪伴她。","en":"Hallon is a character found in the Meadows . It is a tamed Lox that accompanies Hildir at her trading camp.","titleZh":"小红莓","titleEn":"Hallon"},"p-b83add4bc3c77373651d.html":{"zh":"巨石空地是 黑暗林山 中独特的 地点 。 一块大岩石周围环绕22个 神秘的石头 和少量 蓟草 。大岩石可破坏以获取普通 石头 。 每个世界仅有一处巨石空地，共有10个可能生成位置，都距世界中心超过1000米。靠近任一位置会将其永久锁定在那里。 大岩石夜间略微发光。首次发现时，蓝色萤火虫会围绕此处数分钟。","en":"The Big Rock Clearing is a unique point of interest found in the Black Forest . It is a large rock surrounded by 22 Mysterious Rocks and a few Thistle . The large rock can be destroyed for regular Stone . Only one Big Rock Clearing can exist in a world. It has 10 possible spawn locations at more than 1000 meters from the world center. Approaching any of these locations will permanently place it there.","titleZh":"巨石空地","titleEn":"Big Rock Clearing"},"p-b841bead15de6f7c8aad.html":{"zh":"Gudrun 是在 英灵神殿 中提及的 角色 。","en":"Gudrun is a mentioned character in Valheim .","titleZh":"Gudrun","titleEn":"Gudrun"},"p-b842a5b18d506588b250.html":{"zh":"本页列出存档中持久化数据的内部标识符，对模组作者及部分模组可能有用。另见 物品ID 。","en":"This page contains internal IDs for data that gets persisted in the save files. This can be useful for mod creators and some mods. See also: Item IDs .","titleZh":"数据标识","titleEn":"Data IDs"},"p-b88e6b74d4428475a24a.html":{"zh":"这是 英灵神殿 可用 鱼饵 的 分类 。","en":"This is a category for bait available in Valheim .","titleZh":"分类：鱼饵","titleEn":"Category:Bait"},"p-b88f49c50094a29b876f.html":{"zh":"灰烬射手 是 灰烬之地 中的敌对远程敌人。","en":"Charred Marksman are hostile ranged enemies found in the Ashlands .","titleZh":"灰烬射手","titleEn":"Charred Marksman"},"p-b8a914405858df4afbcd.html":{"zh":"纪念场地 是位于 极北之地 的 地点 。","en":"Memorial Sites are points of interest found in the Deep North .","titleZh":"纪念场地","titleEn":"Memorial Site"},"p-b8c18c6a3877270cdab1.html":{"zh":"水晶 是 凛冽雪山 中的材料。","en":"Crystal is a material found in the Mountains .","titleZh":"水晶","titleEn":"Crystal"},"p-b8e0a74433a1176e439f.html":{"zh":"击败各首领并将其战利品挂在 献祭石阵 上，即可解锁 放逐之力 。默认按 按钮 F 激活当前放逐之力。同一时间只能选用一种，可在献祭石碑处切换。 所有放逐之力持续5分钟，共用20分钟冷却。退出游戏、更换当前放逐之力或睡觉均不会重置或缩短冷却。 激活放逐之力时，玩家会进入持续数秒的动画，无法移动或执行其他操作，但可装备或卸下工具、武器。 激活放逐之力时，10米内所有玩家也会获得效果。因此四名玩家依次使用各自的放逐之力，几乎可无限维持效果。","en":"Forsaken powers are unlocked by defeating each boss and hanging their trophy on the Sacrificial Stones . By default, the player's set forsaken power is activated by pressing F . Only one forsaken power can be set at a time, which is changed out at the Sacrificial Stones. All forsaken powers have a duration of 5 minutes. They also share the same 20-minute cooldown, which does not reset or reduce even when the player…","titleZh":"遗弃者能力","titleEn":"Forsaken power"},"p-b8e7e4df56b0e12879e0.html":{"zh":"埃达精华 是从 埃达之力提炼器 获取的制作材料，用于制作、升级多种 迷雾之地 级物品。","en":"Refined eitr is a crafting material obtained from the Eitr Refinery . It is used for crafting and upgrading numerous Mistlands -tier items.","titleZh":"埃达精华","titleEn":"Refined Eitr"},"p-b8f712a4844f39db1d9b.html":{"zh":"矮人疗愈 是在4秒内恢复400生命值的 状态效应 。 战斗中，辅助 矮人法师 可施放治疗，为周围4.32米内所有 矮人 和玩家施加矮人治疗。","en":"Dvergr heal is a Status effect that heals 400 health over 4 seconds. During battle, Support Dvergr Mages can cast a healing spell that applies Dvergr heal to all Dvergr and players in a 4.32-meter radius around them.","titleZh":"矮人疗愈","titleEn":"Dvergr heal"},"p-b904432b6de55a66c7f7.html":{"zh":"大麦 是 北境平原 生物群系中的材料，可在 地精村落 的小块耕地、丑地精村庄的 平原宝箱 、 地精前哨 及 地精废墟 中找到，也可在 极北之地 中 废弃村落 的粮仓木桶内找到。 大麦仅可用 耕地耙 在 北境平原 种植、收获。完全成熟需4,000至5,000秒，即66分40秒至83分20秒，约游戏内2.22-2.78天。 成熟大麦受武器伤害会掉两份大麦，可用 鹿角战锤 、 铁大锤 或 长柄武器' 副攻击等范围攻击。不会损失大麦，但不提供 耕作技能 经验，也不触发额外产出，因此用 镰刀 或手动收获可能获得更多。","en":"Barley is a material item found in the Plains biome, in Fuling Villages as small patches of cultivated land, and inside of Plains Chest found in Fuling Villages, Fuling Outposts and Fuling Ruins , as well as the barrels inside the granary of Abandoned Villages in the Deep North . Barley can only be planted and harvested in the Plains biome, using a Cultivator . It takes between 4,000 seconds and 5,000 seconds (betwe…","titleZh":"大麦","titleEn":"Barley"},"p-b908ce12557e5c3f33c5.html":{"zh":"尼德霍格 是第六种单手 剑 。","en":"Nidhögg is the sixth one-handed sword .","titleZh":"尼德霍格","titleEn":"Nidhögg"},"p-b90b3ce3ea35ac4d9cf3.html":{"zh":"魔阁哈拉 是位于 极北之地 的一处 地牢 。开启其入口“莫克哈拉之门”需要 隐秘钥匙 ，钥匙会在开门后消耗。","en":"Mörkhalla is a dungeon found in the Deep North . An Intricate Key is required to open its entrance, the Gates of Mörkhalla. The key is destroyed after opening the entrance.","titleZh":"魔阁哈拉","titleEn":"Mörkhalla"},"p-b93909b5f83342167cf5.html":{"zh":"尸鬼精英 是 泥泞沼泽 中的敌对 生物 ，属于身体肿胀的古老维京亡灵，比普通 尸鬼 更强，始终持近战武器。眼睛发紫光，比普通个体少见。","en":"Draugr Elite are aggressive creatures found in the Swamps . They are ancient undead Vikings that have since become bloated in appearance. They are stronger than normal Draugr , but always appear equipped with a melee weapon. They have glowing purple eyes and are relatively rare compared to their weaker counterparts.","titleZh":"尸鬼精英","titleEn":"Draugr Elite"},"p-b95006948ace61cdad04.html":{"zh":"休息中 是附近无敌对 生物 ，且坐在火旁，或同时具有 火焰 和 庇护 时施加的 状态效果 。处于 潮湿 时无法获得，坐在 浴缸 例外； 燃烧中 、 冻僵 、 毒素 等伤害状态期间也无法获得。 连续休息20秒后获得 休息好了 。周围 舒适度 决定时间，为舒适度加7分钟，例如舒适度3给10分钟。敌对生物靠近、火熄灭，或大型建筑角落超出火源半径，都可能重置休息。","en":"Resting is a status effect applied when there are no hostile creatures nearby and the player is sitting near a fire, or while under the Fire effect and Shelter effect simultaneously. The resting effect cannot be applied if the player is Wet (unless sitting in a Hot Tub ) or while under the effect of any harming status effect, such as Burning , Freezing or Poison .","titleZh":"休息中","titleEn":"Resting"},"p-b961e7853bfc1aa6585a.html":{"zh":"子分类 分类：首领召唤祭品 分类中的页面 上古种子 古钟 龙蛋 丑地精图腾 希尔德的宝箱 隐秘钥匙 邪恶之血 封印破除者 沼泽钥匙 枯骨","en":"Subcategories Category:Forsaken offerings Pages in category Ancient Seed Bell Dragon Egg Fuling Totem Hildir's Chests Intricate Key Malicious Blood Sealbreaker Swamp Key Withered Bone","titleZh":"分类：杂项物品","titleEn":"Category:Misc Items"},"p-b99c91893437981bd8c4.html":{"zh":"监狱 是第8位及最终首领 凌冽·芬布尔使者 的出生地点和战场，类似 腐疫地堡 ，是如 地牢 的独立区域，可遇见并对战凌冽·芬布尔使者。","en":"The Prison is the spawn location and boss arena of the 8th and final boss, Kall Fimbulbringer . Similar to the Infested Citadel , it is an instanced area (much like a dungeon ) wherein Kall Fimbulbringer can be encountered and fought.","titleZh":"监狱","titleEn":"The Prison"},"p-b9b5bda3604425f0b7c6.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 灰石屋顶 木瓦屋顶 茅草屋顶","en":"Pages in category Grausten Roofs Shingle Roofs Thatch Roofs","titleZh":"分类：屋顶","titleEn":"Category:Roofs"},"p-b9c51749d77e5c76f54b.html":{"zh":"冰火巨斧 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境巨斧 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 劈砍伤害 ，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜伤害 。 已升级的北境巨斧在改造为冰火巨斧时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Frostfire Greataxe is a version of Nord Greataxe upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of slash damage in exchange of a larger amount of fire and frost damage . An upgraded Nord Greataxe will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Frostfire Greataxe.","titleZh":"冰火巨斧","titleEn":"Frostfire Greataxe"},"p-ba16540902bdc96359b7.html":{"zh":"灰矮人暴徒 是 黑暗林山 中的敌对 生物 ，外形如覆苔的大树，体形和力量远超 灰矮人 。","en":"Greydwarf brutes are aggressive creatures found in Black Forests . They are large mossy tree-like beings and are substantially bigger and stronger than Greydwarfs .","titleZh":"灰矮人暴徒","titleEn":"Greydwarf Brute"},"p-ba8af0f4802678da4aed.html":{"zh":"鹿 是 青青草原 和 黑暗林山 中的被动 生物 ，四足、红褐色，极为胆小，完全无害。","en":"Deer are passive creatures found in Meadows and Black Forests . They are four-legged, reddish-brown animals that are extremely timid and completely harmless.","titleZh":"鹿","titleEn":"Deer"},"p-baa01ad879365a411c0c.html":{"zh":"鹿角战锤 是第一种双手 棍棒 。","en":"Stagbreaker is the first two-handed club .","titleZh":"鹿角战锤","titleEn":"Stagbreaker"},"p-bb01a030df624241707d.html":{"zh":"蛟龙 是 无尽之海 中的敌对 生物 ，目前也是海洋唯一自然生成的敌对生物。它们是大型水生蛇状爬行动物，有六只发光眼睛、带刺背鳍，巨口中布满锋利牙齿。 狩猎蛟龙主要为了肉，可用于中后期食物。","en":"Serpents are aggressive creatures found in Oceans , and currently the only hostile creature spawning in Oceans. They are large, aquatic snake-like reptilian creatures with six glowing eyes, spiked dorsal fins and a gaping mouth filled with razor-sharp teeth. Serpents are hunted primarily for their meat, which can be used in mid-late game food.","titleZh":"蛟龙","titleEn":"Serpent"},"p-bb0ad32d02eb671e9220.html":{"zh":"牦牛皮套装 是一套 北境平原 级别的 护甲 ，比 狼皮护甲 和 芬里套装 高一级，之后分别被 甲壳护甲 和 埃达织物套装 替代。","en":"The Lox Fur Set is a Plains -tier armor . This set is the tier above Wolf Armor and Fenris Set , and is replaced by Carapace Armor and Eitr-weave Set , respectively.","titleZh":"牦牛皮套装","titleEn":"Lox Fur Set"},"p-bb0db9f7893c418a1de3.html":{"zh":"攻击击退会将目标推向相反方向，持盾格挡也会造成击退。 推动速度固定为10米/秒，覆盖该方向已有速度，除非目标本已移动更快。 推动时间根据击退及目标质量计算，上限0.4秒，最多移动4米。对较小敌人，40–80击退足以达到上限。 推动方向始终位于水平面。垂直推动力会被忽略，因此可能降低击退距离。 游泳或飞行时被推动，还会使所有方向速度减半。","en":"Knockback from attacks pushes the target towards the opposing direction. Blocking with a shield also causes a knockback. The velocity of the push is fixed at 10 meters per second. This overwrites any existing velocity on the push direction, unless already moving faster. The duration of the push is calculated from the knockback and the target mass. The duration is capped at 0.4 seconds, so a knockback can move the ta…","titleZh":"击退","titleEn":"Knockback"},"p-bb7d2e81f6d12f31b8a3.html":{"zh":"越橘汁 是一种 极北之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Lingonberry Juice is a Deep North -tier food .","titleZh":"越橘汁","titleEn":"Lingonberry Juice"},"p-bbe5eb65d52245a3d14d.html":{"zh":"雕纹长桌 是用 巨木 制造的 极北之地 桌子 。放在附近提高两点 舒适度 ，属于桌子舒适度组，因此只有附近舒适度最高的桌子生效。","en":"Long Carved Table is a Deep North table built from Timberwood . It increases Comfort by two when placed nearby; it belongs to the table comfort group, so only the highest-comfort table nearby counts.","titleZh":"雕纹长桌","titleEn":"Long Carved Table"},"p-bc8c037784075c8ff522.html":{"zh":"石棚 是 青青草原 和 黑暗林山 中的 地点 ，由两块或更多直立巨石支撑一块水平大石板组成。 北境平原 中的类似结构请参阅 巨石阵 。","en":"Dolmens are Points of interest found in the Meadows and the Black Forest . Dolmens consist of two or more upright megaliths supporting a large flat horizontal capstone. For similar structures found in Plains , see Stonehenge .","titleZh":"石棚","titleEn":"Dolmen"},"p-bd0aedf8fe5f6dea5982.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 水晶战斧 招魂之杖 尸鬼之牙 矮人灯笼 火龙剑 燃烧的箭 霜箭 杀戮之戟 巨人之戮 迷雾行者 蜂针箭 毒箭 树脂蜡烛 闪电屠杀者 裂颅者 断脊 余烬之杖 破碎之杖 冰霜之杖 火把","en":"Pages in category Crystal Battleaxe Dead Raiser Draugr Fang Dvergr Lantern Dyrnwyn Fire Arrow Frost Arrow Himminafl Jotun Bane Mistwalker Needle Arrow Poison Arrow Resin Candle Scourging Slayer Skull Splittur Spinesnap Staff of Embers Staff of Fracturing Staff of Frost Torch","titleZh":"分类：光源","titleEn":"Category:Light sources"},"p-bd0ceadf4975eaaa80eb.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以75枚 钱币 购买5个 新鲜海带 。","en":"Fresh seaweed can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 75 Coins for 5 items.","titleZh":"新鲜海带","titleEn":"Fresh Seaweed"},"p-bd223c81de7e86da43ee.html":{"zh":"铁 是由 废铁 或 铁矿 在 冶炼炉 冶炼的制作材料，每份30秒。 铁可在多处找到：","en":"Iron is a crafting material smelted from Scrap Iron or Iron Ore in the Smelter . It takes 30 seconds to smelt one. Iron can be found in various places:","titleZh":"铁","titleEn":"Iron"},"p-bd5a4a57d80fd35e3609.html":{"zh":"蛟龙鳞盾 是第四种塔 盾 。 其格挡护甲与 银盾 相同，但格挡时提供 穿刺 抗性。它还会使玩家的 移动速度 降低10%，并使 闪避 翻滚消耗增加10%。 作为塔盾，它不能用于 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Serpent Scale Shield is the fourth tower shield . It has the same block armor compared to Silver Shield , but provides pierce resistance when blocking. It also reduces the player's movement speed by 10% and increases dodge roll cost by 10%. As a tower shield, it cannot be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"蛟龙鳞盾","titleEn":"Serpent Scale Shield"},"p-bd5ab2a059204a280443.html":{"zh":"灰石宝箱 是 灰烬之地 阶段的一种 储物设施 。 制作灰石箱需要5份 战士战利品 ，成本较高，因此主要用于装饰。","en":"Grausten Chest is an Ashlands -tier Storage option. The 5 Warrior Trophies required to craft the Grausten Chest makes it expensive, and thus mainly a cosmetic option.","titleZh":"灰石宝箱","titleEn":"Grausten Chest"},"p-be01beb2fff31a66abf2.html":{"zh":"平原牦牛 是 北境平原 中的敌对 生物 ，形似大型蜥蜴与牛的混合体，长棕色蓬毛，皮肤像爬行动物。平原牦牛可被 驯养生物 ，之后能繁殖及 骑行 。","en":"Lox are aggressive creatures found in Plains . They are an enlarged fusion of both a lizard and an ox, with shaggy brown hair and reptilian skin. Lox can be tamed which allows them to be bred and ridden .","titleZh":"平原牦牛","titleEn":"Lox"},"p-be176b0015c424b78e9f.html":{"zh":"地图 提供 世界 已探索部分的概览。探索新区域时，玩家周围一定范围内的地形会自动揭示。揭示的地形只反映世界生成时高度图上的 生态区域 分布，不显示建筑或玩家对地形的改动。 地图揭示范围小于世界生成范围，因此玩家亲眼看到的地形可能比地图显示的更远。 按M可打开全屏地图，小地图则始终显示在 状态界面 中。","en":"The map provides an overview of the explored part of the world . Terrain is revealed automatically in a range around the player as new parts of the world are explored. The revealed terrain only reflects the placement of biomes on a heightmap at world generation, structures or player-made alterations to the terrain are not shown.","titleZh":"地图","titleEn":"Map"},"p-be3bdba22ba757625e50.html":{"zh":"预告片船 是一艘大型 轮船 ，目前只能通过 命令 获得。","en":"The Trailership is a large boat . Currently, it can only be obtained through commands .","titleZh":"预告片船","titleEn":"Trailership"},"p-be4ed2e6aae22d41f50f.html":{"zh":"红色黄麻 由 狂信徒 掉落，或破坏 冰霜洞穴 内 凛冽雪山 生物群系 的帘子获得。","en":"Red Jute is a drop from Cultists and from destroyed curtains in the Mountain biome inside Frost Caves .","titleZh":"红色黄麻","titleEn":"Red Jute"},"p-bed7091d9620f141193b.html":{"zh":"跑尸形态 是玩家取回墓碑全部物品后获得的 状态效果 ，持续50秒，提供以下效果：","en":"Corpse run is a status effect applied to the player upon collecting all the items from their grave. The effect lasts for 50 seconds and applies the following effects:","titleZh":"跑尸形态","titleEn":"Corpse run"},"p-bf10a5ee1fab92a8db98.html":{"zh":"“ 这片土地艰险荒野，但被带来的人更坚强。旅人，从眼前馈赠中得到慰藉：优良木石、森林果实与花朵。也留意游荡的鬓猪，它们怕火与人手，却可学会顺从。悄悄靠近，让它们吃你储存的食物，地下根茎是其最爱。 ”—— 符文石 野猪是遍布 英灵神殿 的野生 生物 ，靠近时会表现敌意。状态标签可辨认“野生”或“驯养”，以及“饥饿”“开心”“害怕”“适应中”等情绪。了解这些状态有助于有效互动。 野生鬓猪怕火，包括火把；靠近时会进入“害怕”状态。2星鬓猪极少见，适合通过繁殖获取皮碎片和鬓猪肉，可驯服和繁殖，详见下文。","en":"\" This land is hard and wild but we who are brought here are harder still. Take comfort, traveller, in the gifts before you, the good wood and stone, the fruits and flowers of the forest. Look also to the wild boar who roam these lands. They fear fire and the hand of man but they can be taught to obey it. Go quietly to them and let them eat of your stock. Roots of the ground are their pleasure. \" ― Runestone","titleZh":"鬓猪","titleEn":"Boar"},"p-bf140c9c6e3851c8697e.html":{"zh":"弓 是与 弓 武器类别相关的 技能 。","en":"Bows is a skill related to the Bows weapon class.","titleZh":"弓（技能）","titleEn":"Bows (skill)"},"p-bf3fac40de1b75b9308f.html":{"zh":"营火 是 基础 设施，用于烹饪、睡眠和取暖。 建造时不需要 工作台 或其他设施。","en":"Campfires are base structures used for cooking, sleeping and warmth. They do not require a Workbench or any other structure to build.","titleZh":"营火","titleEn":"Campfire"},"p-bfa740fa2117adc7d174.html":{"zh":"炎金属矿脉 是资源节点，可用 黑金属镐 或更好工具开采 焰金属矿 。 矿脉位于 灰烬之地 生物群系 的熔岩利维坦顶部。开采可能使其开始沉入 熔岩 ，类似在 无尽之海 中从 利维坦 开采 甲壳素 。","en":"Flametal Ore Veins are resource nodes which can be mined for Flametal Ore using a Black Metal Pickaxe or better. The veins are found on top of 'Lavaiathans' found in the Ashlands biome . Mining the ore on top of a Lavaiathan may cause the vein to start sinking into the lava (similar to mining on a Leviathan for Chitin in the Ocean biome).","titleZh":"炎金属矿脉","titleEn":"Flametal Ore Vein"},"p-bfd25f300084fd9a6018.html":{"zh":"灰烬之地矮人 比同族 矮人刺客 强大得多，能力可与二星矮人刺客相比。它们与 迷雾之地 的矮人属于不同氏族。 灰烬之地矮人刺客 是 灰烬之地 中的中立 生物 ，尤其常见于 矮人 聚落周围。它们是矮小的蓝色人形生物，眼睛浅蓝、胡须红色，携带 强弩 。矮人建筑中生成的刺客通常与其他刺客同行，也可能在灰烬之地任意位置生成及重生。 玩家伤害它们、附近矮人，或矮人 守护石 保护的建筑部分时，会激怒它们，转为敌对并攻击。 灰烬之地矮人敌视当地其他主动攻击的生物，一见到便会攻击。","en":"Ashlands Dvergr are much stronger than their cousins Dvergr Rogues , their status can be compared to two-star Dvergr rogues. These Dvergr are a separate clan from those found in the Mistlands . Ashlands Dvergr Rogues are neutral creatures found in the Ashlands , especially around Dvergr settlements. They resemble short, blue humanoids with light blue eyes and red beard hair, carrying an Arbalest . Rogues that spawn…","titleZh":"灰烬之地矮人","titleEn":"Ashlands Dvergr"},"p-c00f09fb50479cfd7a04.html":{"zh":"雷血之弓 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境之弓 得到的版本。 它获得额外的 穿刺 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境之弓在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thunderblood Bow is a version of Nord Bow upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra Pierce and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Bow will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷血之弓","titleEn":"Thunderblood Bow"},"p-c078dd63818f363a444e.html":{"zh":"骨制弩箭 是供 弩 使用的 弹药 。它们是最弱的弩箭，也是唯一不需要 木材 的弩箭。","en":"Bone bolts are ammunition for crossbows . They are the weakest and only bolt that does not require wood .","titleZh":"骨制弩箭","titleEn":"Bone Bolt"},"p-c12639a5bf13368032e9.html":{"zh":"雷血匕首 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境匕首 得到的版本。 它获得额外的 劈砍 、 穿刺 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境匕首在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thunderblood Dagger is a version of Nord Dagger upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra Slash , Pierce , and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Dagger will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷血匕首","titleEn":"Thunderblood Dagger"},"p-c157cbf647f56e730a08.html":{"zh":"工具锤 用于建造 火 、 工作台 、 建筑 和家具等物品。配方从游戏开始就已解锁，制作它不需要制作设施。 可建造物品列表见 建材 。","en":"The Hammer is used to construct objects such as fires , Workbench , buildings , and furniture. The recipe is unlocked from the start of the game, and no crafting station is required to craft it. To see the list of craftable, refer to Building .","titleZh":"工具锤","titleEn":"Hammer"},"p-c18ecd6f4e1a0ab85c2b.html":{"zh":"沼泽符文石塔 是 幽暗沼泽 中的 地点 ，像石塔废墟，共两变体。","en":"Swamp Runestone Towers are Points of interest found in the Swamp . They look like ruins of stone towers. They come in two variants.","titleZh":"沼泽符文石塔","titleEn":"Swamp Runestone Tower"},"p-c1a60f21865d2d3483c9.html":{"zh":"抗火大麦酒 是一种 北境平原 阶段的消耗品，由 大麦酒主成分：抗火 发酵 而成。","en":"Fire Resistance Barley Wine is a Plains -tier consumable item fermented from Barley Wine Base: Fire Resistance .","titleZh":"抗火大麦酒","titleEn":"Fire Resistance Barley Wine"},"p-c1efda35acf6bd14e422.html":{"zh":"刀 是与 刀 武器类别相关的 技能 。","en":"Knives is a skill related to Knives weapon class.","titleZh":"刀（技能）","titleEn":"Knives (skill)"},"p-c2134a04ae76a365ceea.html":{"zh":"冻僵 是在进入 凛冽雪山 、与 冰霜龙母 战斗或 霜龙 事件 期间施加的 状态效果 。 只要玩家未处于 潮湿 ，通过以下任一来源获得 抗性 即可抵消： 此效果停止所有自然 生命值 恢复，但不影响治疗 蜜酒 提供的生命值。","en":"Freezing is a status effect applied to a character when going in the Mountain , while fighting Moder or during the Drake event . It is counteracted by gaining resistance from any one of the following, as long as the player is not Wet : The effect stops all natural health regeneration, but does not affect health gained from healing mead .","titleZh":"冻僵","titleEn":"Freezing"},"p-c22c7fcb0f4b21912f23.html":{"zh":"裂魂 是击败 亚格鲁斯 获取的物品。","en":"Torn Spirit is an item obtained by defeating Yagluth .","titleZh":"裂魂","titleEn":"Torn Spirit"},"p-c2552a6d8c63ca5d1a70.html":{"zh":"诡秘墓穴 是 黑暗林山 中的 地下城 ，地表入口有三种变体。","en":"Burial Chambers are dungeons found in Black Forests . There are three variants to the dungeon entrance in the overworld.","titleZh":"诡秘墓穴","titleEn":"Burial Chambers"},"p-c2633a0a9e1b64a575c6.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 阿斯克套装 熊皮套装 青铜护甲 召唤者套装 甲壳护甲 埃达织物套装 恩布拉套装 芬里套装 焰金属护甲 铁制护甲 皮甲 牦牛皮套装 厚垫护甲 守护者护甲 碎布护甲 树根套装 巨魔套装 先锋套装 邪骨套装 狼皮护甲","en":"Pages in category Ask Set Bear Set Bronze Armor Caller Set Carapace Armor Eitr-weave Set Embla Set Fenris Set Flametal Armor Iron Armor Leather Armor Lox Fur Set Padded Armor Protector Armor Rag Armor Root Set Troll Set Vanguard Set Vilebone Set Wolf Armor","titleZh":"分类：腿部装备","titleEn":"Category:Legs"},"p-c29c208f3d143c6bd5c8.html":{"zh":"立石 是可能出现在 青青草原 和 北境平原 的 生物群系变体 ，以其中高耸、形似立石的岩石命名。","en":"Menhir is an alternative biome that can appear in the Meadows and the Plains . It is named after the tall, menhir-shaped rocks that stand in it.","titleZh":"立石","titleEn":"Menhir"},"p-c2e74a3aadc9f7e9f8de.html":{"zh":"树脓囊是 幽暗沼泽 感染树上的资源节点，破坏掉 树脓 ，仅受 斧 或 镐 伤害。","en":"Gucksacks are resource nodes found on infested trees in Swamps . They drop Guck when destroyed and can only be damaged with axes or pickaxes .","titleZh":"树脓囊","titleEn":"Gucksack"},"p-c2f6a4d9ec7682e63186.html":{"zh":"屋顶 是防止 风化 及雨天 潮湿效果 的构件，包括：","en":"Roofs are building pieces that protect from weathering and the Wet Effect during rain. Types include:","titleZh":"屋顶","titleEn":"Roof"},"p-c323fc99ea0c15d42815.html":{"zh":"沉船 是 极北之地 海岸附近的 地点 ，战利品不同于普通 沉船 。 共2变体，各有75%概率出现宝箱，埋在桅杆下方几次镐击深度。 沉船部件可破坏获取 细木 。","en":"Shipwrecks are Points of interest found around the shores of the Deep North . They have different loot than the regular Shipwrecks . They come in 2 variants. Each have a 75% chance for a chest, it is buried underground, a few pickaxe hits below the mast. The different parts of shipwrecks can be destroyed for Finewood .","titleZh":"沉船 (北方深境)","titleEn":"Shipwreck (Deep North)"},"p-c33b57dc984061957acc.html":{"zh":"寒冰窑 用于将 冰霜 加工成 液态冰霜 。液态冰霜是 霜铸熔炉 的燃料。","en":"Frigid Kiln is a structure used to produce Liquid Frost out of Ice . Liquid Frost is the fuel of the Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"寒冰窑","titleEn":"Frigid Kiln"},"p-c35070bce1f5544161f6.html":{"zh":"抗性和弱点决定受到各类 伤害类型 时的伤害。 生物 有固有抗性和弱点，也受部分 状态效果 影响。玩家可从 护甲 、 蜜酒 或 状态效果 获得抗性和弱点。","en":"Resistances and weaknesses determine how much damage is taken from different damage types . Creatures have innate resistances and weaknesses but are also affected by some status effects . Players may acquire resistances and weaknesses from armor , meads or status effects .","titleZh":"抗性","titleEn":"Resistance"},"p-c35be3765fea61bdcd7e.html":{"zh":"嚎叫洞穴 是 凛冽雪山 中的 地下城 。","en":"Howling Caverns are dungeons found in Mountains .","titleZh":"哀啸之穴","titleEn":"Howling Cavern"},"p-c36ef03ddd0b7eb31bc9.html":{"zh":"上古金属堆 是一种可建造设施，用来储存如今已移除的 上古金属 。","en":"Ancient Metal Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store the now removed Ancient metal .","titleZh":"上古金属堆","titleEn":"Ancient Metal Stack"},"p-c3809596f65352713118.html":{"zh":"森林之心 是 黑暗林山 阶段的 饰物 ，也是游戏中最早可获得的此类物品之一。","en":"Heart of the Forest is a Black Forest -tier trinket , and one of the first available in the game.","titleZh":"森林之心","titleEn":"Heart of the Forest"},"p-c3af076f92c5ed8dcb0d.html":{"zh":"游玩可能遇技术问题或游戏缺陷，本页列常见问题及可能解决方式。 原文认为，崩溃和存档问题通常来自用户操作而非游戏缺陷，许多情况可阅读本页、在 Discord 询问或 Steam论坛 发帖解决。 请通过《英灵神殿》网站上的表单报告错误。","en":"While playing Valheim one might come across technical issues or even bugs. This page contains a list of the most common issues and possible solutions. A game crash or world save issues are usually not bugs but user errors. Which means the player can, in many cases, fix these issues just by reading this page, asking on the Discord or posting on the Steam forums .","titleZh":"故障排查","titleEn":"Troubleshooting"},"p-c3c8c912bf93e84427e8.html":{"zh":"巫师帽 是一件可在 工作台 处制作和升级的护甲部件，只在万圣节 季节性 活动期间（十月1日至十一月6日）开放。","en":"Pointy hat is an armor piece which can be crafted and upgraded at the Workbench . It is only available during the Halloween seasonal event, 1 October – 6 November .","titleZh":"巫师帽","titleEn":"Pointy Hat"},"p-c3d2d1a41366f8a2d9a4.html":{"zh":"恩布拉套装 是一套灰烬之地级别的 护甲 ，比 甲壳护甲 和 埃达织物套装 高一级。其护甲值低于 焰金属护甲 和 阿斯克套装 ，因此应视为“轻甲”。 这套护甲的 埃达之能 恢复加成比埃达织物套装更高，因此使用 魔法 武器时更适合穿戴它。","en":"The Embla Set is an Ashlands-tier armor . This set is the tier above Carapace Armor and the Eitr-weave Set , and should be considered a \"light armor,\" having a lower armor value than Flametal Armor and the Ask Set . The armor grants even higher eitr regeneration than the Eitr-weave Set, which makes it the preferred armor when using magic weapons.","titleZh":"恩布拉套装","titleEn":"Embla Set"},"p-c3ec55965fbf131d9ebd.html":{"zh":"山毛榉生长在 青青草原 ，树皮浅灰，树冠宽阔，有小型和大型两种。小型可徒手破坏，大型至少需要 石斧 。小型被毁后产出约2份 木材 ，大型固定产出20份 木材 ，还有概率掉落 山毛榉种子 、 羽毛 和 树脂 。 使用 耕地耙 和一份 山毛榉 种子 可重新种植山毛榉。","en":"Beech is a type of tree that can be found in the Meadows biome. It is characterized by its light grey bark and wide crown. Beech can be found in small and large variants. The small variant can be damaged with unarmed attacks while the large variant can only be damaged with a Stone Axe or better. The small variant produces ~2 Wood when destroyed. The large variant always produces 20 Wood when destroyed. Beech has a c…","titleZh":"山毛榉","titleEn":"Beech"},"p-c40c747ee79e90e16e46.html":{"zh":"状态界面 （ 游戏界面 ）是叠加在屏幕上的界面，向玩家提供有用信息。","en":"The HUD ( heads-up display ) is an interface overlaid onto the screen, displaying useful information to the player.","titleZh":"状态界面","titleEn":"HUD"},"p-c462ca0bb26a3966d820.html":{"zh":"闪电屠杀者 是使用 堇青石 强化 屠杀者 得到的版本。与所有使用 堇青石 强化的武器一样，它额外获得10点 闪电 伤害 ，并有25%概率施加 连锁闪电 。 已升级的屠杀者在改造为闪电屠杀者时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Scourging Slayer is the upgraded form of Slayer using the Iolite . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Iolite , it has 10 additional lightning damage and a 25% chance to apply Chain Lightning . An upgraded Slayer will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Scourging Slayer.","titleZh":"闪电屠杀者","titleEn":"Scourging Slayer"},"p-c465c70b79b24e4f7c1b.html":{"zh":"邪蛛探索者 是在 迷雾之地 及 腐疫矿区 中的敌对生物。 邪蛛是大型昆虫状生物，兼具甲虫、蚂蚁和蜜蜂特征。有下颚及三对腿，中间一对较大，用来攻击。背部长出一对大皮翼，可短距离飞行。邪蛛及 士兵们 似乎都是 蛊虫之后 的后代，类似现实昆虫群落。","en":"Seekers are aggressive creatures found in the Mistlands and in Infested Mines . Seekers are large insectoid creatures with traits similar to beetles, ants, and bees. They have mandibles and three pairs of legs, the middle of which are larger and used to attack enemies. A pair of large leathery wings sprout from the back and can be used to fly short distances. Seekers and their Soldier counterparts are implied to all…","titleZh":"邪蛛探索者","titleEn":"Seeker"},"p-c4785ba17e12c3aaa027.html":{"zh":"摩根 是 灰烬之地 中敏捷的敌对生物，像 邪煞之树 一样会打破伪装，从地下爬出。","en":"Morgens are agile, aggressive foes found in the Ashlands . They rise from the ground after breaking out of their disguise, similar to Abominations .","titleZh":"摩根","titleEn":"Morgen"},"p-c4d245c74823fed2f2e5.html":{"zh":"雷血重锤 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境重锤 得到的版本。 它获得额外的 钝击 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境重锤在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thunderblood Sledge is a version of Nord Sledge upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra Blunt and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Sledge will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷血重锤","titleEn":"Thunderblood Sledge"},"p-c58950e1228e9c14cd2f.html":{"zh":"耕地耙 可耕地以种植种子，也可种树。 使用 草 模式可在泥地恢复草，在水面恢复荷叶，在岸边造沙地，并在岸边特定区域恢复香蒲。 耕地耙消耗耐力，因此希尔德服装适合管理大型农场。","en":"The Cultivator can be used on a patch of land to ready it for planting seeds, as well as to plant trees. With the Grass mode, the player can regrow grass on patches of dirt, regrow lily pads on water, create sand on the shoreline and regrow cattails in certain areas around the shore. Use of Cultivator does use stamina, making Hildir's clothing useful for managing large farms.","titleZh":"耕地耙","titleEn":"Cultivator"},"p-c5da3458bd5a19c0b45d.html":{"zh":"灰烬弩箭 是供 弩 使用的 弹药 ，也是 甲壳弩箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Charred bolts are ammunition for crossbows and are the next direct upgrade from Carapace Bolts .","titleZh":"灰烬弩箭","titleEn":"Charred Bolt"},"p-c5ec7c0103fc4d803bb4.html":{"zh":"树脂 由 灰宝宝 、 灰矮人 、 灰矮人萨满 、 灰矮人暴徒 及 巫师扫帚 掉落。除 古树 和 灰烬之树 外，所有树木都有概率掉落，也偶见于 青青草原 的 宝箱 。用于多种制作、建造配方，也可补充光源燃料。","en":"Resin is dropped by Greylings , Greydwarfs , Greydwarf Shamans , Greydwarf Brutes , and Kvastur . It has a chance of dropping from all trees except for Ancient Trees and Scorched Trees , and can be occasionally found in Chest in the Meadows . It has a variety of uses in crafting and building and can be used to refuel light sources.","titleZh":"树脂","titleEn":"Resin"},"p-c61d97360a5a41533d46.html":{"zh":"火焰之心 是一种 灰烬之地 级别的 饰物 。","en":"Brimstone is an Ashlands -tier trinket .","titleZh":"火焰之心","titleEn":"Brimstone"},"p-c66e244ea17eb85074bf.html":{"zh":"青铜剑 是第一种 剑 。","en":"Bronze Sword is the first sword .","titleZh":"青铜剑","titleEn":"Bronze Sword"},"p-c6ccc8ab752d0e4e5b72.html":{"zh":"陶瓷板 用 黑大理石 在 工匠台 制作。需击败 蛊虫之后 并建造升级设施 工艺液压机 后才能制作。","en":"Ceramic plate is a material made from Black Marble at the Artisan Table . It can only be crafted after building the Artisan Press upgrade after defeating The Queen .","titleZh":"陶瓷板","titleEn":"Ceramic Plate"},"p-c6faefd5caca8b7d42d1.html":{"zh":"巨魔之杖 是一种召唤大型 召唤巨魔 的 魔法 武器。每次施法都会生成一颗燃烧的陨石，落地时造成伤害并引发火焰。等级1时可以召唤两只巨魔，升级巨魔之杖不会提高该上限（与 招魂之杖 不同，后者升级后可同时召唤更多骷髅）。 召唤巨魔会攻击范围内除其他召唤巨魔之外的一切目标，包括召唤它的玩家。 巨魔之杖无法在 地下城 内使用。","en":"Trollstav is a magic weapon that summons a large Summoned Troll . Each cast from the staff spawns a fiery meteorite that causes damage on impact and starts fires. Two Trolls can be summoned at level 1, and upgrading Trollstav does not increase this limit. (This stands in contrast to the Dead Raiser , whose upgrades allow more Skelletts to be summoned at once.)","titleZh":"巨魔之杖","titleEn":"Trollstav"},"p-c70475560ffe43fd0121.html":{"zh":"幽蓝火盆 是一种可放在任何表面上的光源，需要在 熔炉 范围内建造。","en":"The Blue standing brazier is a light source that can be placed on any surface, and must be built within the range of a Forge .","titleZh":"幽蓝火盆","titleEn":"Blue Standing Brazier"},"p-c76232358bdf16a4e82f.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以180枚 钱币 购买5份 迷雾山林的草本植物 ，仅在击败 蛊虫之后 后出售。","en":"Herbs of the hidden hills can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 180 Coins for 5 herbs. It is only sold after The Queen has been defeated.","titleZh":"迷雾山林的草本植物","titleEn":"Herbs of the Hidden Hills"},"p-c781316c9ff4beaaf1e8.html":{"zh":"鬼魅 是 泥泞沼泽 中的敌对 生物 ，为深蓝色幽灵，披斗篷，兜帽遮住空白面孔。被激怒时发出轻微嘶吼。它们自然生成于夜间，会发光、飞行，因此远处容易发现；靠近时，即使不留神也能注意到光芒。","en":"Wraiths are aggressive creatures found in Swamps . They are dark blueish spectral entities, cloaked with a hood covering their blank face. They emit a quiet snarling hiss sound when they are aggravated. Since they naturally spawn at night, glow and fly, spotting them from a distance is easy; their telltale glow reveals them even to inattentive players as they approach.","titleZh":"鬼魅","titleEn":"Wraith"},"p-c7abd16e2ee36f3df54f.html":{"zh":"仲夏之冠 是一件仲夏期间可获得的季节性护甲部件。 王冠提供1点护甲，没有附加效果。","en":"Midsummer crown is a seasonal armor piece available during midsummer. The crown provides 1 armor and has no additional effect.","titleZh":"仲夏之冠","titleEn":"Midsummer Crown"},"p-c7f64cca16cf649dcff2.html":{"zh":"铁圆盾 是第二种小圆 盾 。 凭借2.5x弹反加成，与同级别的其他盾相比，它在 弹反 攻击时提供的格挡护甲最高。但用于普通格挡时，它是最差的选择。","en":"Iron Buckler is the second buckler shield . Its 2.5x parry bonus makes it the best option in regards to block armor when parrying attacks compared to every other shield in the same tier. But it is the worst option for regular blocking.","titleZh":"铁圆盾","titleEn":"Iron Buckler"},"p-c8047bd8b36449ccdf84.html":{"zh":"雷血十字弓 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境十字弓 得到的版本。 它获得额外的 穿刺 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境十字弓在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。 主要攻击发射 弩箭 。攻击前，必须先将一支弩箭装入弩中。技能等级为0时，装填需要3.5秒并消耗3点耐力；但加上发射、装填和准备动作，实际每6秒才能发射一次。跳跃和冲刺会重置装填进度，冲刺时也无法装填弩箭。装填完成后，可随时发射，且不消耗耐力。发射后需要重新装填一支弩箭。切换到其他武器时，弩箭不会保持装填状态，因此每次装备该物品时都需要装填。 弩箭飞行速度明显快于箭矢，沿直线飞行而非抛物线（不会因重力而下坠）。","en":"Thunderblood Crossbow is a version of Nord Crossbow upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra Pierce and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Crossbow will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷血十字弓","titleEn":"Thunderblood Crossbow"},"p-c806efb93d39240fe391.html":{"zh":"灰烬之木床榻 是 基础 设施，用于睡眠和设置玩家重生点。虽然获取时间晚于 龙床 ，但只提供1点 舒适度 ，与普通 床铺 相同。","en":"Ashwood beds are base structures used for sleeping and setting the player's respawn point. Despite being obtainable later than Dragon Beds , they only give 1 Comfort , as much as a regular bed .","titleZh":"灰烬之木床榻","titleEn":"Ashwood Bed"},"p-c81692d3124ee3bc7110.html":{"zh":"回收灯笼 是一种工具，无法制作或升级。 持握时移动速度降低5%。攻击使用 棍棒 技能，但不造成伤害。它没有耐久度。","en":"Salvaged Lantern is a tool. It cannot be crafted or upgraded. While held, it reduces movement speed by 5%. Its attacks use the Clubs skill but deal no damage. It has no durability.","titleZh":"回收灯笼","titleEn":"Salvaged Lantern"},"p-c81d912226df42e9a706.html":{"zh":"泥泞的废料堆 是主要位于 幽暗沼泽 生物群系 地下圣堂 内的资源节点，需 镐击 采集。 每段5点生命，因此所有镐开采效率相同。","en":"A Muddy Scrap Pile is a resource node and are found predominantly inside Sunken Crypts within the Swamp biome and require a Pickaxe to be harvested. They have 5 health per segment, making all pickaxes equally good at mining them.","titleZh":"泥泞的废料堆","titleEn":"Muddy Scrap Pile"},"p-c829ceaa9c7ec90d9972.html":{"zh":"铁堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 铁 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Iron Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Iron or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"铁堆","titleEn":"Iron Stack"},"p-c88dd658ca62044e3393.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 防叮特调 狂战之酒 动物低语酒 瓦纳蜜酒 抗火大麦酒 抗霜蜜酒 轻盈蜜酒 持久埃达之力蜜酒 长效治疗蜜酒 长效耐力蜜酒 爱之药 大份治疗蜜酒 蜜酒 巨魔之忍蜜酒 中份治疗蜜酒 中份耐力蜜酒 小份埃达之力蜜酒 小份治疗蜜酒 小份耐力蜜酒 抗毒蜜酒 美味蜜酒 拉塔托斯克药剂","en":"Pages in category Anti-Sting Concoction Berserkir Mead Brew of Animal Whispers Draught of Vananidir Fire Resistance Barley Wine Frost Resistance Mead Lightfoot Mead Lingering Eitr Mead Lingering Healing Mead Lingering Stamina Mead Love Potion Major Healing Mead Mead Mead of Troll Endurance Medium Healing Mead Medium Stamina Mead Minor Eitr Mead Minor Healing Mead Minor Stamina Mead Poison Resistance Mead Tasty Mead…","titleZh":"分类：蜜酒","titleEn":"Category:Mead"},"p-c89157bde9909c253adf.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣膀胱 是 灰烬刚鬣 掉落的 材料 。","en":"Asksvin bladder is a material dropped by Asksvin .","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣膀胱","titleEn":"Asksvin Bladder"},"p-c8bfe501a74f95943ca0.html":{"zh":"擀面杖和菜板 用于升级 铸铁锅 。因为需要灰烬之地独有材料，通常是大锅的第五项升级。目前所有相关配方都随 灰烬之地 加入。","en":"Rolling pins and cutting boards are used as an upgrade to the Cauldron . It will typically be the fifth upgrade to the Cauldron, as it requires items only found in Ashlands. Currently, all recipes were introduced in Ashlands","titleZh":"擀面杖和菜板","titleEn":"Rolling Pins and Cutting Boards"},"p-c8d7ab7c8497e065e8c8.html":{"zh":"冰池 是 极北之地 中的资源节点。","en":"Ice Pond is a resource node found in Deep North .","titleZh":"冰池","titleEn":"Ice Pond"},"p-c8fd2ad08eb2761d8f16.html":{"zh":"矮人木桶 是资源节点，可在 迷雾之地 各处 矮人 聚落找到。 没有功能，但破坏后掉落多种有用资源。不过，木桶所在建筑住有 矮人刺客 或 矮人法师 ，玩家直接损伤箱子或其 守护石 保护的其他建筑，会使其敌对，因此破坏有危险。间接伤害或非玩家来源可安全损伤木桶，不激怒矮人。","en":"Dvergr Barrels are resource nodes that can be found in Dvergr settlements throughout the Mistlands . They have no function, but drop several useful resources when destroyed. However, destroying them can be dangerous, since the structures that barrels are found at are home to Dvergr Rogues and/or Dvergr Mages , who will turn hostile if a crate (or any other structure under protection of their Wards ) is damaged direc…","titleZh":"矮人木桶","titleEn":"Dvergr Barrel"},"p-c8ff3d8f3094c330c339.html":{"zh":"红色珠饰上衣 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付550 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的青铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Beaded tunic red is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 550 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's bronze chest .","titleZh":"红色珠饰上衣","titleEn":"Beaded tunic red"},"p-c918e6e110760fb606bd.html":{"zh":"灰烬亡灵堡垒 是 灰烬之地 中的 地点 ，有直冲天空的绿光标记，远处可见。","en":"Charred Fortresses are Points of interest in Ashlands . They are marked by a beam of green light shooting straight up into the sky, visible from a distance.","titleZh":"灰烬城堡","titleEn":"Charred Fortress"},"p-c9bd96425e0b2b6a9839.html":{"zh":"任意捕获的鱼都可在 灶台 处制成 生鱼肉 ，再用 烹饪台 烤成 熟鱼肉 。 可以用 鱼竿 搭配 鱼饵 捕获 鱼 ，也可直接拾取离水搁浅的鱼。","en":"Raw Fish can be made from any caught fish at a Food Preparation Table . It can be cooked into Cooked Fish using a Cooking Station . Fish can be caught with a Fishing Rod using Fishing Bait or by picking up fish that have become stranded out of water.","titleZh":"生鱼肉","titleEn":"Raw Fish"},"p-c9ce92f011b1fe24054e.html":{"zh":"衣柜 是 极北之地 阶段的一种 储物设施 。","en":"Wardrobe is a Deep North -tier Storage option.","titleZh":"衣柜","titleEn":"Wardrobe"},"p-ca010bdeb4a2f7383fe6.html":{"zh":"绿色华丽帽 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付250 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的白银宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Extravagant cap green is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 250 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's silver chest .","titleZh":"绿色华丽帽","titleEn":"Extravagant cap green"},"p-ca1301f70d59ed7728b5.html":{"zh":"山珍佛跳墙 属于 凛冽雪山 阶段的 宴席 。","en":"Hearty Mountain Logger's Stew is the Mountain -tier Feast .","titleZh":"山珍佛跳墙","titleEn":"Hearty Mountain Logger's Stew"},"p-ca2f1b8656246f88ddb6.html":{"zh":"邪骨利爪 是第三种 拳类武器 ，使用 北境平原 中的材料制作。","en":"Vilebone Maulclaws are the third fist weapon crafted from materials found in the Plains .","titleZh":"邪骨利爪","titleEn":"Vilebone Maulclaws"},"p-ca3280d30e1fda946d1a.html":{"zh":"古树长老 是第二位 首领 ，外形为高耸的人形树木，细长躯体覆树皮，长出许多细枝。","en":"The Elder is the second boss . He appears as a towering humanoid tree-like entity with multiple thin branches sprouting out of his slender, bark-covered body.","titleZh":"古树长老","titleEn":"The Elder"},"p-ca335c295caf6371fecc.html":{"zh":"埃达织物套装 是一套 迷雾之地 级别的 护甲 ，比 厚垫护甲 高一级。与 甲壳护甲 相比，其护甲值更低，移动速度惩罚也更小，因此应视为“轻甲”。 这套护甲的每件部件都有独特效果，提供 埃达之能 恢复加成，因此使用 余烬之杖 等 魔法 武器时更适合穿戴它。轻羽斗篷还具有完全免除坠落伤害的独特效果。 (见:轻羽之落 )","en":"The Eitr-weave Set is a Mistlands -tier armor . This set is the tier above Padded Armor and should be considered a \"light armor\" compared to Carapace Armor as its armor values are lower while having less movement speed penalty. The armor offers a unique effect per piece that grants eitr regeneration, which makes it the preferred armor when using magic weapons like Staff of Embers . The Feather cape also offers a uni…","titleZh":"埃达织物套装","titleEn":"Eitr-weave Set"},"p-ca3bcdc77dbc8af26697.html":{"zh":"地精前哨 是 北境平原 中的 地点 ，外形为独立石塔，周围木桩环绕，共两种变体。","en":"Fuling Outposts are Points of interest found in the Plains . They look like isolated stone towers surrounded by wood stakes. They come in two variants.","titleZh":"地精前哨","titleEn":"Fuling Outpost"},"p-ca846601d26b5712944c.html":{"zh":"邪骨套装 是一套平原级别的 护甲 ，护甲值低于厚垫护甲，但穿戴全部3件可获得 邪骨之怒 套装加成，提高伤害和恢复能力，同时使穿戴者更容易受到物理伤害。","en":"The Vilebone Set is a Plains-tier armor set. It has a lower armor value than Padded Armor, but wearing all 3 pieces provides the Vilebone Wrath set bonus, increasing damage and regeneration, but making the wearer slightly more vulnerable to physical damage.","titleZh":"邪骨套装","titleEn":"Vilebone Set"},"p-cadae1a17de3427b5abd.html":{"zh":"远古树根 是 迷雾之地 生物群系中的资源，可在其上放置 汁液提取器 采集 汁液 。","en":"Ancient Roots are a resource found in the Mistlands biome. Sap Extractors can be placed on them to harvest Sap .","titleZh":"远古树根","titleEn":"Ancient Roots"},"p-cb5a1b2e16150568e4e1.html":{"zh":"巨熊肉 是一种基础食物，可通过击杀 巨熊 和 恶骨 获得。 将熊肉放在 烹饪台 或 铁烹饪台 上可烤成 熟巨熊肉 ；若烤得过久，则会变成 木炭 。熟熊肉可以食用，也可以在 铸铁锅 处用来制作 手撕熊肉 。","en":"Bear meat is a basic food source. It can be found by killing Bears and Viles . When placed on a Cooking Station or Iron Cooking Station , Bear meat can be turned into Cooked bear meat , or Coal if overcooked. Cooked bear meat can be eaten or used to make Pulled Bear at a Cauldron .","titleZh":"巨熊肉","titleEn":"Bear Meat"},"p-cb70d388c0d840e348d2.html":{"zh":"邪骨之怒 是穿齐 邪骨套装 三件套后获得的 状态效果 。 它给出:","en":"Vilebone Wrath is a status effect granted by wearing all three pieces of the Vilebone Set . It gives:","titleZh":"邪骨之怒","titleEn":"Vilebone wrath"},"p-cbabd4f39dbd5c6a5e99.html":{"zh":"肉泥 是 灰烬之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Mashed Meat is an Ashlands -tier food.","titleZh":"肉泥","titleEn":"Mashed Meat"},"p-cbe1cb7a9fd9850bfbbc.html":{"zh":"驼鹿毛皮 是从 驼鹿 及 墨尔克哈拉 中的铺盖掉落的材料。","en":"Moose Hide is a material dropped from Moose and bedrolls found in Mörkhalla .","titleZh":"驼鹿毛皮","titleEn":"Moose Hide"},"p-cc278ed65b2d4d792808.html":{"zh":"洋葱 是由 洋葱种子 种植的作物。其种子可在 凛冽雪山 生物群系中找到，通常位于废弃小屋或废塔等地点的箱子内。洋葱与 胡萝卜 、 芜菁 等可种植作物不同：野外只能找到种子，未经玩家种植不会自然出现洋葱植株。","en":"Onions are crops grown from Onion Seeds . They are obtained in the Mountain biome as seeds, normally located in chests in locations such as ruined shacks or ruined towers. Onions are unlike other farmable crops such as Carrot or Turnip in that they are only found as seeds, and never appear in nature in plant form without a player planting it first.","titleZh":"洋葱","titleEn":"Onion"},"p-cc350ea3393968f7cd7c.html":{"zh":"耐力是 英灵神殿 中的个人资源，以黄色条显示。角色基础耐力为50，每格代表25点耐力。 除步行和与物体互动外，多数动作消耗耐力，包括使用工具、武器及其他移动方式。 停止消耗耐力的动作片刻后，或饮用耐力蜜酒，即可恢复耐力。 休息中 和 休息好了 效果、 美味蜜酒 及 长效耐力蜜酒 能加快恢复。 处于 寒冷 、 冻僵 及 潮湿 效果时，耐力恢复更慢。","en":"Stamina is a personal resource in Valheim represented as a yellow bar. Characters have a base 50 stamina, with each bar representing 25 stamina. Stamina is drained by any actions you perform outside of walking and interacting with objects. These actions include using tools/weapons, and movement that is not walking among others.","titleZh":"耐力","titleEn":"Stamina"},"p-cc5076c923b3f04b0820.html":{"zh":"爆炸弹药 是供 投石机 使用的弹药。爆炸时在3米半径内造成纯粹、砍伐和镐击伤害，能够摧毁任何可受伤害的建筑。 与 岩浆软泥怪 类似，命中时产生的爆炸可以改变地形。","en":"The Explosive Payload is ammunition for the Catapult . It explodes dealing pure, chop and pickaxe damage in a 3-meter radius. It can destroy any structure that is able to receive damage. Similarly to Lava Blobs , the explosion generated on impact can alter terrain.","titleZh":"爆炸弹药","titleEn":"Explosive Payload"},"p-cc8e73385cb553eafdc9.html":{"zh":"中份治疗蜜酒 是一种 泥泞沼泽 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：中份治疗 发酵 而成。","en":"Medium healing mead is a Swamp -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Medium healing .","titleZh":"中份治疗蜜酒","titleEn":"Medium Healing Mead"},"p-cc9001734ef60565c35c.html":{"zh":"狼毛披风 是一件 护甲 部件，可在 工作台 处使用 狼皮 、 银 和一个 狼战利品 制作。拾取过每种材料至少一个后解锁。","en":"Wolf Fur Cape is an armor piece made of Wolf Pelts , Silver and a Wolf Trophy at the Workbench . It is unlocked after picking up one of each of the materials.","titleZh":"狼毛披风","titleEn":"Wolf Fur Cape"},"p-cccde336d0abe1d1a7ae.html":{"zh":"蘑菇煎蛋卷 是 迷雾之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Mushroom omelette is a Mistlands -tier food.","titleZh":"蘑菇煎蛋卷","titleEn":"Mushroom Omelette"},"p-ccd5353432c7035229a1.html":{"zh":"元素魔法 是与 元素魔法 武器类别相关的 技能 。","en":"Elemental magic is a skill related to Elemental magic weapon class.","titleZh":"元素魔法(技能)","titleEn":"Elemental magic (skill)"},"p-cd1259f2387155a1c9c8.html":{"zh":"灰烬藤蔓 可在 灰烬之地 找到，生长于 焦骨废墟 侧面。它们产出 藤莓果串 ，是灰烬之地阶段食物的重要材料，也可用 耕地耙 和 灰烬藤蔓种子 种植。","en":"Ashvine can be found in the Ashlands , growing on the side of Charred ruins . They spawn Vineberry clusters , which are an important ingredient for Ashlands tier food, and can be planted using a Cultivator and Vineberry Seeds .","titleZh":"灰烬藤蔓","titleEn":"Ashvine"},"p-cd25ecbfdcb5441fa78d.html":{"zh":"持久埃达之力蜜酒 是一种 灰烬之地 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：持久埃达之力 发酵 而成。","en":"Lingering eitr mead is an Ashlands -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Lingering eitr .","titleZh":"持久埃达之力蜜酒","titleEn":"Lingering Eitr Mead"},"p-cd72f0d36b4bbdd554cf.html":{"zh":"邪煞之根 是由 古树长老 召唤，或位于 邪煞之根 黑暗林山 替代生物群系中的敌对 生物 。 它们是巨大凶猛的树根，疯狂挥动，试图伤害目标。","en":"Roots are aggressive creatures spawned by The Elder or found in Root Black Forest alternative biome. They are enlarged, vicious tree roots that flail around frantically in an attempt to damage their target.","titleZh":"树根（生物）","titleEn":"Root (creature)"},"p-cdb9857e6a7550c175a0.html":{"zh":"巨熊毛皮 是 巨熊 及 恶骨 掉落的物品。","en":"Bear hide is an item dropped by Bears and Viles .","titleZh":"巨熊毛皮","titleEn":"Bear Hide"},"p-ce009db55b680efbe83c.html":{"zh":"生物生成点 是持续生成敌对 生物 的可破坏实体。类型多样，各自生成特定敌人，通常可通过上方漂浮的深紫或绿色烟雾辨认。","en":"A Creature spawner is a destructible entity that continuously spawns hostile creatures . These come in various types, each having their own unique enemies they spawn. They can usually be identified by a dark purple or green smoke that floats above them.","titleZh":"生物生成点","titleEn":"Creature spawner"},"p-ce00a3f781143bebb26b.html":{"zh":"肉夹馍 是一种 极北之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Meat In Bread is a Deep North -tier food .","titleZh":"肉夹馍","titleEn":"Meat In Bread"},"p-ce1edfea6d6b8c2217b9.html":{"zh":"先锋 是穿齐 先锋套装 三件套后获得的 状态效果 。 它给出:","en":"Vanguard is a status effect granted by wearing all three pieces of the Vanguard Set . It gives:","titleZh":"先锋","titleEn":"Vanguard"},"p-ce5cf6be395b5ae5dca8.html":{"zh":"芜菁 是由 芜菁种子 种出的作物。种子仅在 幽暗沼泽 生物群系 采集自然黄色花簇获得。与其他可种植物不同，玩家不能生吃。","en":"Turnips are crops grown from Turnip Seeds , which can only be found in the Swamp biome by picking the naturally growing clusters of yellow flowers. Unlike other farmable flora, they cannot be consumed raw by the player.","titleZh":"芜菁","titleEn":"Turnip"},"p-ce7aa60ec666555fbd4d.html":{"zh":"冰火战戟 是使用 冰火精华 强化 北境战戟 得到的版本。它牺牲少量 穿刺 伤害，换取更多的 火焰 和 冰霜 伤害。 已升级的北境战戟在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Frostfire Atgeir is a version of Nord Atgeir upgraded with a Frostfire Essence . It loses a small amount of Pierce damage in exchange of larger amount of Fire and Frost damage. An upgraded Nord Atgeir will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"冰火战戟","titleEn":"Frostfire Atgeir"},"p-ce97627abaa1033da9d1.html":{"zh":"矮人尖木桩防护栅栏 是 尖桩 ，会对碰到尖端的任何生物，包括玩家和驯养动物，造成15点 穿刺 和80点 击退 。每次造成伤害会损失34点耐久度。 与多数设施不同，矮人尖桩用锤子拆除，或因造成伤害而损毁时，不会返还材料。淋雨不会使其受损。 矮人尖桩须在 黑熔炉 范围内建造。","en":"Dvergr sharp stakes are Stakes which deal 15 pierce and 80 knockback to any creature, including players and tames, that touch the sharp end. The structure will lose 34 durability whenever it deals damage. Unlike most structures, Dvergr sharp stakes will not provide back its crafting materials when removed by a hammer or destroyed due to dealing damage. It does not take any damage from rain.","titleZh":"矮人尖木桩防护栅栏","titleEn":"Dvergr Sharp Stakes"},"p-ceab28e3f51e33f5419b.html":{"zh":"蜂巢 是自然生成的资源。 破坏后掉落一个 蜂后 和1至3份 蜂蜜 。蜂后可用于建造 蜂房 ，持续产出蜂蜜。 受到攻击时，会在4米半径内造成10 毒素 伤害。玩家太近时，也会每4秒攻击一次。","en":"Bee Nests are naturally-occurring resources. When destroyed, they drop one Queen Bee and 1 to 3 Honey . Queen bees are used to build Beehives for a steady source of Honey. When attacked, they deal 10 poison damage in a 4-meter radius. They also attack every 4 seconds if the player is too close.","titleZh":"蜂巢","titleEn":"Bee Nest"},"p-cee566977237a9501352.html":{"zh":"黄色披肩连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付450 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的白银宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Shawl dress yellow is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 450 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's silver chest .","titleZh":"黄色披肩连衣裙","titleEn":"Shawl dress yellow"},"p-cef70511e5c02a6b9098.html":{"zh":"鱼肉卷 是平原阶段的食物。","en":"Fish Wraps are a Plains-tier food.","titleZh":"鱼肉卷","titleEn":"Fish Wraps"},"p-cf0a755fb6b4deccfb28.html":{"zh":"攻城锤 是一种攻城器械，外形有点像 板车 ，但大得多，前方有两根长打击机构，用于近距离摧毁建筑。需要 木材 、 细木 、 圆木 或 灰烬之木 作为燃料。它可破坏任何能够受到伤害的建筑，包括 灰烬亡灵堡垒 的门和墙，也可开采开放世界中能受到 镐 伤害 的资源点，例如岩石、铜矿和锡矿。","en":"Battering rams are siege engines with a slight resemblance to Carts but are significantly larger and have two long punching mechanisms at the front, which are intended to be used to destroy structures at close range. They need Wood , Finewood , Corewood , or Ashwood in order to function. They can destroy any structure that is able to receive damage, including Charred Fortresses doors and walls. But it can also be us…","titleZh":"攻城锤","titleEn":"Battering Ram"},"p-cf5fb38fbc7c30beb97a.html":{"zh":"巨石阵 是 北境平原 中的永久结构，大型巨石相叠，可能环形或独立。","en":"Stonehenges are permanent structures found in Plains . They are a formation of large boulders placed on top of each other, either in a circle or by themselves.","titleZh":"巨石阵","titleEn":"Stonehenge"},"p-cf9d496f244c6265b16d.html":{"zh":"重型屠杀者 是使用 血石 强化 屠杀者 得到的版本。与所有使用血石强化的武器一样，玩家每缺少1点 生命值 ，其伤害就提高0.2% （不要与生命值百分比混淆） 。 已升级的屠杀者在改造为重型屠杀者时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Brutal Slayer is the upgraded form of Slayer using the Bloodstone . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, its damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of health the player is missing (not to be confused with health percentage) . An upgraded Slayer will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Brutal Slayer.","titleZh":"重型屠杀者","titleEn":"Brutal Slayer"},"p-cfb3c47d1c1d27ee15bd.html":{"zh":"灰石弹药 是一种 投石机 弹药。命中时爆炸，对直接目标造成20点钝击伤害，并在3米半径内造成5点钝击、5点砍伐和5点镐击伤害。它能够摧毁任何可受伤害的建筑。 灰石弹药制作成本低，但伤害很少。目前最适合用于在发射效果更强的 爆炸弹药 之前调整投石机的瞄准。","en":"The Grausten payload is a catapult ammo. It explodes dealing 20 blunt damage on impact plus 5 blunt, 5 chop and 5 pickaxe damage in a 3-meter radius. It can destroy any structure that is able to receive damage. Grausten payloads are cheap to craft but inflict very little damage. Their current best use is to adjust the catapult's aim before launching the more effective Explosive Payload .","titleZh":"灰石弹药","titleEn":"Grausten Payload"},"p-cfc0b187b42a46591801.html":{"zh":"铁钉 在 熔炉 用一份 铁 锭制作，每份得到10x钉子。 与 青铜钉 一样，它们可通过传送门， 废铁 及铁锭则不能。","en":"Iron nails are crafted at a Forge with a single Iron ingot which yields 10x nails each. Like Bronze Nails (and unlike Scrap Iron or iron ingots) they can be brought through portals.","titleZh":"铁钉","titleEn":"Iron Nails"},"p-cfcd1f3d6aeb187475ef.html":{"zh":"庇护 是在屋顶下并具有80% 遮蔽 时获得的 状态效果 。 有庇护且 在火源附近 时，获得 休息中 ；有庇护且 冻僵 时，会降低为 寒冷 。 多数制作站及床中 睡觉 也需庇护。各建筑独立检查遮蔽，不依赖玩家状态，但状态可作为提示。","en":"Shelter is a status effect that is given for players that are under a roof and have 80% cover . If sheltered and near a fire , the Resting effect will be applied to the character. Being sheltered while Freezing will reduce it to Cold . Shelter is also required to use most crafting stations and sleep in a bed. Each building checks its coverage independently of the player's status effect, however, it can serve as a he…","titleZh":"庇护","titleEn":"Shelter"},"p-cfe8b9f60f24a0ac9949.html":{"zh":"云莓 是生长在 北境平原 生物群系 地面上的浆果。云莓每300分钟（5h）重新生成。用锄头清理地表植被不会破坏云莓植株，但植株被毁后不会再生。","en":"Cloudberries are berries found growing on the ground in Plains biome . Cloudberries will respawn after 300 minutes ( 5h ). Cloudberry plants will remain intact if ground cover is cleared with the hoe, but they will not regrow if destroyed.","titleZh":"云莓","titleEn":"Cloudberries"},"p-cfed998f07b32c43aeda.html":{"zh":"橡树 生长在 青青草原 ，树干粗大、树冠宽广，至少需要 青铜斧 才能砍伤，最常见于草原开阔地带。 橡树被毁后掉落 木材 和 细木 ，各自数量似乎随机，但总共固定50份木材。 可让倒下的 山毛榉 撞击橡树，或将倒下的山毛榉滚向它。伤害足够即可撞倒，再将树干滚下坡，反复撞障碍物，直至碎成可用木材。 巨魔 也能破坏橡树。这些方法可在能制作 青铜斧 前获得 细木 。","en":"Oak is a type of tree that can be found in the Meadows . It is characterized by its wide trunk and large crown. A Bronze Axe or better is required to damage it. They are most likely found in the open fields of the Meadows. Oak trees produce Wood and Finewood when destroyed. The yield of each type of wood appears to be random, however, a tree will always drop 50 pieces of wood total.","titleZh":"橡树","titleEn":"Oak"},"p-cff063d8e1e3efc9e77d.html":{"zh":"驼鹿腱 是 驼鹿 掉落的材料。","en":"Moose Sinew is a material dropped by the Moose .","titleZh":"驼鹿腱","titleEn":"Moose Sinew"},"p-d003dadb78981e299f5b.html":{"zh":"鸡 是只有 鸡蛋 孵化后才出现的被动生物，是 母鸡 的幼年阶段。","en":"Chicken are passive creatures that can only appear when an Egg hatches. They are the infant stage of Hens .","titleZh":"鸡","titleEn":"Chicken"},"p-d04e1528ec32240fac68.html":{"zh":"耶鲁树 是可建造的 季节性 设施，须在 工作台 范围内放置。对约10米内的玩家提高一点 舒适度 。","en":"Yule Tree is a buildable seasonal structure. It needs to be built within the range of a Workbench . It increases Comfort level by one to players within about 10 meters of it.","titleZh":"耶鲁树","titleEn":"Yule Tree"},"p-d057af8097a581c26f5b.html":{"zh":"木制结构 是玩家最早可用的构件，建造和修复需要 木材 ，且附近须有 工作台 。","en":"Wood structures are the first set of structures available to the player, requiring wood and the proximity of a workbench to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"木制结构","titleEn":"Wood Structures"},"p-d09d618ec3d29dea2ff6.html":{"zh":"风车是用于加工谷物的 基础 设施。","en":"Windmills are base structures used for processing grain.","titleZh":"风车","titleEn":"Windmill"},"p-d0c143d177d7284ca9ae.html":{"zh":"这是与 建造 相关页面的 分类 。","en":"This is a category for pages related to building .","titleZh":"分类：建筑","titleEn":"Category:Building"},"p-d0e50f6932cc1036f8ea.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 灰烬乌鸦 灰烬刚鬣 灰巨人 鬓猪 邪骨恶灵 布伦娜 鸡 乌鸦 招魂之杖 鹿 赤血灵鹿 无眼者 坠落女武神 鱼 霜灵 巨魔长老 盖尔哈法 加尔 灰矮人萨满（北方深境） 海鸥 野兔 母鸡 岩浆软泥怪 利维坦 平原牦牛 冰霜龙母 驼鹿 驼鹿宝宝 真●丑地精 海豹 邪蛛探索者 邪蛛幼雏 邪蛛士兵 无形黏团 驯服 古树长老 壁虱幼虫 巨魔 狼 扭曲者 亚格鲁斯 吉尔与吞格尔","en":"Pages in category Ash Crow Asksvin Barka Boar Bonemass Brenna Chicken Crow Dead Raiser Deer Eikthyr Eyeless One Fallen Valkyrie Fish Frysling Gammeltroll Geirrhafa Gjall Greydwarf Shaman (Deep North) Gull Hare Hen Lava Blob Leviathan Lox Moder Moose Moose Calf Riktig Fuling Seal Seeker Seeker Brood Seeker Soldier Shapeless Pulp Taming The Elder Tick Troll Wolf Writhan Yagluth Zil & Thungr","titleZh":"分类：可驯服生物","titleEn":"Category:Tameable creatures"},"p-d128753179e3dabb01e3.html":{"zh":"奥丁披风 是一件DLC护甲部件，仅供 英灵神殿 的早期支持者使用。Iron Gate Studios通过电子邮件，向报名参加 《英灵神殿》测试 的人发送Steam代码。报名过的玩家可检查自己的邮箱。 发现 皮革碎片 和 木炭 后解锁制作配方。奥丁披风在 工作台 处制作。","en":"Cape of Oden is a DLC armor piece. It is only available for the early supporters of Valheim via a Steam code sent out in an email from Iron Gate Studios to those who signed up for the Valheim Beta . Check your email if you signed up! The crafting recipe is unlocked once the player has discovered Leather Scraps and Coal . The Cape of Oden is crafted at the Workbench .","titleZh":"奥丁披风","titleEn":"Cape of Oden"},"p-d129bc127251a5079103.html":{"zh":"海尔司坦 是 黑暗林山 中的 角色 ，是一只驯服的 平原牦牛 ，在 霍尔德 的贸易营地陪伴他。","en":"Halstein is a character found in Black Forests . He is a tamed Lox that accompanies Haldor at his trading camp.","titleZh":"海尔司坦","titleEn":"Halstein"},"p-d14f43792a8eba568d2c.html":{"zh":"丑地精图腾 是 北境平原 中的稀有物品。","en":"Fuling totems are rare items found in the Plains .","titleZh":"丑地精图腾","titleEn":"Fuling Totem"},"p-d1594e95d9a920795852.html":{"zh":"洋芋儿种子 是 极北之地 种子，可用 耕地耙 种成 洋芋儿 。","en":"Seed Poteitr is a Deep North seed that can be planted using the Cultivator to grow Poteitr .","titleZh":"洋芋儿种子","titleEn":"Seed Poteitr"},"p-d1b08118de3909fa8022.html":{"zh":"灰宝宝 是 青青草原 中的敌对 生物 ，外形如覆苔树木，明显弱于其 灰矮人 同类。","en":"Greylings are aggressive creatures found in Meadows . They are mossy tree-like beings and are substantially weaker than their Greydwarf counterparts.","titleZh":"灰宝宝","titleEn":"Greyling"},"p-d1f4330de1f84d16b999.html":{"zh":"可用 耕地耙 种植 燕麦种子 ，长成3x 燕麦种子 。","en":"Oat Seeds can be planted using the Cultivator in order to grow 3x Oat Seeds .","titleZh":"燕麦种子","titleEn":"Oat Seeds"},"p-d22ecb600769a29f2f1c.html":{"zh":"矮人桩墙 是可建造构件，用作聚落外围围墙。与普通木制 尖木桩围墙 类似，矮人尖桩墙不会因淋雨而腐朽。 矮人尖桩墙须在 黑熔炉 范围内建造。 在平地上， 软泥怪 勉强能跳过矮人尖桩墙。因此，在沼泽等软泥怪常见的区域，最好将围墙建在略高的地形上，防止它们越过。","en":"Dvergr stakewall is a buildable structure. Intended for use as perimeter walls around player settlements. Similar to its regular wooden counterpart, the Stakewall , Dvergr stakewalls do not degrade due to rain. The Dvergr stakewall needs to be built within the range of a Black Forge . A Blob can just barely manage to jump over a Dvergr stakewall on level ground. When building in areas such as the Swamp, where Blobs…","titleZh":"矮人桩墙","titleEn":"Dvergr Stakewall"},"p-d2519e258c8d1383ae87.html":{"zh":"拳类 是与 拳类 武器类别相关的 技能 ，包括 徒手 。","en":"Fists is a skill related to Fists weapon class, including Bare Fists .","titleZh":"拳术（技能）","titleEn":"Fists (skill)"},"p-d268c9c4492022ac5325.html":{"zh":"楼层 部件是可用多种材料建造的结构：","en":"Floor pieces are building structures available in several materials:","titleZh":"楼层","titleEn":"Floor"},"p-d303e0bcb68caa40b428.html":{"zh":"庆典花环 是装饰物，需要在 工作台 范围内建造。","en":"Flower garland is a decorative object. It needs to be built within the range of a Workbench .","titleZh":"庆典花环","titleEn":"Flower Garland"},"p-d3069841632553e745aa.html":{"zh":"饰物 分类，是使用 血怒 的可穿戴物品。","en":"Category for trinkets , wearable items which use Adrenaline .","titleZh":"分类：饰物","titleEn":"Category:Trinket"},"p-d31302e5b74b6f7dd11c.html":{"zh":"腐疫地堡 是第6个首领 蛊虫之后 的出生地点和战场。与此前不同，腐疫堡垒是类似 地牢 的独立区域，可在内部遇见并对战蛊虫之后。","en":"The Infested Citadel is the spawn location and boss arena of the 6th boss, The Queen . Unlike the previous boss arenas, the Infested Citadel is an instanced area (much like a dungeon ) wherein The Queen can be encountered and fought.","titleZh":"腐疫地堡","titleEn":"Infested Citadel"},"p-d35b0efe21288fd59dac.html":{"zh":"铜 是将 铜矿 或 铜碎屑 放入 冶炼炉 冶炼得到的制作材料。 可在 熔炉 处与 锡 合成 青铜 。","en":"Copper is a crafting material smelted from Copper Ore or Copper Scrap in a Smelter . It can be combined with Tin at a Forge to create Bronze .","titleZh":"铜","titleEn":"Copper"},"p-d37e35e6b13763a1ff7e.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 远古护甲 上古之剑 铜矿源 炎金属矿脉 发光金属 铁矿脉 泥泞的废料堆 银矿脉 软组织 锡矿源","en":"Pages in category Ancient Armor Ancient Sword Copper Deposit Flametal Ore Vein Glowing metal Iron vein Muddy Scrap Pile Silver Vein Soft Tissue Tin Deposit","titleZh":"分类：矿床","titleEn":"Category:Ore deposits"},"p-d38169043f8a6b4bbe48.html":{"zh":"建造和修复 铁笼结构 需要 铁 ，且附近必须有 熔炉 。 虽然外观看起来有空隙，但它们完全阻挡投射物， 箭 或 烟雾 等无法穿透。","en":"Cage structures require Iron and the proximity of a Forge to be built and repaired. Despite their sparse appearance, they are entirely solid; projectiles such as arrows or smoke cannot penetrate it.","titleZh":"铁笼结构","titleEn":"Cage Structures"},"p-d388548a790f8957486e.html":{"zh":"维京长船 是大型 船只 ，航速快、储物容量大，操纵性中等。建造成本较高，不适合随意弃置，但生命值和速度远高于维京船，是不错的升级。维京长船可靠、载货量大，操纵性能也很出色，尺寸又不至于笨重。 满帆速度为5.02–9.54米/秒，半帆为3.55–6.74米/秒，划桨为3.16米/秒。","en":"Longships are large boats with a high sailing speed, a high amount of storage and average maneuverability. Their cost of construction makes Longships less than disposable. However, their significantly higher health and fast sailing speeds make them a decent upgrade from the Karve. Longships are reliable boats, able to store a large amount of cargo while boasting some of the best maneuverability, without being so lar…","titleZh":"维京长船","titleEn":"Longship"},"p-d3e53a2e348022ba16a6.html":{"zh":"弩箭 是一种供 弩 使用的弹药。 在进行其他伤害计算之前，弩箭的 伤害 会加到弩的基础伤害上（详见 伤害机制 ）。","en":"Bolts are a type of ammunition for Crossbows . Bolts' damage is added to base crossbow damage before any other damage calculation. (See Damage mechanics for details).","titleZh":"弩箭","titleEn":"Bolts"},"p-d3efea7f66cbc49b1b9c.html":{"zh":"长柄武器 是一类 武器 。 长柄武器是强力的双手武器。所有长柄武器都造成穿刺伤害，并具有独特的范围次要攻击。 游戏中的大多数长柄武器称为长戟。长戟具有独特外观：长木杆侧面装有一片细长弯曲的刀刃。","en":"Polearms is a weapon class. Polearms are strong two-handed weapons. All polearms deal pierce damage, and have a distinct AoE special attack. Most polearms in the game are referred to as atgeirs. Atgeirs share a distinctive in-game look, featuring a thin, curved blade attached to the side of a long wooden pole.","titleZh":"长柄武器","titleEn":"Polearms"},"p-d47c9e58516130271368.html":{"zh":"守护者护甲 是一套 极北之地 级别的 护甲 。","en":"The Protector Armor is a Deep North -tier armor .","titleZh":"守护者护甲","titleEn":"Protector Armor"},"p-d48959ca19e677fb2823.html":{"zh":"鳞木结构 是 极北之地 墙面构件，建造和修复需要 巨木 ，且附近须有 工作台 。","en":"Scalewood structures are Deep North wall pieces. They require Timberwood and the proximity of a workbench to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"鳞木结构","titleEn":"Scalewood Structures"},"p-d4b33a2e35eb8b5cfdbb.html":{"zh":"浆果 可能指：","en":"Berries may refer to:","titleZh":"浆果","titleEn":"Berries"},"p-d4c35805ac37d0fd4ede.html":{"zh":"中份耐力蜜酒 是一种 北境平原 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：中份耐力 发酵 而成。","en":"Medium stamina mead is a Plains -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Medium stamina .","titleZh":"中份耐力蜜酒","titleEn":"Medium Stamina Mead"},"p-d4d8dd9883b92c938fbc.html":{"zh":"雷血之剑 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境之剑 得到的版本。 它获得额外的 劈砍 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境之剑在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thunderblood Sword is a version of Nord Sword upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra Slash and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Sword will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷血之剑","titleEn":"Thunderblood Sword"},"p-d4dc58f5171de5045107.html":{"zh":"法师帽菇 是生长在 迷雾之地 的作物，可在该生物群系中自然找到，也可用 耕地耙 种植。","en":"Magecaps are crops which grow in the Mistlands . They can be found naturally in the biome and farmed by planting them using a Cultivator .","titleZh":"法师帽菇","titleEn":"Magecap"},"p-d5a78b996fe640a3f918.html":{"zh":"毒素 是负面 状态效果 ，对受影响对象造成持续伤害，由 毒素伤害 引起。 抗毒蜜酒 等所有抗性在效果创建时计算，每次伤害结算时忽略。因此效果开始后改变抗性，不会改变该效果。 毒素伤害不叠加。效果会计算尚未造成的伤害；若新攻击的毒素伤害超过剩余量，就重新创建效果，否则忽略新伤害。","en":"Poison is a negative status effect that applies a damage overtime effect on the affected entity. It is caused by Poison damage . All resistances like Poison Resistance Mead are applied at the time of creating the effect and ignored on tick. Therefore any change to resistances after the effect start doesn't change it. Poison damage does not stack. The effect calculates how much damage remains to be dealt, and if a ne…","titleZh":"毒素","titleEn":"Poison"},"p-d614900fbfd69c5ff41d.html":{"zh":"邪煞之根 由 幽暗沼泽 的 邪煞之树 掉落，用于制作 树根套装 及部分 牦牛皮套装 。","en":"Roots are items dropped by Abominations in Swamps and are used to craft the Root Set and parts of the Lox Fur Set .","titleZh":"邪煞之根","titleEn":"Root (item)"},"p-d638ee2f46a405dd2f5c.html":{"zh":"邪蛛士兵 是 迷雾之地 及 腐疫矿区 中的敌对 生物 。 邪蛛侦察兵是大型耐打虫状生物，兼具甲虫、蚂蚁和蜜蜂特征。普通 邪蛛探索者 像蚂蚁，侦察兵则像锹甲，有强劲口钳及圆润甲壳。与普通邪蛛不同，侦察兵没有翅膀。","en":"Seeker Soldiers are aggressive creatures found in the Mistlands and in Infested Mines . Seekers soldiers are large, highly durable insect-like creatures with traits similar to beetles, ants, and bees. While ordinary Seekers resemble ants, Soldiers bear a resemblance to stag beetles, with powerful mandibles and a rounded, armored carapace. Unlike ordinary Seekers, Soldiers do not have wings.","titleZh":"邪蛛士兵","titleEn":"Seeker Soldier"},"p-d696c8a12a798d24ed07.html":{"zh":"倒置塔楼 或 水井 是 幽暗沼泽 和 凛冽雪山 中的 地点 ，呈圆形，楼梯通向地下。","en":"Inverted Towers or Wells are Points of interest found in Swamp and Mountain . These are circular structures with staircases leading down into the ground.","titleZh":"倒置塔楼","titleEn":"Inverted Tower"},"p-d6f33b8ec5b7344bceaa.html":{"zh":"大份治疗蜜酒 是一种 迷雾之地 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：大份治疗 发酵 而成。","en":"Major healing mead is a Mistlands -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Major healing .","titleZh":"大份治疗蜜酒","titleEn":"Major Healing Mead"},"p-d700d8d69e353aa6eba9.html":{"zh":"蓝色披肩连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付450 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的白银宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Shawl dress blue is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 450 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's silver chest .","titleZh":"蓝色披肩连衣裙","titleEn":"Shawl dress blue"},"p-d72ad0182bdbba9ec83f.html":{"zh":"矮人 是主要生活在 迷雾之地 、既可能被动也可能敌对的 生物 。矮人是智慧种族，体形矮小、皮肤蓝色，眼睛发出蓝至紫色光，有白色长须和辫子。 灰烬之地 中的矮人是红发，属于与迷雾之地矮人不同的氏族。","en":"A Dvergr is a type of both passive and aggressive creature found primarily in the Mistlands . The Dvergr are an intelligent race that resemble short, blue humanoids with glowing eyes ranging from blue to purple, and long white beards and braids. The Dvergr living in the Ashlands , are red haired and of a different clan than those from the Mistlands.","titleZh":"矮人（种族）","titleEn":"Dvergr (race)"},"p-d7773df080af69ee8da9.html":{"zh":"焰金属堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 焰金属 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Flametal Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Flametal or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"焰金属堆","titleEn":"Flametal Stack"},"p-d7e2ba755a0b385526af.html":{"zh":"橡果 是一种种子，可用 耕地耙 种植，长成新的 橡树 。种下后需要几个游戏日才能长成。幼苗周围需要少量空间，若空间不足，就无法长成大树。 也用于建造 鸟巢 ，后者会随时间产出 羽毛 。","en":"Acorns are a seed that can be planted using the Cultivator to produce new Oak trees. Once planted, seeds take a few in-game days to grow to full size. Seedlings require a small amount of space directly around where they are planted; if they do not have enough space, they will not grow into full trees. They are also used to build Birds' Nests , which produce Feathers over time.","titleZh":"橡果","titleEn":"Acorns"},"p-d7ee29b7091dbc561c4b.html":{"zh":"破碎之杖 是 灰烬之地 更新加入的一种 魔法 武器。其运作方式类似 余烬之杖 ，但发射的不是单个火球，而是12枚较小弹体，命中目标时会爆炸。若命中地形，弹体会四散，并在片刻后爆炸。每个“碎裂”弹体都造成钝击伤害、少量击退和额外火焰伤害，可使敌人燃烧。 由于法杖发射独立弹体，它可能比余烬之杖造成更高的伤害 针对单一目标 ，因为所示基础伤害为 每一发弹体的伤害。 。此外，根据 火 伤害 的机制，每枚弹体都会叠加火焰效果，因此只要足够多的弹体命中目标，其持续伤害就可能高于余烬之杖。 伤害和埃达之能消耗取决于施法者的 元素魔法 技能等级。","en":"Staff of Fracturing is a Magic weapon introduced in the Ashlands update. It works in a similar fashion to the Staff of Embers , except that instead of a single fireball, it shoots 12 smaller projectiles that explode on impact against a target, if hitting the terrain instead, the projectiles will scatter around and also explode a moment later. Each \"fractured\" piece does blunt with a slight knockback and additional f…","titleZh":"破碎之杖","titleEn":"Staff of Fracturing"},"p-d8385c51550b9831d27a.html":{"zh":"狂战之斧 是一种 灰烬之地 级别的双持 斧 。 狂战之斧造成 砍伐 伤害，因此与所有斧一样可以砍伐树木。其砍伐伤害高于上一种斧—— 巨人之戮 。","en":"Berserkir Axes is an Ashlands -tier dual wielded axe . The Berserkir Axes deal Chop damage, which allows them to cut down trees, like all axes. They deal more Chop damage than the previous axe, the Jotun Bane .","titleZh":"狂战之斧","titleEn":"Berserkir Axes"},"p-d8a1f1d2b4960031a96b.html":{"zh":"橙色华丽帽 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付300 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的青铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Extravagant cap orange is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 300 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's bronze chest .","titleZh":"橙色华丽帽","titleEn":"Extravagant cap orange"},"p-d8b90306693f653d0ca9.html":{"zh":"箭靶 是一种用于训练 弓（技能） 及其他远程武器技能的设施。 击中箭靶只能获得正常 经验 增量的35%。","en":"Archery Target is a structure used to train Bows (skill) and other ranged weapon skills. Hitting the Archery Target only grants 35% of the normal Experience gain.","titleZh":"箭靶","titleEn":"Archery Target"},"p-d8ba0559822e5ff934e9.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以200枚 钱币 购买 镰刀把 ，仅在击败 冰霜龙母 后出售。","en":"Scythe handle can be purchased from The Bog Witch for 200 Coins . It is only sold after Moder has been defeated.","titleZh":"镰刀把","titleEn":"Scythe Handle"},"p-d8c51c1c9b8e0083aabc.html":{"zh":"灰烬头颅 是由 苦难之碑 掉落，并可在 灰烬之地 中 灰烬宝箱 找到的材料。","en":"Charred Skull is a material dropped from Monument of Torment and found in Charred chests in the Ashlands .","titleZh":"灰烬头颅","titleEn":"Charred Skull"},"p-d8c79cdf88ab9ed01b4f.html":{"zh":"废弃小棚 是在 幽暗沼泽 中发现的 地点 ，外形像破败的高脚屋，共有5种变体。","en":"Abandoned Huts are Points of interest found in the Swamp . They look like ruined stilt houses and come in 5 variants.","titleZh":"废弃小棚","titleEn":"Abandoned Hut"},"p-d8e46d5900aa57109f56.html":{"zh":"梭子鱼 是 青青草原 和 黑暗林山 近岸的沿海 鱼 ，用 鱼竿 配从 霍尔德 购买的 鱼饵 ，或 冷鱼饵 捕获。后者在 灶台 以20份 鱼饵 和一个 芬里战利品 制作。","en":"Pike are coastal fish found offshore the Meadows and Black Forest . They can be caught with a Fishing Rod using Fishing Bait purchased from Haldor or Cold fishing bait which can be crafted at the Food Preparation Table by combining 20 Fishing Bait and a Fenring Trophy .","titleZh":"梭子鱼","titleEn":"Pike"},"p-d916515d826cf07e0908.html":{"zh":"青铜 是将两份 铜 及一份 锡 在 熔炉 加工的制作材料。也可破坏 凛冽雪山 中 冰霜洞穴 里的 火盆 ，或 灰烬之地 中废墟及 腐朽之穴 内的 上古之坛 获取。另可在 冶炼炉 直接冶炼少见的 青铜废料 获得。","en":"Bronze is a crafting material crafted by processing two Copper and one Tin at the Forge . Bronze can also be obtained by destroying the Standing Braziers found in Frost Caves within the Mountain biome, or by destroying Ancient Pots found in ruins and Putrid Holes within the Ashlands biome. Additionally, Bronze can also be obtained by directly smelting the uncommon Scrap Bronze in a Smelter .","titleZh":"青铜","titleEn":"Bronze"},"p-d96a5300820ebfeda9c1.html":{"zh":"灰烬乌鸦 是 灰烬之地 的 焦骨废墟 周围出现的被动 生物 。 它们是小型鸟，腿长，喙粗而直，全身连腿脚都为白色。","en":"Ash crows are passive creatures found in Ashlands around Charred ruins . They are small birds with long legs and heavy, straight bills. These birds are entirely white, including their legs and feet.","titleZh":"灰烬乌鸦","titleEn":"Ash Crow"},"p-d9750e42f4357d8a8d8a.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣 是 灰烬之地 中的敌对生物，可驯服并快速骑乘，像巨大的变异 蜥蜴精 。","en":"Asksvin are hostile, tameable, and fast rideable creatures found in the Ashlands . They look like huge, mutated Necks .","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣","titleEn":"Asksvin"},"p-d9f073bb0bf0c12222c2.html":{"zh":"关于《英灵神殿》的建造流程，请参阅建筑。 建筑构件是建筑的基础部分，可灵活组合，打造独特建筑及维京基础设施。","en":"For information on the process of Building in Valheim, see Building . Building Structures are the basic building pieces of structures. These pieces can be used in many ways to create unique buildings and viking infrastructure.","titleZh":"分类：建筑结构","titleEn":"Category:Building structures"},"p-da1da290020b4544141b.html":{"zh":"海鸥 是被动 生物 。它们是长腿、粗直喙的小鸟，主要为白色，喙黄色、翅膀灰色，腿脚为粉米色。","en":"Gulls are passive creatures . They are small birds with long legs and heavy, straight bills. These birds are mainly white, with a yellow beak, gray wings and pinkish beige legs and feet.","titleZh":"海鸥","titleEn":"Gull"},"p-da3c358f28f8b39fb4b8.html":{"zh":"寒冰锤 是第四种单手 棍棒 。 其极强的击退和 减速 效果使它适合同时对付多个敌人。这些特性结合不同伤害类型，使寒冰锤即使在后期生物群系中也仍是一种十分有效的全能武器。","en":"Frostner is the fourth one-handed club . Its very high knockback and slow makes it a good choice for fighting multiple foes at once. These attributes in combination with different damage types make the Frostner a very effective all round weapon even in later biomes.","titleZh":"寒冰锤","titleEn":"Frostner"},"p-da82547bedccbaee148a.html":{"zh":"煤块堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 木炭 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Coal Pile is a buildable structure that is used to store Coal or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"煤块堆","titleEn":"Coal Pile"},"p-dacb6ef58142dae4d047.html":{"zh":"燧石斧 是第二种单手 斧 ，可用于砍伐 山毛榉 、 冷杉 和 松树 树木。","en":"Flint Axe is the second one-handed axe . It can be used to chop down Beech , Fir and Pine trees.","titleZh":"燧石斧","titleEn":"Flint Axe"},"p-dae0896cbc2c67bfbf74.html":{"zh":"锁链 仅可作为掉落物或战利品获取，无法制作。","en":"Chain is an item which can only be found as a drop or loot. It cannot be crafted.","titleZh":"锁链","titleEn":"Chain"},"p-db0b93ef4372a8afe27b.html":{"zh":"机械弹簧 可在 工匠台 制作，用于基地防御，没有 传送门 石头 就无法传送。","en":"Mechanical spring is an item and can be crafted at an Artisan Table . It is used to construct base defenses and cannot be teleported without a Portal stone .","titleZh":"机械弹簧","titleEn":"Mechanical Spring"},"p-db7a5394891d8eb7840f.html":{"zh":"黑金属戟 是第三种 长柄武器 。","en":"Black Metal Atgeir is the third polearm .","titleZh":"黑金属戟","titleEn":"Black Metal Atgeir"},"p-db8a6926fcfd59cc13f1.html":{"zh":"青铜戟 是第一种 长柄武器 。","en":"Bronze Atgeir is the first polearm .","titleZh":"青铜戟","titleEn":"Bronze Atgeir"},"p-dba0dea0584b2923f40c.html":{"zh":"青铜镐 是第二种 镐击 。它可以开采 鹿角镐 能够开采的所有资源，但伤害更高，也更耐用。 主要攻击为能够破坏地面的近战攻击。它没有次要攻击。","en":"Bronze Pickaxe is the second pickaxe . It can be used to mine all the same things as the Antler Pickaxe , but does more damage and is more durable. Its primary attack is a melee attack that destroys ground. It does not have a secondary attack.","titleZh":"青铜镐","titleEn":"Bronze Pickaxe"},"p-dbb45ed135ef3d605640.html":{"zh":"黑血汤 是一种 泥泞沼泽 级别的 食物 。","en":"Black Soup is a Swamp -tier food .","titleZh":"黑血汤","titleEn":"Black Soup"},"p-dbb4e9c1f403cfc275b3.html":{"zh":"皇家果冻 是一种可生吃的均衡型 迷雾之地 食物，可用于多种配方。","en":"Royal jelly is a raw balanced Mistlands food which is used in various recipes.","titleZh":"皇家果冻","titleEn":"Royal Jelly"},"p-dbd5fc2a21422c96c810.html":{"zh":"撕裂者：原始 是使用 翡翠 强化 撕裂者 得到的版本。与所有使用 翡翠 强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 毒素伤害 ，且命中效果有20%概率施加 定身 。 已升级的撕裂者在改造为撕裂者：原始时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Splitnir the Primal is the upgraded form of Splitnir using the Jade . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Jade , they gain 10 poison damage and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply Immobilized . An upgraded Splitnir will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Splitnir the Primal.","titleZh":"撕裂者：原始","titleEn":"Splitnir the Primal"},"p-dbd9d3789af4697f7188.html":{"zh":"巫师扫帚 是 沼泽女巫 小屋中的中立生物，受攻击时会自卫。 它会攻击靠近小屋的怪物。","en":"Kvastur is a neutral creature found in The Bog Witch hut. It defends itself if attacked. It will attack monsters close to the hut.","titleZh":"巫师扫帚","titleEn":"Kvastur"},"p-dc042adbdecb49bc4de4.html":{"zh":"矮人刺客 是 迷雾之地 中的中立 生物 ，尤其在 矮人 聚落周围。体形矮小、蓝皮肤，眼睛浅蓝、头发银色，持 强弩 。建筑处生成的刺客常与其他刺客或 矮人法师 混编。与法师不同，刺客可在迷雾之地各处生成及重新生成。 玩家伤害它们、附近矮人，或矮人 守护石 保护的建筑部分时，会激怒它们，转为敌对并攻击。 矮人与迷雾之地其他敌对生物天然敌对，见到就攻击。推进进度需清理至少一处聚落，因为 矮人板条箱 内的 矮人提取器 是 树汁提取器 必需部件。也可用板车撞碎箱子，或让附近怪物破坏，以绕过交战。","en":"Dvergr Rogues are neutral creatures found in the Mistlands , especially around Dvergr settlements. They resemble short, blue humanoids with light blue eyes and silver hair carrying an Arbalest . Rogues that spawn at Dvergr structures will often be accompanied by a mix of other rogues and/or Dvergr Mages ; unlike mages, however, rogues may spawn (and respawn) anywhere in the Mistlands.","titleZh":"矮人刺客","titleEn":"Dvergr Rogue"},"p-dc0921952ce1ff6aa8b9.html":{"zh":"这是 箭 的 分类 ，它们是一种供 弓 使用的弹药。","en":"This is a category for arrows which are a type of ammunition for bows .","titleZh":"分类：箭","titleEn":"Category:Arrows"},"p-dc0b347a4e9e71e25505.html":{"zh":"铁弩箭 是供 弩 使用的 弹药 ，也是 骨制弩箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Iron bolts are ammunition for crossbows and are the next direct upgrade from Bone Bolts .","titleZh":"铁弩箭","titleEn":"Iron Bolt"},"p-dc294146bc689ccc8153.html":{"zh":"杵与臼 用于升级 铸铁锅 。因为需要只能从 迷雾之地 获得的 黑大理石 ，通常是大锅的第四项升级。","en":"The Mortar and pestle is used as an upgrade to the Cauldron . It will typically be the fourth upgrade to the cauldron, as it requires Black Marble , which can only be acquired from the Mistlands .","titleZh":"杵与臼","titleEn":"Mortar and Pestle"},"p-dca26dd5e931dca97bf6.html":{"zh":"琥珀珍珠 是一种 珍贵 物品。","en":"Amber Pearl is a Valuable item.","titleZh":"琥珀珍珠","titleEn":"Amber Pearl"},"p-dca7f2a5abb16aeccc0f.html":{"zh":"骑士盾牌 是未使用的资源，外观为鸢盾，但功能与圆盾相同。","en":"The knight shield is an unused asset with the appearance of a kite shield but the function of a round shield.","titleZh":"骑士盾牌","titleEn":"Knight shield"},"p-dcafb03495b8c8248945.html":{"zh":"矮人法师 是 迷雾之地 的 矮人 聚落附近的中立 生物 ，体形矮小、蓝皮肤，眼睛浅蓝、头发银色，持 魔法 法杖。共有三种法师，可按法杖和袍子颜色区分。与 矮人刺客 不同，只出现在矮人聚落等建筑周围，几乎总与其他矮人成群，而且不会重新生成。 玩家伤害它们、附近矮人，或矮人 守护石 保护的建筑部分时，会激怒它们，转为敌对并攻击。 矮人与迷雾之地其他敌对生物天然敌对，见到就攻击。推进进度通常需清理至少一处聚落，因为 矮人板条箱 内有 矮人提取器 ，是 树汁提取器 的必需部件。也可用板车撞碎箱子、用 埃达精华 破坏，或等附近怪物破坏，以绕过直接交战。","en":"Dvergr Mages are neutral creatures found in the Mistlands around Dvergr settlements. They resemble short, blue humanoids with light blue eyes and silver hair, and they carry Magic staves. There are three different types of Dvergr Mage, which can be differentiated by the color of their staff and robe. Unlike Dvergr Rogues , mages are exclusively found around Dvergr settlements and other structures (almost always in g…","titleZh":"矮人法师","titleEn":"Dvergr Mage"},"p-dcc578acd71a7bf2c0e9.html":{"zh":"火把 是一种实用型 棍棒 ，主手和副手都可装备。 它提供照明。装备时具有与火堆相同的效果，会吓退 蜥蜴精 、未驯服的 鬓猪 、 灰宝宝 和 灰矮人 。","en":"Torch is a utility club which can be equipped in both main and off-hand. It provides light. When equipped, it has the same effect as a fire, scaring off Necks , untamed Boars , Greylings and Greydwarfs .","titleZh":"火把","titleEn":"Torch"},"p-dcf5201d63f24e9907ac.html":{"zh":"细木弓 是第二种 弓 。","en":"Finewood Bow is the second bow .","titleZh":"细木弓","titleEn":"Finewood Bow"},"p-de4572ce192a27cf694f.html":{"zh":"邪蛛肉冻 是 迷雾之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Seeker aspic is a Mistlands -tier food.","titleZh":"邪蛛肉冻","titleEn":"Seeker Aspic"},"p-de46aeb7239be39ea590.html":{"zh":"银剑 是第三种 剑 。","en":"Silver Sword is the third sword .","titleZh":"银剑","titleEn":"Silver Sword"},"p-df00a9b85110beb3f519.html":{"zh":"锡堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 锡 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Tin Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Tin or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"锡堆","titleEn":"Tin Stack"},"p-df029ad32ddc2a0b8797.html":{"zh":"屠杀者 是第二种双手剑。","en":"Slayer is the second two-handed sword.","titleZh":"屠杀者","titleEn":"Slayer"},"p-df1bc4984a055e10b286.html":{"zh":"幽灵 是 诡秘墓穴 内 黑暗林山 中的敌对 生物 ，也会在“你感到脊背发凉……”袭击 事件 中出现。","en":"Ghosts are aggressive creatures found in Black Forests within Burial Chambers , and as part of \"You feel a chill down your spine...\" raid event .","titleZh":"幽灵","titleEn":"Ghost"},"p-df340cb22df8913a51d4.html":{"zh":"瓦纳蜜酒 是一种 泥泞沼泽 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：瓦纳 发酵 而成。","en":"Draught of Vananidir is a Swamp -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Vananidir .","titleZh":"瓦纳蜜酒","titleEn":"Draught of Vananidir"},"p-df45436c57ba5e8f6833.html":{"zh":"狼肉串 是一种 凛冽雪山 级别的 食物 。","en":"Wolf skewer is a Mountain -tier food .","titleZh":"狼肉串","titleEn":"Wolf Skewer"},"p-df85e96a2da62ca98ee9.html":{"zh":"邪骨恶灵 是第三位 首领 ，外形为巨大的类人团块，由毒泥、淤泥和骨骼残骸组成，可能吸收自祭坛附近墓穴。","en":"Bonemass is the third boss . He appears as a gigantic humanoid mass comprised of toxic ooze, mud and skeletal remains, likely absorbed from nearby tombs situated close to his altar.","titleZh":"邪骨恶灵","titleEn":"Bonemass"},"p-dfb5db052fe28a4ea700.html":{"zh":"铁铸绿光火炬 是可在 熔炉 范围内使用 工具锤 建造的光源，需要 树脓 作为燃料。 绿焰立式铁火把最多装六份树脓。装入1/6容量的燃料可燃烧5小时33分钟，装满可燃烧33小时20分钟，与 铁铸火炬 、 铁铸蓝光火炬 和 壁灯 相同。","en":"The Standing green-burning iron torch is a light source that can be built using the Hammer within range of a Forge . It requires Guck as fuel. The standing green-burning iron torch can hold up to six Guck at once. With 1/6 fuel, a standing green-burning iron torch will last for 5 hours and 33 minutes. At its maximum capacity, a standing green-burning iron torch will last for 33 hours and 20 minutes. This duration is…","titleZh":"铁铸绿光火炬","titleEn":"Standing Green-burning Iron Torch"},"p-dfd96f7540382895817c.html":{"zh":"费德 是 英灵神殿 早期测试版本的临时名称。当时由理查德·斯文松独自开发，其YouTube频道可找到多段早期玩法视频。 Fejd于2018年一月3日开放Windows下载和游玩。","en":"Fejd was the temporary name of Valheim during the early alpha version. It was developed by Richard Svensson alone at the time, and various early gameplay videos can be found on his YouTube channel. Fejd was made available to download and play on Windows on 3 January 2018.","titleZh":"费德","titleEn":"Fejd"},"p-e009a867f990f58b163a.html":{"zh":"地点 （ 兴趣点 ）是建筑或地下城等独特地点，由 英灵神殿 世界生成算法放入 生物群系 。","en":"A point of interest ( POI ) is a distinctive location, such as a building or dungeon, placed in a biome by Valheim's world generation algorithm.","titleZh":"地点","titleEn":"Point of interest"},"p-e011d0b4b53193b4ecb1.html":{"zh":"霜龙巢穴 是 凛冽雪山 中的 地点 ，看似由大岩石和冰块组成的巢，中央有发光粉色龙蛋。","en":"Drake nests are Points of interest found in the Mountain . They look like a nest made of large rocks and ice blocks with a glowing pink egg in the middle.","titleZh":"霜龙巢穴","titleEn":"Drake Nest"},"p-e047367a527a2a7ca307.html":{"zh":"圆柱形篱笆 是可建造构件。","en":"Roundpole Fence is a buildable structure.","titleZh":"圆柱形篱笆","titleEn":"Roundpole Fence"},"p-e05bc7ca3a55e47e1ee9.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以120枚 钱币 购买5个 龙蛋壳粉 。","en":"Powdered dragon eggshells can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 120 Coins for 5 items.","titleZh":"龙蛋壳粉","titleEn":"Powdered Dragon Eggshells"},"p-e07fd015fad8a51ea77a.html":{"zh":"子分类 分类：床 分类：火源 分类中的页面 护甲架 椅子 雕纹长桌 仲夏柱 雕纹方桌 桌子 耶鲁树","en":"Subcategories Category:Beds Category:Fires Pages in category Armor Stand Chairs Long Carved Table Maypole Square Carved Table Tables Yule Tree","titleZh":"分类：提供舒适度","titleEn":"Category:Grants Comfort"},"p-e0c5a33c587dab33233d.html":{"zh":"盛宴 是持续时间更长、可供多人分享的大份餐食。 盛宴在 灶台 处制作，需要使用向 沼泽女巫 购买的香料。 食用前必须用 餐盘 摆放盛宴。可通过餐盘的建造菜单选择盛宴，将其放在地板、桌子或其他表面上。摆放后，一道盛宴可供食用10份，每份效果持续50分钟。全部吃完后，须使用餐盘的“移除”功能清除空盘。如果盛宴已被吃掉一部分，摧毁或拆除它不会返还任何物品。 盛宴属于均衡型食物，提供相同数值的 生命值 和 耐力 。制作时通常消耗不足10份餐食，却能提供10份、持续时间约为多数食物两倍的餐食，相当于20份普通食物，因此很划算。","en":"Feasts are large meals that last longer and can be shared among several people. Feasts are crafted at the Food Preparation Table and require spices bought from The Bog Witch . Before being eaten, they must be placed using the Serving Tray . They can be placed on any surface, on the floor or on a table, this is done using the Serving Tray build menu to choose which feast to place. Once placed, the feast has 10 servin…","titleZh":"宴席","titleEn":"Feast"},"p-e12d82dd611b23d72413.html":{"zh":"淡红银矿石粉 是一件物品。淡红银矿具有金刚至玻璃光泽，反射光下显得闪亮、如玻璃。","en":"Proustite Powder is an item. Proustite has an adamantine to glassy luster, giving it a shiny, glassy appearance when viewed in reflected light.","titleZh":"淡红银矿石粉","titleEn":"Proustite Powder"},"p-e13f0da28839c9871ded.html":{"zh":"撕裂者 是第六种 矛 。","en":"Splitnir is the sixth spear .","titleZh":"撕裂者","titleEn":"Splitnir"},"p-e148029c6590353038b9.html":{"zh":"<mainpage-leftcolumn-start /> 此全面资源由爱好者维护，得到 英灵神殿 开发者官方认可。任何人可贡献，也可使用共享知识，包括物品、世界背景及强敌策略。 无论来 参与编辑 还是获取知识，欢迎来到 注册账号 ！干杯！ <mainpage-endcolumn /> <mainpage-rightcolumn-start /> <mainpage-endcolumn />","en":"<mainpage-leftcolumn-start /> This comprehensive and informative resource is maintained by fans, but officially approved by the developers of Valheim . Anyone may contribute, just as anyone may take part in the knowledge shared - whether it be information about items, lore of the world, or strategies for difficult enemies.","titleZh":"英灵神殿维基/沙盒","titleEn":"Valheim Wiki/sandbox"},"p-e173b37c3b90457e7735.html":{"zh":"极北木结构 是 极北之地 构件，建造和修复需要 巨木 ，且附近须有 工作台 。","en":"Timber structures are Deep North building pieces. They require Timberwood and the proximity of a workbench to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"极北木结构","titleEn":"Timber Structures"},"p-e209d05dba2181f66163.html":{"zh":"沙拉 是 迷雾之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Salad is a Mistlands -tier food.","titleZh":"沙拉","titleEn":"Salad"},"p-e23e32b15260ee89ccfc.html":{"zh":"饰件 是用于装饰 屋顶 的建筑。建造和修复需要 细木 ，且附近必须有 工作台 。","en":"Adornments are structures that can be used to decorate roofs . They require Finewood and the proximity of a Workbench to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"饰件","titleEn":"Adornments"},"p-e252d0b058d9c80223a2.html":{"zh":"精华 可指用于升级武器的 极北之地 材料：","en":"Essence can refer to Deep North materials used to update weapons:","titleZh":"精华","titleEn":"Essence"},"p-e276c06bee50caadbc0e.html":{"zh":"元素魔法 是一类 武器 ，在 迷雾之地 更新中作为两种 魔法 之一加入。","en":"Elemental magic is a weapon class which was added in the Mistlands update, as one of the two types of Magic .","titleZh":"元素魔法","titleEn":"Elemental magic"},"p-e27f3a289ceb40df4796.html":{"zh":"蚂蟥 是 泥泞沼泽 中的敌对 生物 ，是大型水生环节动物，通过吸食受害者血液为生。","en":"Leeches are aggressive creatures found in Swamps . They are enlarged, aquatic annelid worms that feed off their victims by sucking their blood.","titleZh":"蚂蟥","titleEn":"Leech"},"p-e28d1afad1a693124e24.html":{"zh":"石化组织 是一种矿石，可在 高炉 用 木炭 作燃料，转为 血金 。","en":"Petrified Tissue is an ore which can be turned into Bloodgold at a Blast Furnace using Coal as fuel.","titleZh":"石化组织","titleEn":"Petrified Tissue"},"p-e299496eac0e1a5d4b28.html":{"zh":"世界之树粥 是 迷雾之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Yggdrasil porridge is a Mistlands -tier food.","titleZh":"世界之树粥","titleEn":"Yggdrasil Porridge"},"p-e2b3f27d6fca99302aa8.html":{"zh":"无眼者 是 极北之地 地下 蜿蜒隧道 中的敌对生物。","en":"Eyeless Ones are hostile creatures found in the Winding Tunnels below ground in the Deep North .","titleZh":"无眼者","titleEn":"Eyeless One"},"p-e2bc75c8e4f024ebd2ad.html":{"zh":"铁制战斗神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Iron Battle Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"铁制战斗神像","titleEn":"Iron Battle Idol"},"p-e2e5e0213e916e5b144b.html":{"zh":"鬓猪肉干 是一种 黑暗林山 级别的 食物 。","en":"Boar jerky is a Black Forest -tier food .","titleZh":"鬓猪肉干","titleEn":"Boar Jerky"},"p-e2f68dab77ee83767ef5.html":{"zh":"灰烬刚鬣蛋由 灰烬之地 生物群系 中的 灰烬刚鬣 产下，详情参见 灰烬刚鬣——繁殖 。","en":"Asksvin eggs are laid by Asksvin in the Ashlands biome . See Asksvin - Breeding for more details.","titleZh":"灰烬刚鬣蛋","titleEn":"Asksvin egg"},"p-e31ead2508896ed4d27c.html":{"zh":"邪影弩炮 是由骨头制成的 弩炮 ，位于 灰烬之地 。 通常 灰烬城堡 四角各安装一台这种邪异装置，会攻击范围内玩家。摧毁后掉落骨碎片及 灰烬齿轮 ，后者用于制作 投石机 。","en":"Skugg are ballistae made of bone and are found in Ashlands . Typically, four of these infernal devices are mounted in each corner of a Charred Fortress and they will attack players when in range. When destroyed, they drop bone fragments and a Charred Cogwheel which can be used to craft the Catapult .","titleZh":"邪影弩炮","titleEn":"Skugg"},"p-e37a3db28fe3ea89afc6.html":{"zh":"雾尼 是 英灵神殿 中的 角色 。他是一只会说话的大渡鸦，与 福金 一起为新抵达 迷雾之地 的阵亡维京人提供指引。","en":"Munin is a character found in Valheim . He is a large, talking raven who provides guidance to slain Vikings that have newly arrived in the Mistlands , along with Hugin .","titleZh":"雾尼","titleEn":"Munin"},"p-e38f4f2655fef87caaca.html":{"zh":"狼眼 是 凛冽雪山 阶段饰品。","en":"Wolf Sight is a Mountain -tier trinket.","titleZh":"狼眼","titleEn":"Wolf Sight"},"p-e3a24e43721ad1a4803f.html":{"zh":"木材堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 木材 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Wood Stack is a buildable structure that is used to store Wood or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"木材堆","titleEn":"Wood Stack"},"p-e3a26b909f3580155e06.html":{"zh":"巨魔长老 是在 极北之地 游荡的巨大敌对生物，是年老的 巨魔 ，也是整个 英灵神殿 最大的生物。 巨魔长老对北方深境进度至关重要。击败后会变成 石化巨魔长老 石像，成为地形的一部分，可在上面建造，也可炸开获得 石化组织 ，用来提炼北方深境金属 血金 。 巨魔长老对多数物理伤害有抗性，头部弱点除外。","en":"Gammeltrolls are huge hostile creatures that roam around the Deep North . They are elder Trolls , the largest creatures in all of Valheim . Gammeltrolls are essential for progression in the Deep North. Upon being defeated, they turn into statues as Petrified Gammeltrolls . Those become part of the terrain and can be built on, or blown up to obtain Petrified Tissue , the raw source of Bloodgold , the Deep North-tier…","titleZh":"巨魔长老","titleEn":"Gammeltroll"},"p-e3fe2a3fe52c9c358744.html":{"zh":"桌子 是家具，可在上面摆放物品，也可单纯用于装饰。","en":"Tables are furniture. They can be used for placing items on top or as simple decorative objects.","titleZh":"桌子","titleEn":"Tables"},"p-e4e8cc9b9fdd046d3256.html":{"zh":"狂战之斧：嗜血 是使用 血石 强化 狂战之斧 得到的版本。与所有使用血石强化的武器一样，玩家每缺少1点 生命值 ，其伤害就提高0.2% （不要与生命值百分比混淆） 。 已升级的狂战之斧在改造为狂战之斧：嗜血时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Bleeding Berserkir Axes are the upgraded form of Berserkir Axes using the Bloodstone . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, their damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of health the player is missing (not to be confused with health percentage) . An upgraded Berserkir Axes will NOT keep their upgrade level when they are made into Bleeding Berserkir Axes.","titleZh":"狂战之斧：嗜血","titleEn":"Bleeding Berserkir Axes"},"p-e50e40041523f24bf261.html":{"zh":"蓝色黄麻窗帘 是装饰物，需要在 工作台 范围内建造。 在 迷雾之地 各处由 黑大理石 建成的 矮人 建筑中，也能找到蓝色黄麻窗帘。可将其破坏以获得 蓝黄麻 。不过，玩家若损伤这些窗帘，或矮人 守护石 范围内的其他建筑，附近矮人就会转为敌对并攻击玩家。 蓝色和红色黄麻窗帘是仅有的提供2点舒适度的旗帜或窗帘。","en":"Blue Jute Curtain is a decorative object. It needs to be built within the range of a Workbench . Blue Jute Curtains can also be found adorning the Dvergr structures built of Black Marble throughout the Mistlands . There, they can be broken to obtain their Blue Jute . Although, if a player damages them, or any other structure in range of a Dvergr Ward , nearby Dvergr will become hostile and attack players.","titleZh":"蓝色黄麻窗帘","titleEn":"Blue Jute Curtain"},"p-e52817818a06d588d6ba.html":{"zh":"陷阱 是一种自动防御并造成伤害的 杂项结构 。 陷阱默认未激活，交互后可立即激活，无法手动解除。物体（例如原木）、掉落物品、被动生物、敌人或玩家进入其正上方作用范围时，就会触发。五秒后可重新设置；过早重设会显示“陷阱还没准备好”。 设置或激活陷阱时应小心，因为它也会杀死玩家。","en":"The Trap is a Misc Structure that acts as an automated defense/source of damage. The Trap's default state is unarmed, and can be armed immediately, by interacting with it. The Trap cannot be disarmed manually and remains armed until an entity (object (i.e. log), a dropped item, passive creature, enemy or player) moves into the Trap's range, immediately above it. A player can reset the Trap after five seconds, if a p…","titleZh":"陷阱","titleEn":"Trap"},"p-e5455837ec6498ec9793.html":{"zh":"灰烬之木 是砍伐 灰烬之地 中的 灰烬之树 获得的木材。虽可用石斧砍伐，但灰烬之地需击败 蛊虫之后 后才可进入，因此只能在后期采集。","en":"Ashwood is a type of wood obtained by chopping down Scorched Trees in the Ashlands biome. While they can be chopped with a stone axe, Ashlands are only accessible after defeating The Queen , so it can only be collected in the late game.","titleZh":"灰烬之木","titleEn":"Ashwood"},"p-e5716be7dc8f1b2c1d03.html":{"zh":"鸟巢 可能指：","en":"Nest may refer to:","titleZh":"鸟巢","titleEn":"Nest"},"p-e5828e47fb273a5e0f48.html":{"zh":"对象 是无法建造的建筑或杂项，外观与可建造设施类似，但不属于其他类别，例如各种矮人家具。","en":"Objects are unbuildable structures and miscellany which are similar to buildable structures, but do not fall under any other category. Examples include the various types of Dvergr furniture.","titleZh":"分类：物件","titleEn":"Category:Objects"},"p-e5b09abbe92cfc0042db.html":{"zh":"感觉不舒服 是食用 兔兔梅 、 腐坏的肉 或 毒蕈 后获得的负面状态效果。 效果持续15秒，期间生命值和耐力无法恢复，移动速度减半；每2秒受到1点伤害，并移除一种已食用的食物效果。 可用此效果清除当前 食物 ，无需等待到期。","en":"Feeling sick is a negative status effect gained by consuming a Bukeperries , Rotten Meat or Toadstool . For 15 seconds, it disables health and stamina regen, halves movement speed, and every 2 seconds it deals 1 damage and undoes one consumed Food. The effect is useful to remove active food without having to wait past theirs expiration times.","titleZh":"感觉不舒服","titleEn":"Feeling sick"},"p-e5ccf384640e394e3010.html":{"zh":"奥丁兜帽 是一件DLC护甲部件，仅供 英灵神殿 的早期支持者使用。Iron Gate Studios通过电子邮件，向报名参加 《英灵神殿》测试 的人发送Steam代码。报名过的玩家可检查自己的邮箱。 发现 皮革碎片 和 木炭 后解锁制作配方。奥丁兜帽在 工作台 处制作。","en":"Hood of Oden is a DLC armor piece. It is only available for the early supporters of Valheim via a Steam code sent out in an email from Iron Gate Studios to those who signed up for the Valheim Beta . Check your email if you signed up! The crafting recipe is unlocked once the player has discovered Leather Scraps and Coal . The Hood of Oden is crafted at the Workbench .","titleZh":"奥丁兜帽","titleEn":"Hood of Oden"},"p-e636e4055d9b129da9b9.html":{"zh":"青铜箭 是供弓使用的 弹药 ，也是 燧石箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Bronzehead arrows are ammunition for bows and are the next direct upgrade from Flinthead Arrows .","titleZh":"青铜箭","titleEn":"Bronzehead Arrow"},"p-e63ff73150cfd999c308.html":{"zh":"茅草屋顶 是 木制 构件，可用来 庇护 ，避免 雨水 导致易受影响的建筑 潮湿效果 和 风化 。建造和修复时附近需要 工作台 。","en":"Thatch roofs are wooden building pieces that can be used to shelter from the effect of rain , which causes the Wet Effect and weathering of susceptible structures. They require the proximity of a workbench to be built and repaired.","titleZh":"茅草屋顶","titleEn":"Thatch Roofs"},"p-e70bc5798f8391942dd6.html":{"zh":"敌对生物 可能具有表示其 等级 的星级。一星生物拥有双倍生命值，造成150%伤害；二星生物拥有三倍生命值，造成双倍伤害，因此可能很难应付。采用合适策略会更容易击杀它们。","en":"Aggressive creatures can have stars representing their level . One-star creatures have double the health and deal 150% damage, while two-stars have triple the health and deal double damage, and can therefore be difficult to fight. Using the right strategy will make killing them much easier.","titleZh":"敌对生物攻略","titleEn":"Aggressive creature strategies"},"p-e72dc849772921980949.html":{"zh":"鱼饵 是用于 钓鱼 的物品。装备 鱼竿 ，再在 物品栏 中右键点击鱼饵即可装上。鱼饵种类决定能捕获哪些 鱼 。","en":"Bait is a type of item used for fishing . A bait can be attached to a Fishing Rod by equipping the rod and then right-clicking the bait in the inventory . Depending on the bait attached to a fishing rod, different types of fish can be caught.","titleZh":"鱼饵","titleEn":"Bait"},"p-e75bcca46fe1a780eaff.html":{"zh":"复仇宝珠 是为实体提供蓝色球形屏障的正面 状态效果 。 带有 复仇宝珠 的单位受到伤害时，会自动朝攻击者发射一枚反击弹体，造成固定的 冰霜 伤害。 使用 北境复仇者 为玩家及5米内全部盟友施加复仇球，每级持续60秒。","en":"Vengeance Sphere is a positive status effect that surrounds the affected entity in a blue spherical barrier. When a unit with Vengeance Sphere receive damage, it automatically launches back a projectile toward the attacker dealing a fixed amount of Frost damage. Vengeance Sphere is obtained by using the Northern Vengeance on the player and all allies in a 5-meters radius. The spell lasts 60 seconds per levels.","titleZh":"复仇宝珠","titleEn":"Vengeance Sphere"},"p-e775d3a4480d5625b340.html":{"zh":"银矿脉 是高海拔 凛冽雪山 的资源节点，用 铁镐 或更好工具开采掉 银矿 及 石头 。 装备 愿望骨 可探测矿脉。靠近时愿望骨发声，玩家周围出现彩色粒子；越近，音调越高、频率越快。 也可用 鹿角战锤 或 铁大锤 随机砸地，直到地下显示“太硬了”，称为 勘探 。在 凛冽雪山 定位银时， 鹿角战锤 比 铁大锤 精准得多。虽慢，但无需击杀 邪骨恶灵 。","en":"Silver Veins are resource nodes found in tall Mountains . They drop Silver Ore and Stone when mined with an Iron Pickaxe or better. Veins can be detected by equipping the Wishbone . The Wishbone will emit a tone along with colored particles from the player when a vein is nearby. The tone becomes higher-pitched and faster the closer the player is to the vein.","titleZh":"银矿脉","titleEn":"Silver Vein"},"p-e77e42254b227703e4a5.html":{"zh":"狼肉干 是 凛冽雪山 阶段的食物。","en":"Wolf jerky is a Mountain -tier food.","titleZh":"狼肉干","titleEn":"Wolf Jerky"},"p-e7b53c34193265d125df.html":{"zh":"世界树 也称 世界之树 ，是 英灵神殿 天空可见的巨大圣树。","en":"Yggdrasil , also called the World-Tree , is an immense sacred tree visible in the sky above Valheim .","titleZh":"世界树","titleEn":"Yggdrasil"},"p-e8322d923afd27c46685.html":{"zh":"饰物 是可装备、提供各种战斗收益的 物品 。 装备饰品可获取 血怒 ，积累足够后自动消耗并触发效果。重复触发同一饰品会重置计时。 同时仅一饰品，卸下不取消已激活效果，因此可切换并逐个触发，累积多种效果。 迷雾之地阶段之前的饰品，可在等级1 熔炉 制作。迷雾之地及以后需要等级1 黑熔炉 。","en":"Trinkets are items that can be equipped to provide various benefits during combat. Equipping a trinket allows the player to gain Adrenaline , which will be spent automatically to trigger the trinket's effect once enough adrenaline has been gained. Triggering twice the same trinket resets the effect timer. Only one trinket can be equipped at a time. Removing a trinket does not cancel its activated effects, thus it is…","titleZh":"饰物","titleEn":"Trinkets"},"p-e860ac8dc657c7c112f0.html":{"zh":"迷雾野兔至尊餐 是 迷雾之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Misthare Supreme is a Mistlands -tier food.","titleZh":"迷雾野兔至尊餐","titleEn":"Misthare Supreme"},"p-e882154bb2efd8735668.html":{"zh":"面包 是一种 北境平原 级别的 食物 。","en":"Bread is a Plains -tier food .","titleZh":"面包","titleEn":"Bread"},"p-e882a085cbb14a690d38.html":{"zh":"邪根之牙 是使用 翡翠 强化 灰烬之牙 得到的版本。与所有使用翡翠强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 毒素伤害 ，且命中效果有20%概率施加 定身 。 已升级的灰烬之牙在改造为邪根之牙时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Root Fang is the upgraded form of Ash Fang using Jade . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Jade, they gain 10 poison damage and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply Immobilized . An upgraded Ash Fang will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Root Fang.","titleZh":"邪根之牙","titleEn":"Root Fang"},"p-e8d94f57fdafd8087f83.html":{"zh":"纪念用炭 是 极北之地 中的物品。 用于获取 冰火精华 和 雷血精华 。","en":"Memorial Coal is an item found in the Deep North . It is used to obtain Frostfire Essence and Thunderblood Essence .","titleZh":"纪念用炭","titleEn":"Memorial Coal"},"p-e91837e0deb55a18a7c9.html":{"zh":"灰烬战士 是 灰烬之地 中的敌对敌人。","en":"Charred Warriors are hostile enemies found in the Ashlands .","titleZh":"灰烬战士","titleEn":"Charred Warrior"},"p-e931d213282fc1158b7d.html":{"zh":"木制 战斗 神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Wooden Battle Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"木制 战斗 神像","titleEn":"Wooden Battle Idol"},"p-e931ec535f307a5c6add.html":{"zh":"本页包含当前所有战斗机制和数值。","en":"This page contains all current combat mechanics and stats.","titleZh":"伤害机制","titleEn":"Damage mechanics"},"p-e94d5f83143286019d5f.html":{"zh":"长效耐力蜜酒 是一种 迷雾之地 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：长效耐力 发酵 而成。","en":"Lingering stamina mead is a Mistlands -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Lingering stamina .","titleZh":"长效耐力蜜酒","titleEn":"Lingering Stamina Mead"},"p-e954dbd55cb738ca4f07.html":{"zh":"烟雾笼罩 是影响 烟雾 云内玩家的 状态效果 。 每秒造成2点伤害，没有声音提示。 烟雾伤害为 纯伤害 。","en":"Smoked is a status effect that affects players inside clouds of smoke . It deals 2 damage per second without sound cue. Smoke damage is pure damage .","titleZh":"烟雾笼罩","titleEn":"Smoked"},"p-e95b90fbedc85fc41d73.html":{"zh":"黏液炸弹 是一类命中时会召唤生物的 炸弹 。召唤的生物会攻击玩家。 使用 沼泽女巫 出售的 木塞瓶 ，可在 工作台 处制作它们。","en":"Blob bombs are a type of Bomb that summons a creature on impact. The creature is aggressive toward the player. They are crafted at a Workbench by using a Corked Vial sold by The Bog Witch .","titleZh":"黏液炸弹","titleEn":"Blob Bombs"},"p-e9678fc298165279292b.html":{"zh":"维京船 是中型 船只 ，航速中等、储物空间较小，操纵性良好。成本适中，生命值略高于木筏，速度则快得多，因此维京船是首种适合较远航程的可靠船只。不过，遭遇 蛟龙 时，其生命值仍使它比看起来脆弱，应保持谨慎。 满帆速度为3.89–7.39米/秒，半帆为2.75–5.22米/秒，划桨为3.16米/秒。","en":"Karves are medium boats with a medium sailing speed, a small amount of storage and good maneuverability. Their moderate cost of construction along with slightly higher health and significantly faster sailing speeds than the Raft make the Karve the first reliable boat for longer ocean voyages. Care should still be taken, since its health makes the Karve deceptively fragile when set upon by Serpents .","titleZh":"维京船","titleEn":"Karve"},"p-e9d7b76127dca2c7d07e.html":{"zh":"乘骑 是让玩家使用鞍具骑乘驯服生物的机制。 将鞍具放入快捷栏，靠近生物时使用即可装备。骑乘时，方向键不会使坐骑转向；玩家必须转动镜头，坐骑始终朝镜头所指方向直行。坐骑可步行或冲刺，但无法倒退。 骑术（技能） 会提高冲刺速度并降低其耐力消耗。 坐骑完全忽略玩家携带的重量，即使骑手超重，也能移动乃至冲刺。","en":"Riding is a mechanic that allows a player to ride a tamed creature by using a saddle. Saddles can be equipped by assigning them to a hot key and using them while close to the creature. Directional keys will not cause the mount to turn while riding. Instead, the player must move the camera and the mount will always move straight in the direction that the camera is facing. A mount can move either at walking or sprinti…","titleZh":"乘骑","titleEn":"Riding"},"p-ea297370e6a990dcc157.html":{"zh":"灰矮人之眼 是一种 材料 ，可用于建造、制作及升级。","en":"Greydwarf eyes are a type of material and can be used in building, crafting, and upgrading.","titleZh":"灰矮人之眼","titleEn":"Greydwarf Eye"},"p-ea2efec0bf254e0fa2a5.html":{"zh":"芬里套装 是一套 凛冽雪山 级别的 护甲 ，比 树根套装 和 铁制护甲 高一级。与 狼皮护甲 相比，其护甲值更低，且没有移动速度惩罚，因此应视为“轻甲”。目前它是游戏中唯一提供移动速度加成的护甲。","en":"Fenris Set is a Mountain -tier armor . This set is the tier above Root Set and Iron Armor and should be considered a \"light armor\" compared to Wolf Armor as its armor values are lower while having no movement speed penalty. It is currently the only armor in the game that provides a movement speed buff.","titleZh":"芬里套装","titleEn":"Fenris Set"},"p-ea5f6bdc79b884c397d6.html":{"zh":"骷髅怪 是 青青草原 、 黑暗林山 、 泥泞沼泽 、 凛冽雪山 及 极北之地 中的敌对 生物 。 骷髅的生命、伤害及颜色随所在生物群系而异。 骷髅有80%概率为近战变体，20%概率为远程变体。 近战骷髅有25%概率装备 木盾 ，25%概率装备 青铜盾 。盾牌仅作装饰，死亡不会掉落。","en":"Skeletons are aggressive creatures found in Meadows , Black Forest , Swamp , Mountain , Deep North . Skeletons have different health, damage and color depending on their biome. Skeletons appear 80% of the time as melee variants and 20% of the time as ranged variants. Melee have a 25% chance to equip a Wood Shield and a 25% chance for a Bronze Buckler . Shields are purely cosmetic and don't drop on death.","titleZh":"骷髅怪","titleEn":"Skeleton"},"p-ea858afbf837aae71461.html":{"zh":"巨狼 是 凛冽雪山 中的敌对 生物 ，属于尾巴长而蓬松的大型犬科动物，可繁殖并 驯养生物 。","en":"Wolves are aggressive creatures found in the Mountains . They are large canines with long, bushy tails that can be bred and tamed .","titleZh":"狼","titleEn":"Wolf"},"p-ea863a46204ded59c009.html":{"zh":"平原牦牛肉 是一种通过击杀 平原牦牛 获得的基础食物。可在 铁烹饪台 上直接烤成 熟平原牦牛肉 ，但不能使用木制 烹饪台 ；若烤得过久，则会变成 木炭 。也可直接用于 灶台 的食物配方。","en":"Lox meat is a basic food obtained by killing Lox . It can be cooked directly on an Iron Cooking Station , but not on a wooden Cooking Station , to obtain Cooked lox meat , or Coal if overcooked. It is used directly in food recipes at the Food Preparation Table .","titleZh":"平原牦牛肉","titleEn":"Lox Meat"},"p-ea8df01e6ca072400faa.html":{"zh":"丛林之锤 是使用 翡翠 强化 焰金属锤 得到的版本。与所有使用翡翠强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 毒素伤害 ，且命中效果有20%概率施加 定身 。 已升级的焰金属锤在改造为丛林之锤时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Klossen is the upgraded form of Flametal Mace using the Jade . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Jade, they gain 10 poison damage and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply Immobilized . An upgraded Flametal Mace will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Klossen.","titleZh":"丛林之锤","titleEn":"Klossen"},"p-ea93d6a262ecb87a9fa4.html":{"zh":"工具 扩展玩家改造周围环境的能力，如 地形改造 ，或协助特定任务，如 饮酒 、 采矿业 。","en":"Tools are items used to extend the player's ability to modify features of the surrounding environment (e.g. terraforming ) or help them accomplish a particular task (e.g. drinking , mining ).","titleZh":"工具","titleEn":"Tools"},"p-eaa58e0666e1db3869e0.html":{"zh":"北境宝剑 是一种 极北之地 级别的双手 剑 。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境宝剑铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Greatsword is a Deep North -tier two handed Sword . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Greatsword and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境宝剑","titleEn":"Nord Greatsword"},"p-eb1ddf24ecd6efdbe275.html":{"zh":"北境十字弓 是第三种 弩 。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境十字弓铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。 主要攻击发射 弩箭 。攻击前，必须先将一支弩箭装入弩中。技能等级为0时，装填需要3.5秒并消耗3点耐力；但加上发射、装填和准备动作，实际每6秒才能发射一次。跳跃和冲刺会重置装填进度，冲刺时也无法装填弩箭。装填完成后，可随时发射，且不消耗耐力。发射后需要重新装填一支弩箭。切换到其他武器时，弩箭不会保持装填状态，因此每次装备该物品时都需要装填。 弩箭飞行速度明显快于箭矢，沿直线飞行而非抛物线（不会因重力而下坠）。","en":"Nord Crossbow is the third crossbow . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Crossbow and harden it in a Frost Foundry . Its primary attack fires bolts . To attack, a bolt is first loaded into the crossbow. Loading takes 3.5 seconds and uses 3 stamina at level 0, however, with the firing, loading, and readying animations, it can only be fired every 6 seconds. Jumping…","titleZh":"北境十字弓","titleEn":"Nord Crossbow"},"p-eb560be2afdd4268dd0d.html":{"zh":"灰烬之牙 是第六种 弓 。 升级后，还会为箭矢附加 灵魂伤害 。","en":"Ash Fang is the sixth bow . While upgraded, it also adds spirit damage to the arrows.","titleZh":"灰烬之牙","titleEn":"Ash Fang"},"p-ebc8cf63f6b3e250b563.html":{"zh":"芜菁鬼灯 是一种光源。 最多可装6份 树脂 。装入1/6容量的燃料可燃烧5小时33分钟，装满可燃烧33小时20分钟，与 铁铸火炬 、 壁灯 、 铁铸绿光火炬 和 铁铸蓝光火炬 相同，比 木制火炬 更久。放在附近可提高2点 舒适度 。","en":"The Jack-O-Turnip is a light source. It can hold up to 6 Resin at once. With 1/6 fuel, a Jack-O-Turnip will last for 5 hours and 33 minutes. At maximum capacity, it should burn for 33 hours and 20 minutes. This duration is the same for the Standing Iron Torch , Sconce , Standing Green-Burning Iron Torch and Standing Blue-Burning Iron Torch , and lasts longer than the Standing Wood Torch . It increases Comfort by 2 w…","titleZh":"芜菁鬼灯","titleEn":"Jack-O-Turnip"},"p-ebcf983695346eea6325.html":{"zh":"蜂蜜 是一种 食物 ，是制作许多 蜜酒 的必需材料，也用于 烹饪 。","en":"Honey is a food . It is required to make many Mead and is also used in Cooking .","titleZh":"蜂蜜","titleEn":"Honey"},"p-ec303764d3c247f15bb1.html":{"zh":"奔跑 是一种 技能 。","en":"Running is a skill .","titleZh":"奔跑（技能）","titleEn":"Running (skill)"},"p-ec3fbc7c38e6d765680e.html":{"zh":"北境战矛 是一种 极北之地 级别的 矛 。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境战矛铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Spear is an Deep North -tier Spear . It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding Cast Nord Spear and harden it in a Frost Foundry .","titleZh":"北境战矛","titleEn":"Nord Spear"},"p-ed01fac69b3d1411a807.html":{"zh":"炙烤杂蔬 是 灰烬之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Scorching medley is an Ashlands -tier food.","titleZh":"炙烤杂蔬","titleEn":"Scorching Medley"},"p-ed1a5a81b8121ad13a87.html":{"zh":"魔法 是随 迷雾之地 更新加入的战斗机制，带来了法师玩法。它与传统近战和远程玩法相似又有所不同，还提供了更直接的团队协作收益。","en":"Magic is a combat mechanic that appeared with the Mistlands update, which has opened up the mage play style which functions similar, but different to the traditional play styles of melee and range, as well as offering more direct team-play benefits.","titleZh":"魔法","titleEn":"Magic"},"p-ed615dadd5af9cbb4de8.html":{"zh":"沉船是 黑暗林山 、 幽暗沼泽 和 北境平原 海岸附近的 地点 。 共4种变体，有74.9%概率出现含 贵重物品 的 沉船 宝箱 。 沉船部件可破坏获取 细木 ，大型产10至15细木，小型产3至6细木。","en":"Shipwrecks are Points of interest found around the shores of the Black Forest , Swamp and Plains . They come in 4 variants. They have a 74.9% chance for a Shipwreck Chest that contains valuables . The different parts of shipwrecks can be destroyed for Finewood . Large parts yield between 10 and 15 Finewood, and small parts yield between 3 and 6 Finewood.","titleZh":"沉船","titleEn":"Shipwreck"},"p-edd2287afad9be012dee.html":{"zh":"这是 游戏机制 的 分类 。","en":"This is a category for game mechanics .","titleZh":"分类：游戏机制","titleEn":"Category:Mechanics"},"p-ededb38319eac31a929d.html":{"zh":"厄妖毛束 是一种 极北之地 材料。","en":"Elaking Hair Bundle is a Deep North material.","titleZh":"厄妖毛束","titleEn":"Elaking Hair Bundle"},"p-edf4c69a5925fe647b72.html":{"zh":"灰烬之骨 用于多种灰烬之地级武器及护甲。 与 白骨碎片 一样，焦黑骨头可为 护盾发生器 供能。","en":"Charred bone is an item used for many of the Ashlands-tier weapons and armor. Like Bone Fragments , Charred bone can be used to power a Shield Generator .","titleZh":"灰烬之骨","titleEn":"Charred Bone"},"p-ee4b4532f4c4fc3628b3.html":{"zh":"灯笼 可能指：","en":"Lantern may refer to:","titleZh":"灯笼","titleEn":"Lantern"},"p-ee716178bd188c0b2e61.html":{"zh":"霜灵 是投掷雪球远程攻击的敌对 极北之地 生物，掉落 冰霜之核 。但当前版本没有地点或地下城放置其生成器，因此正常游玩不会出现；冰霜之核改为悬挂在 蜿蜒隧道 中。 霜灵能耐受水、火和烟雾，攻击被格挡时会踉跄。","en":"Fryslings are hostile Deep North creatures that attack from range by throwing snowballs. They drop Frostcores , but in the current game version no location or dungeon places Frysling spawners, so they do not appear in normal play; Frostcores are instead found hanging in the Winding Tunnels . Fryslings tolerate water, fire and smoke. They are staggered when their attack is blocked.","titleZh":"霜灵","titleEn":"Frysling"},"p-ef09170332112a1229d4.html":{"zh":"黑金属塔盾 是第五种塔 盾 。 其格挡能力高于 黑金属盾 ，但会使玩家的 移动速度 降低10%，并使 闪避 翻滚消耗增加10%。 作为塔盾，它不能用于 弹反 敌人的攻击。","en":"Black Metal Tower Shield is the fifth tower shield . It has more block power compared to Black Metal Shield , but it reduces the player's movement speed by 10% and increases dodge roll cost by 10%. As a tower shield, it cannot be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"黑金属塔盾","titleEn":"Black Metal Tower Shield"},"p-ef5a9ffa419c58c4d8e0.html":{"zh":"河豚 是被动型 生物 （ 鱼 ），栖息于 迷雾之地 生物群系近岸水域，也可在 无尽之海 生物群系找到。 可用钓竿配 迷雾鱼饵 捕获，鱼饵在 灶台 以20份 鱼饵 和一个 平原牦牛战利品 制作。 用于制作 钓鱼帽","en":"Pufferfish are passive creatures ( fish ) found in the waters just offshore of the Mistlands biome, as well as in the Ocean biome. They can be caught with a fishing pole using Misty fishing bait which can be crafted at the Food Preparation Table by combining 20 Fishing Bait and a Lox Trophy . Needed to craft a Fishing Hat","titleZh":"河豚","titleEn":"Pufferfish"},"p-ef6cf39b42cf0431f314.html":{"zh":"黑金属战斧 是第三种双手 斧 。","en":"Black Metal Battleaxe is the third two-handed axe .","titleZh":"黑金属战斧","titleEn":"Black Metal Battleaxe"},"p-ef795958174711a18f44.html":{"zh":"冷杉球果 可从砍倒的 冷杉 拾取。之后用 耕地耙 重新种植，可培育树木获取 木材 。","en":"Fir Cones can be picked up from felled Fir trees. These cones can be replanted later with a Cultivator in order to farm the tree as a source of Wood .","titleZh":"冷杉球果","titleEn":"Fir Cone"},"p-ef848a56b3e6229549d8.html":{"zh":"熊皮套装 是一套 黑暗林山 级别的 护甲 ，护甲值低于 青铜护甲 ，但高于 巨魔套装 。不过，穿戴全部3件可获得 狂暴 套装加成，提高伤害、耐力恢复和生命值恢复，但也使穿戴者更容易受到物理伤害。 每只普通 巨熊 掉落4张巨熊毛皮，因此制作整套至少需要击杀4只巨熊。考虑到巨熊战利品的掉落概率为10%，实际可能需要击杀更多。","en":"The Bear Set is a Black Forest -tier armor set. It has a lower armor value than the Bronze Armor , but a higher armor value than the Troll Set . However, wearing all 3 pieces provides the Berserk set bonus, increasing damage, stamina and health regeneration, but making the wearer slightly more vulnerable to physical damage.","titleZh":"熊皮套装","titleEn":"Bear Set"},"p-ef9da5147c29ad1d34e7.html":{"zh":"神秘的石头 既是物品，也是可放置设施。","en":"Mysterious Rock is an item and a placeable structure.","titleZh":"神秘的石头","titleEn":"Mysterious Rock"},"p-eff6029836620af0381c.html":{"zh":"开膛弩：风暴 是使用 堇青石 强化 开膛弩 得到的版本。与所有使用 堇青石 强化的武器一样，它们获得10点 闪电 伤害 ，且命中效果有25%概率施加 连锁闪电 。 已升级的开膛弩在改造为开膛弩：风暴时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。 主要攻击发射 弩箭 。攻击前，必须先将一支弩箭装入弩中。技能等级为0时，装填需要3.5秒并消耗3点耐力；但加上发射、装填和准备动作，实际每6秒才能发射一次。跳跃和冲刺会重置装填进度，冲刺时也无法装填弩箭。装填完成后，可随时发射，且不消耗耐力。发射后需要重新装填一支弩箭。切换到其他武器时，弩箭不会保持装填状态，因此每次装备该物品时都需要装填。 弩箭飞行速度明显快于箭矢，沿直线飞行而非抛物线（不会因重力而下坠）。","en":"Storm Ripper is the upgraded form of Ripper using Iolite . Like all upgraded-weapons that use Iolite , they gain 10 lightning damage and their hit effect has a 25% chance to apply Chain Lightning . An upgraded Ripper will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is made into Storm Ripper. Its primary attack fires bolts . To attack, a bolt is first loaded into the crossbow. Loading takes 3.5 seconds and uses 3 stamina at l…","titleZh":"开膛弩：风暴","titleEn":"Storm Ripper"},"p-f00013255c4099ca2cd8.html":{"zh":"北境重盾 是第七种塔 盾 。 其格挡能力高于 北境之盾 和 北境圆盾 ，但会使玩家的 移动速度 降低10%，并使 闪避 翻滚消耗增加10%。北境重盾目前具有游戏中所有盾里最高的格挡护甲值。 作为塔盾，它不能用于 弹反 敌人的攻击。 无法直接制作。玩家必须先制作对应的 北境重盾铸坯 ，再在 霜铸熔炉 中硬化。","en":"Nord Greatshield is the seventh tower shield . It has more block power compared to the Nord Shield and Nord Buckler , but it reduces the player's movement speed by 10% and increases dodge roll cost by 10%. The Nord Greatshield currently has the highest block armor value of any shield in the game. As a tower shield, it cannot be used to parry enemy attacks.","titleZh":"北境重盾","titleEn":"Nord Greatshield"},"p-f01828d05eebff6540db.html":{"zh":"多种生物群系地面的矮小植物。","en":"Small flora that spawn on the ground in many biomes.","titleZh":"灌木","titleEn":"Bushes"},"p-f018cb729d59b13d1f4e.html":{"zh":"加尔 是 迷雾之地 中的大型敌对飞行生物。附近出现时，可听到介于飞机轰鸣与气喇叭之间的独特声音。此外，加尔周围的雾气呈火焰般的橙色。","en":"Gjall are massive flying, aggressive creatures found in the Mistlands . If there is one nearby, you will be alerted by a unique sound: a cross between a plane and an airhorn. Additionally, the mist in the immediate area around a Gjall will have a fiery orange hue.","titleZh":"加尔","titleEn":"Gjall"},"p-f01ddbc2f162df7d4ece.html":{"zh":"矛 是与 矛 类别相关的 技能 。","en":"Spears is a skill related to Spears class.","titleZh":"矛（技能）","titleEn":"Spears (skill)"},"p-f067a8bafce903cb7e72.html":{"zh":"蘑菇 可在 青青草原 、 黑暗林山 和 泥泞沼泽 的地面上找到。采集后，会在原位置于240分钟（4h）后重新生成。覆盆子和蓝莓的植株被移除后不会再生，而蘑菇即使所在的地面被清理或挖掘，仍会重新生成。 蘑菇本身的食物效果很弱，但它是后期一些顶级配方的重要材料，也可以喂给驯养的野猪。由于无法种植，且单个地点的数量不多，最好从游戏初期就储存一些，留待后用。","en":"Mushrooms can be found on the ground in the Meadows , Black Forest and Swamp . Picked mushrooms will respawn after 240 minutes, or 4h , at the same place that they were picked. Unlike the case with raspberries and blueberries, which do not return if the plant itself is removed, mushrooms will return if the ground is cleared or even excavated.","titleZh":"蘑菇","titleEn":"Mushroom"},"p-f09abd259d0ada2a71f6.html":{"zh":"弓 是一类 武器 。 弓发射已装备的 箭 ，射出的箭无法回收。按住主要攻击按钮可以拉弓，提高箭矢发射时的精度和伤害。格挡会取消拉弓，而不会射出箭矢。 技能等级为0时，弓的拉弓时间为2.5秒；到等级100时缩短至0.5秒。不过，弓每0.8秒才能发射一次，技能等级85时即可达到这一间隔。","en":"Bows is a weapon class. Bows shoot equipped arrows that cannot be retrieved. Holding down the primary attack button draws the bow back, improving accuracy and damage when the arrow is released. Blocking cancels a draw without firing the arrow. Bows have 2.5 seconds of draw time at skill level 0, which decreases to a draw time of 0.5 seconds by level 100. However, the bow can only be fired every 0.8 seconds, which ca…","titleZh":"弓","titleEn":"Bows"},"p-f0b13694892fdebf3270.html":{"zh":"巨魔套装 是一套 黑暗林山 级别的 护甲 。与青铜时代可获得的 青铜护甲 和 熊皮套装 相比，巨魔套装的护甲值较低，但不会降低移动速度。同时穿戴全部四件可获得 不易被发现效果 。 这套护甲之后会被 树根套装 或 铁制护甲 替代。 每只普通 巨魔 掉落五张 巨魔皮 ，因此制作完整护甲套装及披风至少需要击杀五只巨魔。","en":"Troll Set is a Black Forest -tier armor . Compared to the other armors available in the Bronze Age, Bronze Armor and Bear Set , the Troll Set has lower armor values but does not reduce movement speed. Simultaneously wearing all four pieces provides the Sneaky Effect . This set is replaced by the Root Set or Iron Armor .","titleZh":"巨魔套装","titleEn":"Troll Set"},"p-f10a3543a5eef525862f.html":{"zh":"美味蜜酒 是一种 黑暗林山 阶段的消耗品，由 蜜酒主成分：可口 发酵 而成。","en":"Tasty mead is a Black Forest -tier consumable item fermented from Mead base: Tasty .","titleZh":"美味蜜酒","titleEn":"Tasty Mead"},"p-f11d50d821c9fe22ce51.html":{"zh":"巨人巫师 是 魔阁哈拉 及 巨人入侵 期间出现的敌对 生物 ，会在空中飞行并施放伤害法术。 击杀巨人巫师会设置世界标记jotun_killed，使巨人巫师与 巨人战士 能在 极北之地 进行白天巡逻。","en":"Hexen are aggressive creatures found in Mörkhalla and during Jotun Invasions . They fly around and cast damaging spells. Killing a Hexen sets the world key jotun_killed , which enables Hexen and Krigen daytime patrols in the Deep North .","titleZh":"巨人巫师","titleEn":"Hexen"},"p-f1270b7c366d08b6713c.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以200枚 钱币 购买5个 火辣香料粉 ，仅在击败 青焰龙王 后出售。","en":"Fiery spice powder can be purchased from The Bog Witch at 200 Coins for 5 items. It is only sold after Fader has been defeated.","titleZh":"火辣香料粉","titleEn":"Fiery Spice Powder"},"p-f14d3dfafb206d8cbb44.html":{"zh":"将 玄武岩炸弹 投入 熔岩 中可以生成小平台，主要用于抵达 炎金属矿脉 。 生成的玄武岩平台会在熔岩中或熔岩上方漂浮30秒，然后开始缓慢沉入熔岩。","en":"Basalt Bombs can be used to create small platforms when thrown into lava , its main purpose is to reach Flametal Ore Veins . The basalt platform created will float in or above the lava for 30 seconds before beginning to sink into the lava at a slow rate.","titleZh":"玄武岩炸弹","titleEn":"Basalt Bomb"},"p-f151cd9e12c8994edfa3.html":{"zh":"寒冷 是在 夜间 ，或同时处于 庇护 和 冻僵 时施加的 状态效果 。使 生命值 恢复降低50%， 耐力 和 埃达之能 恢复降低25%。 站在产生 火焰 效果的对象附近，例如 营火 或工作的 冶炼炉 ，可抵消此效果；也可获得 冰霜 抗性，食用 抗霜蜜酒 可暂时获得，穿 狼毛披风 、 狼皮护甲 宝箱 或 平原牦牛披风 等保暖衣物则持续获得。","en":"Cold is a status effect applied at night , or while Sheltered and Freezing . It reduces health regeneration by 50%, and stamina and eitr regeneration by 25%. It is counteracted by standing near objects that produce the Fire effect (such as a Campfire or a working Smelter ) or by gaining a resistance to frost : temporarily by consuming a Frost Resistance Mead or permanently by wearing warm clothes, such as the Wolf F…","titleZh":"寒冷","titleEn":"Cold"},"p-f18a52add97fca76da5c.html":{"zh":"龙床 是 基础 设施，用于睡眠和设置重生点，提供的 舒适度 高于普通 床铺 。","en":"Dragon beds are base structures used for sleeping and setting the player's respawn point. They give higher comfort compared to normal beds .","titleZh":"龙床","titleEn":"Dragon Bed"},"p-f19643d5c0aec2a3c8cc.html":{"zh":"软泥 是 幽暗沼泽 生物群系 中 软泥怪 及 大型软泥怪 掉落的物品。","en":"Ooze is an item dropped by Blobs and Oozers in the Swamp biome .","titleZh":"软泥","titleEn":"Ooze"},"p-f1b33bbc85508ee13990.html":{"zh":"雷嗜血重锤 是使用 雷血精华 强化 北境钉锤 得到的版本。 它获得额外的 钝击 和 闪电 伤害，每次命中有25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，且玩家每缺少一点生命值，伤害提高0.2%。 已升级的北境钉锤在使用精华改造时， 不会 保留原有升级等级。","en":"Thunderblood Mace is a version of Nord Mace upgraded with a Thunderblood Essence . It gains extra Blunt and Lightning damage, a 25% chance per hit to trigger chain lightning and a 0.2% damage increase for each health point the player is missing. An upgraded Nord Mace will NOT keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.","titleZh":"雷嗜血重锤","titleEn":"Thunderblood Mace"},"p-f1e508c4582c09cd3b6e.html":{"zh":"尖牙 可能指：","en":"Fang may refer to:","titleZh":"尖牙","titleEn":"Fang"},"p-f208264029838269c9d4.html":{"zh":"矮人金属墙 是可建造构件，需要 铜 ，且须在 黑熔炉 范围内建造。可在 迷雾之地 的部分 矮人 建筑中自然找到。迷雾之地的 腐疫矿区 内部还有不可破坏的变体。 虽然外观看起来有空隙，但完全阻挡投射物， 箭 等无法穿透。","en":"Dvergr Metal Wall is a buildable structure. It requires Copper to build and needs to be built within the range of a Black Forge . It can be found naturally in the world as part of some Dvergr structures in the Mistlands . An indestructible variant can also be found inside Infested Mines in the Mistlands. Despite its sparse appearance, it is entirely solid; projectiles such as Arrows cannot penetrate it.","titleZh":"矮人金属墙","titleEn":"Dvergr Metal Wall"},"p-f2813a523c21f6654fc4.html":{"zh":"邪蝠 是 冰霜洞穴 内 凛冽雪山 中的敌对 生物 ，体型小，皮毛和翅膀光滑漆黑，能够飞行。","en":"Bats are aggressive creatures found in Mountains inside Frost Caves . They have a small body size and glossy black coat and wings, capable of flight.","titleZh":"邪蝠","titleEn":"Bat"},"p-f28f5a6eec5b3809d910.html":{"zh":"铁矿脉 是不自然生成的资源节点，需 青铜镐 或更好工具采集。","en":"An Iron Vein is a resource node that are not naturally found in game and require a Bronze Pickaxe or better to harvest them.","titleZh":"铁矿脉","titleEn":"Iron vein"},"p-f29f9d5fef2a5df43fe8.html":{"zh":"石堆 是 凛冽雪山 中的 地点 ，外形像石堆。 没有特定用途，破坏后可获得3至6份 石头 。","en":"Cairns are Points of interest found in the Mountain . They look like piles of rocks. They do not have any particular purpose. They can be destroyed for 3 to 6 Stones .","titleZh":"石堆","titleEn":"Cairns"},"p-f2a4c0b18aa920860c65.html":{"zh":"可用 耕地耙 种植 羽衣甘蓝种子 ，长成3x 羽衣甘蓝 。","en":"Kale Seeds can be planted using the Cultivator in order to grow 3x Kale .","titleZh":"羽衣甘蓝种子","titleEn":"Kale Seeds"},"p-f2fbf6a5f843152bdc8d.html":{"zh":"鸡肉 是一种食物，由被杀死的 母鸡 和 鸡 掉落，例如使用 屠夫刀 或开启PVP后将其击杀。 将鸡肉放在 烹饪台 或 铁烹饪台 上可烤成 熟鸡肉 ；若任其烧焦，则会变成 木炭 。","en":"Chicken meat is a food source dropped by Hens and Chickens when they are killed, such as with a Butcher Knife or after enabling PVP. When placed on a Cooking Station or Iron Cooking Station , Chicken meat can be turned into Cooked chicken meat , or Coal if left to burn.","titleZh":"鸡肉","titleEn":"Chicken Meat"},"p-f347459522011af4a0e4.html":{"zh":"制作 是一种 技能 。","en":"Crafting is a skill .","titleZh":"制作（技能）","titleEn":"Crafting (skill)"},"p-f3902c25141a721c7a30.html":{"zh":"黑金属弩炮弹 是一种用作 弩炮 弹药的 弩炮弹 ，可在 工匠台 处制作。","en":"Black metal missile is a missile used as ammunition for the Ballista , and can be crafted at the Artisan Table .","titleZh":"黑金属弩炮弹","titleEn":"Black Metal Missile"},"p-f399827619531548ebb3.html":{"zh":"冰冻树枝 是 极北之地 中的材料。","en":"Frozen Branch is a material found in the Deep North .","titleZh":"冰冻树枝","titleEn":"Frozen Branch"},"p-f3aed59448e859ce563b.html":{"zh":"灰矮人萨满 是 黑暗林山 中的敌对 生物 ，外形如覆苔树木，在巡逻队中主要负责治疗，也能施放远程毒素攻击。","en":"Greydwarf shamans are aggressive creatures found in Black Forests . They are mossy tree-like beings that act primarily as healers in patrols while also possessing the ability to cast a ranged poison attack.","titleZh":"灰矮人萨满","titleEn":"Greydwarf Shaman"},"p-f3f3fb48c86c0d3bab28.html":{"zh":"可向 沼泽女巫 以85枚 钱币 购买 毒蕈 ，仅在击败 冰霜龙母 后出售。 食用毒蕈会获得 感觉不舒服 效果，与 兔兔梅 类似。可借此换吃不同的 食物 。","en":"Toadstool can be purchased from The Bog Witch for 85 Coins . It is only sold after Moder has been defeated. Consuming Toadstool gives the Feeling sick effect, similar to Bukeperries . It can be used to switch to different Foods .","titleZh":"毒蕈","titleEn":"Toadstool"},"p-f3fc451cfae642d3d54f.html":{"zh":"野兔肉 是 野兔 掉落的食物。可以在 烹饪台 或 铁烹饪台 上烤成 熟兔肉 ；若烤得过久，则会变成 木炭 。也可以在 灶台 处将其制作成其他食物。","en":"Hare meat is a food dropped by Hares . It can be cooked on a Cooking Station or Iron Cooking Station to obtain Cooked hare meat or Coal if overcooked. It can be crafted into other foods using the Food Preparation Table .","titleZh":"野兔肉","titleEn":"Hare Meat"},"p-f4709a9359f1def796bc.html":{"zh":"灰矮人 是 黑暗林山 中的敌对 生物 ，外形如覆苔的树木，强度为其 灰宝宝 同类的两倍。","en":"Greydwarfs are aggressive creatures found in Black Forests . They are mossy tree-like beings and are twice as strong as their Greyling counterparts.","titleZh":"灰矮人","titleEn":"Greydwarf"},"p-f471e2ec70ee21aa0b16.html":{"zh":"紫色简朴帽 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付150 钱币 购买。","en":"Simple cap purple is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 150 Coins .","titleZh":"紫色简朴帽","titleEn":"Simple cap purple"},"p-f472cddcaecf53113933.html":{"zh":"锄头 可抬高或平整地面，也可铺 铺平 及 石铺路 地面装饰，形成可见路径。","en":"The Hoe is a tool that can be used to elevate or level the ground. It can also be used to apply the Pathen and Paved road ground decorations to an area, visually creating a path for players to walk on.","titleZh":"锄头","titleEn":"Hoe"},"p-f482af6734a6c2541789.html":{"zh":"摩根之心 是击杀 灰烬之地 生态区域 中的 摩根 获得的物品。","en":"Morgen heart is an item found by killing Morgens in the Ashlands biome .","titleZh":"摩根之心","titleEn":"Morgen Heart"},"p-f49d2b27496af704fd72.html":{"zh":"这是 烟花 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 物品 。","en":"This is a category for fireworks which are a type of items .","titleZh":"分类：烟花","titleEn":"Category:Fireworks"},"p-f4afba87f0f428ad9e36.html":{"zh":"铜矿 可在 冶炼炉 精炼为 铜 。 两份铜可在 熔炉 与 锡 加工，得到 青铜 。","en":"Copper Ore can be refined into Copper in a Smelter . Two Copper can be further processed at a Forge with Tin to yield Bronze .","titleZh":"铜矿","titleEn":"Copper Ore"},"p-f4d791c8e9df08d6c377.html":{"zh":"桦树种子 可用 耕地耙 种植，长成新的 桦树 。种下后需要几个游戏日长大。幼苗周围须留出少量空间，空间不足便无法长成大树。可从桦树获取，掉落率取决于是否为种植树及原产生态区，详情见 这儿 。","en":"Birch seeds is an item which can be planted using the Cultivator to produce new Birch trees. Once planted, the seeds take a few in-game days to grow to full size. Seedlings require a small amount of space directly around where they are planted; if they do not have enough space they will not grow into full trees. They can be obtained from birch trees, where the drop rate varies based on whether the tree was planted a…","titleZh":"桦树种子","titleEn":"Birch Seeds"},"p-f4d7ceb57c1f15cd429a.html":{"zh":"矮人灯塔 是 迷雾之地 各处常靠近海岸的 矮人 建筑，主要由 黑大理石 建成，住有 矮人刺客 和 法师 。每座矮人灯塔都有推进流程的重要制作材料 矮人板条箱 。","en":"Dvergr Lighthouses are one of the types of Dvergr structures located throughout the Mistlands , often near the coast. A tower made mostly of Black Marble , it is one type of Dvergr structure and is home to Dvergr Rogues and mages . Each Dvergr Lighthouse contains a Dvergr Component Crate , an important crafting component for progression.","titleZh":"矮人灯塔","titleEn":"Dvergr Lighthouse"},"p-f4dec3c36e82951710de.html":{"zh":"理发套件 是在 希尔德的请求 更新加入的物品，用于建造 理发台 ，默认解锁。","en":"Barber kit is an item which got introduced in the Hildir's Request update. It is used to construct the Barber Station and is unlocked by default.","titleZh":"理发套件","titleEn":"Barber Kit"},"p-f4ee697565a35434188d.html":{"zh":"蜂针箭 是供弓使用的 弹药 ，也是 黑曜石箭 的直接升级版本。","en":"Needle arrows are ammunition for bows and are the next direct upgrade from Obsidian Arrows .","titleZh":"蜂针箭","titleEn":"Needle Arrow"},"p-f4fc2b23c5e19e5758fd.html":{"zh":"女武神 是 英灵神殿 中的 生物 ，为大型鸟状生物，将刚阵亡的维京人飞送至 英灵神殿 世界。","en":"Valkyries are creatures found in Valheim . They are large, bird-like creatures that fly newly slain Vikings into the world of Valheim .","titleZh":"女武神","titleEn":"Valkyrie"},"p-f4fddf9a710e745ed89a.html":{"zh":"桦树 生长在 青青草原 和 北境平原 ，树皮白色并带黑斑，至少需要 青铜斧 才能砍伤。 桦树被毁后掉落 木材 和 细木 。两种木材的数量随机，但每棵总共固定掉落20份木材，树桩另掉2份木材。 可故意让倒下的 山毛榉 撞击桦树，累积足够伤害将其撞倒，再把树干滚下坡，反复撞向障碍物，直到碎成可用木材。 巨魔 也能破坏桦树。这些方法可让玩家在能制作 青铜斧 前获得 细木 。 桦树有4种变体：两种形状各有两种由生物群系决定的配色，配色不影响形状。形状1的大枝较少，最低大枝约离地8米；形状2在约4米高处分出一根粗枝，上方也有更多大枝。每种形状都有绿色叶片（非平原 生物群系 ）和黄色叶片（仅平原）两种。颜色完全由生成地决定，形状随机。玩家种植的桦树始终长绿叶。","en":"Birch is a type of tree that can be found in the Meadows and Plains biomes. It is characterized by its white bark with black spots. A Bronze Axe or better is required to damage it. Birch trees produce Wood and Finewood when destroyed. The yield of each type of wood is random, however, a birch tree will always drop 20 pieces of wood total (plus 2 Wood from its stump).","titleZh":"桦树","titleEn":"Birch"},"p-f5351cdfbb75d86acbdb.html":{"zh":"精英 苦难之碑 是 神秘的地点 中的 生物生成点 。 其颜色为紫色，不同于偏红的普通 苦难之碑 。 精英纪念碑只生成2星版本： 灰烬僵尸 概率42%， 灰烬战士 概率33%， 灰烬射手 概率17%， 灰烬术士 概率8%。 玩家进入60米内时纪念碑激活，每10秒尝试在4米内生成生物。","en":"The elite Monument of Torment is a creature spawner found at the Mysterious Locations . They are violet in color, unlike the more red regular Monument of Torment . The elite Monument can spawn only 2-starred versions of Charred Twitcher (42% chance), Charred Warrior (33% chance), Charred Marksman (17% chance) and Charred Warlock (8% chance).","titleZh":"苦难之碑（精英）","titleEn":"Monument of Torment (Elite)"},"p-f57eddb4e027139d853f.html":{"zh":"状态效果 是可获取的修正，通常限时，较少作为半永久被动效果存在。 下表未列的额外来源包括 放逐之力 和 蜜酒 。","en":"Status effects are modifiers you can attain either on a timer, or more rarely, as a semi-permanent passive effect. Additional sources of status effects, not listed below, include Forsaken powers and Mead .","titleZh":"状态效果","titleEn":"Status effects"},"p-f5a30282818f12b8f3fb.html":{"zh":"作弊剑 是一种只能通过控制台命令获得的 剑 。 主要攻击为3连击，最后一击造成双倍伤害。较慢的次要攻击造成3x伤害。 它对所有生物、岩石和树木造成巨额伤害，装备时还具有装饰性的彩虹闪光效果。与 作弊大锤 不同，它的耐久度不会随使用降低，也没有耐久度条。任何制作设施都无法修理它（不过，它不会损坏，因此无需修理）。","en":"The Cheat Sword is a sword that is only available with console commands. Its primary attack is a 3 hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit. Its slower secondary attack deals 3x damage. It deals massive damage to all creatures, rocks and tree while having a cosmetic rainbow sparkle effect when equipped. Unlike the Cheat Sledge , its durability does not degrade with use, and it does not have a durability m…","titleZh":"作弊剑","titleEn":"Cheat Sword"},"p-f5ba0df5cb44d1d22726.html":{"zh":"丑地精俘虏 是 墨尔克哈拉 中的生物。","en":"Captive Fuling are creatures found in Mörkhalla .","titleZh":"丑地精俘虏","titleEn":"Captive Fuling"},"p-f5d1dce68f65817c9054.html":{"zh":"篝火是 基础 设施，用于烹饪、睡眠和取暖。 与 营火 相比，火焰覆盖面积更大，而且不会在雨中熄灭。","en":"Bonfires are base structures used for cooking, sleeping and warmth. Compared to Campfires , they provide fire over a larger area and do not go out during rain.","titleZh":"篝火","titleEn":"Bonfire"},"p-f614cb6ab783f3287834.html":{"zh":"分类中的页面 古树 山毛榉 桦树 冷杉 橡树 松树 灰烬之树 树桩 巨木冷杉 树木 世界树嫩枝","en":"Pages in category Ancient Tree Beech Birch Fir Oak Pine Scorched Tree Stump (Tree) Timber Tree Trees Yggdrasil Shoot","titleZh":"分类：树木","titleEn":"Category:Trees"},"p-f68665c81bb8a2d16315.html":{"zh":"庆典帽 是一件纪念 英灵神殿 发售五周年的护甲部件，可在 工作台 处制作。 使物品的基础耐力消耗降低-15%。","en":"Celebratory Cap is an armor piece marking the fifth anniversary of the release of Valheim that can be crafted at a Workbench . It affects base item stamina use by -15%.","titleZh":"庆典帽","titleEn":"Celebratory Cap"},"p-f6a8a96649cf772ddb7f.html":{"zh":"此为 材料 的 分类 ，属于用于 建造 及 制作 的 物品 。","en":"This is a category for materials which are a type of items used for building and crafting .","titleZh":"分类：材料","titleEn":"Category:Materials"},"p-f6dade35527dfa89b5a4.html":{"zh":"这是 棍棒 的 分类 ，它们属于一种 武器 。","en":"This is a category for clubs which are a type of weapons .","titleZh":"分类：棍棒","titleEn":"Category:Clubs"},"p-f713dd7fc59388476ecc.html":{"zh":"尖木桩防护栅栏 是 尖桩 ，对碰到尖端的任何生物，包括玩家和驯养动物，造成15点 穿刺 伤害和40点 击退 。护甲和抗性可降低玩家受到的伤害。每次造成伤害会损失34点耐久度。 与多数设施不同，尖桩被锤子拆除，或因造成伤害而损毁时，不会返还建造材料。","en":"Sharp stakes are Stakes which deal 15 pierce damage and 40 knockback to any creature, including players and tames, that touch the sharp end. Damage to the player is reduced by armor and resistances. The structure will lose 34 durability whenever it deals damage. Unlike most structures, Sharp stakes will not provide back its crafting materials when removed by a hammer or destroyed due to dealing damage.","titleZh":"尖木桩防护栅栏","titleEn":"Sharp Stakes"},"p-f7332b99b04827c7781e.html":{"zh":"雷血精华 用于将诺德武器升级雷血变体，由 堕落战士 掉落。在 纪念地 祭坛放三个 纪念用炭 召唤。 雷血武器主要伤害略增，并获得 闪电 伤害。 雷血武器每次命中25%概率触发 连锁闪电 ，类似 堇青石 升级武器；玩家每缺一生命值，伤害再提高0.2%，类似 血石 升级武器。","en":"Thunderblood Essence is a material used to ugprade Nord weapons to their Thunderblood variants. They are dropped by Fallen Warriors summoned by placing three Memorial Coal on the altar found at the Memorial Place . Thunderblood weapons have a slightly increased amount of their main damage type and will also gain Lightning damage.","titleZh":"雷血精华","titleEn":"Thunderblood Essence"},"p-f73a325a5b6593399da2.html":{"zh":"木制弩炮弹 是一种用作 弩炮 弹药的 弩炮弹 ，可在 工匠台 处制作。","en":"Wooden missile is a missile used as ammunition for the Ballista , and can be crafted at the Artisan Table .","titleZh":"木制弩炮弹","titleEn":"Wooden Missile"},"p-f74ce8df7be427c41451.html":{"zh":"魔法屏障 是为实体提供球形屏障的正面 状态效果 。持续一定时间，期间吸收固定上限伤害；超过上限后屏障破裂，同时移除状态。 玩家使用 佑护之杖 获得，可作用于施法者及小半径内友方玩家和驯服生物。持续60至120秒，取决于法杖品质。吸收上限为200至700伤害，完全取决于施法者 血魔法 等级，详情见该页。","en":"Magic barrier is a positive status effect that surrounds the affected entity in a spherical barrier. This barrier lasts for a certain amount of time, and while active it can absorb up to a fixed amount of damage. Once this damage limit is exceeded, the barrier breaks, which also removes the status effect. The effect is acquired from a player using the Staff of Protection , which can apply it to the caster and to oth…","titleZh":"魔法屏障","titleEn":"Magic barrier"},"p-f76ea921edc2e55df3e0.html":{"zh":"墙 部件是可用多种材料建造的结构：","en":"Wall pieces are building structures available in several materials:","titleZh":"墙","titleEn":"Wall"},"p-f7717a62a96d5c06baa0.html":{"zh":"迷雾行者 是第五种 剑 。 迷雾行者可以驱散9米半径内 迷雾之地 的 雾 。","en":"Mistwalker is the fifth sword . The Mistwalker is capable of dispelling the Mist of Mistlands in a 9-meter radius.","titleZh":"迷雾行者","titleEn":"Mistwalker"},"p-f778a33133e5c30bebdb.html":{"zh":"格挡 是使用任意 武器 或 盾 格挡时，降低受到 生物 攻击伤害的机制。","en":"Blocking is a mechanic that reduces the damage received from creature attacks while blocking with any weapons or shields .","titleZh":"格挡","titleEn":"Blocking"},"p-f7eb86e06ee819dce177.html":{"zh":"灰矮人（极北之境） 是 极北之地 中更强的 灰矮人 变体。","en":"Greydwarf (Deep North) is a stronger version of Greydwarf found in Deep North .","titleZh":"灰矮人（极北之境）","titleEn":"Greydwarf (Deep North)"},"p-f7f10649a07abf98285b.html":{"zh":"上古金币 是在 极北之地 发现的 珍贵 。","en":"Ancient Coin is a Valuable found in Deep North .","titleZh":"上古金币","titleEn":"Ancient Coin"},"p-f816a74c2310179d8785.html":{"zh":"床是 基础 设施，用于睡眠和设置玩家重生点。","en":"Beds are base structures used for sleeping and setting the player's respawn point.","titleZh":"床铺","titleEn":"Bed"},"p-f83679a36a638971fcf3.html":{"zh":"废弃房屋 是 青青草原 中独立分布的废墟建筑，主要由 木制结构 建成，有时包含无法使用的 床铺 ，共有13种变体。 房屋若并非独立分布，则会形成 废弃村落 或 尸鬼村落 。","en":"Abandoned Houses are isolated ruined structures found in the Meadows . They are mostly made of Wood Structures and sometimes contain an unusable Bed . They come in 13 variants. When the houses are not isolated, they form either an Abandoned Village or a Draugr Village .","titleZh":"废弃房屋","titleEn":"Abandoned House"},"p-f909ee5cea870db30212.html":{"zh":"河鲈 是 青青草原 和 黑暗林山 近岸的沿海 鱼 ，用 鱼竿 配 霍尔德 出售的基础 鱼饵 捕获。","en":"Perch are coastal fish found offshore the Meadows and Black Forest . They can be caught with a Fishing Rod using the basic Fishing Bait sold by Haldor .","titleZh":"河鲈","titleEn":"Perch"},"p-f935447711f07b2181bd.html":{"zh":"裂颅者 是第四种双手 斧 。","en":"Skull Splittur is the fourth two-handed axe .","titleZh":"裂颅者","titleEn":"Skull Splittur"},"p-f950109fcbe642a759a2.html":{"zh":"骨头 可能指：","en":"Bone may refer to:","titleZh":"骨头","titleEn":"Bone"},"p-f9896d553add9b3f183a.html":{"zh":"烟花 是可投进火中，产生观赏爆炸效果的消耗品。使用时显示“你向火中扔了一些X”，X替换为所用烟花名称。 可从 希尔德 以50 钱币 购买 普通烟花 。其他颜色烟花可在任意等级 工作台 ，用基础烟花与材料制作，爆炸颜色与烟花颜色一致。","en":"Fireworks are a type of consumable that can be used on a fire to produce an aesthetic explosion. The message, \"You throw some X into the fire\" appears when activated, \"X\" replaced with the firework you use. Basic fireworks can be purchased from Hildir for 50 Coins . Other colored fireworks are crafted by combining Basic fireworks with materials at a Workbench of any level. The color of the explosion matches the colo…","titleZh":"烟花","titleEn":"Fireworks"},"p-f9964d8f7c52d45a5ed7.html":{"zh":"维修棚是快速搭建、可修基本武器的小棚昵称。 需要 工具锤 及26份 木材 。先在平地放 工作台 ，从左侧放墙，再垂直放第二墙，接第三墙，最后在工作台右侧放第四墙，如下图。 还需完成遮蔽：工作台须封闭并在 屋顶 下。后方双墙放两片朝向玩家的26度屋顶，再在左右墙与屋顶间接26度三角墙，如下图。三角墙非遮蔽必需，仅美观。木材不足或赶时间，四面墙及两片顶即可。 完成了！小维修棚可修基本武器和护甲，修理完全免费。祝维京人们冒险顺利！","en":"The Repair Shack is a nickname for a quickly built shack that you can repair basic weapons in. In order to craft this shack you need a hammer and 26 wood . First, place down a workbench on a flat piece of land. Then, starting on the left side, place a wall, then another wall perpendicular to that one, followed by a third wall connected to the one you just placed. Lastly, place the fourth wall around the right side o…","titleZh":"修理棚屋","titleEn":"Repair shack"},"p-f9cf4ccb3d84cd861d82.html":{"zh":"圆柱大门 是可建造构件。","en":"Roundpole Gate is a buildable structure.","titleZh":"圆柱大门","titleEn":"Roundpole Gate"},"p-fa122c4ed88fb2acfb18.html":{"zh":"高炉 用于将高级金属原料加工成金属锭。虽然功能与 冶炼炉 相似，但不能冶炼普通冶炼炉能处理的矿石。","en":"The Blast Furnace is a structure used to process advanced raw metals into ingots. Although it performs a similar function to the Smelter , it cannot smelt the ores that the Smelter can.","titleZh":"高炉","titleEn":"Blast Furnace"},"p-fa77a5252d38a04cd913.html":{"zh":"门 可能指： 单扇门请参阅 门 。","en":"Gate may refer to: For single doors, see Door .","titleZh":"门","titleEn":"Gate"},"p-fa8d84566676ee2ee662.html":{"zh":"遮蔽决定玩家何时处于 庇护 ，也影响部分建筑行为。 遮蔽按17条检测射线中被障碍阻挡的数量计算。每条起于遮蔽点外0.5米，延伸29.5米，即距遮蔽点30米。 射线方向固定，不随建筑旋转，方向如下： 屋顶检查正上方100米内是否有不漏雨材料。 实际实现有以下特殊情况：","en":"Cover determines when players are sheltered and affects behavior of some structures. Cover is calculated by checking how many of the 17 cover rays are blocked by obstacles. Each ray starts 0.5 meters from the structure cover point and extends to 29.5 meters (30 meters from the cover point). Cover rays always have the same orientation that doesn't depend on the structure rotation. The directions are:","titleZh":"遮蔽","titleEn":"Cover"},"p-fad95c33954345e44823.html":{"zh":"熔岩灯笼 是不需要燃料的装饰光源，放在附近可提高2点 舒适度 。 建造需要 工作台 及 灰烬之地 的材料。","en":"Lava lantern is a decorative light source that does not require any kind of fuel. It increases Comfort by 2 when placed nearby. It requires a Workbench and materials from Ashlands to be built.","titleZh":"熔岩灯笼","titleEn":"Lava Lantern"},"p-fae673586a527fd4b542.html":{"zh":"邪蛛肉 是 邪蛛探索者 和 邪蛛士兵 掉落的食物。可以在 铁烹饪台 上直接烤成 熟蛛肉 ，但不能使用木制 烹饪台 ；若烤得过久，则会变成 木炭 。也可直接用于 灶台 的食物配方。","en":"Seeker meat is a food dropped by Seekers and Seeker Soldiers . It can be cooked directly on an Iron Cooking Station , but not on a wooden Cooking Station , to obtain Cooked Seeker Meat or Coal if overcooked. It is used directly in food recipes at the Food Preparation Table .","titleZh":"邪蛛肉","titleEn":"Seeker Meat"},"p-fb1e8f9dc6a6cfcd2001.html":{"zh":"发光金属 曾是占位 灰烬之地 中的资源节点，需 铁镐 或更好工具采集。","en":"Glowing metal was a resource node and used to be found in the placeholder Ashlands biome and required an Iron Pickaxe or better to be harvested.","titleZh":"发光金属","titleEn":"Glowing metal"},"p-fb4d02c2856eacb0f690.html":{"zh":"献祭之血 由 凌冽·芬布尔使者 掉落，可在 凿刻平台 召唤 福金 、 雾尼 及 女武神 。与 女武神 互动会结束游戏。 献祭之血无法用 传送门 或 传送门 - 石 传送，允许全部物品传送的世界修正也不改变这一点。目的是让玩家结束游戏前，再乘船穿越世界一次。","en":"Sacrificial Blood is an item dropped by Kall Fimbulbringer . It can be used at the Chiselled Platform to summon Hugin , Munin and a Valkyrie . The game ends when interacting with the Valkyrie . The Sacrificial Blood cannot be teleported, neither with Portal or Portal Stone , and the world modifier that allows all items through portals does not change this. The idea is for the player to have one last ship trip across…","titleZh":"献祭之血","titleEn":"Sacrificial Blood"},"p-fbba2e9621ee7f0784f4.html":{"zh":"焦油 由 焦油怪 掉落，或在 北境平原 生物群系 的 焦油坑 内部及周围找到。","en":"Tar is an item dropped by Growths or found in and around Tar Pits in the Plains biome .","titleZh":"焦油","titleEn":"Tar"},"p-fbf247e43d3745e56454.html":{"zh":"门 可能指： 更大的开口请参阅 门 。","en":"Door may refer to: For larger openings, see Gate .","titleZh":"门","titleEn":"Door"},"p-fc00b25a4cd4f08e4d91.html":{"zh":"雷霆之杖 是一种 魔法 武器，会在近距离发射由12道闪电弹组成的霰弹。 每次射击后都会进行1.9秒的装填动作。装填过程中，攻击所需的 埃达之能 会逐渐消耗；玩家可以行走和跳跃，但冲刺会取消装填。 雷霆之杖的伤害取决于施法者的 元素魔法 技能等级。与其他魔法武器一样，它没有次要攻击。","en":"Dundr is a Magic weapon that shoots a grapeshot of 12 lightning bolts at short range. Each shot is followed by a 1.9 seconds reloading animation. During reloading the eitr cost of the attack is slowly consumed while the player can walk and jump, but sprinting will cancel the reload. The Dundr's damage is dependent on the caster's Elemental magic skill level. Like other magic weapons, it has no secondary attack.","titleZh":"雷霆之杖","titleEn":"Dundr"},"p-fc3c29aeedb3826088bf.html":{"zh":"火辣派派 是一种 灰烬之地 级别的 食物 。","en":"Piquant Pie is an Ashlands -tier food .","titleZh":"火辣派派","titleEn":"Piquant Pie"},"p-fc97cc456cf3a5f1a84f.html":{"zh":"雷托领主之墓 是 灰烬之地 中的 地下城 ，入口位于第三处 神秘的地点 。","en":"The Tomb of Lord Reto is a dungeons found in Ashlands , the entrance is situated at the third Mysterious Location .","titleZh":"雷托领主之墓","titleEn":"Tomb of Lord Reto"},"p-fcd6fea72de7e6c09ca2.html":{"zh":"玩家的 生命值 降至0时会发生 死亡 。","en":"Death occurs when a player reaches 0 health .","titleZh":"死亡","titleEn":"Death"},"p-fcff8933ff61a887b2e3.html":{"zh":"青铜防护神像 是在 潜能熔炉 升级物品所用的神像。","en":"The Bronze Protection Idol is an idol used to upgrade items at the Forge of Potential .","titleZh":"青铜防护神像","titleEn":"Bronze Protection Idol"},"p-fd090f63d2000fa6820f.html":{"zh":"湮灭者 是可建造设施，能将任意物品转化为 木炭 。","en":"Obliterators are buildable structures that convert any item to Coal .","titleZh":"湮灭者","titleEn":"Obliterator"},"p-fd0fc1b989541254fac9.html":{"zh":"蓝色珠饰上衣 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付550 钱币 购买。只有交还 希尔德的青铜宝箱 后，商人才会出售它。","en":"Beaded tunic blue is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 550 Coins . This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning Hildir's bronze chest .","titleZh":"蓝色珠饰上衣","titleEn":"Beaded tunic blue"},"p-fd10a146e9625bfd3f69.html":{"zh":"材料 是用于 建造 或 制作 其他物品的材料。","en":"Materials are items used for building or for crafting other items.","titleZh":"材料","titleEn":"Materials"},"p-fd2b000ad52048d72722.html":{"zh":"先锋套装 是一套 极北之地 级别的 护甲 。","en":"The Vanguard Set is a Deep North -tier armor .","titleZh":"先锋套装","titleEn":"Vanguard Set"},"p-fd324240063c1f7d1c3f.html":{"zh":"尸体堆 是 地下圣堂 、 尸鬼村庄 和 泥泞沼泽 中的 生物生成点 。 尸体堆可生成任意尸鬼： 生成的敌人有15%概率为1星，2.25%概率为2星。 玩家进入20米内时激活生成点，每6秒尝试在3米内生成，直到20米内有2只尸鬼。","en":"The Body Pile is a creature spawner found in Sunken Crypts , Draugr Villages , Swamp . The pile can spawn any Draugr: Spawned enemies have a 15% chance to be 1-star and a 2.25% chance to be 2-star. The spawner activates when there is a player within 20 meters. The nest attempts to spawn within 3 meters every 6 seconds until there are 2 Draugr within 20 meters.","titleZh":"尸体堆","titleEn":"Body Pile"},"p-fdbf4c13e701260a86da.html":{"zh":"Harald 是在 英灵神殿 中提及的 角色 。","en":"Harald is a mentioned character in Valheim .","titleZh":"Harald","titleEn":"Harald"},"p-fdd8ecee78be97352166.html":{"zh":"黑大理石堆 是一种可建造设施，可储存 黑大理石 ，也可单纯用于装饰家园。","en":"Black Marble Pile is a buildable structure that is used to store Black Marble or simply decorate a homestead.","titleZh":"黑大理石堆","titleEn":"Black Marble Pile"},"p-fe25e57a6b940a9a6c8d.html":{"zh":"棕色披肩连衣裙 是一件护甲部件，可向 希尔德 支付250 钱币 购买。","en":"Shawl dress brown is an armor piece which can be purchased from Hildir for 250 Coins .","titleZh":"本色简朴上衣","titleEn":"Simple tunic natural"},"p-fe2a36d099f39798b17c.html":{"zh":"闪闪菇菇奶昔 是 灰烬之地 阶段的食物。","en":"Sparkling Shroomshake is an Ashlands -tier food.","titleZh":"闪闪菇菇奶昔","titleEn":"Sparkling Shroomshake"},"p-fe4ab16a4f22abda0da9.html":{"zh":"此为 宝石 的 分类 ，属于用于 制作 的 材料 。","en":"This is a category for gemstones which are a type of materials used for crafting .","titleZh":"分类：宝石","titleEn":"Category:Gems"},"p-fe6feffbc0e1cdb42843.html":{"zh":"烤箱松饼 是 极北之地 阶段提供埃达之能的食物。","en":"Oven Pancake is a Deep North -tier Eitr food.","titleZh":"烤箱松饼","titleEn":"Oven Pancake"},"p-fe7fad52d6a14b674fa3.html":{"zh":"黑暗林山限定套餐 属于 黑暗林山 阶段的 宴席 。","en":"Black Forest Buffet Platter is the Black Forest -tier Feast .","titleZh":"黑暗林山限定套餐","titleEn":"Black Forest Buffet Platter"},"p-fe9a413cd4f76ee4e814.html":{"zh":"鹿皮 可由 鹿 掉落，或在 黑暗林山 生物群系 的 巨魔洞穴 珍宝箱 找到。也可破坏 地精村落 居所屋顶获得。","en":"Deer hide can be dropped from Deer or found in Troll Cave treasure chests within the Black Forest biome . They can also be looted from Fuling Villages by destroying the roofs of their dwellings.","titleZh":"鹿皮","titleEn":"Deer Hide"},"p-fec2a021cdbf33cf8722.html":{"zh":"腐朽之穴 是 灰烬之地 中的 地下城 。每个腐臭洞穴有一只 摩根 ，击杀后不重生。","en":"Putrid Holes are dungeons found in Ashlands . One Morgen can be found within each Putrid Hole, which does not respawn when killed.","titleZh":"腐朽之穴","titleEn":"Putrid Hole"},"p-fece7f9297c133836b01.html":{"zh":"狼皮护甲 是一套 凛冽雪山 级别的 护甲 ，比 铁制护甲 和 树根套装 高一级，之后分别被 厚垫护甲 和 邪骨套装 替代。","en":"Wolf Armor is a Mountain -tier armor . This set is the tier above Iron Armor and Root Set , and is replaced by Padded Armor and Vilebone Set , respectively.","titleZh":"狼皮护甲","titleEn":"Wolf Armor"},"p-fed12611d2d8c162e347.html":{"zh":"无尽之海 是由广阔水体组成的 生物群系 ，如现实海洋。实际主要通过 船只 探索，因为离岸游泳会迅速耗尽 耐力 并导致溺水。与其说是独立生物群系，海洋更像玩家探索的通道。 目前只有难找且破坏力强的 蛟龙 ，以及更难找的 利维坦 ，后者是覆盖灌木、藻类和藤壶的巨大有壳生物。这两种生物分别是获得 蛟龙鳞 和 甲壳素 的唯一途径。","en":"The Ocean is a biome made up of, much like examples in real life, a vast body of water. It is only realistically accessible by boats , as swimming out from the safety of the shore quickly depletes stamina and leads to drowning. In many ways, the Ocean acts as less its own dedicated biome, per se, and more a vehicle for player exploration.","titleZh":"无尽之海","titleEn":"Ocean"},"p-fed1a0585f331f521306.html":{"zh":"常春藤 是沼泽女巫更新加入的植物，可使用 常春藤种子 和 耕地耙 种植。它仅用于装饰，种下后会攀爬建筑，适合点缀房屋。与 灰烬藤蔓 不同，它不会结出 酒莓束 或其他可采集物品。 每株常春藤需要一份 常春藤种子 。幼苗ID为VineGreen_sapling，长成的植株ID为VineGreen。 常春藤蔓延到表面后，就不再需要连接耕地。玩家可借助临时支撑表面，让它蔓延到二楼墙面。后续生长不需要与地面连接。","en":"Ivy is a plant added in the Bog Witch update that can be planted with the Ivy Seeds using the Cultivator . Its only purpose is decorative; it can climb structures when planted, which makes it useful for decorating buildings. Unlike Ashvine , it never grows Vineberry Clusters or any other harvestable item. Each Ivy costs one Ivy Seeds to plant. The planted sapling (ID VineGreen_sapling) grows into the full plant (ID…","titleZh":"常春藤","titleEn":"Ivy"},"p-feeedebfee67630b51c2.html":{"zh":"纺车 是将 亚麻 加工成 亚麻线 的设施。每份亚麻需要30秒转化成亚麻线，最多装40份亚麻，完成的亚麻线会自动掉出。 击杀 冰霜龙母 获得 工匠台 的材料后，解锁纺车。放置时须位于工匠台范围内，建好后运行则不再需要工匠台。","en":"The Spinning Wheel is a crafting station which converts Flax into Linen Thread . Each piece of Flax takes 30 seconds to convert into Linen thread. It has a capacity of 40 Flax, and will drop Linen as it is made automatically. The Spinning Wheel becomes available after the player has killed Moder to obtain the materials for an Artisan Table . It must be placed within the radius of the Artisan Table, but does not requ…","titleZh":"纺车","titleEn":"Spinning Wheel"},"p-fef64a514785645cd1da.html":{"zh":"这是 神像 的 分类 。","en":"This is a category for idols .","titleZh":"分类：神像","titleEn":"Category:Idols"},"p-ff014cecaa644933c4ce.html":{"zh":"初始双斧 是第一种双持 斧 。 初始双斧造成 砍伐 伤害，可砍伐与 青铜斧 相同的树木，例如 桦树 、 橡树 和 古树 。","en":"Early Axes are the first dual wielded axe . The Early Axes deal Chop damage and can cut down the same trees as the Bronze Axe , such as Birches , Oaks and Ancient Trees .","titleZh":"初始双斧","titleEn":"Early Axes"},"p-ff96df936e42f069f82f.html":{"zh":"铁镐 是第三种 镐击 。除之前的镐能够开采的资源外，它还可开采 黑曜石 和 银 。 主要攻击为能够破坏地面的近战攻击。它没有次要攻击。","en":"Iron Pickaxe is the third Pickaxe . It can be used to mine Obsidian and Silver , in addition to what previous pickaxes can mine. Its primary attack is a melee attack that destroys ground. It does not have a secondary attack.","titleZh":"铁镐","titleEn":"Iron Pickaxe"},"weapons.html":{"zh":"武器 是可用于对 生物 和 建筑 造成 伤害 的 物品 。","en":"Weapons are items that can be used to deal damage to creatures and structures .","titleZh":"武器","titleEn":"Weapons"}};